    "char_end": 3630,
    "char_count": 1678,
    "text": "Page 2 of 5\nmanage real estate assets\nincluding properties taken on\nlease, rent, or license for\npurposes of development, sub-\nletting, or sale and to earn rental\nor lease income.\n    (b) *Matters which are necessary for furtherance of the objects specified\n      in clause 3(a) are\n1.\n?  To enter into\nagreements, contracts, or\narrangements with builders,\narchitects, contractors,\nengineers, interior designers,\nlandscape designers, and other\nprofessionals for the construction\nand development of real estate.\n2.\n?  To obtain, purchase,\nor otherwise acquire licenses,\npermits, approvals, and\nclearances from the central,\nstate, municipal or local\nauthorities necessary for real\nestate development and\nconstruction.\n3.\n?  To raise or borrow\nmoney, arrange for loans, issue\ndebentures or other securities,\nand mortgage or pledge the\ncompany?s assets in connection\nwith the main objects.\n4.\n?  To buy, sell, lease,\nlicense, hire, exchange, or\notherwise deal in plant,\nmachinery, equipment,\nmaterials, vehicles, or any other\nmovable or immovable property\nrequired for or in connection\nwith the real estate business.\n5.\n?  To provide\nconsultancy, advisory, and\nagency services in relation to real\nestate, including marketing,\nbrokerage, valuation, and\nproperty management services.\n6.\n?  To act as promoters,\ndevelopers, co-developers, or\njoint venture partners with\nindividuals, companies, societies,\ntrusts, or government bodies for\nreal estate projects.\n7.\n?  To acquire\ndevelopment rights, FSI, TDR, or\nsimilar entitlements for land\ndevelopment under applicable\nlaws.\nTo carry on the business of\nbuying, selling, importing,\nexporting, marketing,\ndistributing, supplying, trading,",
