  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0068",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 68,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12996,
    "char_end": 12997,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "7",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0069",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 69,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12999,
    "char_end": 13106,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "TABLE -F\nARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF A COMPANY LIMITED BY SHARES\nInterpretation\nI. (1) In these regulations—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0070",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 70,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 13107,
    "char_end": 13204,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "(a) “the Act” means the Companies Act, 2013,\n(b) “the seal” means the common seal of the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0071",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 71,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 13205,
    "char_end": 13875,
    "char_count": 670,
    "text": "(2) Unless the context otherwise requires, words or expressions contained in these regulations shall\nbear the same meaning as in the Act or any statutory modification thereof in force at the date at which\nthese regulations become binding on the company.\nShare capital and variation of rights\nII. 1. Subject to the provisions of the Act and these Articles, the shares in the capital of the company\nshall be under the control of the Directors who may issue, allot or otherwise dispose of the same or any of\nthem to such persons, in such proportion and on such terms and conditions and either at a premium or at\npar and at such time as they may from time to time think fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0072",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 72,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 13876,
    "char_end": 14250,
    "char_count": 374,
    "text": "2. (i) Every person whose name is entered as a member in the register of members shall be entitled to\nreceive within two months after incorporation, in case of subscribers to the memorandum or after\nallotment or within one month after the application for the registration of transfer or transmission or\nwithin such other period as the conditions of issue shall be provided,—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0073",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 73,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 14251,
    "char_end": 15146,
    "char_count": 895,
    "text": "(a) one certificate for all his shares without payment of any charges; or\n(b) several certificates, each for one or more of his shares, upon payment of twenty rupees for\neach certificate after the first.\n1[(ii) Every certificate shall specify the shares to which it relates and the amount paid-up thereon and\nshall be signed by two directors or by a director and the company secretary, wherever the company has\nappointed a company secretary:\nProvided that in case the company has a common seal it shall be affixed in the presence of the persons\nrequired to sign the certificate.\nExplanation.—For the purposes of this item, it is hereby clarified that in case of an One Person\nCompany, it shall be sufficient if the certificate is signed by a director and the company secretary,\nwherever the company has appointed a company secretary, or any other person authorised by the Board\nfor the purpose.]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0074",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 74,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 15147,
    "char_end": 15410,
    "char_count": 263,
    "text": "(iii) In respect of any share or shares held jointly by several persons, the company shall not be bound\nto issue more than one certificate, and delivery of a certificate for a share to one of several joint holders\nshall be sufficient delivery to all such holders.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0075",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 75,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 15411,
    "char_end": 15984,
    "char_count": 573,
    "text": "3. (i) If any share certificate be worn out, defaced, mutilated or torn or if there be no further space on\nthe back for endorsement of transfer, then upon production and surrender thereof to the company, a new\ncertificate may be issued in lieu thereof, and if any certificate is lost or destroyed then upon proof thereof\nto the satisfaction of the company and on execution of such indemnity as the company deem adequate, a\nnew certificate in lieu thereof shall be given. Every certificate under this Article shall be issued on\npayment of twenty rupees for each certificate.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 76,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 15985,
    "char_end": 16087,
    "char_count": 102,
    "text": "(ii) The provisions of Articles (2) and (3) shall mutatis mutandis apply to debentures of the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 77,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 16088,
    "char_end": 16617,
    "char_count": 529,
    "text": "4. Except as required by law, no person shall be recognised by the company as holding any share\nupon any trust, and the company shall not be bound by, or be compelled in any way to recognise (even\nwhen having notice thereof) any equitable, contingent, future or partial interest in any share, or any\ninterest in any fractional part of a share, or (except only as by these regulations or by law otherwise\nprovided) any other rights in respect of any share except an absolute right to the entirety thereof in the\nregistered holder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0078",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 78,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 16619,
    "char_end": 16740,
    "char_count": 121,
    "text": "1. Subs. by Notification No. G.S.R. 362(E), dated 10th April, 2018 for item (ii) in sub-paragraph (2) (w.e.f. 10-4-2018).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0079",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 79,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 16742,
    "char_end": 16743,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "8",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0080",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 80,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 16745,
    "char_end": 17029,
    "char_count": 284,
    "text": "5. (i) The company may exercise the powers of paying commissions conferred by sub-section (6) of\nsection 40, provided that the rate per cent. or the amount of the commission paid or agreed to be paid shall\nbe disclosed in the manner required by that section and rules made thereunder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0081",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 81,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 17030,
    "char_end": 17169,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "(ii) The rate or amount of the commission shall not exceed the rate or amount prescribed in rules\nmade under sub-section (6) of section 40.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0082",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 82,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 17170,
    "char_end": 17328,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "(iii) The commission may be satisfied by the payment of cash or the allotment of fully or partly paid\nshares or partly in the one way and partly in the other.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0083",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 83,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 17329,
    "char_end": 17844,
    "char_count": 515,
    "text": "6. (i) If at any time the share capital is divided into different classes of shares, the rights attached to\nany class (unless otherwise provided by the terms of issue of the shares of that class) may, subject to the\nprovisions of section 48, and whether or not the company is being wound up, be varied with the consent\nin writing of the holders of three-fourths of the issued shares of that class, or with the sanction of a special\nresolution passed at a separate meeting of the holders of the shares of that class.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0084",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 84,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 17845,
    "char_end": 18113,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "(ii) To every such separate meeting, the provisions of these regulations relating to general meetings\nshall mutatis mutandis apply, but so that the necessary quorum shall be at least two persons holding at\nleast one-third of the issued shares of the class in question.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0085",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 85,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 18114,
    "char_end": 18413,
    "char_count": 299,
    "text": "7. The rights conferred upon the holders of the shares of any class issued with preferred or other\nrights shall not, unless otherwise expressly provided by the terms of issue of the shares of that class, be\ndeemed to be varied by the creation or issue of further shares ranking pari passu therewith.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0086",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 86,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 18414,
    "char_end": 18704,
    "char_count": 290,
    "text": "8. Subject to the provisions of section 55, any preference shares may, with the sanction of an ordinary\nresolution, be issued on the terms that they are to be redeemed on such terms and in such manner as the\ncompany before the issue of the shares may, by special resolution, determine.\nLien",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0087",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 87,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 18705,
    "char_end": 18929,
    "char_count": 224,
    "text": "9. (i) The company shall have a first and paramount lien—\n(a) on every share (not being a fully paid share), for all monies (whether presently payable or not)\ncalled, or payable at a fixed time, in respect of that share; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0088",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 88,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 18930,
    "char_end": 19237,
    "char_count": 307,
    "text": "(b) on all shares (not being fully paid shares) standing registered in the name of a single person,\nfor all monies presently payable by him or his estate to the company:\nProvided that the Board of directors may at any time declare any share to be wholly or in part\nexempt from the provisions of this clause.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0089",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 89,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 19238,
    "char_end": 19385,
    "char_count": 147,
    "text": "(ii) The company’s lien, if any, on a share shall extend to all dividends payable and bonuses declared\nfrom time to time in respect of such shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0090",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 90,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 19386,
    "char_end": 19532,
    "char_count": 146,
    "text": "10. The company may sell, in such manner as the Board thinks fit, any shares on which the company\nhas a lien:\nProvided that no sale shall be made—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0091",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 91,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 19533,
    "char_end": 19937,
    "char_count": 404,
    "text": "(a) unless a sum in respect of which the lien exists is presently payable; or\n(b) until the expiration of fourteen days after a notice in writing stating and demanding payment\nof such part of the amount in respect of which the lien exists as is presently payable, has been given to\nthe registered holder for the time being of the share or the person entitled thereto by reason of his\ndeath or insolvency.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0092",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 92,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 19938,
    "char_end": 20068,
    "char_count": 130,
    "text": "11. (i) To give effect to any such sale, the Board may authorise some person to transfer the shares\nsold to the purchaser thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0093",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 93,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 20069,
    "char_end": 20167,
    "char_count": 98,
    "text": "(ii) The purchaser shall be registered as the holder of the shares comprised in any such transfer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0094",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 94,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 20168,
    "char_end": 20380,
    "char_count": 212,
    "text": "(iii) The purchaser shall not be bound to see to the application of the purchase money, nor shall his\ntitle to the shares be affected by any irregularity or invalidity in the proceedings in reference to the sale.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0095",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 95,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 20382,
    "char_end": 20383,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "9",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0096",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 96,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 20385,
    "char_end": 20561,
    "char_count": 176,
    "text": "12. (i) The proceeds of the sale shall be received by the company and applied in payment of such part\nof the amount in respect of which the lien exists as is presently payable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0097",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 97,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 20562,
    "char_end": 20778,
    "char_count": 216,
    "text": "(ii) The residue, if any, shall, subject to a like lien for sums not presently payable as existed upon the\nshares before the sale, be paid to the person entitled to the shares at the date of the sale.\nCalls on shares",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0098",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 98,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 20779,
    "char_end": 21230,
    "char_count": 451,
    "text": "13. (i) The Board may, from time to time, make calls upon the members in respect of any monies\nunpaid on their shares (whether on account of the nominal value of the shares or by way of premium) and\nnot by the conditions of allotment thereof made payable at fixed times:\nProvided that no call shall exceed one-fourth of the nominal value of the share or be payable at less\nthan one month from the date fixed for the payment of the last preceding call.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0099",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 99,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 21231,
    "char_end": 21455,
    "char_count": 224,
    "text": "(ii) Each member shall, subject to receiving at least fourteen days’ notice specifying the time or times\nand place of payment, pay to the company, at the time or times and place so specified, the amount called\non his shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0100",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 100,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 21456,
    "char_end": 21697,
    "char_count": 241,
    "text": "(iii) A call may be revoked or postponed at the discretion of the Board.\n14. A call shall be deemed to have been made at the time when the resolution of the Board\nauthorising the call was passed and may be required to be paid by instalments.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0101",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 101,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 21698,
    "char_end": 21805,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "15. The joint holders of a share shall be jointly and severally liable to pay all calls in respect thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0102",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 102,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 21806,
    "char_end": 22137,
    "char_count": 331,
    "text": "16. (i) If a sum called in respect of a share is not paid before or on the day appointed for payment\nthereof, the person from whom the sum is due shall pay interest thereon from the day appointed for\npayment thereof to the time of actual payment at ten per cent. per annum or at such lower rate, if any, as\nthe Board may determine.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0103",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 103,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 22138,
    "char_end": 22229,
    "char_count": 91,
    "text": "(ii) The Board shall be at liberty to waive payment of any such interest wholly or in part.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0104",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 104,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 22230,
    "char_end": 22570,
    "char_count": 340,
    "text": "17. (i) Any sum which by the terms of issue of a share becomes payable on allotment or at any fixed\ndate, whether on account of the nominal value of the share or by way of premium, shall, for the purposes\nof these regulations, be deemed to be a call duly made and payable on the date on which by the terms of\nissue such sum becomes payable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0105",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 105,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 22571,
    "char_end": 22814,
    "char_count": 243,
    "text": "(ii) In case of non-payment of such sum, all the relevant provisions of these regulations as to payment\nof interest and expenses, forfeiture or otherwise shall apply as if such sum had become payable by virtue\nof a call duly made and notified.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0106",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 106,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 22815,
    "char_end": 22992,
    "char_count": 177,
    "text": "18. The Board—\n(a) may, if it thinks fit, receive from any member willing to advance the same, all or any part of\nthe monies uncalled and unpaid upon any shares held by him; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0107",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 107,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 22993,
    "char_end": 23346,
    "char_count": 353,
    "text": "(b) upon all or any of the monies so advanced, may (until the same would, but for such advance,\nbecome presently payable) pay interest at such rate not exceeding, unless the company in general\nmeeting shall otherwise direct, twelve per cent. per annum, as may be agreed upon between the Board\nand the member paying the sum in advance.\nTransfer of shares",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0108",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 108,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23347,
    "char_end": 23482,
    "char_count": 135,
    "text": "19. (i) The instrument of transfer of any share in the company shall be executed by or on behalf of\nboth the transferor and transferee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0109",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 109,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23483,
    "char_end": 23641,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "(ii) The transferor shall be deemed to remain a holder of the share until the name of the transferee is\nentered in the register of members in respect thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0110",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 110,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23642,
    "char_end": 23736,
    "char_count": 94,
    "text": "20. The Board may, subject to the right of appeal conferred by section 58 decline to register—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0111",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 111,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23737,
    "char_end": 23839,
    "char_count": 102,
    "text": "(a) the transfer of a share, not being a fully paid share, to a person of whom they do not approve;\nor",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0112",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 112,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23840,
    "char_end": 23899,
    "char_count": 59,
    "text": "(b) any transfer of shares on which the company has a lien.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0113",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 113,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 23901,
    "char_end": 23903,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "10",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0114",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 114,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 23905,
    "char_end": 24089,
    "char_count": 184,
    "text": "21. The Board may decline to recognise any instrument of transfer unless—\n(a) the instrument of transfer is in the form as prescribed in rules made under sub-section (1) of\nsection 56;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0115",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 115,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 24090,
    "char_end": 24311,
    "char_count": 221,
    "text": "(b) the instrument of transfer is accompanied by the certificate of the shares to which it relates,\nand such other evidence as the Board may reasonably require to show the right of the transferor to\nmake the transfer; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0116",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 116,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 24312,
    "char_end": 24808,
    "char_count": 496,
    "text": "(c) the instrument of transfer is in respect of only one class of shares.\n22. On giving not less than seven days’ previous notice in accordance with section 91and rules made\nthereunder, the registration of transfers may be suspended at such times and for such periods as the Board\nmay from time to time determine:\nProvided that such registration shall not be suspended for more than thirty days at any one time or for\nmore than forty-five days in the aggregate in any year.\nTransmission of shares",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0117",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 117,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 24809,
    "char_end": 25089,
    "char_count": 280,
    "text": "23. (i) On the death of a member, the survivor or survivors where the member was a joint holder, and\nhis nominee or nominees or legal representatives where he was a sole holder, shall be the only persons\nrecognised by the company as having any title to his interest in the shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0118",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 118,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 25090,
    "char_end": 25266,
    "char_count": 176,
    "text": "(ii) Nothing in clause (i) shall release the estate of a deceased joint holder from any liability in respect\nof any share which had been jointly held by him with other persons.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0119",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 119,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 25267,
    "char_end": 25518,
    "char_count": 251,
    "text": "24. (i) Any person becoming entitled to a share in consequence of the death or insolvency of a\nmember may, upon such evidence being produced as may from time to time properly be required by the\nBoard and subject as hereinafter provided, elect, either—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0120",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 120,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 25519,
    "char_end": 25666,
    "char_count": 147,
    "text": "(a) to be registered himself as holder of the share; or\n(b) to make such transfer of the share as the deceased or insolvent member could have made.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0121",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 121,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 25667,
    "char_end": 25875,
    "char_count": 208,
    "text": "(ii) The Board shall, in either case, have the same right to decline or suspend registration as it would\nhave had, if the deceased or insolvent member had transferred the share before his death or insolvency.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0122",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 122,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 25876,
    "char_end": 26080,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "25. (i) If the person so becoming entitled shall elect to be registered as holder of the share himself, he\nshall deliver or send to the company a notice in writing signed by him stating that he so elects.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0123",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 123,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 26081,
    "char_end": 26212,
    "char_count": 131,
    "text": "(ii) If the person aforesaid shall elect to transfer the share, he shall testify his election by executing a\ntransfer of the share.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0124",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 124,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 26213,
    "char_end": 26557,
    "char_count": 344,
    "text": "(iii) All the limitations, restrictions and provisions of these regulations relating to the right to transfer\nand the registration of transfers of shares shall be applicable to any such notice or transfer as aforesaid as\nif the death or insolvency of the member had not occurred and the notice or transfer were a transfer signed\nby that member.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0125",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 125,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 26558,
    "char_end": 27375,
    "char_count": 817,
    "text": "26. A person becoming entitled to a share by reason of the death or insolvency of the holder shall be\nentitled to the same dividends and other advantages to which he would been titled if he were the\nregistered holder of the share, except that he shall not, before being registered as a member in respect of\nthe share, be entitled in respect of it to exercise any right conferred by membership in relation to meetings\nof the company:\nProvided that the Board may, at any time, give notice requiring any such person to elect either to be\nregistered himself or to transfer the share, and if the notice is not complied with within ninety days, the\nBoard may thereafter withhold payment of all dividends, bonuses or other monies payable in respect of\nthe share, until the requirements of the notice have been complied with.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0126",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 126,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 27376,
    "char_end": 27580,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "27. In case of a One Person Company—\n(i) on the death of the sole member, the person nominated by such member shall be the person\nrecognised by the company as having title to all the shares of the member;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0127",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 127,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 27582,
    "char_end": 27584,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "11",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0128",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 128,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 27586,
    "char_end": 27729,
    "char_count": 143,
    "text": "(ii) the nominee on becoming entitled to such shares in case of the member’s death shall be\ninformed of such event by the Board of the company;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0129",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 129,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 27730,
    "char_end": 27886,
    "char_count": 156,
    "text": "(iii) such nominee shall be entitled to the same dividends and other rights and liabilities to which\nsuch sole member of the company was entitled or liable;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0130",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 130,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 27887,
    "char_end": 28109,
    "char_count": 222,
    "text": "(iv) on becoming member, such nominee shall nominate any other person with the prior written\nconsent of such person who, shall in the event of the death of the member, become the member of the\ncompany.\nForfeiture of shares",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0131",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 131,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 28110,
    "char_end": 28466,
    "char_count": 356,
    "text": "28. If a member fails to pay any call, or instalment of a call, on the day appointed for payment\nthereof, the Board may, at any time thereafter during such time as any part of the call or instalment\nremains unpaid, serve a notice on him requiring payment of so much of the call or instalment as is unpaid,\ntogether with any interest which may have accrued.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0132",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 132,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 28467,
    "char_end": 28686,
    "char_count": 219,
    "text": "29. The notice aforesaid shall—\n(a) name a further day (not being earlier than the expiry of fourteen days from the date of service\nof the notice) on or before which the payment required by the notice is to be made; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0133",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 133,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 28687,
    "char_end": 28843,
    "char_count": 156,
    "text": "(b) state that, in the event of non-payment on or before the day so named, the shares in respect of\nwhich the call was made shall be liable to be forfeited.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0134",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 134,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 28844,
    "char_end": 29122,
    "char_count": 278,
    "text": "30. If the requirements of any such notice as aforesaid are not complied with, any share in respect of\nwhich the notice has been given may, at any time thereafter, before the payment required by the notice\nhas been made, be forfeited by a resolution of the Board to that effect.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0135",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 135,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 29123,
    "char_end": 29243,
    "char_count": 120,
    "text": "31. (i) A forfeited share may be sold or otherwise disposed of on such terms and in such manner as\nthe Board thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0136",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 136,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 29244,
    "char_end": 29368,
    "char_count": 124,
    "text": "(ii) At any time before a sale or disposal as aforesaid, the Board may cancel the forfeiture on such\nterms as it thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0137",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 137,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 29369,
    "char_end": 29676,
    "char_count": 307,
    "text": "32. (i) A person whose shares have been forfeited shall cease to be a member in respect of the\nforfeited shares, but shall, notwithstanding the forfeiture, remain liable to pay to the company all monies\nwhich, at the date of forfeiture, were presently payable by him to the company in respect of the shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0138",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 138,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 29677,
    "char_end": 29827,
    "char_count": 150,
    "text": "(ii) The liability of such person shall cease if and when the company shall have received payment in\nfull of all such monies in respect of the shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0139",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 139,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 29828,
    "char_end": 30165,
    "char_count": 337,
    "text": "33. (i) A duly verified declaration in writing that the declarant is a director, the manager or the\nsecretary, of the company, and that a share in the company has been duly forfeited on a date stated in the\ndeclaration, shall be conclusive evidence of the facts therein stated as against all persons claiming to be\nentitled to the share;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0140",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 140,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 30166,
    "char_end": 30379,
    "char_count": 213,
    "text": "(ii) The company may receive the consideration, if any, given for the share on any sale or disposal\nthereof and may execute a transfer of the share in favour of the person to whom the share is sold or\ndisposed of;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0141",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 141,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 30380,
    "char_end": 30462,
    "char_count": 82,
    "text": "(iii) The transferee shall thereupon be registered as the holder of the share; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0142",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 142,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 30463,
    "char_end": 30719,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "(iv) The transferee shall not be bound to see to the application of the purchase money, if any, nor shall\nhis title to the share be affected by any irregularity or invalidity in the proceedings in reference to the\nforfeiture, sale or disposal of the share.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0143",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 143,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 30720,
    "char_end": 31051,
    "char_count": 331,
    "text": "34. The provisions of these regulations as to forfeiture shall apply in the case of non-payment of any\nsum which, by the terms of issue of a share, becomes payable at a fixed time, whether on account of the\nnominal value of the share or by way of premium, as if the same had been payable by virtue of a call duly\nmade and notified.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0144",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 144,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31053,
    "char_end": 31055,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "12",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0145",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 145,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31057,
    "char_end": 31262,
    "char_count": 205,
    "text": "Alteration of capital\n35. The company may, from time to time, by ordinary resolution increase the share capital by such\nsum, to be divided into shares of such amount, as may be specified in the resolution.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0146",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 146,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31263,
    "char_end": 31349,
    "char_count": 86,
    "text": "36. Subject to the provisions of section 61, the company may, by ordinary resolution,—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0147",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 147,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31350,
    "char_end": 31463,
    "char_count": 113,
    "text": "(a) consolidate and divide all or any of its share capital into shares of larger amount than its\nexisting shares;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0148",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 148,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31464,
    "char_end": 31598,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(b) convert all or any of its fully paid-up shares into stock, and reconvert that stock into fully\npaid-up shares of any denomination;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0149",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 149,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31599,
    "char_end": 31711,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(c) sub-divide its existing shares or any of them into shares of smaller amount than is fixed by the\nmemorandum;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0150",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 150,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31712,
    "char_end": 31843,
    "char_count": 131,
    "text": "(d) cancel any shares which, at the date of the passing of the resolution, have-not been taken or\nagreed to be taken by any person.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0151",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 151,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 31844,
    "char_end": 32361,
    "char_count": 517,
    "text": "37. Where shares are converted into stock,—\n(a) the holders of stock may transfer the same or any part thereof in the same manner as, and\nsubject to the same regulations under which, the shares from which the stock arose might before the\nconversion have been transferred, or as near thereto as circumstances admit:\nProvided that the Board may, from time to time, fix the minimum amount of stock transferable,\nso, however, that such minimum shall not exceed the nominal amount of the shares from which the\nstock arose.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0152",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 152,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 32362,
    "char_end": 32878,
    "char_count": 516,
    "text": "(b) the holders of stock shall, according to the amount of stock held by them, have the same\nrights, privileges and advantages as regards dividends, voting at meetings of the company, and other\nmatters, as if they held the shares from which the stock arose; but no such privilege or advantage\n(except participation in the dividends and profits of the company and in the assets on winding up)\nshall be conferred by an amount of stock which would not, if existing in shares, have conferred that\nprivilege or advantage.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0153",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 153,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 32879,
    "char_end": 33094,
    "char_count": 215,
    "text": "(c) such of the regulations of the company as are applicable to paid-up shares shall apply to stock\nand the words “share” and “shareholder” in those regulations shall include “stock” and “stock-holder”\nrespectively.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0154",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 154,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33095,
    "char_end": 33239,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "38. The company may, by special resolution, reduce in any manner and with, and subject to, any\nincident authorised and consent required by law,—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0155",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 155,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33240,
    "char_end": 33366,
    "char_count": 126,
    "text": "(a) its share capital;\n(b) any capital redemption reserve account; or\n(c) any share premium account.\nCapitalisation of profits",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0156",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 156,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33367,
    "char_end": 33457,
    "char_count": 90,
    "text": "39. (i) The company in general meeting may, upon the recommendation of the Board, resolve—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0157",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 157,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33458,
    "char_end": 33697,
    "char_count": 239,
    "text": "(a) that it is desirable to capitalise any part of the amount for the time being standing to the credit\nof any of the company’s reserve accounts, or to the credit of the profit and loss account, or otherwise\navailable for distribution; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0158",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 158,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33698,
    "char_end": 33916,
    "char_count": 218,
    "text": "(b) that such sum be accordingly set free for distribution in the manner specified in clause (ii)\namongst the members who would have been entitled thereto, if distributed by way of dividend and in\nthe same proportions.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0159",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 159,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 33917,
    "char_end": 34061,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "(ii) The sum aforesaid shall not be paid in cash but shall be applied, subject to the provision contained\nin clause (iii), either in or towards—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0160",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 160,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 34062,
    "char_end": 34162,
    "char_count": 100,
    "text": "(A) paying up any amounts for the time being unpaid on any shares held by such members\nrespectively;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0161",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 161,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34164,
    "char_end": 34166,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "13",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0162",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 162,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34168,
    "char_end": 34338,
    "char_count": 170,
    "text": "(B) paying up in full, unissued shares of the company to be allotted and distributed, credited as\nfully paid-up, to and amongst such members in the proportions aforesaid;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0163",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 163,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34339,
    "char_end": 34436,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "(C) partly in the way specified in sub-clause (A) and partly in that specified in sub-clause (B);",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0164",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 164,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34437,
    "char_end": 34666,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "(D) A securities premium account and a capital redemption reserve account may, for the purposes\nof this regulation, be applied in the paying up of unissued shares to be issued to members of the\ncompany as fully paid bonus shares;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0165",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 165,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34667,
    "char_end": 34771,
    "char_count": 104,
    "text": "(E) The Board shall give effect to the resolution passed by the company in pursuance of this\nregulation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0166",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 166,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34772,
    "char_end": 34860,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "40. (i) Whenever such a resolution as aforesaid shall have been passed, the Board shall—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0167",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 167,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 34861,
    "char_end": 35029,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "(a) make all appropriations and applications of the undivided profits resolved to be capitalised\nthereby, and all allotments and issues of fully paid shares if any; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0168",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 168,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 35030,
    "char_end": 35132,
    "char_count": 102,
    "text": "(b) generally do all acts and things required to give effect thereto.\n(ii) The Board shall have power—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0169",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 169,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 35133,
    "char_end": 35317,
    "char_count": 184,
    "text": "(a) to make such provisions, by the issue of fractional certificates or by payment in cash or\notherwise as it thinks fit, for the case of shares becoming distributable infractions; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0170",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 170,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 35318,
    "char_end": 35852,
    "char_count": 534,
    "text": "(b) to authorise any person to enter, on behalf of all the members entitled thereto, into an\nagreement with the company providing for the allotment to them respectively, credited as fully paid-\nup, of any further shares to which they may be entitled upon such capitalisation, or as the case may\nrequire, for the payment by the company on their behalf, by the application thereto of their respective\nproportions of profits resolved  to be capitalised, of the amount or any part of the amounts remaining\nunpaid on their existing shares;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0171",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 171,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 35853,
    "char_end": 35965,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(iii) any agreement made under such authority shall be effective and binding on such members.\nBuy-back of shares",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0172",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 172,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 35966,
    "char_end": 36253,
    "char_count": 287,
    "text": "41. Notwithstanding anything contained in these articles but subject to the provisions of sections 68 to\n70 and any other applicable provision of the Act or any other law for the time being in force, the company\nmay purchase its own shares or other specified securities.\nGeneral meetings",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0173",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 173,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 36254,
    "char_end": 36359,
    "char_count": 105,
    "text": "42. All general meetings other than annual general meeting shall be called extraordinary general\nmeeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0174",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 174,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 36360,
    "char_end": 36445,
    "char_count": 85,
    "text": "43. (i) The Board may, whenever it thinks fit, call an extraordinary general meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0175",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 175,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 36446,
    "char_end": 36785,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "(ii) If at any time directors capable of acting who are sufficient in number to form a quorum are not\nwithin India, any director or any two members of the company may call an extraordinary general meeting\nin the same manner, as nearly as possible, as that in which such a meeting may be called by the Board.\nProceedings at general meetings",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0176",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 176,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 36786,
    "char_end": 36937,
    "char_count": 151,
    "text": "44. (i) No business shall be transacted at any general meeting unless a quorum of members is present\nat the time when the meeting proceeds to business.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0177",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 177,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 36938,
    "char_end": 37050,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(ii) Save as otherwise provided herein, the quorum for the general meetings shall be as provided in\nsection 103.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0178",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 178,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 37051,
    "char_end": 37162,
    "char_count": 111,
    "text": "45. The Chairperson, if any, of the Board shall preside as Chairperson at every general meeting of the\ncompany.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0179",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 179,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 37163,
    "char_end": 37439,
    "char_count": 276,
    "text": "46. If there is no such Chairperson, or if he is not present within fifteen minutes after the time\nappointed for holding the meeting, or is unwilling to act as Chairperson of the meeting, the directors\npresent shall elect one of their members to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0180",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 180,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 37441,
    "char_end": 37443,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "14",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0181",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 181,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 37445,
    "char_end": 37701,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "47. If at any meeting no director is willing to act as Chairperson or if no director is present within\nfifteen minutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the members present shall choose one of\ntheir members to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0182",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 182,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 37702,
    "char_end": 38000,
    "char_count": 298,
    "text": "48. In case of a One Person Company—\n(i) the resolution required to be passed at the general meetings of the company shall be deemed to\nhave been passed if the resolution is agreed upon by the sole member and communicated to the\ncompany and entered in the minutes book maintained under section 118;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0183",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 183,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38001,
    "char_end": 38189,
    "char_count": 188,
    "text": "(ii) such minutes book shall be signed and dated by the member;\n(iii) the resolution shall become effective from the date of signing such minutes by the sole\nmember.\nAdjournment of meeting",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0184",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 184,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38190,
    "char_end": 38385,
    "char_count": 195,
    "text": "49. (i) The Chairperson may, with the consent of any meeting at which a quorum is present, and shall,\nif so directed by the meeting, adjourn the meeting from time to time and from place to place.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0185",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 185,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38386,
    "char_end": 38541,
    "char_count": 155,
    "text": "(ii) No business shall be transacted at any adjourned meeting other than the business left unfinished at\nthe meeting from which the adjournment took place.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0186",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 186,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38542,
    "char_end": 38686,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "(iii) When a meeting is adjourned for thirty days or more, notice of the adjourned meeting shall be\ngiven as in the case of an original meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0187",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 187,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38687,
    "char_end": 38891,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "(iv) Save as aforesaid, and as provided in section 103 of the Act, it shall not be necessary to give any\nnotice of an adjournment or of the business to be transacted at an adjourned meeting.\nVoting rights",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0188",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 188,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38892,
    "char_end": 38997,
    "char_count": 105,
    "text": "50. Subject to any rights or restrictions for the time being attached to any class or classes of shares,—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0189",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 189,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 38998,
    "char_end": 39209,
    "char_count": 211,
    "text": "(a) on a show of hands, every member present in person shall have one vote; and\n(b) on a poll, the voting rights of members shall be in proportion to his share in the paid-up equity\nshare capital of the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0190",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 190,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 39210,
    "char_end": 39334,
    "char_count": 124,
    "text": "51. A member may exercise his vote at a meeting by electronic means in accordance with section 108\nand shall vote only once.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0191",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 191,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 39335,
    "char_end": 39522,
    "char_count": 187,
    "text": "52. (i) In the case of joint holders, the vote of the senior who tenders a vote, whether in person or by\nproxy, shall be accepted to the exclusion of the votes of the other joint holders.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0192",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 192,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 39523,
    "char_end": 39641,
    "char_count": 118,
    "text": "(ii) For this purpose, seniority shall be determined by the order in which the names stand in the\nregister of members.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0193",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 193,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 39642,
    "char_end": 39919,
    "char_count": 277,
    "text": "53. A member of unsound mind, or in respect of whom an order has been made by any court having\njurisdiction in lunacy, may vote, whether on a show of hands or on a poll, by his committee or other legal\nguardian, and any such committee or guardian may, on a poll, vote by proxy.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0194",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 194,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 39920,
    "char_end": 40043,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "54. Any business other than that upon which a poll has been demanded may be proceeded with,\npending the taking of the poll.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0195",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 195,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 40044,
    "char_end": 40214,
    "char_count": 170,
    "text": "55. No member shall be entitled to vote at any general meeting unless all calls or other sums presently\npayable by him in respect of shares in the company have been paid.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0196",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 196,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 40215,
    "char_end": 40459,
    "char_count": 244,
    "text": "56. (i) No objection shall be raised to the qualification of any voter except at the meeting or adjourned\nmeeting at which the vote objected to is given or tendered, and every vote not disallowed at such meeting\nshall be valid for all purposes.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0197",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 197,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 40460,
    "char_end": 40599,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "(ii) Any such objection made in due time shall be referred to the Chairperson of the meeting, whose\ndecision shall be final and conclusive.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0198",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 198,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 40601,
    "char_end": 40603,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "15",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0199",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 199,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 40605,
    "char_end": 41154,
    "char_count": 549,
    "text": "Proxy\n57. The instrument appointing a proxy and the power-of-attorney or other authority, if any, under\nwhich it is signed or a notarised copy of that power or authority, shall be deposited at the registered office\nof the company not less than 48 hours before the time for holding the meeting or adjourned meeting at\nwhich the person named in the instrument proposes to vote, or, in the case of a poll, not less than 24 hours\nbefore the time appointed for the taking of the poll; and in default the instrument of proxy shall not be\ntreated as valid.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0200",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 200,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 41155,
    "char_end": 41263,
    "char_count": 108,
    "text": "58. An instrument appointing a proxy shall be in the form as prescribed in the rules made under\nsection 105.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0201",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 201,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 41264,
    "char_end": 41820,
    "char_count": 556,
    "text": "59. A vote given in accordance with the terms of an instrument of proxy shall be valid,\nnotwithstanding the previous death or insanity of the principal or the revocation of the proxy or of the\nauthority under which the proxy was executed, or the transfer of the shares in respect of which the proxy\nis given:\nProvided that no intimation in writing of such death, insanity, revocation or transfer shall have been\nreceived by the company at its office before the commencement of the meeting or adjourned meeting at\nwhich the proxy is used.\nBoard of Directors",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0202",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 202,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 41821,
    "char_end": 41980,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "60. The number of the directors and the names of the first directors shall be determined in writing by\nthe subscribers of the memorandum or a majority of them.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0203",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 203,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 41981,
    "char_end": 42113,
    "char_count": 132,
    "text": "61. (i) The remuneration of the directors shall, in so far as it consists of a monthly payment, be\ndeemed to accrue from day-to-day.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0204",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 204,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 42114,
    "char_end": 42285,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "(ii) In addition to the remuneration payable to them in pursuance of the Act, the directors may be paid\nall travelling, hotel and other expenses properly incurred by them—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0205",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 205,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 42286,
    "char_end": 42420,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(a) in attending and returning from meetings of the Board of Directors or any committee thereof\nor general meetings of the company; or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0206",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 206,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 42421,
    "char_end": 42559,
    "char_count": 138,
    "text": "(b) in connection with the business of the company.\n62. The Board may pay all expenses incurred in getting up and registering the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0207",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 207,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 42560,
    "char_end": 42838,
    "char_count": 278,
    "text": "63. The company may exercise the powers conferred on it by section 88 with regard to the keeping of\na foreign register; and the Board may (subject to the provisions of that section) make and vary such\nregulations as it may thinks fit respecting the keeping of any such register.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0208",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 208,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 42839,
    "char_end": 43173,
    "char_count": 334,
    "text": "64. All cheques, promissory notes, drafts, hundis, bills of exchange and other negotiable instruments,\nand all receipts for monies paid to the company, shall be signed, drawn, accepted, endorsed, or otherwise\nexecuted, as the case may be, by such person and in such manner as the Board shall from time to time by\nresolution determine.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0209",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 209,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 43174,
    "char_end": 43313,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "65. Every director present at any meeting of the Board or of a committee thereof shall sign his name\nin a book to be kept for that purpose.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0210",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 210,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 43314,
    "char_end": 43631,
    "char_count": 317,
    "text": "66. (i) Subject to the provisions of section 149, the Board shall have power at any time, and from time\nto time, to appoint a person as an additional director, provided the number of the directors and additional\ndirectors together shall not at any time exceed the maximum strength fixed for the Board by the articles.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0211",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 211,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 43632,
    "char_end": 43882,
    "char_count": 250,
    "text": "(ii) Such person shall hold office only up to the date of the next annual general meeting of the\ncompany but shall be eligible for appointment by the company as a director at that meeting subject to the\nprovisions of the Act.\nProceedings of the Board",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0212",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 212,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 43883,
    "char_end": 44014,
    "char_count": 131,
    "text": "67. (i) The Board of Directors may meet for the conduct of business, adjourn and otherwise regulate\nits meetings, as it thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0213",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 213,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44016,
    "char_end": 44018,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "16",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0214",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 214,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44020,
    "char_end": 44153,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "(ii) A director may, and the manager or secretary on the requisition of a director shall, at any time,\nsummon a meeting of the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0215",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 215,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44154,
    "char_end": 44297,
    "char_count": 143,
    "text": "68. (i) Save as otherwise expressly provided in the Act, questions arising at any meeting of the Board\nshall be decided by a majority of votes.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0216",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 216,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44298,
    "char_end": 44410,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(ii) In case of an equality of votes, the Chairperson of the Board, if any, shall have a second or casting\nvote.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0217",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 217,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44411,
    "char_end": 44803,
    "char_count": 392,
    "text": "69. The continuing directors may act notwithstanding any vacancy in the Board; but, if and so long as\ntheir number is reduced below the quorum fixed by the Act for a meeting of the Board, the continuing\ndirectors or director may act for the purpose of increasing the number of directors to that fixed for the\nquorum, or of summoning a general meeting of the company, but for no other purpose.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0218",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 218,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44804,
    "char_end": 44918,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "70. (i) The Board may elect a Chairperson of its meetings and determine the period for which he is to\nhold office.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0219",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 219,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 44919,
    "char_end": 45167,
    "char_count": 248,
    "text": "(ii) If no such Chairperson is elected, or if at any meeting the Chairperson is not present within five\nminutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the directors present may choose one of their\nnumber to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0220",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 220,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 45168,
    "char_end": 45336,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "71. (i) The Board may, subject to the provisions of the Act, delegate any of its powers to committees\nconsisting of such member or members of its body as it thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0221",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 221,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 45337,
    "char_end": 45483,
    "char_count": 146,
    "text": "(ii) Any committee so formed shall, in the exercise of the powers so delegated, conform to any\nregulations that may be imposed on it by the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0222",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 222,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 45484,
    "char_end": 45792,
    "char_count": 308,
    "text": "72. (i) A committee may elect a Chairperson of its meetings.\n(ii) If no such Chairperson is elected, or if at any meeting the Chairperson is not present within five\nminutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the members present may choose one of their\nmembers to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0223",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 223,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 45793,
    "char_end": 46061,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "73. (i) A committee may meet and adjourn as it thinks fit.\n(ii) Questions arising at any meeting of a committee shall be determined by a majority of votes of the\nmembers present, and in case of an equality of votes, the Chairperson shall have a second or casting vote.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0224",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 224,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 46062,
    "char_end": 46513,
    "char_count": 451,
    "text": "74. All acts done in any meeting of the Board or of a committee thereof or by any person acting as a\ndirector, shall, notwithstanding that it may be afterwards discovered that there was some defect in the\nappointment of any one or more of such directors or of any person acting as aforesaid, or that they or any\nof them were disqualified, be as valid as if every such director or such person had been duly appointed\nand was qualified to be a director.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0225",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 225,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 46514,
    "char_end": 46861,
    "char_count": 347,
    "text": "75. Save as otherwise expressly provided in the Act, a resolution in writing, signed by all the\nmembers of the Board or of a committee thereof, for the time being entitled to receive notice of a meeting\nof the Board or committee, shall be valid and effective as if it had been passed at a meeting of the Board\nor committee, duly convened and held.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0226",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 226,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 46862,
    "char_end": 47078,
    "char_count": 216,
    "text": "76. In case of a One Person Company—\n(i) where the company is having only one director, all the businesses to be transacted at the\nmeeting of the Board shall be entered into minutes book maintained under section 118;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0227",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 227,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 47079,
    "char_end": 47322,
    "char_count": 243,
    "text": "(ii) such minutes book shall be signed and dated by the director;\n(iii) the resolution shall become effective from the date of signing such minutes by the director.\nChief Executive Officer, Manager, Company Secretary or Chief Financial Officer",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0228",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 228,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 47323,
    "char_end": 47558,
    "char_count": 235,
    "text": "77. Subject to the provisions of the Act,—\n(i) A chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer may be\nappointed by the Board for such term, at such remuneration and upon such conditions as it may thinks",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0229",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 229,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 47560,
    "char_end": 47562,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "17",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0230",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 230,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 47564,
    "char_end": 47722,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "fit; and any chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer so\nappointed may be removed by means of are solution of the Board;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0231",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 231,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 47723,
    "char_end": 47838,
    "char_count": 115,
    "text": "(ii) A director may be appointed as chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief\nfinancial officer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0232",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 232,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 47839,
    "char_end": 48236,
    "char_count": 397,
    "text": "78. A provision of the Act or these regulations requiring or authorising a thing to be done by or to a\ndirector and chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer shall not be\nsatisfied by its being done by or to the same person acting both as director and as, or in place of, chief\nexecutive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer.\nThe Seal",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0233",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 233,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 48237,
    "char_end": 49203,
    "char_count": 966,
    "text": "79. (i) The Board shall provide for the safe custody of the seal.\n(ii) The seal of the company shall not be affixed to any instrument except by the authority of a\nresolution of the Board or of a committee of the Board authorised by it in that behalf, and except in the\npresence of at least two directors and of the secretary or such other person as the Board may appoint for\nthe purpose; and those two directors and the secretary or other person aforesaid shall sign every\ninstrument to which the seal of the company is so affixed in their presence.\n2[Explanation.—For the purposes of this sub-paragraph it is hereby clarified that on and from the\ncommencement of the Companies (Amendment) Act, 2015 (21 of 2015), i.e. with effect from the 29th\nMay, 2015, company may not be required to have the seal by virtue of registration under the Act and if a\ncompany does not have the seal, the provisions of this sub-paragraph shall not be applicable.]\nDividends and Reserve",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0234",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 234,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 49204,
    "char_end": 49327,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "80. The company in general meeting may declare dividends, but no dividend shall exceed the amount\nrecommended by the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0235",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 235,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 49328,
    "char_end": 49510,
    "char_count": 182,
    "text": "81. Subject to the provisions of section 123, the Board may from time to time pay to the members\nsuch interim dividends as appear to it to be justified by the profits of the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0236",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 236,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 49511,
    "char_end": 50102,
    "char_count": 591,
    "text": "82. (i) The Board may, before recommending any dividend, set aside out of the profits of the\ncompany such sums as it thinks fit as a reserve or reserves which shall, at the discretion of the Board, be\napplicable for any purpose to which the profits of the company may be properly applied, including\nprovision for meeting contingencies or for equalizing dividends; and pending such application, may, at\nthe like discretion, either be employed in the business of the company or be invested in such investments\n(other than shares of the company) as the Board may, from time to time, thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0237",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 237,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 50103,
    "char_end": 50240,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "(ii) The Board may also carry forward any profits which it may consider necessary not to divide,\nwithout setting them aside as a reserve.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0238",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 238,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 50241,
    "char_end": 50644,
    "char_count": 403,
    "text": "83. (i) Subject to the rights of persons, if any, entitled to shares with special rights as to dividends, all\ndividends shall be declared and paid according to the amounts paid or credited as paid on the shares in\nrespect whereof the dividend is paid, but if and so long as nothing is paid upon any of the shares in the\ncompany, dividends may be declared and paid according to the amounts of the shares.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0239",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 239,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 50645,
    "char_end": 50790,
    "char_count": 145,
    "text": "(ii) No amount paid or credited as paid on a share in advance of calls shall be treated for the purposes\nof this regulation as paid on the share.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0240",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 240,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 50791,
    "char_end": 51149,
    "char_count": 358,
    "text": "(iii) All dividends shall be apportioned and paid proportionately to the amounts paid or credited as\npaid on the shares during any portion or portions of the period in respect of which the dividend is paid;\nbut if any share is issued on terms providing that it shall rank for dividend as from a particular date such\nshare shall rank for dividend accordingly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0241",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 241,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 51150,
    "char_end": 51356,
    "char_count": 206,
    "text": "84. The Board may deduct from any dividend payable to any member all sums of money, if any,\npresently payable by him to the company on account of calls or otherwise in relation to the shares of the\ncompany.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0242",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 242,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 51357,
    "char_end": 51776,
    "char_count": 419,
    "text": "85. (i) Any dividend, interest or other monies payable in cash in respect of shares may be paid by\ncheque or warrant sent through the post directed to the registered address of the holder or, in the case of\njoint holders, to the registered address of that one of the joint holders who is first named on the register of\nmembers, or to such person and to such address as the holder or joint holders may in writing direct.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0243",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 243,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 51778,
    "char_end": 51878,
    "char_count": 100,
    "text": "1. The Explanation ins. by Notification No. G.S.R. 362(E) dated 10th April, 2018 (w.e.f. 10-4-2018).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0244",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 244,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 51880,
    "char_end": 51882,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "18",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0245",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 245,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 51884,
    "char_end": 51986,
    "char_count": 102,
    "text": "(ii) Every such cheque or warrant shall be made payable to the order of the person to whom it is sent.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0246",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 246,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 51987,
    "char_end": 52143,
    "char_count": 156,
    "text": "86. Any one of two or more joint holders of a share may give effective receipts for any dividends,\nbonuses or other monies payable in respect of such share.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0247",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 247,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 52144,
    "char_end": 52290,
    "char_count": 146,
    "text": "87. Notice of any dividend that may have been declared shall be given to the persons entitled to share\ntherein in the manner mentioned in the Act.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0248",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 248,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 52291,
    "char_end": 52625,
    "char_count": 334,
    "text": "88. No dividend shall bear interest against the company.\nAccounts\n89. (i) The Board shall from time to time determine whether and to what extent and at what times and\nplaces and under what conditions or regulations, the accounts and books of the company, or any of them,\nshall be open to the inspection of members not being directors.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0249",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 249,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 52626,
    "char_end": 52848,
    "char_count": 222,
    "text": "(ii) No member (not being a director) shall have any right of inspecting any account or book or\ndocument of the company except as conferred by law or authorised by the Board or by the company in\ngeneral meeting.\nWinding up",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0250",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 250,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 52849,
    "char_end": 52930,
    "char_count": 81,
    "text": "90. Subject to the provisions of Chapter XX of the Act and rules made thereunder—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0251",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 251,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 52931,
    "char_end": 53252,
    "char_count": 321,
    "text": "(i) If the company shall be wound up, the liquidator may, with the sanction of a special resolution\nof the company and any other sanction required by the Act, divide amongst the members, in specie or\nkind, the whole or any part of the assets of the company, whether they shall consist of property of the\nsame kind or not.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0252",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 252,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 53253,
    "char_end": 53493,
    "char_count": 240,
    "text": "(ii) For the purpose aforesaid, the liquidator may set such value as he deems fair upon any\nproperty to be divided as aforesaid and may determine how such division shall be carried out as\nbetween the members or different classes of members.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0253",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 253,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 53494,
    "char_end": 53803,
    "char_count": 309,
    "text": "(iii) The liquidator may, with the like sanction, vest the whole or any part of such assets in\ntrustees upon such trusts for the benefit of the contributories if he considers necessary, but so that no\nmember shall be compelled to accept any shares or other securities whereon there is any liability.\nIndemnity",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0254",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 254,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 53804,
    "char_end": 54817,
    "char_count": 1013,
    "text": "91. Every officer of the company shall be indemnified out of the assets of the company against any\nliability incurred by him in defending any proceedings, whether civil or criminal, in which judgment is\ngiven in his favour or in which he is acquitted or in which relief is granted to him by the court or the\nTribunal.\nNote: The Articles shall be signed by each subscriber of the memorandum of association who shall add\nhis address, description and occupation, if any, in the presence of at least one witness who shall attest the\nsignature and shall likewise add his address, description and occupation, if any, and such signatures shall\nbe in form specified below:\nNames, addresses, descriptions\nand occupations of subscribers\nWitnesses (along with names, addresses,\ndescriptions and occupations)\nA.B. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nC.D. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nE.F. of…………. Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nG.H. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0255",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 255,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 54819,
    "char_end": 54821,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "19",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0256",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 256,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 54823,
    "char_end": 55052,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "I.J. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nK.L. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nM.N. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nDated the……..day of ………20……\nPlace: ................................",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0257",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 257,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 55054,
    "char_end": 55482,
    "char_count": 428,
    "text": "TABLE – G\nARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF A COMPANY LIMITED BY GUARANTEE AND\nHAVING A SHARE CAPITAL\n1. The number of members with which the company proposes to be registered is hundred, but the\nBoard of Directors may, from time to time, register an increase of members.\n2. All the articles of Table F in Schedule I annexed to the Companies Act, 2013 shall be deemed to be\nincorporated with these articles and to apply to the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0258",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 258,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 55484,
    "char_end": 56870,
    "char_count": 1386,
    "text": "TABLE - H\nARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF A COMPANY LIMITED BY GUARANTEE AND NOT\nHAVING SHARE CAPITAL\nInterpretation\nI. (1) In these regulations—\n(a) “the Act” means the Companies Act, 2013;\n(b) “the seal” means the common seal of the company.\n(2) Unless the context otherwise requires, words or expressions contained in these regulations shall\nhave the same meaning as in the Act or any statutory modification thereof in force at the date at which\nthese regulations become binding on the company.\nMembers\nII. 1. The number of members with which the company proposes to be registered is hundred, but the\nBoard of Directors may, from time to time, whenever the company or the business of the company\nrequires it, register an increase of members.\n2. The subscribers to the memorandum and such other persons as the Board shall admit to\nmembership shall be members of the company.\nGeneral meetings\n3. All general meetings other than annual general meeting shall be called extraordinary general\nmeeting.\n4. (i) The Board may, whenever it thinks fit, call an extraordinary general meeting.\n(ii) If at any time directors capable of acting who are sufficient in number to form a quorum are not\nwithin India, any director or any two members of the company may call an extraordinary general meeting\nin the same manner, as nearly as possible, as that in which such a meeting may be called by the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0259",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 259,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 56872,
    "char_end": 56874,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "20",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0260",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 260,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 56876,
    "char_end": 57058,
    "char_count": 182,
    "text": "Proceedings at general meetings\n5. (i) No business shall be transacted at any general meeting unless a quorum of members is present at\nthe time when the meeting proceeds to business.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0261",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 261,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 57059,
    "char_end": 57171,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(ii) Save as otherwise provided herein, the quorum for the general meetings shall be as provided in\nsection 103.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0262",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 262,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 57172,
    "char_end": 57282,
    "char_count": 110,
    "text": "6. The Chairperson, if any, of the Board shall preside as Chairperson at every general meeting of the\ncompany.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0263",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 263,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 57283,
    "char_end": 57558,
    "char_count": 275,
    "text": "7. If there is no such Chairperson, or if he is not present within fifteen minutes after the time\nappointed for holding the meeting, or is unwilling to act as Chairperson of the meeting, the directors\npresent shall elect one of their members to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0264",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 264,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 57559,
    "char_end": 57837,
    "char_count": 278,
    "text": "8. If at any meeting no director is willing to act as Chairperson or if no director is present within\nfifteen minutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the members present shall choose one of\ntheir members to be Chairperson of the meeting.\nAdjournment of meeting",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0265",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 265,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 57838,
    "char_end": 58032,
    "char_count": 194,
    "text": "9. (i) The Chairperson may, with the consent of any meeting at which a quorum is present, and shall,\nif so directed by the meeting, adjourn the meeting from time to time and from place to place.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0266",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 266,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58033,
    "char_end": 58188,
    "char_count": 155,
    "text": "(ii) No business shall be transacted at any adjourned meeting other than the business left unfinished at\nthe meeting from which the adjournment took place.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0267",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 267,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58189,
    "char_end": 58333,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "(iii) When a meeting is adjourned for thirty days or more, notice of the adjourned meeting shall be\ngiven as in the case of an original meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0268",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 268,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58334,
    "char_end": 58538,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "(iv) Save as aforesaid, and as provided in section 103 of the Act, it shall not be necessary to give any\nnotice of an adjournment or of the business to be transacted at an adjourned meeting.\nVoting rights",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0269",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 269,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58539,
    "char_end": 58854,
    "char_count": 315,
    "text": "10. Every member shall have one vote.\n11. A member of unsound mind, or in respect of whom an order has been made by any Court having\njurisdiction in lunacy, may vote, whether on a show of hands or on a poll, by his committee or other legal\nguardian, and any such committee or guardian may, on a poll, vote by proxy.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0270",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 270,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58855,
    "char_end": 58989,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "12. No member shall be entitled to vote at any general meeting unless all sums presently payable by\nhim to the company have been paid.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0271",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 271,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 58990,
    "char_end": 59234,
    "char_count": 244,
    "text": "13. (i) No objection shall be raised to the qualification of any voter except at the meeting or adjourned\nmeeting at which the vote objected to is given or tendered, and every vote not disallowed at such meeting\nshall be valid for all purposes.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0272",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 272,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 59235,
    "char_end": 59374,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "(ii) Any such objection made in due time shall be referred to the Chairperson of the meeting, whose\ndecision shall be final and conclusive.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0273",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 273,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 59375,
    "char_end": 59912,
    "char_count": 537,
    "text": "14. A vote given in accordance with the terms of an instrument of proxy shall be valid,\nnotwithstanding the previous death or insanity of the principal or the revocation of the proxy or of the\nauthority under which the proxy was executed, or the transfer of the shares in respect of which the proxy\nis given:\nProvided that no intimation in writing of such death, insanity, revocation or transfer shall have been\nreceived by the company at its office before the commencement of the meeting or adjourned meeting at\nwhich the proxy is used.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0274",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 274,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 59913,
    "char_end": 60037,
    "char_count": 124,
    "text": "15. A member may exercise his vote at a meeting by electronic means in accordance with section 108\nand shall vote only once.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0275",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 275,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 60038,
    "char_end": 60161,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "16. Any business other than that upon which a poll has been demanded may be proceeded with,\npending the taking of the poll.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0276",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 276,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60163,
    "char_end": 60165,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "21",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0277",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 277,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60167,
    "char_end": 60345,
    "char_count": 178,
    "text": "Board of Directors\n17. The number of the directors and the names of the first directors shall be determined in writing by\nthe subscribers of the memorandum or a majority of them.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0278",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 278,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60346,
    "char_end": 60478,
    "char_count": 132,
    "text": "18. (i) The remuneration of the directors shall, in so far as it consists of a monthly payment, be\ndeemed to accrue from day-to-day.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0279",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 279,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60479,
    "char_end": 60650,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "(ii) In addition to the remuneration payable to them in pursuance of the Act, the directors may be paid\nall travelling, hotel and other expenses properly incurred by them—",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0280",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 280,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60651,
    "char_end": 60785,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(a) in attending and returning from meetings of the Board of Directors or any committee thereof\nor general meetings of the company; or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0281",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 281,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60786,
    "char_end": 60994,
    "char_count": 208,
    "text": "(b) in connection with the business of the company.\nProceedings of the Board\n19. (i) The Board of Directors may meet for the conduct of business, adjourn and otherwise regulate\nits meetings, as it thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0282",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 282,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 60995,
    "char_end": 61128,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "(ii) A director may, and the manager or secretary on the requisition of a director shall, at any time,\nsummon a meeting of the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0283",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 283,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 61129,
    "char_end": 61272,
    "char_count": 143,
    "text": "20. (i) Save as otherwise expressly provided in the Act, questions arising at any meeting of the Board\nshall be decided by a majority of votes.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0284",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 284,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 61273,
    "char_end": 61385,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(ii) In case of an equality of votes, the Chairperson of the Board, if any, shall have a second or casting\nvote.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0285",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 285,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 61386,
    "char_end": 61778,
    "char_count": 392,
    "text": "21. The continuing directors may act notwithstanding any vacancy in the Board; but, if and so long as\ntheir number is reduced below the quorum fixed by the Act for a meeting of the Board, the continuing\ndirectors or director may act for the purpose of increasing the number of directors to that fixed for the\nquorum, or of summoning a general meeting of the company, but for no other purpose.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0286",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 286,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 61779,
    "char_end": 61893,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "22. (i) The Board may elect a Chairperson of its meetings and determine the period for which he is to\nhold office.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0287",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 287,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 61894,
    "char_end": 62143,
    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "(ii) If no such Chairperson is elected, or if at any meeting the Chairperson is not present within five\nminutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the directors present may choose one of their\nmembers to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0288",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 288,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 62144,
    "char_end": 62312,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "23. (i) The Board may, subject to the provisions of the Act, delegate any of its powers to committees\nconsisting of such member or members of its body as it thinks fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0289",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 289,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 62313,
    "char_end": 62459,
    "char_count": 146,
    "text": "(ii) Any committee so formed shall, in the exercise of the powers so delegated, conform to any\nregulations that may be imposed on it by the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0290",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 290,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 62460,
    "char_end": 62768,
    "char_count": 308,
    "text": "24. (i) A committee may elect a Chairperson of its meetings.\n(ii) If no such Chairperson is elected, or if at any meeting the Chairperson is not present within five\nminutes after the time appointed for holding the meeting, the members present may choose one of their\nmembers to be Chairperson of the meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0291",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 291,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 62769,
    "char_end": 63037,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "25. (i) A committee may meet and adjourn as it thinks proper.\n(ii) Questions arising at any meeting of a committee shall be determined by a majority of votes of the\nmembers present, and in case of an equality of votes, the Chairman shall have a second or casting vote.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0292",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 292,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 63038,
    "char_end": 63489,
    "char_count": 451,
    "text": "26. All acts done by any meeting of the Board or of a committee thereof or by any person acting as a\ndirector, shall, notwithstanding that it may be afterwards discovered that there was some defect in the\nappointment of any one or more of such directors or of any person acting as aforesaid, or that they or any\nof them were disqualified, be as valid as if every such director or such person had been duly appointed\nand was qualified to be a director.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0293",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 293,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 63491,
    "char_end": 63493,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "22",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0294",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 294,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 63495,
    "char_end": 63924,
    "char_count": 429,
    "text": "27. Save as otherwise expressly provided in the Act, a resolution in writing, signed by all the\nmembers of the Board or of a committee thereof, for the time being entitled to receive notice of a meeting\nof the Board or committee, shall be as valid and effective as if it had been passed at a meeting of the\nBoard or committee, duly convened and held.\nChief Executive Officer, Manager, Company Secretary or\nChief Financial Officer",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0295",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 295,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 63925,
    "char_end": 64315,
    "char_count": 390,
    "text": "28. Subject to the provisions of the Act,—\n(i) A chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer may be\nappointed by the Board for such term, at such remuneration and upon such conditions as it thinks fit;\nand any chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer so appointed\nmay be removed by means of a resolution of the Board.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0296",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 296,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 64316,
    "char_end": 64431,
    "char_count": 115,
    "text": "(ii) A director may be appointed as chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief\nfinancial officer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0297",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 297,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 64432,
    "char_end": 64829,
    "char_count": 397,
    "text": "29. A provision of the Act or these regulations requiring or authorising a thing to be done by or to a\ndirector and chief executive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer shall not be\nsatisfied by its being done by or to the same person acting both as director and as, or in place of, chief\nexecutive officer, manager, company secretary or chief financial officer.\nThe Seal",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0298",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 298,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 64830,
    "char_end": 66578,
    "char_count": 1748,
    "text": "30. (i) The Board shall provide for the safe custody of the seal.\n(ii) The seal of the company shall not be affixed to any instrument except by the authority of a\nresolution of the Board or of a committee of the Board authorised by it in that behalf, and except in the\npresence of at least two directors and of the secretary or such other person as the Board may appoint for\nthe purpose; and those two directors and the secretary or other person aforesaid shall sign every\ninstrument to which the seal of the company is so affixed in their presence.\n3[Explanation.—For the purposes of this sub-paragraph it is hereby clarified that on and from the\ncommencement of the Companies (Amendment) Act, 2015 (21 of 2015), i.e. with effect from the 29th\nMay, 2015, company may not be required to have the seal by virtue of registration under the Act and if a\ncompany does not have the seal, the provisions of this sub-paragraph shall not be applicable.]\nNote: The Articles shall be signed by each subscriber of the memorandum of association who shall add\nhis address, description and occupation, if any, in the presence of at least one witness who shall attest the\nsignature and shall likewise add his address, description and occupation, if any, and such signatures shall\nbe in form specified below:\nNames, addresses, descriptions\nand occupations of subscribers\nWitnesses (along with names, addresses,\ndescriptions and occupations)\nA.B. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nC.D. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nE.F. of…………. Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nG.H. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nI.J. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nK.L. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0299",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 299,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 66580,
    "char_end": 66680,
    "char_count": 100,
    "text": "1. The Explanation ins. by Notification No. G.S.R. 362(E), dated 10th April 2018 (w.e.f. 10-4-2018).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0300",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 300,
    "page_start": 23,
    "page_end": 23,
    "char_start": 66682,
    "char_end": 66684,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "23",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC010-0301",
    "doc_id": "DOC-010",
    "paragraph_index": 301,
    "page_start": 23,
    "page_end": 23,
    "char_start": 66686,
    "char_end": 67844,
    "char_count": 1158,
    "text": "M.N. of………….Merchant\nSigned before me\nSignature…………….\nDated the……..day of ………20……\nPlace: ................................\nTABLE – I\nARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF AN UNLIMITED COMPANY AND\nHAVING A SHARE CAPITAL\n1. The number of members with which the company proposes to be registered is hundred, but the\nBoard of Directors may, from time to time, register an increase of members.\n2. All the articles of Table F in Schedule I annexed to the Companies Act, 2013 shall be deemed to be\nincorporated with these articles and to apply to the company.\nTABLE - J\nARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF AN UNLIMITED COMPANY AND\nNOT HAVING SHARE CAPITAL\n1. The number of members with which the company proposes to be registered is hundred, but the\nBoard of Directors may, from time to time, whenever the company or the business of the company\nrequires it, register an increase of members.\n2. The subscribers to the memorandum and such other persons as the Board shall admit to\nmembership shall be members of the company.\n3. All the articles of Table H in Schedule I annexed to the Companies Act, 2013 shall be deemed to\nbe incorporated with these articles and to apply to the company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
