    "text": "Pursuant to Regulation 30 read with sub-para (4), Para B, Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing Obligations\nand Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we are pleased to inform that the Company has received a 2-year\nrate contract from a Joint Venture of Tata Power and Government of Odisha for a contract value of ₹14,55,77,244.94\nfor the supply of various sizes of LT Power & control Cable.\nThe details as mandated under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements)\nRegulations, 2015 read with SEBI Circular No. CIR/CFD/CMD/4/2015 dated September 9, 2015 along with SEBI\nCircular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated July 13, 2023 and Para B of Part A of Schedule III\nand SEBI Circular No. SEBI/HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated 30th January 2026 are enclosed\nherewith as Annexure-A.",
