    "text": "Sub: Intimation under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligation and Disclosure\nRequirements) Regulations, 2015-Receipt of Material Order / Contract\nPursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements)\nRegulations, 2015, we are pleased to inform that the Company has received order from\nSiemens Energy for ₹ 68,533,898.50/- (Six Crores Eighty-Five Lacs Thirty-Three\nThousand Eight Hundred Ninety-Eight only) (inclusive of GST) for supply of LV Cable\nfor 220kV GIS (NEA) Leknath & Damauli, Nepal.\nThe details as mandated under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and\nDisclosure\nRequirements)\nRegulations,\n2015\nread\nwith\nSEBI\nCircular\nNo.\nCIR/CFD/CMD/4/2015 dated September 9, 2015 along with SEBI Circular No.\nSEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated July 13, 2023 is attached herewith\nas Annexure A.\nSr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1.\nName of entity awarding the order (s)\ncontract (s)\nSiemens Energy\n2.\nsigniϐicant terms and conditions of\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded, in brief;\nSupply of LV Cable # for 220kV GIS\n(NEA) Leknath & Damauli, Nepal\n3.\nwhether order(s) / contract(s) have\nbeen awarded by domestic/\ninternational entity\nDomestic\n4.\nNature of order (s)/Contract (s)\nSupply of LV Cable # for 220kV GIS\n(NEA) Leknath & Damauli, Nepal\n5.\nWhether domestic or international\nDomestic\n6.\ntime by which the\norder(s)/contract(s) is to be executed\n30\nApril\n2026\n(Partial\ndelivery\nallowed)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
