    "text": "Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations,\n2015, we are pleased to inform that the Company has received a Purchase Order from a Reputed EPC for\nsupply to a State Electricity Board (SEB) in India for Rs. ₹ 37,85,31,728/- (inclusive of GST) of HT\nCables, LT AB Cables and Covered Conductors, details of which are as under:\nThe details as mandated under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure\nRequirements) Regulations, 2015 read with SEBI Circular No. CIR/CFD/CMD/4/2015 dated September\n9, 2015, along with SEBI Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated July 13,\n2023, is attached herewith as Annexure A.\nSr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1.\nName of entity awarding the order (s)\ncontract (s)\nReputed EPC\n2.\nWhether order(s) / contract(s) have been\nawarded by domestic/ international entity\nDomestic\n3.\nSigniϐicant terms and conditions of\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded, in brief;\nReceived purchase order from an EPC\ncontractor for supply to a State\nElectricity  Board (SEB) in India. The\ncontract\nincludes\nstandard\ncommercial terms such as delivery\ntimelines, inspection, warranty, and\nquality assurance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
