    "char_count": 1412,
    "text": "(Formerly known-as Sattva Engineering Construction Private Limited)\n(CIN: L45201TN2005PLC058383)\nRegd. Office : Greams Dugar, 4th Floor, North Wing, Old No. 149, New No 64, Greams Road,\nThousand Lights, Chennai – 600 006. Tel: 044 – 2829 2303/2304 Email: Corporate@Sattvaengg.In,\nWebsite: www.sattvaengg.in\nDate: June 12, 2026\nTo\nThe Secretary,\nNational Stock Exchange of India Limited\nExchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex\nBandra (E), Mumbai – 400 051\nSymbol: SATTVAENGG          ISIN: INE14DW01018\nSubject: Disclosure under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and\nDisclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 – Receipt of Letter of Acceptance of\nTender from Thiruverkadu Municipality.\nPursuant to Regulation 30 and other applicable Regulations of the SEBI (Listing\nObligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, this is to inform that M/s.\nSattva Engineering Construction Limited along with M/s. JSR Infra Developers private\nLimited has received Letter of Acceptance of Tender (LOA)/Bagging of Contract from\nThiruverkadu Municipality.\nProject: “DESIGN, ENGINEERING, BUILD AND COMMISSIONING OF 46 MLD\nCAPACITY SEWAGE TREATMENT PLANT AT KOLADI WITH SEQUENTIAL BATCH\nREACTOR (SBR) INCLUDING OPERATION AND MAINTENANCE FOR 10 YEARS\nAT THIRUVERKADU.”\nContract  Value: 108,40,21,646/- (Excluding GST) (Rupees One Hundred and Eight\nCrore Forty Lakhs Twenty-One Thousand Six Hundred and Forty-Six Only)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
