    "text": "(Formerly known-as Sattva Engineering Construction Private Limited)\n(CIN: L45201TN2005PLC058383)\nRegd. Office : Greams Dugar, 4th Floor, North Wing, Old No. 149, New No 64, Greams Road,\nThousand Lights, Chennai – 600 006. Tel: 044 – 2829 2303/2304 Email: Corporate@Sattvaengg.In,\nWebsite: www.sattvaengg.in\nAnnexure A\nSr. No.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1.\nName of the entity awarding the\norder(s)/contract(s)\nM/s. Thiruverkadu Municipality\n2.\nSignificant terms and conditions\nof order(s)/contract(s) awarded,\nin brief\nPerformance Bank Guarantee equivalent to\n10% of value of Contract including GST with\nin 15days from receipt\nof Letter of\nAcceptance, agreement and other terms &\nConditions.\n3.\nWhether\norder(s)/contract(s)\nhave\nbeen\nawarded\nby\ndomestic/international entity\nDomestic Entity\n4.\nNature of order(s)/contract(s)\nBagging of Contract/Receipt of LoA for\nTender.\n“DESIGN, ENGINEERING, BUILD AND\nCOMMISSIONING\nOF\n46\nMLD\nCAPACITY\nSEWAGE\nTREATMENT\nPLANT AT KOLADI WITH SEQUENTIAL\nBATCH REACTOR (SBR) INCLUDING\nOPERATION AND MAINTENANCE FOR\n10 YEARS AT THIRUVERKADU.”\n5.\nWhether domestic or international  Domestic\n6.\nTime\nperiod\nby\nwhich\nthe\norder(s)/contract(s)\nis\nto\nbe\nexecuted\nDesign, Construction & Commissioning:\n18 Months",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC014-0005",
