    "char_start": 3290,
    "char_end": 4119,
    "char_count": 829,
    "text": "Operation & Maintenance:  120 Months\n7.\nBroad consideration or size of the\norder(s)/contract(s)\nThe Broad consideration for this order\nshall be Rs 108,40,21,646/-  (Rupees\nOne Hundred and Eight Crore Forty\nLakhs\nTwenty-One\nThousand\nSix\nHundred and Forty-Six Only) Excluding\nGST.\nConstruction:\nRs.\n78,78,77,946/-\n(Rupees Seventy-Eight Crore Seventy-\nEight Lakhs Seventy-Seven Thousand\nNine\nHundred\nand\nForty-Six\nOnly)\nExcluding GST.\nOperation\n&\nManagement:\nRs.\n29,61,43,700/-\n(Rupees\nTwenty-Nine\nCrore\nSixty-One\nLakhs\nForty-Three\nThousand and Seven Hundred Only)\nExcluding GST.\n8.\nWhether the promoter/ promoter\ngroup / group companies have\nany interest in the entity that\nawarded\nthe\norder(s)\n/\ncontract(s)? If yes, nature of\ninterest and details thereof.\nNo\n9.\nWhether the order(s)/contract(s)\nwould fall within related party\nNo",
