    "char_end": 3204,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "3. That the amount lying to the credit of the partners as on dated………. shall be deemed as their\ncapital investment. Further capital, loans or deposits looking to the needs/requirements of the\npartnership firm shall be arranged, invested or contributed by the partners.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
