    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 5665,
    "char_end": 6040,
    "char_count": 375,
    "text": "7. That the parties shall keep or cause to be kept proper books of account and documents and\nshall make entries therein of all receipts, payments and other matters as is usually done and\nentered in the books of account kept by persons engaged in business similar to that of the firm.\nEach partner shall have a right to have access to and to inspect and take copy of the same.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
