    "text": "13. That with respect to any matter connected with the affairs of the firm, which is not\nspecifically provided for herein, the partners may make such agreements therefor and may set\nin such manner with regard thereto as may be agreed upon by and between themselves.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
