    "char_end": 9070,
    "char_count": 635,
    "text": "16. All bonds, bills, notes, bills of exchange, hundies or promissory notes or other securities\ngiven on behalf of the partnership (except cheques) shall be signed, endorsed, accepted or\nexecuted jointly by all the partners and any bond, bill, note, bill of exchange, etc. to which any\npartner may be a party contrary to this provision shall be deemed to have been on the personal\naccount of such partner and he shall pay and discharge the same out of his own moneys and\nindemnify other partners and the firm against payment thereof and against all actions,\nproceedings, costs, charges, expenses, claims and demands in respect thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
