    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1500,
    "char_end": 2246,
    "char_count": 746,
    "text": "1. The owner, being the owner of the …………… machine with fittings, tools, and\naccessories, more particularly described in the Schedule hereto shall let and the hirer shall take\non hire from the ..............day of...............\n2. On execution of these presents, the hirer shall pay a sum of Rs. ............ to the owner\nas initial payment by way of hire and shall during the continuance of this agreement pay to the\nowner at his address for the time and without previous demand by way of rent for the hire of\nthe said …………… machine the monthly sum of Rs...............the first payment to be made on the\n..............day of ..............next and each subsequent payment on the ..............day of each\nsucceeding month during the said term.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC017-0004",
    "doc_id": "DOC-017",
    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2248,
    "char_end": 2318,
    "char_count": 70,
    "text": "Law Department, Andhra Pradesh\nTemplate regarding Commercial Contracts",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC017-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-017",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2320,
    "char_end": 3879,
    "char_count": 1559,
    "text": "3. During the continuance of the agreement, the hirer shall\na. not sell or offer for sale, assign, mortgage, pledge, sub-let, let or otherwise deal\nwith the said …………… machine or any part or parts thereof or with any interest\ntherein;\nb. keep the said …………… machine in his own possession and will not remove the\nsame or any part or parts thereof without the previous consent in writing of the\nowner;\nc. use the …………… machine in a skilful and proper manner and shall at his own\nexpense keep the said weighing machine in good and substantial repair and\ncondition (reasonable wear and tear excepted);\nd. keep insured the ……………machine during the period of hiring against any loss or\ndamage by hire or otherwise in the sum of Rs ............. with an insurance company\nin the name of the owner and deliver the policy of such insurance to the owner\nand duly and punctually pay all premiums necessary for keeping the said\ninsurance effective throughout the period of this agreement:\nProvided that in case the hirer shall at any time fail to effect or keep effect the said\npolicy by making default in any payment of premium, the owner shall be entitled to\neffect such insurance and pay the premium to the said insurance company and the hirer\nshall forthwith pay to the owner all the premiums and other sums paid by the owner;\n     e. not do or omit to do any act which may result in seizure and/or the confiscation of\nthe …………… machine by the Central or State Government or local authority or any\npublic officer or authority under any law for the time being in force.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC017-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-017",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 3880,
    "char_end": 4423,
    "char_count": 543,
    "text": "4. If the said …………… machine shall be destroyed or damaged by fire or otherwise, all\nmoneys received or receivable in respect of such insurance as aforesaid shall forthwith be\nreceived by the owner who shall as the case may require, apply such money either in making\ngood the damage done or in replacing the said …………… machine by other articles of similar\ndescription and value and such substituted articles shall become subject to the provisions of\nthis agreement in the same manner as the articles for which they shall have been substituted.",
