    "char_end": 4772,
    "char_count": 348,
    "text": "5. The hirer may determine the hiring at any time by giving 15 days notice in writing to\nthe owner at his address for the time being and by returning the said …………… machine at the\nhirer's own risk and expense and shall thereupon forthwith pay to the owner all hire charges\nupto the date of such determination and other sums due under the agreement.",
