    "text": "(9) LEAVE AND LICENSE AGREEMENT\nThis Agreement made at ------- this----- day of -------- between ------------(hereinafter referred to\nas 'licensor') of one part and --------- (hereinafter referred to as 'licensee') of the other part;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
