    "char_end": 1122,
    "char_count": 362,
    "text": "Whereas, the licensor has requested the licensee to allow him to use and occupy the licensed\npremises as licensee and the licensor has agreed to allow the licensee to use the premises as\nbare licensee and to occupy the same without any right, title, interest or claim in the licensed\npremises or to any right or interest of the licensor in the licensed premises.",
