    "char_start": 3151,
    "char_end": 3623,
    "char_count": 472,
    "text": "7. The licensee hereby agree and covenants with and to the licensor that the licensee under no\ncircumstances whatsoever, transfer or assign in any manner, whatsoever benefit of this present\nto any other person and accepts and acknowledges that licensor has allowed licensee to use\nand occupy the licensed premises only and in no manner has granted any right interest in the\nlicensed premises or any right to transfer or heritable right in respect of the licensed premises.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC018-0016",
