    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 72,
    "char_end": 371,
    "char_count": 299,
    "text": "*Disclaimer – This legal form and document is for reference only. Any document that you\nenter into, should be in consultation with an Advocate or a Solicitor. The Government will not be\nresponsible for any claim arising out of the use of the following document.\n(4) Letter of Guarantee and Indemnity",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0002",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
    "paragraph_index": 2,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 373,
    "char_end": 1424,
    "char_count": 1051,
    "text": "To,\n………………………\n…………………………\n…………………………\n1. In consideration of your agreeing to grant lease of (description of premises) to……………\n(Name of guarantor) (hereinafter referred to as \"the lessee\") under the terms of a lease\nagreement proposed to be made between yourselves and the lessee of the equipment\nspecified in the Schedule to the said lease agreement and more particularly described in the\nSchedule hereto, we the undersigned hereby jointly and severally guarantee on demand by you\nthe punctual payment by the lessee of all lease rentals, interest, all other sums whatsoever due\nand the Agreed loss Value referred to in the Schedule of the lease agreement and the due\nperformance and observance of all the lessee's covenants and obligations thereunder and we\nfurther undertake to jointly and severally indemnify and keep you indemnified against all\nlosses, claims, damages, charges and proceedings incurred or suffered by you in consequence\nof any failure by the lessee to perform any of the lessee's covenants and obligations under the\nlease agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1425,
    "char_end": 1745,
    "char_count": 320,
    "text": "2. We jointly and severally agree that any notice in writing by you about the indebtedness of\nthe lessee about the lease rentals and other sums whatsoever due under the lease agreement\nshall be conclusive evidence against us and we shall pay the said sum to you within 15 days of\nservice of notice by you in this regard.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0004",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1746,
    "char_end": 2304,
    "char_count": 558,
    "text": "3. We further jointly and severally agree that:\ni.\nOur liability under this guarantee and indemnity shall be as principal debtors and\nshall be a continuing guarantee and irrevocable;\nii.\nOur liability shall subsist whether or not you have availed legal right or remedies\nagainst the lessee;\niii.\nOur liability shall also extend to cover any renewal or renewals of the lease\nagreement; and\niv.\nThis guarantee and indemnity shall not be affected or prejudiced by any other\nguarantee/indemnity and any other form of security now or hereafter held by\nthe lessor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2306,
    "char_end": 2376,
    "char_count": 70,
    "text": "Law Department, Andhra Pradesh\nTemplate regarding Commercial Contracts",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2378,
    "char_end": 3289,
    "char_count": 911,
    "text": "4. Our liability under this guarantee shall not in any way be discharged, diminished or affected:\ni.\nBy the grant of time or indulgence to the lessee or by effecting any compromise with\nthe lessee or any agreement not to sue the lessee or any variations of the terms of\nthe lease agreement.\nii.\nAny change in the constitution of the lessee.\n5. Our liability under this guarantee shall be in addition to any security or additional security\nobtained by you from the lessee and the loss or release of any security will not in any way\ndiminish or affect our liability.\n6. Any waiver, forbearance or indulgence granted by you to us or any of us shall not affect our\nliability to you hereunder and this guarantee and indemnity shall bind our respective heirs,\nrepresentatives, executors, successors and assigns and shall not be determined or affected by\nthe incapacity of any one of us.\nThe Schedule above referred to",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC019-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-019",
