    "text": "(3) Indemnity for title\nThis Deed of Indemnity is made at……………… on this........ day of (Month and year)\nbetween Mr. A…………… of ........  hereinafter referred to as “the Vendor”- of the One Part and\nMr. B…………… of ....... hereinafter referred to as “The Purchaser” of the Other Part:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC022-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-022",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 615,
    "char_end": 964,
    "char_count": 349,
    "text": "(A) Whereas, by a Deed of Conveyance bearing even date with these Presents but\nexecuted before this deed and made between the Vendor of the One Part and the Purchaser of\nthe Other Part, the Vendor has granted and transferred by way of sale the land and premises at\n........ more particularly described In the Schedule by the said Deed of Conveyance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC022-0004",
    "doc_id": "DOC-022",
    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 965,
    "char_end": 1346,
    "char_count": 381,
    "text": "(B) And Whereas, the title of the Vendor to the said land and premises described in the\nSchedule hereunder written is based on the Vendor being in possession thereof for the last\nmore than …………… years as of right and without any Interruption from anybody else and which\npossession has now become adverse and there Is no document of title in respect thereof in\nfavour of the Vendor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC022-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-022",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1347,
    "char_end": 1781,
    "char_count": 434,
    "text": "(C) And Whereas, at the treaty of the sale of the said land and premises it was agreed\nbetween the Vendor and the Purchaser that the Vendor shall execute a separate deed\nindemnifying the Purchaser against any claim made and established by any of the owners of the\nsaid land described and the Schedule of the said Deed of Conveyance being the same as\ndescribed in the Schedule hereunder written and which the Vendor now proposes to do,",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
