    "char_start": 389,
    "char_end": 604,
    "char_count": 215,
    "text": "To,\nListing Compliance Department,\nNational Stock Exchange of India Limited (SME Emerge),\nExchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1,\nBlock G, Bandra Kurla Complex,\nBandra (E), Mumbai-400 051\nCompany Symbol – LAKSHYA (NSE Emerge)",
