    "char_start": 624,
    "char_end": 675,
    "char_count": 51,
    "text": "Subject: Intimation regarding receipt of Work Order",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 677,
    "char_end": 776,
    "char_count": 99,
    "text": "Ref.: Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 778,
    "char_end": 1141,
    "char_count": 363,
    "text": "We are pleased to inform that the Company has secured a significant order of Provision of Integrated Service\ncontract for O&M of Cairn Assets for RJ-ON-90/1 Block for RJ North Well Pads Across Mangala, Bhagyam and\nAishwarya at Rajasthan worth Rs. 641,92,12,546 /- (Rupees Six Hundred Forty One Crore, Ninety Two Lakh,\nTwelve Thousand, Five Hundred and Forty Six).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1143,
    "char_end": 1555,
    "char_count": 412,
    "text": "This order marks a significant milestone in the Company’s growth journey and aligns with its strategic focus on\nexpanding its presence in high-value, long-term O&M and integrated service contracts within the oil & gas\nsector. It further strengthens the Company’s positioning as a reliable and preferred service partner for marquee\nclients, while enhancing its visibility in strategically important energy assets.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1557,
    "char_end": 2104,
    "char_count": 547,
    "text": "The contract is expected to provide strong revenue visibility over the execution period, improve the stability,\nand contribute positively to margins through efficient resource deployment and operational synergies.\nAdditionally, it reinforces the Company’s unwavering commitment to operational excellence, safety standards,\nand service quality, which remain the cornerstone of its business philosophy. Overall, this development is a\ntestament to the Company’s dedicated efforts towards sustainable growth, disciplined execution, and value\ncreation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2106,
    "char_end": 2445,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "In accordance with the Regulation 30 read with the Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure\nRequirements) Regulations, 2015, the relevant particulars as required under the SEBI Circular No.\nHO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026 and any other relevant circulars, are\nprovided in Annexure hereto.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC025-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-025",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2447,
    "char_end": 2515,
    "char_count": 68,
    "text": "We request you to kindly take note of these details and disseminate.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
