    "char_start": 29040,
    "char_end": 29469,
    "char_count": 429,
    "text": "pursuant to a license agreement with a third party (the foregoing collectively referred to herein as “proprietary information”) are confidential and proprietary to buyer; and Service\nProvider agrees to use reasonable care to safeguard the proprietary information and to prevent the unauthorized use or disclosure thereof, which care shall not be less than that\nused by Service Provider to protect its own proprietary information.",
