    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 760,
    "char_end": 1003,
    "char_count": 243,
    "text": "We wish to inform that our Company has received a Service Order (SO) and Purchase Order (PO)\ndated 11th May 2026 from Adani Power Limited, Raipur for Overhead Electrification Works of\nRailway Line at Raipur Thermal Power Project, Chhattisgarh.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC030-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-030",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1005,
    "char_end": 1358,
    "char_count": 353,
    "text": "The contract value is INR ₹17,70,07,366.74 (Rupees Seventeen Crore, Seventy Lakh, Seven\nThousand, Three hundred Sixty-Six Rupees and Seventy-Four Paise), to be executed within 12\nmonths. The order has been awarded by Adani Power Limited through competitive bidding. This\ntransaction does not fall under related party transactions and is at arm’s length.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC030-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-030",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
