    "char_start": 2359,
    "char_end": 2727,
    "char_count": 368,
    "text": "Annexure A\nSr. No.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1 Name of the entity awarding the\norder(s)/contract(s)\nAdani Power Limited, Raipur\n2 Significant terms and conditions of the\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded in brief\nService Order (SO) and Purchase Order (PO) from\nAdani Power.\nproject - “Overhead Electrification Works of\nRailway Line at Raipur Thermal Power Project,\nChhattisgarh.\"",
