    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2891,
    "char_end": 3071,
    "char_count": 180,
    "text": "Performance Guarantee: 5% of contract basic\nvalue, i.e. ₹ 75,00,312.15 (Rupees seventy-five\nlakh three hundred twelve rupees and fifteen\npaise only), to be submitted within 15 days",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC030-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-030",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 3073,
    "char_end": 4114,
    "char_count": 1041,
    "text": "Project Completion period: 12 months.\n\n3 Whether order(s)/contract(s) have been\nawarded by domestic/international entity\nDomestic entity\n4 Nature of order(s)/contract(s)\nService Order (SO) and Purchase Order (PO) from\nAdani Power.\nproject - “Overhead Electrification Works of\nRailway Line at Raipur Thermal Power Project,\nChhattisgarh.\"\n5 Whether domestic or international\nDomestic\n6 Time period by which the\norder(s)/contract(s) is to be executed\n12 months from the date of LOA (11th May 2026)\n7 Broad consideration or size of the\norder(s)/contract(s)\n17,70,07,366.74 (Rupees Seventeen Crore,\nSeventy Lakh, Seven Thousand, three hundred\nSixty-Six Rupees and Seventy-Four Paise) with GST\n8\nWhether the promoter/promoter\ngroup/group companies have any interest in\nthe entity that awarded the\norder(s)/contract(s)? If yes, nature of\ninterest and details thereof\nNo such interest.\n9\nWhether the order(s)/contract(s) would fall\nwithin related party transactions? If yes,\nwhether the same is done at “arm’s length”\nNo – It is not a related party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
