    "paragraph_index": 0,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 0,
    "char_end": 264,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "Ref: MVL/NSE EMERGE/Reg-30/2025-26/04\nTo,\n\n    Dated: 31.03.2026\nListing Department,\nNSE Emerge,\nNational Stock Exchange of India Limited,\nExchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex,\nBandra (E), Mumbai – 400051\nDear Sir/Madam,\nSYMBOL      : MAYASHEEL\nISIN\n: INE0ZTO01018",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0001",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 1,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 266,
    "char_end": 1977,
    "char_count": 1711,
    "text": "Sub: Intimation under Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of SEBI (Listing\nObligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 as amended\n(“Listing Regulations”)– – Receipt of Letter of Acceptance (LOA)\nPursuant to Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of SEBI (Listing Obligations and\nDisclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 and SEBI Circular dated November 11,\n2024, we are pleased to inform that Mayasheel Ventures Limited (in Joint\nVenture with M/s JSP Projects Pvt. Ltd.) has received a Letter of Acceptance\n(LOA) for a significant infrastructure project in the State of Arunachal Pradesh.\nAs per the LOA, the details of the project are as follows:\n\nProject Name: Construction of road from km 0.00 to km 27.430 (Package 1)\nof Bile Miging section of NH-913 (Frontier Highway) to Intermediate Lane on\nEPC mode in the State of Arunachal Pradesh\n\nAwarding Authority: Ministry of Road Transport & Highways (MoRTH)\n\nNature of Contract: EPC (Engineering, Procurement and Construction)\n\nOrder Value: ₹3,06,53,00,000/- (Rupees Three Hundred Six Crore Fifty-Three\nLakh Only), excluding GST\n\nMode of Award: Through tender process; accepted as lowest evaluated\nresponsive bid\n\nTime Period: 36 months\nThe bid for the aforesaid project was submitted in a Joint Venture (JV) with M/s JSP\nProjects Pvt. Ltd., wherein Mayasheel Ventures Limited is the Lead Member. The\nexecution of the project shall be primarily carried out by Mayasheel Ventures Limited\nin accordance with the terms of the JV agreement.\nThis order strengthens the Company’s position in the highway and border\ninfrastructure segment, particularly in strategically significant regions, and aligns with\nits growth strategy in EPC civil works.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0002",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 2,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1979,
    "char_end": 2381,
    "char_count": 402,
    "text": "Further, details as required under Regulation 30 read with SEBI Circular dated\nNovember 11, 2024 are enclosed herewith as Annexure A.\nThis intimation is also being made available on the website of the Company at:\nhttps://mayasheelventures.com/\nYou are requested to kindly take the same on record.\nThanking You,\nYours faithfully,\nFor Mayasheel Ventures Limited\n(Formerly known as Mayasheel Construction)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
