    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 2467,
    "char_end": 3459,
    "char_count": 992,
    "text": "NEELAM\nRANI\nDigitally signed by\nNEELAM RANI\nDate: 2026.03.31\n16:52:48 +05'30'\n\nAnnexure-A\nDisclosure of details as required under the Regulations 30 of SEBI Listing\nRegulations read with SEВІ Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155\ndated November 11, 2024\nBagging/ Receiving of Orders/ Contracts\nSr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDescription\n1.\nName of the entity awarding the\norder(s)/contract(s)\nMinistry\nof\nRoad\nTransport\n&\nHighways (MoRTH)\n2.\nSignificant terms and conditions of\norder(s)/contract(s)\nawarded\nin\nbrief\nEPC contract for construction of\nhighway\nstretch\nunder\nNH-913\n(Frontier Highway), whereas, the bid\nfor\nthe\naforesaid\nproject\nwas\nsubmitted in a Joint Venture (JV) with\nM/s JSP Projects Pvt. Ltd., wherein\nMayasheel Ventures Limited is the\nLead Member. The execution of the\nproject shall be primarily carried out\nby Mayasheel Ventures Limited in\naccordance with the terms of the JV\nagreement.\n3.\nWhether order(s)/contract(s) have\nbeen\nawarded\nby\ndomestic\n/\ninternational entity\nDomestic",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 3,
