  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4228,
    "char_end": 6008,
    "char_count": 1780,
    "text": "ORIGINALCOPY\nRW/Zone-NE/NH-913/BRO/BM/I/AP/23-24\n(C.No.234416)\nGovernmentof India\nMinistry of RoadTransport&Highways\n(NorthEastZone)\n(TransportBhawan,1,ParliamentStreet,NewDelhi-110001)\nDated:30.03.2026\nTo\nSh.Amit Garg,Authorized Signatory\nM/sMayasheelVenturesLimitedinJVwithM/sJSPProjectsPvt.Ltd.\nIrd,B2FlatNo8,IlndFLOOR\nNEHRUNAGAR,GZB201001(U.P.)\nContactNo.:-9910109866,0120-4265140\n(Email:-mayasheelconstruction@gmail.com)\nSubject: Construction of road from km 0.00 to km 27.430 (Package 1)of Bile Migging\nsection of NH-913 (Frontier Highway) to Intermediate Lane on EPC mode in the State\nofArunachal Pradesh-Letterof Acceptance (LOA)-Reg.\nReference:Yourbid for the subject work(Tender ID:2025_MoRTH_868279_1)dated\n25.09.2025.\nSir,\nThis is to notifyyou that yourBid dated 25.09.2025 for execution of thework\nConstructionof road fromkm 0.00 tokm 27.430 (Package 1)of BileMiggingsection\nof NH-913 (Frontier Highway) to Intermediate Lane on EPC mode in the State of\nArunachalPradeshatyour\nrquotedbidpriceamountingto Rs.\n3,06,53,00,000/-(Rupees Three Hundred Six Crore Fifty Three Lakh Only) excluding\nGsThas been determined to be the lowest evaluated bid and is substantially\nresponsiveand has been accepted.\n2.\nYou are requested to sign and return the duplicate copy of LoA as an\nacknowledgement and sign the Contract Agreement within the period prescribed in\nClause1.3oftheRFP.\n3.\nYou are also requested to furnish Performance Security for an amount of Rs.\n9,19,59,000/- (Rupees Nine Crore Nineteen Lakh Fifty-Nine Thousand Only) and\nAdditional Performance Security for an amount of Rs.9,80,89,600/- (Rupees Nine\nCrore Eighty Lakh Eighty-Nine Thousand Six Hundred Only) as per Clause 2.21 of the\nRFPwithin 30 (thirty)days of receipt of this Letter of Acceptance (LOA).In case of",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 6009,
    "char_end": 6197,
    "char_count": 188,
    "text": "delay in submission of Performance Security and Additional Performance Security, you\nmay seek extension of time for a period not exceeding 6o (Sixty)days in accordance\nwithClause2.21ofRFP.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC031-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-031",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6199,
    "char_end": 6684,
    "char_count": 485,
    "text": "In case of failureof submission of Performance Security,Additional Performance\nSecurity and Security against Damages (if any) within the additional 60 (Sixty) days\ntime period, the award shall be deemed to be cancelled and Bid security shall be\nencashedbytheAuthorityas per Clause2.21of the RFP.\nYoursfaithfully,\n(Rajeev Singh)\nAdditionalDirectorGeneral (NorthEast)\nMinistryof RoadTransport&Highways\nCopy to:\n(i)\nTheRegionalOfficer,Itanagar,MoRTH\n(1i)\nChiefEngineer,ProjectBrahmank,BRO",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC032-0000",
    "doc_id": "DOC-032",
    "paragraph_index": 0,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 0,
    "char_end": 264,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "Ref: MVL/NSE EMERGE/Reg-30/2025-26/03\nTo,\n\n      Dated: 02.01.2026\nListing Department,\nNSE Emerge,\nNational Stock Exchange of India Limited,\nExchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex,\nBandra (E), Mumbai – 400051\nDear Sir/Madam,\nSYMBOL\n: MAYASHEEL\nISIN\n   : INE0ZTO01018",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC032-0001",
    "doc_id": "DOC-032",
    "paragraph_index": 1,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 266,
    "char_end": 2037,
    "char_count": 1771,
    "text": "Sub: Intimation under Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of SEBI (Listing\nObligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 as amended (“Listing\nRegulations”)– Receipt of Work order\nPursuant to Regulation 30 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, we are pleased to inform you\nthat Mayasheel Ventures Limited (“MVL”) has received a significant work order under the\nBorder Infrastructure segment.\nIn this regard, we are pleased to inform that:\n\nCentral Public Works Department (CPWD) ICBPZ, Leh, have awarded work related to\nConstruction of 135 feet earthen bundh, metalled road and Naka cum machan fighting\nbunkers along existing fencing along 179 km of international border in Jammu sector\nalong Indo–Pakistan Border. (SH: Construction of earthen bundh, lateral road, ditch and\nNaka cum machan fighting bunkers including water supply, sanitary installation, internal\nelectrical installation in District Jammu, Samba & Kathua under Jammu sector on EPC\nMode–Package-II, BOP Chinaz to BOP Karotna Khurd) to mayasheel Ventures Limited.\nThe above work has been allotted based on the technical and financial evaluation conducted by\nthe competent authority. The Company considers this order as part of its ongoing strategy to\nexpand its presence in the Border Infrastructure and EPC Civil Works segment.\nThe disclosure as required under SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Circular No.\nSEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated November 11, 2024 is attached herewith and marked\nas Annexure A to this letter.\nThis intimation is also being made available on the website of the Company at\nhttps://mayasheelventures.com/\nYou are requested to kindly take the same on record.\nThanking You,\nYours faithfully,\nFor Mayasheel Ventures Limited\n(Formerly known as Mayasheel Construction)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC032-0002",
    "doc_id": "DOC-032",
    "paragraph_index": 2,
