    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC032-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-032",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2123,
    "char_end": 2965,
    "char_count": 842,
    "text": "NEELAM\nRANI\nDigitally signed by\nNEELAM RANI\nDate: 2026.01.02\n12:57:17 +05'30'\n\nAnnexure-A\nDisclosure of details as required under the Regulations 30 of SEBI Listing Regulations\nread with SEВІ Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated November 11,\n2024\nBagging/ Receiving of Orders/ Contracts\nSr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDescription\n1.\nName of the entity awarding the\norder(s)/contract(s)\nCentral\nPublic\nWorks\nDepartment\n(CPWD), ICBPZ, Leh\n2.\nSignificant terms and conditions of\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded in brief\nThe Company has been awarded the work\nbased on an open tender process (EPC\nMode – Package II). The contract includes\nconstruction, civil works, water supply,\nsanitary and internal electrical installation\nalong the Indo–Pakistan border.\n3.\nWhether\norder(s)/contract(s)\nhave\nbeen\nawarded\nby\ndomestic\n/\ninternational entity\nDomestic",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC032-0004",
    "doc_id": "DOC-032",
    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2967,
    "char_end": 4071,
    "char_count": 1104,
    "text": "4.\nNature of order(s)/contract(s)\n“Construction of 135 feet earthen bundh,\nmetalled road and Naka cum machan\nfighting bunkers along existing fencing\nalong 179 km of international border in\nJammu\nsector\nalong\nIndo–Pakistan\nBorder. (SH: Construction of earthen\nbundh, lateral road, ditch and Naka cum\nmachan fighting bunkers including water\nsupply,\nsanitary\ninstallation,\ninternal\nelectrical installation in District Jammu,\nSamba & Kathua under Jammu sector on\nEPC Mode–Package-II, BOP Chinaz to BOP\nKarotna Khurd).”\n5.\nWhether Domestic or International\nDomestic\n6.\nTime\nPeriod\nby\nwhich\nthe\norder(s)/contract(s) is to be executed\n27 Months\n7.\nBroad consideration or size of the\norder(s)/contract(s)\n14367.23 Lakhs\n8.\nWhether\nthe\npromoter/\npromoter\ngroup/ group companies have any\ninterest in the entity that awarded the\norder(s)/contract(s)? If yes, nature of\ninterest and details thereof\nNo\n9.\nWhether the order(s)/contract(s) would\nfall within related party transactions? If\nyes, whether the same is done at\n“arm’s length’\nNo\n\nNEELAM\nRANI\nDigitally signed by\nNEELAM RANI\nDate: 2026.01.02\n12:57:38 +05'30'",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
