  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 585,
    "char_end": 656,
    "char_count": 71,
    "text": "Subject: Intimation for receipt of Purchase Order from TSecond Inc, USA",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0004",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 4,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 658,
    "char_end": 673,
    "char_count": 15,
    "text": "Dear Sir/Madam,",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 675,
    "char_end": 892,
    "char_count": 217,
    "text": "We wish to inform you that Ceinsys Tech Limited and Technology Associates Inc. USA, Wholly Owned\nSubsidiary of the Company has received today Purchase Orders from T Second Inc, USA, as per the details\nmentioned below:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 894,
    "char_end": 1410,
    "char_count": 516,
    "text": "Sr.\nNo.\nName\nof\nCompany\nAmount\nof\nPurchase\nOrder\n(INR)\n@\n95.11\nconversion rate\nAmount of Purchase\nOrder\n(US $)\nDetails of Purchase Order\n1\nCeinsys Tech\nLimited\nRs 27,70,50,294.06\n$ 2,912,946.00\nNVME drives supply\n2\nCeinsys Tech\nLimited\nRs 1,54,93,419.00\n$ 162,900.00\nAI-powered\nbuilding/road\nextraction and encroachment\nand\nasset\nmonitoring,\nprocessed directly on BRYCK\nAI platform.\n3\nTechnology\nAssociates Inc\nRs 80,84,350.00\n$ 85,000.00\nFor\nEnterprise\nGeospatial\nImagery Repository and AI\nFeature Extraction.\nTotal",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1412,
    "char_end": 1880,
    "char_count": 468,
    "text": "Rs 30,06,28,063.06\n$ 3,160,846.00\n\nThe Company and T Second India Private limited had recently entered into a Teaming agreement to\nevaluate options to work on common areas of interest which would complement each other’s capabilities.\nT Second India Private Limited, is engaged in the business of the design, development, and manufacturing\nof hyperconverged platforms for edge environments. T Second India Private Limited is wholly owned\nsubsidiary of T Second Inc, USA",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1882,
    "char_end": 2041,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "The purchase orders as above have been awarded to the Company in pursuance to the opportunities\nidentified through the above Teaming agreement in the areas of:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2043,
    "char_end": 2382,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "Ceinsys Tech Ltd.\nRegistered Office: 10/5, IT Park, Nagpur-440022.\nMaharashtra, India I CIN: L72300MH1998PLC114790\ninfo@cstech.ai  I EPABX: +91 712 2249033/358/930\nFax: +91 712 2249605\nwww.cstech.ai\n1. Hardware supply and Development of Solutions\n2. AI / ML Capabilities and technology solutions\n3. Joint working on Strategic opportunities",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2384,
    "char_end": 2703,
    "char_count": 319,
    "text": "The receipt of these international purchase orders marks a significant business opportunity for the\nCompany and its USA subsidiary in the area of application of AI tools and products developed by the\ncompany for enterprise solutions and new generation tech-applications and strengthens its presence in\noverseas markets.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC033-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-033",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
