    "char_end": 1074,
    "char_count": 433,
    "text": "Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations,\n2015 (“Listing Regulation”), please take note that the Company has received a Purchase Order on June\n19, 2026 for design, manufacturing, supply, installation and commissioning of a Spot Welding Line for\nAutomotive Manufacturing valued at Rs. 9.03 crores (inclusive of all taxes and duties) from a leading\nTier-1 Automotive Customer.",
