    "char_end": 3379,
    "char_count": 1559,
    "text": "Patil Automation Limited\n      Registered Office & Works: Gat No. 154, Behind G.E. Company, Sudumbre,\nTal. Maval, Dist. Pune (INDIA) – 412109\n      +91 91683 38383                  sales@patilautomation.com\nwww.patilautomation.com\nCIN : L29299PN2015PLC155878\nAnnexure A\nThe disclosure as required under Regulation 30 of the SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI\nCircular no. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026\nSr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1\nName of the entity awarding the\norder(s) / contract(s)\nA leading Tier-1 Automotive Indian Company\n2\nSignificant terms and conditions of\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded in brief\nDesign, manufacturing, supply, installation and\ncommissioning of a Spot Welding Line for\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n3\nWhether order(s) / contract(s) have\nbeen\nawarded\nby\ndomestic\n/\ninternational entity\nDomestic\n4\nNature of order(s) / contract(s)\nDesigning, manufacturing, supply, installation and\ncommissioning of a Spot Welding Line for\nAutomotive Manufacturing\n5\nWhether domestic or international\nDomestic\n6\nTime period by\nwhich\nthe\norder(s)/contract(s) is to be executed\nBy September 30, 2026\n7\nBroad consideration or size of the\norder(s) contract(s)\nRs. 9.03 crores (inclusive of all taxes and duties)\n8\nWhether\nthe\npromoter/promoter\ngroup/ group companies have any\ninterest in the entity that awarded the\norder(s)/contract(s)? If yes, nature of\ninterest and details thereof\nNo\n9\nWhether\nthe\norder(s)/contract(s)\nwould\nfall\nwithin\nrelated\nparty\ntransactions? If yes, whether the same is\ndone at “arm’s length”.\nNo",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3381,
    "char_end": 3469,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "Patil Automation Lands Strategic Spot Welding Line Project from\n Leading Tier-1 Customer",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3471,
    "char_end": 3866,
    "char_count": 395,
    "text": "Pune – June 19, 2026: Patil Automation Limited (NSE: PATILAUTOM | INE17GV01016), a leading provider\nof turnkey welding, assembly, and robotics-integrated automation systems, has announced a new order\nwin from a leading Tier-1 automotive customer, reinforcing its growing presence in the automotive\nautomation space and reflecting sustained demand for its engineering-led manufacturing solutions.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3868,
    "char_end": 4123,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "The order, valued at ₹9.03 crore (inclusive of taxes), is for the design, manufacturing, supply, installation,\nand commissioning of a Spot-Welding Line for automotive manufacturing applications. The project is\nscheduled to be executed within three months.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4125,
    "char_end": 4549,
    "char_count": 424,
    "text": "The order reflects the continued confidence of leading automotive customers in Patil Automation's\nengineering capabilities, execution expertise, and ability to deliver advanced manufacturing\nsolutions. As automotive manufacturers increasingly invest in automation to enhance productivity,\nprecision, and operational efficiency, the Company continues to benefit from sustained demand for its\nspecialized automation offerings.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0016",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 16,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4551,
    "char_end": 4972,
    "char_count": 421,
    "text": "Patil Automation has steadily expanded its customer base across automotive and industrial\nmanufacturing segments while strengthening relationships with existing clients through consistent\nproject execution and technology-driven solutions. The latest order further adds to the Company's growing\norder book and supports its strategy of driving long-term growth through deeper customer engagement\nand sector diversification.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4974,
    "char_end": 5331,
    "char_count": 357,
    "text": "Commenting on the Order Win, Mr. Manoj Patil, Promoter and Managing Director of Patil\nAutomation Limited, said: “We are pleased to secure this order from a leading Tier-1 automotive\ncustomer. The order underscores the trust our customers place in our engineering expertise, execution\ncapabilities, and commitment to delivering reliable automation solutions.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 5333,
    "char_end": 5778,
    "char_count": 445,
    "text": "The automotive industry continues to be a key growth driver for our business, supported by increasing\ninvestments in automation and manufacturing modernization. Alongside strengthening our position in\nthis segment, we are also expanding our reach across other industrial sectors, creating a diversified\ngrowth platform for the future. We remain focused on timely execution, operational excellence, and\nbuilding long-term customer relationships.\"",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 5780,
    "char_end": 6305,
    "char_count": 525,
    "text": "About Patil Automation Limited\n\nPatil Automation Limited (“PAL” or “the Company”), founded in 2015 and headquartered in Pune, is a\ncomprehensive automation solutions provider catering to both automotive and non-automotive sectors.\nThe Company offers end-to-end automation systems encompassing design, manufacturing, testing,\ninstallation, modification, and maintenance services for industries such as automotive, electric vehicles\n(EV), defense, construction equipment, renewable energy, white goods, and general engineering.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 6307,
    "char_end": 6537,
    "char_count": 230,
    "text": "PAL’s diverse product portfolio includes welding lines, assembly lines, special purpose machines (SPMs),\nand material handling systems, engineered to enhance precision, productivity, and scalability in modern\nmanufacturing setups.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 6539,
    "char_end": 6777,
    "char_count": 238,
    "text": "The Company now operates 3 advanced manufacturing facilities at MIDC Chakan, Pune, covering ~2 lakh\nsq. Ft., with a combined annual production capacity of ~3,454 units, enabling faster execution and\nexpansion into new industrial segments.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 6779,
    "char_end": 6953,
    "char_count": 174,
    "text": "PAL has successfully delivered automation projects across 10+ countries, with a strong domestic presence\nin Maharashtra, Haryana, Karnataka, and other key manufacturing hubs.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 6955,
    "char_end": 7130,
    "char_count": 175,
    "text": "For FY26, the Company reported a Total Income of ₹172.79 crore, EBITDA of ₹30.65 crore, and Net Profit of\n₹19.07 crore, reflecting consistent operational and financial growth.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 7132,
    "char_end": 7774,
    "char_count": 642,
    "text": "Disclaimer\n\nCertain statements in this document that are not historical facts are forward looking statements. Such\nforward-looking statements are subject to certain risks and uncertainties like government actions, local,\npolitical or economic developments, technological risks, and many other factors that could cause actual\nresults to differ materially from those contemplated by the relevant forward-looking statements. The\nCompany will not be in any way responsible for any action taken based on such statements and\nundertakes no obligation to publicly update these forward-looking statements to reflect subsequent\nevents or circumstances.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC034-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-034",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 7776,
    "char_end": 7936,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "For Further Information Please Contact:\n\nMr. Prafulla Patil- Executive Director & CFO\nPrafulla.patil@patilautomation.com\n+91 83088 10470\nwww.patilautomation.com",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
