    "char_start": 2537,
    "char_end": 3701,
    "char_count": 1164,
    "text": "Sr.\nNo.\nParticulars\nDetails\n1.\nName of the entity awarding the order(s)/contract(s)\nHoganas India Private Limited\n2.\nSignificant\nterms\nand\nconditions\nof\norder(s)/contract(s) awarded in brief\nThe total consideration of the said\nPurchase Order is Rs. 59.27 Lakhs\n(approximately),\ninclusive\nof\napplicable taxes and duties.\n3.\nWhether order(s) / contract(s) have been awarded by\ndomestic/ international entity\nDomestic Entity\n4.\nNature of order(s) / contract(s)\nFor the supply of Copper Powder\n5.\nWhether domestic or international\nDomestic\n6.\nTime period by which the order(s)/contract(s) is to be\nexecuted\nThe delivery of the order is scheduled\non or before March 01, 2026, as per the\nterms of the Purchase Order.\n7.\nBroad consideration or size of the order(s)/contract(s)\nRs.\n59.27\nLakhs\n(approximately)\n(inclusive of all taxes and duties)\n8.\nWhether the promoter/ promoter group / group\ncompanies have any interest in the entity that\nawarded the order(s)/contract(s)? If yes, nature of\ninterest and details thereof\nNo\n9.\nWhether the order(s)/contract(s) would fall within\nrelated party transactions? If yes, whether the same is\ndone at “arm’s length”\nNot Applicable",
