    "char_end": 1757,
    "char_count": 1757,
    "text": "(Formerly known as Ganesh Electricals Private Limited)\nCIN: L31900CiJ2019PLC108417\nTo,\nListing Department\nNational Stock Exchange of India Limited,\nExchange Plaza, C-1,Block G,\nBandra Kurla Complex,\nBandra(East),\nMumbai-400051.\nNSE SME EMERGE Symbol: GGBL\nDear Sir/Madam,\nDate: 12/02/2025\nISIN: INEOR8C01018\nSub: Intimation under Regulation 30 read with Schedule Ill of the SEBI (Listing Obligations\nand Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015\nIn terms of Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and\nDisclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 read with Para B of Part A of Schedule Ill to the said\nRegulations, we are pleased to inform that the Company has received the Lett}r/Notification of\nAward (Notification of Award with reference no. NVVN/C&M/RE-310/2024-25/FC, NVVN/C&M/RE-\n310/2024-25/SC, NVVN/C&M/RE-310/2024-25/TC dated February 11, 2025 as per Bid Document No.\nNVVN/C&M/RE-310/2024-25 dated 14.08.2024) from NTPC Vidyut Vyapar Nigam Limited (A Wholly\nOwned Subsidiary of NTPC) for \"Development of 7131 KW Grid Connected Rooftop Solar Projects at\nvarious locations of Central Armed Forces and Departments under Ministry of Home Affairs Zone 1\n(Bihar, Jharkhand) aggregating amount (approx.) of INR 33,03,94,980.75/- (Rupees Thirty Three\nCrore Three Lakh Ninety Four Thousand Nine Hundred Eighty and Paise Seventy Five Only) inclusive\nof all duties and taxes.\nFurther, the details as required under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure\nRequirements) Regulations, 2015 read with SEBI Circular SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated 11\nNovember 2024 are given in the enclosed Annexure A.\nPlease take the same on your records.\nThanking you.\nYours faithfully,\nFor Ganesh Green Bharat Limited",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
