    "char_start": 2181,
    "char_end": 3967,
    "char_count": 1786,
    "text": "(Formerly known as Ganesh Electricals Private Limited)\nCIN: L31900GJ2019PLC108417\nSr. No.\n1.\n2.\n3.\n4.\n5.\n6.\nParticulars\nName of the entity awarding\nthe order(s)/contract(s)\nAnnexure A\nDescription\nNTPC Vidyut Vyapar Nigam Limited (A Wholly Owned\nSubsidiary of NTPC}\nSignificant\nterms\nand As per the terms of the Order/Contract\nconditions\nof\norder(s)/\ncontract(s) awarded in brief\nWhether order(s)/contract(s)\nDomestic entity\nhave\nbeen\nawarded\nby\ndomestic/international\nNature of order(s)/contract(s)\nNotification of Award of Contract for following as under:\nWhether\ninternational\ndomestic\nFirst Contract: Ex works {India) Supply of all Plant and\nEquipment for Development of 7131 KW Grid Connected\nRooftop Solar Projects at various locations of Central\nArmed Forces and Departments under Ministry of Home\nAffairs Zone 1 (Bihar, Jharkhand).\nSecond Contract: For providing all services i.e. inland\ntransportation for delivery at site, inland transit\ninsurance,\nunloading,\nstorage,\nhandling\nat\nsite,\ninstallation (including civil, structural steel work & allied\nwork, as applicable), insurance covers other than inland\ntransit insurance, testing and commissioning including\ncarrying out guarantee tests in respect of all the plant\nand equipment supplied under the 'First Contract' and\nall other services specified in the contract documents for\nDevelopment of 7131 KW Grid Connected Rooftop Solar\nProjects at various locations of Central Armed Forces and\nDepartments under Ministry of Home Affairs Zone 1\n(Bihar, Jharkhand).\nThird Contract: For Operation and Maintenance Services\nfor Ten Years specified in the bidding documents of\nDevelopment of 7131 KW Grid Connected Rooftop Solar\nProjects at various locations of Central Armed Forces and\nDepartments under Ministry of Home Affairs Zone 1",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC036-0003",
    "doc_id": "DOC-036",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
