  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC042-0005",
    "doc_id": "DOC-042",
    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 729,
    "char_end": 1057,
    "char_count": 328,
    "text": "Scrip Code\nSymbol\nISIN\n543273\nKMEW\nINE0CJD01011\n\nSub: Intimation under Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of Securities and Exchange Board of\nIndia (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended\n(“Listing Regulations”) – Receipt of Work Order from Dredging Corporation of India Limited\n(“DCIL”)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC042-0006",
    "doc_id": "DOC-042",
    "paragraph_index": 6,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1059,
    "char_end": 1623,
    "char_count": 564,
    "text": "Pursuant to Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of the Listing Regulations, we are pleased to inform\nyou that Knowledge Marine & Engineering Works Limited (“KMEW”) has been received a Work Order\nfrom Dredging Corporation of India Limited (DCIL) for Rock Dredging (removal of pinnacles/ high\nspots) at Coastal Berth at JNPA and discharge of dredged material at DS-3 Dumping Ground. The\nsaid work order is valued at ₹ 58.39 Crores (Rupees Fifty-Eight Crores and Thirty-Nine Lakhs)\nincluding taxes and is to be completed within 90 days from the commencement of work.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC042-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-042",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1625,
    "char_end": 1713,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "Please find attached a copy of the Press Release with respect to same as “Annexure – A”.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC042-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-042",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1715,
    "char_end": 1890,
    "char_count": 175,
    "text": "The details as required under the Listing Regulations read with SEBI Circular No.\nSEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated November 11, 2024 are given in \"Annexure B\" to this letter.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
