    "char_count": 291,
    "text": "Regd. Office: Unit No. 706 & 707, The Epicentre, W. T. Patil Marg, Off Eastern Freeway,\nBEST Colony, Near Shivaji Chowk, Chembur East, Mumbai – 400 071\nPhone: 022 – 35398686 | E-mail: info@kmew.in |Website: www.kmew.in\nListed on BSE & NSE exchange (KMEW | 543273 | INE0CJD01011)\nAnnexure – B",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
