    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "Whereas:\nA. Party 1 engages in [__] and Party 2 engages in [__].\nB. The Parties wish to collaborate and enter into discussions for the purpose of [__] (“Purpose”) and wish to\nkeep such discussions confidential.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
