    "char_end": 1535,
    "char_count": 615,
    "text": "1.\n“Confidential Information” shall mean and include all non-public information, written or oral, disclosed,\ndirectly or indirectly, through any means of communication or observation (including oral, graphic, written\nor electronic form) by the Disclosing Party or any of its affiliates or representatives to or for the benefit of\nthe Receiving Party from the Effective Date, irrespective of whether such information: (a) has been\nspecifically marked as “confidential” at the time of disclosure; (b) is treated as proprietary information by the\nDisclosing Party; or (c) is owned or developed by the Disclosing Party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
