    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 985,
    "char_end": 1125,
    "char_count": 140,
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual agreements and covenants hereafter set forth, the Parties\nhereto agree as follows:\n1. Services",
