    "char_start": 1127,
    "char_end": 1529,
    "char_count": 402,
    "text": "The Consultant agrees to provide certain consultancy and advisory services (“Services”) to the Company in\naccordance with the terms set out in this Agreement and the consideration for the same shall be as set forth under\nClause 3. The Services shall include advisory, mentorship and strategic advice for the growth of the Company and\nto assist the Company in developing its business strategy and [___].",
