    "char_end": 3080,
    "char_count": 493,
    "text": "4. Intellectual Property Rights\n\nThe Deliverables shall be deemed to be ‘work for hire’ and all Intellectual Property Rights therein shall vest solely\nwith the Company upon creation. To the extent that any right, title or interest in the Deliverables is not vested\nwith the Company by operation of law or by contract, each Consultant hereby irrevocably and perpetually assigns,\ntransfers and conveys, to the Company any and all of such Consultant’s worldwide, right, title and interest, and to",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC051-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-051",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
