    "char_start": 11276,
    "char_end": 11591,
    "char_count": 315,
    "text": "Page 4\n\n12. Delivery by Electronic Means\n\nThis Agreement, to the extent signed and delivered by electronic means, shall be treated in all manner and respects\nas an original agreement and shall be considered to have the same binding legal effect as if it were the original\nsigned version thereof delivered in person.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
