    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1030,
    "char_end": 1261,
    "char_count": 231,
    "text": "The Roof-top Renewable Energy Generating System meets the applicable norms for being\nintegrated into the Distribution Network, and that the Eligible Consumer shall maintain the\nSystem accordingly for the duration of this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1263,
    "char_end": 1701,
    "char_count": 438,
    "text": "2.\nTechnical and Inter-connection Requirements:\n\n2.1.\nThe metering arrangement and the inter-connection of the Roof-top Renewable Energy\nGenerating System with the Network of the Licensee shall be as per the provisions of the Net\nMetering Regulations and the technical standards and norms specified by the Central\nElectricity Authority for connectivity of distributed generation resources and for the\ninstallation and operation of meters.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1703,
    "char_end": 2069,
    "char_count": 366,
    "text": "2.2.\nThe Eligible Consumer agrees that he shall install, prior to connection of the Roof-top\nRenewable Energy Generating System to the Network of the Licensee, an isolation device\n(both automatic and in built within inverter and external manual relays); and the Licensee\nshall have access to it if required for the repair and maintenance of the Distribution Network.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2071,
    "char_end": 2159,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "2.3.\nThe Licensee shall specify the interface/inter-connection point and metering point.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2161,
    "char_end": 2336,
    "char_count": 175,
    "text": "2.4.\nThe Eligible Consumer shall furnish all relevant data, such as voltage, frequency, circuit\nbreaker, isolator position in his System, as and when required by the Licensee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2338,
    "char_end": 2519,
    "char_count": 181,
    "text": "2.5. All the equipment connected to Network of the Licensee at the time of installation shall be\ncompliant with the Technical Specifications for rooftop system as Published by MNRE.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2521,
    "char_end": 2672,
    "char_count": 151,
    "text": "3.\nSafety:\n\n3.1.\nThe consumer shall comply with the Central Electricity Authority (Measures Relating to Safety\nand Electricity Supply) Regulations 2010",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 2674,
    "char_end": 2676,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "50",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0016",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 16,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 2678,
    "char_end": 3017,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "3.2.\nThe equipment connected to the Licensee's Distribution System shall be compliant with\nrelevant International (IEEE/IEC) or Indian Standards (BIS), as the case may be, and the\ninstallation of electrical equipment shall comply with the requirements specified by the\nCentral Electricity Authority regarding safety and electricity supply.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3019,
    "char_end": 3268,
    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "3.3.\nThe design, installation, maintenance and operation of the Roof-top Renewable Energy\nGenerating System shall be undertaken in a manner conducive to the safety of the Roof-top\nRenewable Energy Generating System as well as the Licensee's Network.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3270,
    "char_end": 3720,
    "char_count": 450,
    "text": "3.4.\nIf, at any time, the Licensee determines that the Eligible Consumer's Roof-top  Renewable\nEnergy Generating System is causing or may cause damage to and/or results in the Licensee's\nother consumers or its assets, the Eligible Consumer shall disconnect the Roof-top Renewable\nEnergy Generating System from the distribution Network upon direction from the Licensee\nand shall undertake corrective measures at his own expense prior to re-connection.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3722,
    "char_end": 4083,
    "char_count": 361,
    "text": "3.5.\nThe Licensee shall not be responsible for any accident resulting in injury to human beings or\nanimals or damage to property that may occur due to back- feeding from the Roof-top\nRenewable Energy Generating System when the grid supply is off. The Licensee may\ndisconnect the installation at any time in the event of such exigencies to prevent such\naccident.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4085,
    "char_end": 4388,
    "char_count": 303,
    "text": "4.\nOther Clearances and Approvals:\n\nThe Eligible Consumer shall obtain any statutory approvals and clearances that may be\nrequired, such as from the Electrical Inspector or the municipal or other authorities, before\nconnecting the Roof-top Renewable Energy Generating System to the distribution Network.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4390,
    "char_end": 4430,
    "char_count": 40,
    "text": "5.\nPeriod of Agreement, and Termination:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4432,
    "char_end": 4434,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "51",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4436,
    "char_end": 4987,
    "char_count": 551,
    "text": "This Agreement shall be for a period for 25 years, but may be terminated prematurely.\n(a) By mutual consent; or\n(b) By the Eligible Consumer, by giving 30 days' notice to the Licensee.\n(c) By the Licensee, by giving 30 days' notice, if the Eligible Consumer breaches any terms of this\nAgreement or the provisions of the Net Metering Regulations and does not remedy such\nbreach within 30 days, or such other reasonable period as may be provided, of receiving\nnotice of such breach, or for any other valid reason communicated by the Licensee in writing.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4989,
    "char_end": 5235,
    "char_count": 246,
    "text": "6.\nAccess and Disconnection:\n\n6.1.\nThe Eligible Consumer shall provide access to the Licensee to the metering equipment and\ndisconnecting devices of Roof-top Renewable Energy Generating System, both automatic and\nmanual, by the Eligible Consumer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 5237,
    "char_end": 5461,
    "char_count": 224,
    "text": "6.2.\nIf, in an emergent or outage situation, the Licensee cannot access the disconnecting devices\nof the Roof-top Renewable Energy Generating System, both automatic and manual, it may\ndisconnect power supply to the premises.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0026",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 26,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 5463,
    "char_end": 5649,
    "char_count": 186,
    "text": "6.3.\nUpon termination of this Agreement under Clause 5, the Eligible Consumer shall disconnect\nthe Roof-top Renewable Energy Generating System forthwith from the Network of the\nLicensee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0027",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 27,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 5651,
    "char_end": 5933,
    "char_count": 282,
    "text": "7.\nLiabilities:\n\n7.1.\nThe Parties shall indemnify each other for damages or adverse effects of either Party's\nnegligence or misconduct during the installation of the Roof-top Renewable Energy\nGenerating System, connectivity with the distribution Network and operation of the System.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0028",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 28,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5935,
    "char_end": 5937,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "52",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0029",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 29,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5939,
    "char_end": 6295,
    "char_count": 356,
    "text": "7.2.\nThe Parties shall not be liable to each other for any loss of profits or revenues, business\ninterruption losses, loss of contract or goodwill, or for indirect, consequential, incidental or\nspecial damages including, but not limited to, punitive or exemplary damages, whether any\nof these liabilities, losses or damages arise in contract, or otherwise.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0030",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6297,
    "char_end": 6434,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "8.\nCommercial Settlement:\n\n8.1.\nThe commercial settlements under this Agreement shall be in accordance with the Net\nMetering Regulations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6436,
    "char_end": 6690,
    "char_count": 254,
    "text": "8.2.\nThe Licensee shall not be liable to compensate the Eligible Consumer if his Rooftop\nRenewable Energy Generating System is unable to inject surplus power generated into the\nLicensee's Network on account of failure of power supply in the grid/Network.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6692,
    "char_end": 7205,
    "char_count": 513,
    "text": "8.3.\nThe existing metering System, if not in accordance with the Net Metering Regulations, shall\nbe replaced by a bi-directional meter (whole current/CT operated) or a pair of meters (as per\nthe definition of 'Net Meter' in the Regulations), and a separate generation meter may be\nprovided to measure Solar power generation. The bi-directional meter (whole current/CT\noperated) or pair of meters shall be installed at the inter-connection point to the Licensee's\nNetwork for recording export and import of energy.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0033",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 33,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7207,
    "char_end": 7330,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "8.4.\nThe uni-directional and bi-directional or pair of meters shall be fixed in separate meter boxes\nin the same proximity.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0034",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 34,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7332,
    "char_end": 7501,
    "char_count": 169,
    "text": "9.\nConnection Costs:\n\nThe Eligible Consumer shall bear all costs related to the setting up of the Roof-top Renewable\nEnergy Generating System and the cost of Net Meters.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0035",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 35,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7503,
    "char_end": 7505,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "53",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0036",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 36,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7507,
    "char_end": 7668,
    "char_count": 161,
    "text": "10.\nDispute Resolution:\n\n10.1.\nAny dispute arising under this Agreement shall be resolved promptly, in good faith and in an\nequitable manner by both the Parties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0037",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 37,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7670,
    "char_end": 7904,
    "char_count": 234,
    "text": "10.2.\nThe Eligible Consumer shall have recourse to the concerned Consumer Grievance Redressal\nForum constituted under the relevant Regulations in respect of any grievance regarding\nbilling which has not been redressed by the Licensee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC044-0038",
    "doc_id": "DOC-044",
    "paragraph_index": 38,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7906,
    "char_end": 8062,
    "char_count": 156,
    "text": "In the witness where of …………… (name) for and on behalf of Eligible Consumer and\nShri. ……………….. (name) for and on behalf of Licensee agree to this agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
