    "text": "finalizing e-Bidding / RA.\nc. The technical parameters and warranty of the item identified by\nthe Buyer shall be base parameters of the item for conducting e-\nBidding / RA for the required Goods/Services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC052-0028",
