    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 45305,
    "char_end": 45874,
    "char_count": 569,
    "text": "charges on account of GST on these goods are correct under the\nprovisions of that Act or the Rules made there under.\nc. Certified that the Seller is registered with above indicated GSTIN as\ndealer in the State where in their Billing address is located for the purpose\nof GST.\nd. The on-line bill form / invoice generated on GeM is not a replacement for\nthe GST invoice. The proper GST invoice as per requirements of GST\nrules shall be sent by the seller to the buyer / consignee directly along\nwith the Goods / Services as and when deliveries are made to the\nconsignee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
