    "char_end": 71329,
    "char_count": 273,
    "text": "32 | P a g e\n\nxiii.\nSplitting of demands by creating multiple Bids/RAs of same goods /\nservices or making repeated procurements of same goods/services\nthrough L-1 buying as per rule 149(i) and 9(ii) of GFR-2017.\nxiv.\nUploading goods / services containing information that —",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC052-0075",
    "doc_id": "DOC-052",
    "paragraph_index": 75,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 71330,
    "char_end": 71708,
    "char_count": 378,
    "text": "(a) belongs to another person and to which the user does not have any\nright to;\n(b) is grossly harmful, harassing, blasphemous, defamatory, obscene,\npornographic, paedophilic, libellous, invasive of another's privacy,\nhateful, or racially, ethnically objectionable, disparaging, relating or\nencouraging money laundering or gambling, or otherwise unlawful in\nany manner whatever;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC052-0076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-052",
    "paragraph_index": 76,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 71709,
    "char_end": 71812,
    "char_count": 103,
    "text": "(c) harm minors in any way;\n(d) infringes any patent, trademark, copyright or other proprietary\nrights;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC052-0077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-052",
    "paragraph_index": 77,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 71813,
    "char_end": 72017,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "(e) violates any law for the time being in force;\n(f) deceives or misleads the addressee about the origin of such\nmessages or communicates any information which is grossly offensive\nor menacing in nature;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
