    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 5428,
    "char_end": 5906,
    "char_count": 478,
    "text": "I/We undertake and confirm that eligible similar work(s) has/have not been got executed\nthrough another contractor on back to back basis. Further that, if such a violation comes to\nthe notice of Department, then I/We shall be debarred for tendering in PWD in future forever.\nAlso, if such a violation comes to the notice of Department before date of start of work, the\nEngineer-in-Charge shall be free to forfeit the entire amount of Earnest Money\nDeposit/Performance Guarantee.",
