    "char_start": 29585,
    "char_end": 29945,
    "char_count": 360,
    "text": "performance guarantee shall be returned to the contractor, without any interest.\nHowever, in case of contracts involving maintenance of building and\nservices/any other work after construction of same building and services/other\nwork, then 50% of Performance Guarantee shall be retained as Security\nDeposit. The same shall be returned year wise proportionately.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
