    "char_end": 30222,
    "char_count": 276,
    "text": "(iii) The Engineer-in-Charge shall not make a claim under the performance\nguarantee except for amounts to which the President of India is entitled under\nthe contract (not withstanding and/or without prejudice to any other provisions in\nthe contract agreement) in the event of:",
