    "text": "Superintending Engineer /Project Manager / Chief Engineer/ Chief Project\nManager, if required. After recording of the provisional Completion Certificate\nfor the work by the competent authority, the 80 % of performance guarantee\nshall be returned to the contractor, without any interest. However in case of\ncontracts involving Maintenance of building and services /any other work after\nconstruction of same building and services/ other work, then 40% of\nperformance guarantee shall be returned to the contractor, without any interest\nafter recording the provisional Completion certificate.",
