    "page_start": 25,
    "page_end": 25,
    "char_start": 69579,
    "char_end": 69753,
    "char_count": 174,
    "text": "dirt as aforesaid, and the contractor shall have no claim in respect of scaffolding or\nsurplus materials as aforesaid except for any sum actually realized by the sale thereof",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC053-0153",
    "doc_id": "DOC-053",
    "paragraph_index": 153,
    "page_start": 25,
    "page_end": 25,
    "char_start": 69755,
    "char_end": 70399,
    "char_count": 644,
    "text": "Contractor to keep Site\nClean\nClause 8A\nThe contractor shall submit completion plans for Internal and External Civil, Electrical\nand Mechanical Services within thirty days of the completion of the work, provided that\nthe service plans having been issued for execution by the Engineer-in-Charge, unless\nthe contractor, by virtue of any other provision in the contract, is required to prepare\nsuch plans. In case, the contractor fails to submit the completion plan as aforesaid, he\nshall be liable to pay a sum of 0.1 % (zero point one percent) of accepted Tendered\nValue or limit prescribed in Schedule F whichever is more as may be fixed by the",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
