    "page_end": 27,
    "char_start": 76349,
    "char_end": 76778,
    "char_count": 429,
    "text": "proper materials to be substituted thereof and in case of default, the Engineer-in-\nCharge may cause the same to be supplied and all costs which may attend such\nremoval and substitution shall be borne by the Contractor. The contractor shall at his\nown expense, provide a material testing lab at the site for conducting routine field tests.\nThe lab shall be equipped at least with the testing equipment as specified in schedule\nF.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC053-0164",
