    "char_count": 200,
    "text": "(i)\nAdvance payment for which escalation is payable in this Quarter (I) = (G-H)\n\n(j)\nAmount paid based on prevailing market rates due to deviations/variations\nas per clause 12 during this quarter: (J)",
