    "text": "agent for the principal.\n\n8. That a breach of the condition in clause 6 hereof shall entitle the principal to put an end to this agreement forthwith and also to recover from the said agent by way of liquidated damages the sum of Rs............................... for each such article sold in breach of such clause. The agent undertakes that all purchasers to whom he may sell the principal’s goods shall duly enter into, and carry out the aforesaid agreement referred to in clause 6 hereof for the purposes of this agreement be deemed to be a breach of clause 6 of this agreement by the agent and give the principal the rights and remedies against the agent for breach by the agent of this agreement.",
