    "char_start": 5052,
    "char_end": 5282,
    "char_count": 230,
    "text": "10. That the agent shall not sell the goods of the principal to any purchaser except at current price list of the principal conveyed by him from time to time. The agent may, however, allow a discount or rebate of.........per cent.",
