    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 6934,
    "char_end": 7155,
    "char_count": 221,
    "text": "16. That all products/goods shall be sold by the agent for delivery at agent’s place of business but the agent shall, at his own expense, have the right to deliver products/goods to purchasers at their places of business.",
