    "text": "Represented by:\n\n(hereinafter referred to as the “Second Party”, which expression shall, unless repugnant to the meaning or context hereof, be deemed to include its successors and permitted assigns); ON THE SECOND PART.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0008",
