    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 629,
    "char_end": 763,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "The Party of First and the Second Part are individually referred to as “Party” individually and collectively referred to as “Parties”.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 765,
    "char_end": 1147,
    "char_count": 382,
    "text": "WHEREASthe Parties intend to participate in discussions in order to explore a potential business relationship and the Parties may share information that is confidential and proprietary either during the discussions or during the course of the business relationship, for the purpose of enabling the parties to interact and work productively(hereinafter referred to as the “Purpose\");",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1149,
    "char_end": 1304,
    "char_count": 155,
    "text": "WHEREASthe Parties desire to protect such Confidential Information and ensure that it is not disclosed to any third party with the permission of the Party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1306,
    "char_end": 1417,
    "char_count": 111,
    "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, THIS AGREEMENT WITNESSETH AND IT IS HEREBY AGREED BY AND BETWEEN THE PARTIES HERETO AS FOLLOWS:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1419,
    "char_end": 1857,
    "char_count": 438,
    "text": "CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION\n\nFor purposes of this Agreement, “Confidential Information” means and includes all information or material that has or could have commercial value or other utility in the business in which Parties are engaged and any data or information that is proprietary to the Parties and not generally known to the public, whether in tangible or intangible form, whenever and however disclosed, including, but not limited to:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1859,
    "char_end": 1949,
    "char_count": 90,
    "text": "Any Trade Secrets, Proprietary documents, business plans, process, structure or practices;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1951,
    "char_end": 2220,
    "char_count": 269,
    "text": "Any marketing strategies, plans, financial information, or projections; operations, sales estimates, business plans and performance results relating to the past, present or future business activities of such party, its affiliates, subsidiaries and affiliated companies;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2222,
    "char_end": 2302,
    "char_count": 80,
    "text": "Any information related to the cost of project execution or delivery of service;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0016",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 16,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2304,
    "char_end": 2511,
    "char_count": 207,
    "text": "Plans for products or services, and client or partner lists;\n\nAnyalgorithm, software, design, process, procedure, formula, source code, object code, flow charts, databases, improvement, technology or method;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
