    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2513,
    "char_end": 2614,
    "char_count": 101,
    "text": "Any concepts, reports, data, know-how, works-in-progress, designs, development tools, specifications;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2616,
    "char_end": 2869,
    "char_count": 253,
    "text": "Any invoices, bills, e-mail communications, mobile text communications, and any other communication related to the projects, products or services undertaken by either of the Parties for the other Party or on the behalf of the other Party or its vendors;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2871,
    "char_end": 2977,
    "char_count": 106,
    "text": "Any other information that should reasonably be recognized as confidential information of the other Party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 2979,
    "char_end": 3376,
    "char_count": 397,
    "text": "Confidential Information need not be novel, unique, patentable, copyrightable or constitute a trade secret in order to be designated Confidential Information. The Parties acknowledge that the Confidential Information is proprietary to the otherParty, has been developed and obtained through great efforts by the Party and that Parties regard all of their Confidential Information as trade secrets.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 3378,
    "char_end": 3475,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "The Parties shall use the Confidential Information solely for and in connection with the Purpose.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 3477,
    "char_end": 3625,
    "char_count": 148,
    "text": "Notwithstanding any other provision of this Agreement, the Parties acknowledge that Confidential Information shall not include any information that:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC060-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-060",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 3627,
    "char_end": 3721,
    "char_count": 94,
    "text": "Is or becomes legally and publicly available to either Party without breach of this Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
