    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 965,
    "char_end": 1402,
    "char_count": 437,
    "text": "AND WHEREAS, the Lessor has agreed with the Lessee to grant to the Lessee under the terms of this Deed the Demised Premises with all fittings, fixtures and furniture installed therein and as fully described in Annexure-I detailed hereunder annexed and forming part of this Deed. The lessee has agreed to take on lease the same, subject to the covenants, conditions and stipulations, hereinafter in these presents expressed and contained.",
