    "page_start": 1,
    "page_end": 1,
    "char_start": 1404,
    "char_end": 1588,
    "char_count": 184,
    "text": "NOW IT IS HEREBY MUTUALLY AGREED BY AND BETWEEN THE PARTIES HERETO AS FOLLOWS:\n\nThe Term of Lease shall be for a fixed period of 11 Months which shall commence from the effective date.",
