    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3448,
    "char_end": 3558,
    "char_count": 110,
    "text": "\"Approved\" means approval in writing including subsequent written confirmation of\nprevious verbal approval(s).",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3560,
    "char_end": 3719,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "The \"Bid /Tender/Offer\" means the proposal along with required supporting documents\nsubmitted by the Bidder/Service Provider for consideration by the Employer.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3722,
    "char_end": 3847,
    "char_count": 125,
    "text": "The „Bidder/Tenderer” means the person(s) / Firm / company /Corporation\n/Organization/entity, who participated in the Tender.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3849,
    "char_end": 4016,
    "char_count": 167,
    "text": "“Completion Certificate” means the certificate to be issued by the Engineer In-charge\n(EIC) when the Services have been completed entirely in accordance with Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4018,
    "char_end": 4141,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "“Completion Date” means the date of actual completion of the services by the Service\nProvider as certified by the Employer.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4143,
    "char_end": 4341,
    "char_count": 198,
    "text": "“Contract” means an agreement between Employer and the Service Provider/Supplier for\nexecution of the Service(s) as per Contract Documents and its subsequent amendment(s),\nif any in writing thereto.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4343,
    "char_end": 4607,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "\"Contract Documents\" means collectively the Tender Documents, Designs, Drawings,\nScope of Services, Specifications, Schedule of Rates (SOR), Letter of Acceptance and\nagreed variations if any, and such other documents constituting the tender and acceptance\nthereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4609,
    "char_end": 4731,
    "char_count": 122,
    "text": "\"Day\" means a calendar day of 24 hours from midnight to midnight irrespective of the\nnumber of hours serviced in that day.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4733,
    "char_end": 4880,
    "char_count": 147,
    "text": "“Demobilization” means removal of all equipment, machinery, manpower from the site\nafter completion of the services with the due permission of EIC.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
