    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5560,
    "char_end": 5792,
    "char_count": 232,
    "text": "The “Engineer-In-Charge\" (EIC) means the person designated from time to time by\nEmployer and shall include those who are expressly authorized by him to act for and on\nhis behalf for operation/execution of this Contract for Services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5794,
    "char_end": 5983,
    "char_count": 189,
    "text": "“Equipment/Materials/Goods” means and include all equipment, machinery, stores,\ngoods which are required under the Contract for satisfactory performance of Services by\nthe Service Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5985,
    "char_end": 6241,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "\"Fax of Acceptance” means intimation regarding notification of award by the Employer\nto the successful Bidder/Service Provider through a Fax/ Letter  conveying that the\nTender/Bid/Offer has been accepted in accordance with the provisions contained therein.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0033",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 33,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6243,
    "char_end": 6434,
    "char_count": 191,
    "text": "“Guarantee/Warranty/ Defect Liability Period (DLP)” means the period and other\nconditions governing the warranty/guarantee/defect liability period of the services as\nprovided in the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0034",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 34,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6436,
    "char_end": 6661,
    "char_count": 225,
    "text": "\"Metric System\": All technical documents are given in the metric system and all service\nshould be carried out according to the metric system. All documents concerning the\nservice shall also be maintained in the metric system.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0035",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 35,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6663,
    "char_end": 6947,
    "char_count": 284,
    "text": "“Mobilization” means stabilizing adequate infrastructure at designated Site comprising of\nEquipment, aids, tools, tackles, instruments, Goods & Materials, experienced manpower,\nsupported with supervising personal in order to provide services as per the provision of\nContract document.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0036",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 36,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6949,
    "char_end": 7408,
    "char_count": 459,
    "text": "“Negligence”  means any act or  failure to act (whether sole, joint or concurrent) by a\nperson or an entity which was intended to cause, or which was reckless disregard of or\nwanton indifference to, avoidable and harmful consequences such person or entity knew,\nor should have known, would result from such act or failure to act. Notwithstanding the\nforegoing, negligence shall not include any action taken in good faith for the safeguard of\nlife or property.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0037",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 37,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7410,
    "char_end": 7817,
    "char_count": 407,
    "text": "The \"Service(s)\" means and include all services and activities/jobs to be performed by the\nService Provider in pursuant to and in accordance with Contract or part thereof as the\ncase may be and shall include all extra, additional, altered or substituted services and\napprovals from any agency/third party & license(s)/permissions from statutory authorities\n(if any), as required for purpose of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0038",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 38,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7819,
    "char_end": 8013,
    "char_count": 194,
    "text": "The \"Service Provider\" means Bidder/Tenderer whose tender has been accepted by the\nEmployer and includes the Service Provider's legal representative(s), his successor(s) and\npermitted assign(s).",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
