  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0041",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 41,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8361,
    "char_end": 8489,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0042",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 42,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8491,
    "char_end": 8693,
    "char_count": 202,
    "text": "“Site” means the place(s) provided by the Employer where the Services are to be carried\nout/executed and any other place(s) as may be specifically designated in the Contract as\nforming part of the site.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0043",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 43,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8695,
    "char_end": 8906,
    "char_count": 211,
    "text": "“Specifications” means and include detailed description, statements to technical data,\nperformance characteristics, and standards (Indian as well as International) as applicable\nand as specified in the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0044",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 44,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8908,
    "char_end": 9274,
    "char_count": 366,
    "text": "The \"Sub-Service Provider\" means any person /  firm /  Organization / company /entity\n(other than the Service Provider) and it‟s legal representatives, successors and permitted\nassigns  named in the Contract as a Sub-Service Provider for a part of the Services or to\nwhom a part of the Services has been sub-Contracted with the written prior consent of the\nEmployer.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0045",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 45,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9276,
    "char_end": 9561,
    "char_count": 285,
    "text": "\"Value of Contract” or “Total Contract Price” means the sum accepted or the sum\ncalculated in accordance with the prices accepted in the Contract as payable to the\nService Provider for the entire execution and full completion of the service, including\nAmendment(s) to Contract, if any.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0046",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 46,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9563,
    "char_end": 9615,
    "char_count": 52,
    "text": "\"Week\" means a period of any consecutive seven Days.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0047",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 47,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9617,
    "char_end": 9849,
    "char_count": 232,
    "text": "“Willful Misconduct” means intentional disregard of good and prudent standards of\nperformance or proper conduct under the Contract with knowledge that it is likely to\nresult in any injury to any person or loss or damage of property.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0048",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 48,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9851,
    "char_end": 9942,
    "char_count": 91,
    "text": "“Working Day” means any Day which is not declared by the Employer to be holiday or\noff-day.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0049",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 49,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9944,
    "char_end": 10358,
    "char_count": 414,
    "text": "1.2    INTERPRETATIONS & PRIORITY OF CONTRACT DOCUMENTS\n\n1.2.1 The documents forming the Contract are to be read together and interpreted as mutually\nexplanatory of one another. If there is a direct inconsistency in specific obligation(s), then\nfor the purposes of interpretation, and unless otherwise provided in the Contract, the\npriority of the Contract Documents shall be in accordance with following sequence:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0050",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 50,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 10360,
    "char_end": 10761,
    "char_count": 401,
    "text": "i)\nThe Contract Agreement\nii)\nDetailed Letter of Acceptance along with its enclosures\niii)\nFax of Acceptance\niv)\nScope of Works/ Job Specifications (specific to particular job only, wherever\nprovided)\nv)\nDrawings\nvi)\nSpecial Conditions of Contract (SCC)\nvii)\nTechnical Specifications (wherever applicable)\nviii)\nInstructions to Bidders (ITB)\nix)\nGeneral Conditions of Contract (GCC)\nx)\nOther Documents",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0051",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 51,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10763,
    "char_end": 10804,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0052",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 52,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10806,
    "char_end": 10934,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n7",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0053",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 53,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10936,
    "char_end": 11230,
    "char_count": 294,
    "text": "Works shown in the Drawing but not mentioned in the Specifications or described in the\nSpecifications without being shown in the Drawings shall nevertheless be deemed to be\nincluded in the same manner as if they had been specifically shown upon the Drawings\nand described in the Specifications.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0054",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 54,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 11232,
    "char_end": 11397,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "Any amendment/change order issued by Employer upon signing of formal Contract shall\ntake precedence over respective clauses of the formal Contract and its annexures.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0055",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 55,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 11399,
    "char_end": 11791,
    "char_count": 392,
    "text": "The higher priority interpretation shall be adopted only to the extent required to deal with\nan inconsistency. Specific term(s) agreed take priority over general statement(s) and\nterms in Contract Document created at a later date govern over terms in earlier Contract\nDocument. Subject to foregoing, the terms of the groups of documents set out above have\nequal importance within their group.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0056",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 56,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 11793,
    "char_end": 12178,
    "char_count": 385,
    "text": "1.2.2  Headings and Marginal Notes: All headings and marginal notes to the clauses of these\nGeneral Conditions of Contract or to the Specifications or to any other Tender Document\nare solely for the purpose of giving a concise indication and not a summary of the\ncontents thereof, and they shall never be deemed to be part thereof or be used in the\ninterpretation thereof the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0057",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 57,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12180,
    "char_end": 12353,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "1.2.3 Singular and Plural: In Contract Documents unless otherwise stated specifically, the\nsingular shall include the plural and vice versa wherever the context so requires.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0058",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 58,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12355,
    "char_end": 12514,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "1.2.4  Gender: Where the context so requires, words imparting the masculine gender shall also\ninclude the feminine gender and the neuter gender and vice versa.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0059",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 59,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12516,
    "char_end": 12782,
    "char_count": 266,
    "text": "1.2.5 Severability: Should any provision of this Contract be found to be invalid, illegal or\notherwise not enforceable by any court of law, such finding shall not affect the remaining\nprovision(s)/clause(s) hereto and they shall remain binding on the parties hereto.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0060",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 60,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12784,
    "char_end": 13087,
    "char_count": 303,
    "text": "1.3\nSPECIAL CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT\n\n1.3.1  Special Conditions of Contract consisting of scope of services, specification of Services &\nitems etc. shall be read in conjunction with the General Conditions of Contract, and any\nother documents forming part of this Contract wherever the context so requires.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0061",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 61,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 13089,
    "char_end": 13384,
    "char_count": 295,
    "text": "1.3.2  Notwithstanding the sub-division of the documents into these separate sections and\nvolumes every part of each section/volume shall be deemed to be supplementary to and\ncomplementary of every other part and shall be read with and into the Contract so far as it\nmay be practicable to do so.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0062",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 62,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 13386,
    "char_end": 13777,
    "char_count": 391,
    "text": "1.3.3  Where any portion of the General Condition of Contract is repugnant to or at variance with\nany provisions of the Special Conditions of Contract, unless a different intention appears\nthe provisions of the Special Conditions of Contract shall be deemed to over-ride the\nprovisions of the General Conditions of Contract and shall to the extent of such\nrepugnancy, or variations, prevail.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0063",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 63,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13779,
    "char_end": 13820,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0064",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 64,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13822,
    "char_end": 13950,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n8",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0065",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 65,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13952,
    "char_end": 14273,
    "char_count": 321,
    "text": "1.3.4  Wherever it is mentioned in the Specifications that the Service Provider shall perform\ncertain Service or provide certain facilities, it is understood that the Service Provider shall\ndo so at his cost and the Value of Contract shall be deemed to have included cost of such\nperformance and provisions, so mentioned.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0066",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 66,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 14275,
    "char_end": 14596,
    "char_count": 321,
    "text": "1.3.5  The materials, design and services shall satisfy the relevant Standards, the Job\nSpecifications contained herein and Codes referred to. Where the job specification\nstipulate requirements in addition to those contained in the standard codes and\nspecifications, these additional requirements shall also be satisfied.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
