  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0070",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 70,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 14880,
    "char_end": 14892,
    "char_count": 12,
    "text": "SECTION – II",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0071",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 71,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 14894,
    "char_end": 15090,
    "char_count": 196,
    "text": "2.0\nGENERAL INSTRUCTIONS & OBLIGATIONS\n\n2.1\nFORMATION OF CONTRACT\n\n2.1.1 Employer will be the sole judge in the matter of award of Contract and the decision of\nEmployer shall be final and binding.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0072",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 72,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15092,
    "char_end": 15264,
    "char_count": 172,
    "text": "2.1.2 The acceptance of tender will be intimated to the successful Bidder by the Employer\neither by Fax / E - mail /Letter or like means defined as Fax of Acceptance (FOA).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0073",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 73,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15266,
    "char_end": 15389,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "2.1.3 The Contract shall come into force on the date of FOA and the same shall be binding on\nEmployer and Service Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0074",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 74,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15391,
    "char_end": 15901,
    "char_count": 510,
    "text": "2.2\nSIGNING OF AGREEMENT\n\n2.2.1 The successful Tenderer/Service Provider shall be required to execute an Agreement\nwithin 15 days of the FOA in the format attached/enclosed with Tender Document. In the\nevent of failure on the part of the Service Provider to sign the Agreement within the\naforesaid  stipulated period, the Earnest Money Deposit or initial Security\nDeposit/Performance Security Deposit (as available, preferably the later) will be forfeited\nand Employer may consider the Contract as terminated..",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0075",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 75,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15903,
    "char_end": 16142,
    "char_count": 239,
    "text": "2.3\nADDENDA/CORRIGENDA\n\n2.3.1  Addenda/ Corrigenda to the Tender Documents incorporating modification(s) and\nclarification(s) to the Tender Document issued prior to the due date of bid submission\nshall become integral part of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 76,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16144,
    "char_end": 17484,
    "char_count": 1340,
    "text": "2.4\nLIABILITY OF GOVERNMENT OF INDIA\n\n2.4.1 It is expressly understood and agreed by and between Bidder /Service Provider and\nEmployer that Employer is entering into this agreement solely on its own behalf and not\non behalf of any other person or entity. In particular, it is expressly understood and\nagreed that the Government of India is not a party to this agreement and has no liabilities,\nobligations or rights hereunder. It is expressly understood and agreed that Employer is an\nindependent legal entity with power and authority to enter into Contracts solely on its\nown behalf under the applicable Laws of India and general principles of Contract Law.\nThe Bidder/Service Provider expressly agrees, acknowledges and understands that\nEmployer is not an agent, representative or delegate of the Government of India. It is\nfurther understood and agreed that the Government of India is not and shall not be liable\nfor any acts, omissions, commissions, breaches or other wrongs arising out of the\nContract. Accordingly, Bidder/Service Provider hereby expressly waives, releases and\nforegoes any and all actions or claims, including cross claims, impleader claims or\ncounter claims against the Government of India arising out of this Contract and covenants\nnot to sue to Government of India as to any manner, claim, cause of action or thing",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 77,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17486,
    "char_end": 17527,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0078",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 78,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17529,
    "char_end": 17658,
    "char_count": 129,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n10",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0079",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 79,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17660,
    "char_end": 18076,
    "char_count": 416,
    "text": "whatsoever arising of or under this agreement/Contract.\n\n2.5\nSITE VISIT\n\n2.5.1 The Bidder/Service Provider shall be deemed to have visited the Site(s)/work centre(s)\nand familiarized itself while submitting the Tender. Non-familiarity with the Site\nconditions by the Bidder/ Service Provider will not be considered a reason either for extra\nclaim(s) or for any delay in performance or any other claim in this regard.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0080",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 80,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18078,
    "char_end": 18179,
    "char_count": 101,
    "text": "2.6\nACTION IN CASE OF CORRUPT/FRAUDULENT /COLLUSIVE /COERCIVE\nPRACTICES AND EVALUATION OF PERFORMANCE",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0081",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 81,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18181,
    "char_end": 18265,
    "char_count": 84,
    "text": "The Bidder(s)/Service Provider(s) are required to abide by the following provisions:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0082",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 82,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18267,
    "char_end": 18558,
    "char_count": 291,
    "text": "(i)\nThe procedure for action in case of Corrupt/ Fraudulent/ Collusive/ Coercive Practices\ncontaining provisions for putting a Bidder/Service Provider on suspension and/or banning\nlist (as the case may be) if such an agency has indulged in Corrupt/ Fraudulent/\nCollusive/ Coercive Practices.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0083",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 83,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18560,
    "char_end": 18616,
    "char_count": 56,
    "text": "Detailed Procedure is elaborated in the tender document.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0084",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 84,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18618,
    "char_end": 18981,
    "char_count": 363,
    "text": "Further, Bidder(s)/Service Provider(s) accepts and certifies that they would adhere to the\nFraud Prevention Policy of BCPL and shall not indulge themselves or allow others\n(working in BCPL) to indulge in fraudulent activities and that they would immediately\napprise the Owner/BCPL/Organization(s) of the fraud/ suspected fraud as soon as it\ncomes to their notice.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0085",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 85,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18983,
    "char_end": 19160,
    "char_count": 177,
    "text": "(ii)\nThe procedure for evaluation of performance of Service Provider containing provisions\nfor putting a Service Provider on suspension and/or holiday list (as the case may be).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0086",
