    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21265,
    "char_end": 21783,
    "char_count": 518,
    "text": "2.10.1 perform the services in accordance with the Scope of Services /Specifications and\nActivity Schedule of the Tender Document and carry out its obligations with all due\ndiligence and efficiency, in accordance with generally accepted professional techniques\nand practices and shall observe sound management practices and employ appropriate\nadvance technology and safe methods. When completed, the job/services shall be fit for\nthe purpose for which the services are intended as specifically defined in the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0096",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 96,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21785,
    "char_end": 21935,
    "char_count": 150,
    "text": "2.10.2 provide all labour as required to provide the Service unless otherwise provided in the\nScope of Services or Special Conditions of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0097",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 97,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21937,
    "char_end": 22162,
    "char_count": 225,
    "text": "2.10.3 perform all other obligations, jobs / services which are required by the terms of this\nContract or which reasonably can be implied from such terms as being necessary for\nproviding necessary service as per the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0098",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 98,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22164,
    "char_end": 22457,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "2.10.4 be deemed to have satisfied himself before submitting his bid as to the correctness and\nsufficiency of its bid for the services required and of the rates and prices quoted, which\nrates and prices shall, except insofar as otherwise provided, cover all its obligations under\nthe Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0099",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 99,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22459,
    "char_end": 22715,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "2.10.5 give or provide all necessary supervision during the performance of the services and as\nlong thereafter within the warranty period/DLP as Employer may consider necessary for\nthe proper fulfilling of Service Provider's obligations under the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
