    "char_start": 73534,
    "char_end": 73546,
    "char_count": 12,
    "text": "SECTION – IV",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0258",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 258,
    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 73548,
    "char_end": 74447,
    "char_count": 899,
    "text": "4.0\nPAYMENT, INSURANCE AND TAXES\n\n4.1\nDEDUCTION FROM THE CONTRACT PRICE\n\n4.1.1 All costs, damages or expenses which Employer may have paid or incurred, which under\nthe provisions of the Contract, the Service Provider is liable to pay to the Employer. All\nsuch claims shall be claimed by the Employer from the Service Provider regularly as and\nwhen they fall due. Such claims shall be paid by the Service Provider within 15 (fifteen)\ndays of the receipt of the corresponding bills/ claims and if not paid by the Service\nProvider within the said period, the Employer may, then, deduct the amount from any\nimmediate moneys due to the Service Provider like R.A Bills, Final Bills, Contract\nPerformance Security or any payment becoming due to the Service Provider under the\nContract or may be recovered by actions of law or otherwise, if the Service Provider fails\nto satisfy the Employer of such claims.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0259",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 259,
    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 74449,
    "char_end": 75371,
    "char_count": 922,
    "text": "4.2\nSCHEDULE OF RATES AND PAYMENTS\n\n4.2.1  SERVICE PROVIDER'S REMUNERATION\n\nThe price to be paid by the Employer to Service Provider for the whole of the Service to\nbe done and for the performance of all the obligations undertaken by the Service Provider\nunder the Contract Documents shall be ascertained by the application of the respective\nSchedule of Rates (the inclusive nature of which is more particularly defined by way of\napplication but not of limitation, with the succeeding sub-clause of this clause) and\npayment to be made accordingly for the Services actually executed and approved by the\nEngineer-in-Charge. The sum so ascertained shall (except only as and to the extent\nexpressly provided herein) constitute the sole and inclusive remuneration of the Service\nProvider under the Contract and no further or other payment whatsoever shall be or\nbecome due or payable to the Service Provider under the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0260",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 260,
    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 75373,
    "char_end": 76120,
    "char_count": 747,
    "text": "4.2.2  SCHEDULE OF RATES TO BE INCLUSIVE\n\nThe prices/rates quoted by the Service Provider shall remain firm till the issue of Final\nCertificate and shall not be subject to escalation. Schedule of Rates shall be deemed to\ninclude and cover all costs, expenses and liabilities of every description and all risks of\nevery kind to be taken in rendering the services to the Employer by the Service Provider.\nThe Service Provider shall be deemed to have known the nature, scope, magnitude and\nthe extent of the service though the Contract Document may not fully and precisely\nfurnish/specify them. The Tenderer shall deemed to include the requisite services as may\nbe required to complete the Services properly including remedying of any defect therein.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0261",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 261,
    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 76122,
    "char_end": 76202,
    "char_count": 80,
    "text": "4.2.3 SCHEDULE\nOF\nRATES\nTO\nCOVER\nCONSTRUCTION\nEQUIPMENTS,\nMATERIALS, LABOUR ETC.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0262",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 262,
    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 76204,
    "char_end": 76290,
    "char_count": 86,
    "text": "Without in any way limiting the provisions of the preceding sub-clause the Schedule of",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0263",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 263,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 76292,
    "char_end": 76333,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0264",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 264,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 76335,
    "char_end": 76464,
    "char_count": 129,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n30",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0265",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 265,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 76466,
    "char_end": 77087,
    "char_count": 621,
    "text": "Rates shall be deemed to include and cover the cost of all construction equipment,\ntemporary work (except as provided for herein), pumps, materials, labour, insurance,\nfuel, consumables, stores & appliances and such other items / equipments / materials as\nrequired for carrying out the services by the Service Provider and all other matters in\nconnection with each item in the Schedule of Rates and the execution of the Service or\nany portion thereof finished, complete in every respect and maintained as shown or\ndescribed in the Contract Documents or as may be ordered in writing during the\ncontinuance of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0266",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 266,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 77089,
    "char_end": 77960,
    "char_count": 871,
    "text": "4.2.4 SCHEDULE OF RATES TO COVER ROYALTIES, RENTS AND CLAIMS\n\nThe Schedule of Rates (i.e., Value of Contract) shall be deemed to include and cover the\ncost of all royalties and fees for the articles and processes, protected by letters, patent or\notherwise incorporated in or used in connection with the Service, also all royalties, rents\nand other payments in connection with obtaining materials of whatsoever kind for the\nService and shall include an indemnity to the Employer which the Service Provider\nhereby gives against all actions, proceedings, claims, damages, costs and expenses arising\nfrom the incorporation in or use in the Service of any such articles, processes or\nmaterials, octroi or other municipal or local Board Charges, if levied on materials,\nequipment or machineries to be brought to site for use for Services shall be borne by the\nService Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0267",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 267,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 77962,
    "char_end": 78590,
    "char_count": 628,
    "text": "4.2.5  SCHEDULE OF RATES TO COVER TAXES AND DUTIES\n\nNo exemption or reduction of Customs Duties, GST, Works Contract Tax or any port\ndues, transport charges, stamp duties or Central or State Government or local Body or\nMunicipal Taxes or duties, taxes or charges (from or of any other body), entry tax,\nwhatsoever, will be granted or obtained, all of which expenses shall be deemed to be\nincluded in and covered by the Schedule of Rates, unless mentioned specifically\nelsewhere in the Tender Document. The Service Provider shall also obtain and pay for all\npermits/licenses or other privileges necessary to complete the Service.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0268",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 268,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 78592,
    "char_end": 79029,
    "char_count": 437,
    "text": "4.2.6  SCHEDULE OF RATES TO COVER RISKS OF DELAY\n\nThe Schedule of Rates shall be deemed to include and cover the risk of all possibilities of\ndelay and interference with the Service Provider's conduct/peformance of Services which\noccurs from any causes including orders of the Employer in the exercise of his power and\non account of extension of time granted due to various reasons and for all other possible\nor probable causes of delay.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0269",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 269,
    "page_start": 30,
    "page_end": 30,
    "char_start": 79031,
    "char_end": 79506,
    "char_count": 475,
    "text": "4.2.7  SCHEDULE OF RATES CANNOT BE ALTERED\n\nFor Service under unit rate basis, no alteration will be allowed in the Schedule of Rates\nby reason of services or any part of them being modified, altered, extended, diminished\nor committed. The Schedule of Rates are fully inclusive of rates which have been fixed\nby the Service Provider and agreed to by the Employer and cannot be altered. For\nlumpsum Contracts, the payment will be made according to the Service actually carried",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0270",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 270,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 79508,
    "char_end": 79549,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0271",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 271,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 79551,
    "char_end": 79680,
    "char_count": 129,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n31",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0272",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 272,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 79682,
    "char_end": 80021,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "out, for which purpose an item wise, or work wise Schedule of Rates shall be furnished,\nsuitable for evaluating the value of Service provided and preparing running account bill.\nPayment for any additional Service which is not covered in the Schedule of Rates shall\nonly be released on issuance of Amendment to LOA/Contract by the Employer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0273",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 273,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 80023,
    "char_end": 80184,
    "char_count": 161,
    "text": "4.3\nPROCEDURE FOR BILLING OF SERVICES\n\n4.3.1   BILLING PROCEDURE\n\nFollowing procedures shall be adopted for billing of services executed by the Service\nProvider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0274",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 274,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 80186,
    "char_end": 80517,
    "char_count": 331,
    "text": "4.3.1.1 The Bill(s) complete in all respect with details and enclosure(s) is to be submitted  by\nService Provider in line with terms of  the Contract. Employer shall make all endeavour\nto release payments of undisputed amount of the bills submitted within 15 (Fifteen) days\nfrom the date of certification by the Engineer-in-Charge.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0275",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 275,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 80519,
    "char_end": 80830,
    "char_count": 311,
    "text": "4.3.1.2 COMPUTERISED BILLING SYSTEM: Brahmaputra Cracker and Polymer Ltd. has\nintroduced Computerised Billing System whereby whenever the Bill(s) are submitted in\nBCPL by a Service Provider, a receipt number is usually generated. The Service Provider\nmay also know the status of the Bill through BCPL‟s website.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0276",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 276,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 80832,
    "char_end": 81046,
    "char_count": 214,
    "text": "4.3.2  MODE OF MEASUREMENT\n\nThe payment shall be made based on the mode of measurement as specified in the\nContract. Otherwise, the mode of measurement shall be adopted as per latest Indian\nStandard Specifications.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0277",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 277,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 81048,
    "char_end": 82314,
    "char_count": 1266,
    "text": "4.4\nNOTICE OF CLAIMS FOR ADDITIONAL PAYMENTS\n\n4.4.1  Should the Service Provider consider that he is entitled to any extra payment for any\nextra/additional Job(s)/Service(s) or material change in original Specifications carried out\nby him in respect of job, he shall forthwith give notice in writing to the Engineer-in-\nCharge that he claims extra payment. Such notice shall be given to the Engineer-in-\nCharge upon which Service Provider bases such claims and such notice shall contain full\nparticulars of the nature of such claim with full details of amount claimed. Irrespective of\nany provision in the Contract to the contrary, the Service Provider must intimate his\nintention to lodge claim on the Employer within 10 (ten) days of the commencement of\nhappening of the event and quantify the claim within 30 (thirty) days, failing which the\nService Provider will lose his right to claim any compensation/reimbursement/damages\netc.. Failure on the part of Service Provider to put forward any claim without the\nnecessary particulars as above within the time above specified shall be an absolute waiver\nthereof. No omission by Employer to reject any such claim and no delay in dealing\ntherewith shall be waiver by Employer of any of these rights in respect thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0278",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 278,
    "page_start": 31,
    "page_end": 31,
    "char_start": 82316,
    "char_end": 82489,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "4.4.2  Engineer-in-Charge shall review such claims within a reasonable period of time and\ncause to discharge these in a manner considered appropriate after due deliberations",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0279",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 279,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 82491,
    "char_end": 82532,
    "char_count": 41,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0280",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 280,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 82534,
    "char_end": 82663,
    "char_count": 129,
    "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n32",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0281",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 281,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 82665,
    "char_end": 83931,
    "char_count": 1266,
    "text": "thereon. However, Service Provider shall be obliged to carry on with the Jobs/services\nduring the period in which his claims are under consideration by the Employer,\nirrespective of the outcome of such claims, where additional payments for Services\nconsidered extra are justifiable in accordance with the Contract provisions, Employer\nshall arrange to release the same in the same manner as for normal job payments. Such of\nthe extra services so admitted by Employer shall be governed by all the terms, conditions,\nstipulations and specifications as are applicable for the Contract. The rates for extra\nservices shall generally be the unit rates provided for in the Contract. In the event unit\nrates for extra services so executed are not available as per Contract, payments may either\nbe released on day work basis for which daily/hourly rates for workmen and hourly rates\nfor equipment rental shall apply, or on the unit rate for Services executed shall be derived\nby interpolation/ extrapolation of unit rates already existing in the Contract. In all the\nmatters pertaining to applicability of rate and admittance of otherwise of an extra service\nclaim(s) of Service Provider, the decision of Engineer-in-Charge shall be final and\nbinding on the Service Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0282",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 282,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 83933,
    "char_end": 84490,
    "char_count": 557,
    "text": "4.5\nINSURANCE\n\n4.5.1 Service Provider shall, at his own expense, arrange appropriate insurance to cover all\nrisks assumed by the Service Provider under this Contract in respect of its personnel\ndeputed under this Contract as well as Service Provider‟s equipment, tools and any other\nbelongings of the Service Provider or their personnel during the entire period of their\nengagement in connection with this Contract. Employer will have no liability on this\naccount. The Personnel covered must be covered to meet the liability under Employee\nCompensation Act.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0283",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 283,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 84492,
    "char_end": 84607,
    "char_count": 115,
    "text": "4.5.2 The provisions of this Clause shall in no way limit the liability of the Service Provider\nunder the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0284",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 284,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 84609,
    "char_end": 84922,
    "char_count": 313,
    "text": "4.5.3 If the Service Provider neglects, fails, or refuses to obtain or maintain insurances required\nto be effected, or fails to provide certification etc., the Employer has the right to procure\nand maintain policies at Service Provider‟s expense plus administrative cost of 10% of\nthe amount of Insurance premium.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
