    "char_count": 163,
    "text": "4.5.4 INSURANCE TYPES\n\nService Provider shall at all time during the currency of the Contract provide, pay for and\nmaintain the following insurance amongst others:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0286",
