    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 85089,
    "char_end": 85637,
    "char_count": 548,
    "text": "a.\nEmployee Compensation and Employer‟s common law liability insurance\ncovering liability to employees of the Service Provider under the laws of their\nplace or employment or place or injury, arising out of injury sustained in\nconnection with any of the services. This insurance will be extended where\nsubmitted by law, to indemnify the Employer against any statutory liability which\nit may incur towards injured employees of the Service Provider. A proof of the\nsame should be submitted to EIC for liability in line with Employees\nCompensation Act.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
