    "char_count": 233,
    "text": "d.\nAutomobile Public Liability Insurance covering owned, non-owned and hired\nautomobiles used in the performance of the work hereunder, with bodily injury\nlimits and property damage limits as governed by Indian Insurance regulations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
