    "paragraph_index": 293,
    "page_start": 33,
    "page_end": 33,
    "char_start": 86606,
    "char_end": 86803,
    "char_count": 197,
    "text": "4.5.5   Service Provider shall obtain additional insurance or revise the limits of existing\ninsurance as per Employer‟s request in which case additional cost shall be to Service\nProvider‟s account.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0294",
    "doc_id": "DOC-065",
    "paragraph_index": 294,
    "page_start": 33,
    "page_end": 33,
    "char_start": 86805,
    "char_end": 86984,
    "char_count": 179,
    "text": "Further, the Service Provider shall ensure the adequacy of Insurance at all time in\naccordance with the nature of the Service(s), terms of the Contract and Statutory\nrequirements.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC065-0295",
