    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6257,
    "char_end": 6448,
    "char_count": 191,
    "text": "“Guarantee/Warranty/ Defect Liability Period (DLP)” means the period and other\nconditions governing the warranty/guarantee/defect liability period of the services as\nprovided in the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0029",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 29,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6450,
    "char_end": 6675,
    "char_count": 225,
    "text": "\"Metric System\": All technical documents are given in the metric system and all service\nshould be carried out according to the metric system. All documents concerning the\nservice shall also be maintained in the metric system.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
