    "paragraph_index": 61,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 14844,
    "char_end": 15041,
    "char_count": 197,
    "text": "2.0\nGENERAL INSTRUCTIONS & OBLIGATIONS\n\n2.1\nFORMATION OF CONTRACT:\n\n2.1.1 Employer will be the sole judge in the matter of award of Contract and the decision of\nEmployer shall be final and binding.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0062",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 62,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15043,
    "char_end": 15215,
    "char_count": 172,
    "text": "2.1.2 The acceptance of tender will be intimated to the successful Bidder by the Employer\neither by Fax / E - mail /Letter or like means defined as Fax of Acceptance (FOA).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
