    "paragraph_index": 63,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15217,
    "char_end": 15340,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "2.1.3 The Contract shall come into force on the date of FOA and the same shall be binding on\nEmployer and Service Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0064",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 64,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15342,
    "char_end": 15853,
    "char_count": 511,
    "text": "2.2\nSIGNING OF AGREEMENT:\n\n2.2.1 The successful Tenderer/Service Provider shall be required to execute an Agreement\nwithin 15 days of the FOA in the format attached/enclosed with Tender Document. In the\nevent of failure on the part of the Service Provider to sign the Agreement within the\naforesaid  stipulated period, the Earnest Money Deposit or initial Security\nDeposit/Performance Security Deposit (as available, preferably the later) will be forfeited\nand Employer may consider the Contract as terminated..",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0065",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 65,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15855,
    "char_end": 16095,
    "char_count": 240,
    "text": "2.3\nADDENDA/CORRIGENDA:\n\n2.3.1  Addenda/ Corrigenda to the Tender Documents incorporating modification(s) and\nclarification(s) to the Tender Document issued prior to the due date of bid submission\nshall become integral part of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0066",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 66,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16097,
    "char_end": 17354,
    "char_count": 1257,
    "text": "2.4\nLIABILITY OF GOVERNMENT OF INDIA:\n\n2.4.1 It is expressly understood and agreed by and between Bidder /Service Provider and\nEmployer that Employer is entering into this agreement solely on its own behalf and not\non behalf of any other person or entity. In particular, it is expressly understood and\nagreed that the Government of India is not a party to this agreement and has no liabilities,\nobligations or rights hereunder. It is expressly understood and agreed that Employer is an\nindependent legal entity with power and authority to enter into Contracts solely on its\nown behalf under the applicable Laws of India and general principles of Contract Law.\nThe Bidder/Service Provider expressly agrees, acknowledges and understands that\nEmployer is not an agent, representative or delegate of the Government of India. It is\nfurther understood and agreed that the Government of India is not and shall not be liable\nfor any acts, omissions, commissions, breaches or other wrongs arising out of the\nContract. Accordingly, Bidder/Service Provider hereby expressly waives, releases and\nforegoes any and all actions or claims, including cross claims, impleader claims or\ncounter claims against the Government of India arising out of this Contract and covenants",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0067",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 67,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17356,
    "char_end": 17539,
    "char_count": 183,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n10",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0068",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 68,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17541,
    "char_end": 17680,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "not to sue to Government of India as to any manner, claim, cause of action or thing\nwhatsoever arising of or under this agreement/Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0069",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 69,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17682,
    "char_end": 18042,
    "char_count": 360,
    "text": "2.5\nSITE VISIT:\n\n2.5.1 The Bidder/Service Provider shall be deemed to have visited the Site(s)/work centre(s)\nand familiarized itself while submitting the Tender. Non-familiarity with the Site\nconditions by the Bidder/ Service Provider will not be considered a reason either for extra\nclaim(s) or for any delay in performance or any other claim in this regard.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0070",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 70,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18044,
    "char_end": 18138,
    "char_count": 94,
    "text": "2.6\nACTION IN CASE OF CORRUPT/ FRAUDULENT/ COLLUSIVE/ COERCIVE\nPRACTICES AND POOR PERFORMANCE:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0071",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 71,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18140,
    "char_end": 18223,
    "char_count": 83,
    "text": "The Bidder(s)/Service Provider(s) are required to abide by the following documents:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0072",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 72,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18225,
    "char_end": 18516,
    "char_count": 291,
    "text": "(i)\nThe procedure for action in case of Corrupt/ Fraudulent/ Collusive/ Coercive Practices\ncontaining provisions for putting a Bidder/Service Provider on suspension and/or banning\nlist (as the case may be) if such an agency has indulged in Corrupt/ Fraudulent/\nCollusive/ Coercive Practices.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0073",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 73,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18518,
    "char_end": 18554,
    "char_count": 36,
    "text": "The Procedure is enclosed in tender.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0074",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 74,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18556,
    "char_end": 19023,
    "char_count": 467,
    "text": "Further, Bidder(s)/Service Provider(s) accepts and certifies that they would adhere to the\nFraud Prevention Policy of GAIL Gas and shall not indulge themselves or allow others\n(working in GAIL Gas) to indulge in fraudulent activities and that they would\nimmediately apprise the Owner/GAIL Gas/Organization(s) of the fraud/ suspected fraud\nas soon as it comes to their notice. The Fraud Prevention Policy document is available on\nGAIL Gas website (https://gailgas.com)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0075",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 75,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19025,
    "char_end": 19202,
    "char_count": 177,
    "text": "(ii)\nThe procedure for evaluation of performance of Service Provider containing provisions\nfor putting a Service Provider on suspension and/or holiday list (as the case may be).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 76,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19204,
    "char_end": 19240,
    "char_count": 36,
    "text": "The Procedure is enclosed in tender.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 77,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19242,
    "char_end": 20019,
    "char_count": 777,
    "text": "2.7\nRETIRED GOVERNMENT OR EMPLOYER’s OFFICERS:\n\n2.7.1 No Employee/Officer employed in Engineering or Administrative duties in an\nEngineering Department of the States/ Central Government or of the Employer is allowed\nto service as a Service Provider for a period of one year after his retirement /resignation\n/severance from Government Service or from the employment of the Employer without\nthe previous permission of the Employer. The Contract, if awarded, is liable to be\nterminated if either the Service Provider or any of his employees is found at any time to\nbe such a person, who has not obtained the permission of the State/Central Government\nor of the Employer as aforesaid before submission of tender, or engagement in the\nService Provider's service as the case may be.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0078",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 78,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20021,
    "char_end": 20204,
    "char_count": 183,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n11",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0079",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 79,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20206,
    "char_end": 20471,
    "char_count": 265,
    "text": "2.8\nCONFLICT OF INTEREST:\n\n2.8.1 During the currency of Contract and after its termination, the Service Provider and its\naffiliates, shall be disqualified from providing any goods, works or services for any\nproject resulting from or closely related to the Services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0080",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 80,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20473,
    "char_end": 21023,
    "char_count": 550,
    "text": "2.9\nABNORMAL RATES:\n\n2.9.1 The Tenderer is expected to quote rate for each item after careful analysis of cost\ninvolved for the performance of the completed item considering all specifications and\nConditions of Contract. In case, it is noticed that the rates quoted by the Tenderer for any\nitem are unusually higher or unusually lower, it will be sufficient cause for the rejection\nof the tender/bid unless the Employer is convinced about the reasonableness after\nscrutiny of the analysis for such rate(s) to be furnished by the Tenderer (on demand).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0081",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 81,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21025,
    "char_end": 21150,
    "char_count": 125,
    "text": "2.9.2   In case of Abnormally High Rated (AHR) item(s), the same shall be dealt as per AHR\nclause in the SCC (as applicable).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0082",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 82,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21152,
    "char_end": 21299,
    "char_count": 147,
    "text": "2.10\nGENERAL OBLIGATIONS OF SERVICE PROVIDER:\n\nService Provider shall, in accordance with and subject to the terms and conditions of this\nContract:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0083",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 83,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21301,
    "char_end": 21819,
    "char_count": 518,
    "text": "2.10.1 perform the services in accordance with the Scope of Services /Specifications and\nActivity Schedule of the Tender Document and carry out its obligations with all due\ndiligence and efficiency, in accordance with generally accepted professional techniques\nand practices and shall observe sound management practices and employ appropriate\nadvance technology and safe methods. When completed, the job/services shall be fit for\nthe purpose for which the services are intended as specifically defined in the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0084",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 84,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21821,
    "char_end": 21971,
    "char_count": 150,
    "text": "2.10.2 provide all labour as required to provide the Service unless otherwise provided in the\nScope of Services or Special Conditions of the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0085",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 85,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21973,
    "char_end": 22198,
    "char_count": 225,
    "text": "2.10.3 perform all other obligations, jobs / services which are required by the terms of this\nContract or which reasonably can be implied from such terms as being necessary for\nproviding necessary service as per the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0086",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 86,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22200,
    "char_end": 22493,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "2.10.4 be deemed to have satisfied himself before submitting his bid as to the correctness and\nsufficiency of its bid for the services required and of the rates and prices quoted, which\nrates and prices shall, except insofar as otherwise provided, cover all its obligations under\nthe Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0087",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 87,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22495,
    "char_end": 22751,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "2.10.5 give or provide all necessary supervision during the performance of the services and as\nlong thereafter within the warranty period/DLP as Employer may consider necessary for\nthe proper fulfilling of Service Provider's obligations under the Contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0088",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 88,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 22753,
    "char_end": 22936,
    "char_count": 183,
    "text": "General Conditions of Contract - Services\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n12",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0089",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 89,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 22938,
    "char_end": 23088,
    "char_count": 150,
    "text": "2.10.6 not disrupt the Services of the Employer being carried out by the Service Provider / and\nshall provide access for carrying out job/services to:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0090",
    "doc_id": "DOC-066",
    "paragraph_index": 90,
