    "text": "a.\nEmployee Compensation and Employer’s common law liability insurance\ncovering liability to employees of the Service Provider under the laws of their\nplace or employment or place or injury, arising out of injury sustained in",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC066-0242",
