    "char_start": 86703,
    "char_end": 86900,
    "char_count": 197,
    "text": "4.5.5   Service Provider shall obtain additional insurance or revise the limits of existing\ninsurance as per Employer’s request in which case additional cost shall be to Service\nProvider’s account.",
