    "char_end": 87261,
    "char_count": 178,
    "text": "4.5.6  CERTIFICATE OF INSURANCE:\n\nBefore commencing performance of the services, Service Provider shall on request\nfurnish EIC/Employer with certificates of insurance indicating:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
