    "char_start": 57269,
    "char_end": 57719,
    "char_count": 450,
    "text": "CONTRACTOR shall discuss the network so submitted with the EMPLOYER and the agreed network which may be in the\nform as submitted with the EMPLOYER or in revised form in line with the outcome of discussions shall form part of the\nCONTRACT, to be signed within fifteen (15) days from the date of LETTER OF ACCEPTANCE OF TENDER. During the\nperformance of the CONTRACT, if in the opinion of the EMPLOYER proper progress is not maintained suitable changes",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
