    "char_start": 84656,
    "char_end": 85002,
    "char_count": 346,
    "text": "40 OTHER AGENCIES AT SITE:\n40.1  The CONTRACTOR shall have to execute the WORK in such place and conditions where other agencies will also be engaged for\nother works such as site grading, filling, and levelling, electrical and mechanical engineering works, etc. No claim shall be\nentertained due to WORK being executed in the above circumstances.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0102",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 102,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 85004,
    "char_end": 85615,
    "char_count": 611,
    "text": "41 NOTICE:\n41.1  TO THE CONTRACTOR: Any notice hereunder may be served on the CONTRACTOR or his duly authorised representative at the\njob site or may be served by registered mail direct to the address furnished by the CONTRACTOR. Proof of issue of any such\nnotice could be conclusive of the CONTRACTOR having been duly informed of all contents therein.\n41.2  TO THE EMPLOYER: Any notice to be given to the EMPLOYER under the terms of the CONTRACTOR shall be served by sending\nthe same by Registered mail to or delivering the same at the respective site offices of M/S. BCPL addressed to the\nHEAD/SITE-IN-CHARGE.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0103",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 103,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 85617,
    "char_end": 86272,
    "char_count": 655,
    "text": "42 RIGHT OF VARIOUS INTERESTS:\n42.1  The EMPLOYER reserves the right to distribute the work between more than one agency(ies). The CONTRACTOR shall\ncooperate and afford other agency(ies) reasonable opportunity for access to the WORK for the carriage and storage of\nmaterials and execution of their works.\n42.2  Wherever the work being done by any department of the EMPLOYER or by other agency(ies) employed by the EMPLOYER is\ncontingent upon WORK covered by this CONTRACT, the respective rights of the various interests involved shall be determined\nby the ENGINEER-IN-CHARGE to secure the completion of the various portions of the work in general harmony.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0104",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 104,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 86274,
    "char_end": 87616,
    "char_count": 1342,
    "text": "43 PATENTS AND ROYALTIES:\n43.1  The CONTRACTOR, if licensed under any patent covering equipment, machinery, materials or compositions of matter to be\nused or supplied or methods and process to be practiced or employed in the performance of this CONTRACT, agrees to pay all\nroyalties and license fees which may be due with respect thereto. If any equipment, machinery, materials, composition of\nmatters, be used or supplied or methods and processes to be practised or employed in the performance of this CONTRACT, is\ncovered by a patent under which the CONTRACTOR is not licensed then the CONTRACTOR before supplying or using the\nequipment, machinery materials, composition method or processes shall obtain such licences and pay such royalties and\nlicence fees as may be necessary for performance of this CONTRACT. In the event the CONTRACTOR fails to pay any such\nroyalty or obtain any such licence, any suit for infringement of such patents which is brought against the CONTRACTOR or the\nEMPLOYER as a result such failure will be defended by the CONTRACTOR at his own expense and the CONTRACTOR will pay\nany damages and costs awarded in such suit. The CONTRACTOR shall promptly notify the EMPLOYER if the CONTRACTOR has\nacquired the knowledge of any plant under which a suit for infringement could be reasonably brought because of the use by",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0105",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 105,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 87618,
    "char_end": 87620,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "20",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
