    "char_start": 91375,
    "char_end": 91971,
    "char_count": 596,
    "text": "CERTIFICATE, from all liens and other encumbrances against the EMPLOYER on account of debts or claims alleged to be due\nfrom the CONTRACTOR or his SUB-CONTRACTOR to any person including SUB- CONTRACTOR and on behalf of EMPLOYER will\ndefend at his own expense, any claim or litigation brought against the EMPLOYER or the CONTRACTOR in connection\ntherewith. CONTRACTOR shall defend or contest at his own expense any fresh claim or litigation by any person including his\nSUB-CONTRACTOR, till its satisfactory settlement even after the expiry of two years from the date of issue of FINAL\nCERTIFICATE.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
