    "paragraph_index": 110,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 91973,
    "char_end": 92846,
    "char_count": 873,
    "text": "45 DELAYS BY EMPLOYER OR HIS AUTHORISED AGENTS:\n45.1  In case the CONTRACTOR's performance is delayed due to any act or omission on the part of the EMPLOYER or his authorized\nagents, then the CONTRACTOR shall be given due extension of time for the completion of the WORK, to the extent such\nomission on the part of the EMPLOYER has caused delay in the CONTRACTOR's performance of his WORK.\n45.2  No adjustment in CONTRACT PRICE shall be allowed for reasons of such delays and extensions granted except as provided in\nTENDER DOCUMENT, where the EMPLOYER reserves the right to seek indulgence of CONTRACTOR to maintain the agreed\nTime Schedule of Completion. In such an event the CONTRACTOR shall be obliged for working by CONTRACTOR's personnel\nfor additional time beyond stipulated working hours as also Sundays and Holidays and achieve the completion date/interim\ntargets.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0111",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 111,
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "char_start": 92848,
    "char_end": 93616,
    "char_count": 768,
    "text": "46 PAYMENT IF THE CONTRACT IS TERMINATED:\n46.1  If the CONTRACT shall be terminated as per Tender pursuant to Clause no. 29 of GCC, the CONTRACTOR shall be paid by the\nEMPLOYER in so far as such amounts or items shall not have already been covered by payments of amounts  made to the\nCONTRACTOR for the WORK executed and accepted by ENGINEER-IN-CHARGE prior to the date of termination at the rates\nand prices provided for in the CONTRACT and in addition to the following:\ni)\nThe amount payable in respect of any preliminary items, so far as the Work or service comprised therein has been\ncarried out or performed and an appropriate portion as certified by ENGINEER-IN- CHARGE of any such items or service\ncomprised in which has been partially carried out or performed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
