    "char_end": 94820,
    "char_count": 573,
    "text": "47 NO WAIVER OF RIGHTS:\n47.1  Neither the inspection by the EMPLOYER or any of their officials, employees, or agents nor any order by the EMPLOYER for\npayment of money or any payment for or acceptance of the whole or any part of the Work by the EMPLOYER nor any\nextension of time, nor any possession taken by EMPLOYER shall operate as a waiver of any provision of the CONTRACT, or of\nany power herein reserved to the EMPLOYER, or any right to damages herein provided, nor shall any waiver of any breach in\nthe CONTRACT be held to be a waiver of any other subsequent breach.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
