    "char_start": 144082,
    "char_end": 144507,
    "char_count": 425,
    "text": "SECTION-VI CERTIFICATES AND PAYMENTS\n87 SCHEDULE OF RATES AND PAYMENTS:\n87.1  CONTRACTOR'S REMUNERATION: The price to be paid by the EMPLOYER to CONTRACTOR for the whole of the WORK to be\ndone and for the performance of all the obligations undertaken by the CONTRACTOR under the CONTRACT DOCUMENTS shall\nbe ascertained by the application of the respective Schedule of Rates (the inclusive nature of which is more particularly",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0178",
