    "char_count": 254,
    "text": "WHEREAS Brahmaputra Cracker & Polymer Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as BCPL) which expression shall unless repugnant to the\ncontext includes their legal representatives, successors and assigns having their registered office at Hotel Brahmaputra Ashok, M.",
