    "char_end": 213502,
    "char_count": 515,
    "text": "Contract Agreement for the work of --------------- of Brahmaputra Cracker & Polymer Ltd. (BCPL) made on -------- between (Name\nand Address)------------- , hereinafter called the “CONTRACTOR” (which term shall unless excluded by or repugnant to the subject or\ncontext include\nits successors and permitted assignees) of the one part and BCPL hereinafter called the “EMPLOYER” (which term shall, unless\nexcluded by or repugnant to the subject or context include its successors and assignees) of the\nother part. WHEREAS",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0257",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 257,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 213503,
    "char_end": 213907,
    "char_count": 404,
    "text": "A. The EMPLOYER being desirous of having provided and executed certain work mentioned, enumerated or referred to in the\nTender Documents including Letter Inviting Tender, General Tender Notice, General Conditions of Contract, Special Conditions of\nContract, Specifications, Drawings, Plans, Time Schedule of completion of jobs, Schedule of Rates, Agreed Variations, other\ndocuments has called for Tender.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0258",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 258,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 213908,
    "char_end": 215123,
    "char_count": 1215,
    "text": "B. The CONTRACTOR has inspected the SITE and surroundings of WORK specified in the Tender Documents and has satisfied\nhimself by careful examination before submitting his tender as to the nature of the surface, strata, soil, sub-soil and ground, the\nform and nature of site and local conditions, the quantities, nature and magnitude of the work, the availability of labour and\nmaterials necessary for the execution of work, the means of access to SITE, the supply of power and water thereto and the\naccommodation he may require and has made local and independent enquiries and obtained complete information as to the\nmatters and thing referred to, or implied in the tender documents or having any connection therewith and has considered the\nnature and extent of all probable and possible situations, delays, hindrances or interferences to or with the execution and\ncompletion of the work to be carried out under the CONTRACT, and has examined and considered all other matters, conditions and\nthings and probable and possible contingencies, and generally all matters incidental thereto and ancillary thereof affecting the\nexecution and completion of the WORK and which might have influenced him in making his tender.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0259",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 259,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 215124,
    "char_end": 216562,
    "char_count": 1438,
    "text": "C. The Tender Documents including the Notice Letter Inviting Tender, General Conditions of Contract, Special Conditions of\nContract, Schedule of Rates, General Obligations, SPECIFICATIONS, DRAWINGS, PLANS, Time Schedule for completion of Jobs,\nLetter of Acceptance of Tender and any statement of agreed variations with its enclosures copies of which are hereto annexed\nform part of this CONTRACT though separately set out herein and are included in the expression “CONTRACT” wherever herein\nused.\nAND WHEREAS The EMPLOYER accepted the Tender of the CONTRACTOR for the provision and the execution of the said WORK at\nthe rates stated in the schedule of quantities of the work and finally approved by EMPLOYER (hereinafter called the \"Schedule of\nRates\") upon the terms and subject to the conditions of CONTRACT.\nNOW THIS AGREEMENT WITNESSETH AND IT IS HEREBY AGREED AND DECLARED AS FOLLOWS:- 1. In consideration of the payment\nto be made to the CONTRACTOR for the WORK to be executed by him, the CONTRACTOR hereby covenants with\nEMPLOYER that the CONTRACTOR shall and will duly provide, execute and complete the said work and shall do and perform all\nother acts and things in the CONTRACT mentioned or described or which are to be implied there from or may be reasonably\nnecessary for the completion of the said WORK and at the said times and in the manner and subject to the terms and conditions or\nstipulations mentioned in the contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0260",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 260,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 216564,
    "char_end": 217015,
    "char_count": 451,
    "text": "2. In consideration of the due provision execution and completion of the said WORK, EMPLOYER does hereby agree with the\nCONTRACTOR that the EMPLOYER will pay to the CONTRACTOR the respective amounts for the WORK actually done by him and\napproved by the EMPLOYER at the Schedule of Rates and such other sum payable to the CONTRACTOR under provision of\nCONTRACT, such payment to be made at such time in such manner as provided for in the CONTRACT. A N D",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
