    "page_start": 46,
    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 220135,
    "char_end": 220349,
    "char_count": 214,
    "text": "Ref.----------------\n\nBank Guarantee No.----------\n\n Date--------------------------------------\nTo\nBrahmaputra Cracker & Polymer Ltd.\nMain Fire Station Building, BCPL Project Site,\nLepetkata-786006, Dibrugarh\nAssam",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0287",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 287,
    "page_start": 46,
    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 220351,
    "char_end": 222082,
    "char_count": 1731,
    "text": "Dear Sir (s),\n\nIn accordance with Letter inviting Tender under your reference No.---------------------------\nM/s--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------having their Registered/Head Office at-------------------------------\n----------------------------(hereinafter called the Bidder) wish to participate in the said tender for---------------------------------------------------\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAs an irrevocable Bank Guarantee against Earnest Money Deposit for an amount of ---------is required to be submitted by the\nBidder as a condition precedent for participation in the said Tender which amount in liable to be for forfeited on the happening of\nany contingencies mentioned in the Tender Document.\nWe, the -------------------------------------------------Bank at------------------------------------- having our Head Office -----------------------------------\n-------------------------------------------  (Local Address)  guarantee  and undertake  to  pay immediately on demand without any recourse\nto the bidder by Brahmaputra Cracker & Polymer Limited., the amount  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n--without any reservation, protest, demur and recourse. Any such demand made by BCPL, shall be conclusive and binding on us\nirrespective of any dispute or difference raised by the Bidder.\nThis guarantee shall be irrevocable and shall remain, valid upto------------------------------- (This date should be 180 days (One hundred\n& eighty days) after the date finally set out for closing of tender). If any further extension of this guarantee is required the same",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0288",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "paragraph_index": 288,
    "page_start": 46,
