    "char_end": 81129,
    "char_count": 140,
    "text": "a)\nTo OWNER/CONSULTANT:\nb)\nTo CONTRACTOR:\n\n47.3 Any telegram or telex messages sent shall be confirmed in writing in the above-\nsaid manner.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0228",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 228,
    "page_start": 33,
    "page_end": 33,
    "char_start": 81131,
    "char_end": 81347,
    "char_count": 216,
    "text": "ARTICLE-48 ENTIRE AGREEMENT\n\n48.1 CONTRACT to the exclusion of all prior arrangements, statements or\nrepresentation, whether oral or written constitutes the full agreement between the\nparties hereto relating of WORK.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
