    "char_start": 81637,
    "char_end": 81786,
    "char_count": 149,
    "text": "Name of Work: Fabrication & supply of 1 no. self-propelled barge (excluding fabrication of bullets)\nfor transportation of Liquefied ammonia gas (LAG)",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0234",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 234,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 81788,
    "char_end": 82258,
    "char_count": 470,
    "text": "1.\nIntroduction\n\n1.1\nThe Fertilisers and Chemicals Travancore Limited(FACT) hereinafter also referred to as\n“OWNER” is a Government of India Public Sector undertaking involved in the manufacture and\nmarketing of nitrogenous, phosphatic and potassic fertilizers as well as a variety of industrial\nchemical products. The company has presently two manufacturing units, one at FACT-CD,\nAmbalamugal and the other at FACT-UC, Udyogamandal, both located in the state of Kerala.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0235",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 235,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 82260,
    "char_end": 82448,
    "char_count": 188,
    "text": "1.2\nFACT intends to have one number of New barge by Fabrication & supply of 1 no. self-propelled\nbarge (excluding fabrication of bullets) for transportation of Liquefied ammonia gas (LAG).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0236",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 236,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 82450,
    "char_end": 82633,
    "char_count": 183,
    "text": "1.3\nFACT has assigned the Project Management Consultancy (PMC) works to its own Engineering\nDivision – The FACT Engineering and Design Organisation (herein after referred to as FEDO).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0237",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 237,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 82635,
    "char_end": 82795,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "2.0\nSCOPE OF WORK\n\n2.1\nFabrication & supply of 1 no. self-propelled barge (excluding fabrication of bullets) for transportation\nof Liquefied ammonia gas (LAG)\n.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0238",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 238,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 82797,
    "char_end": 82947,
    "char_count": 150,
    "text": "2.2\nDetailed Scope of Work is described in the Special Conditions of Contract and technical\ndocumentation in Part II Technical of the tender attached.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
