    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0260",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 260,
    "page_start": 40,
    "page_end": 40,
    "char_start": 85448,
    "char_end": 85540,
    "char_count": 92,
    "text": "The following procedure shall be followed for arriving at unit rates for extra items of work",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0261",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 261,
    "page_start": 40,
    "page_end": 40,
    "char_start": 85542,
    "char_end": 85639,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "a)\nDerive from rates for similar items of work already available in the Schedule of Items of\nWork",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0262",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 262,
    "page_start": 40,
    "page_end": 40,
    "char_start": 85641,
    "char_end": 85839,
    "char_count": 198,
    "text": "b)\nIf rates as per (a) above are not available, rates shall be worked out from data on the basis\nof which the estimate for the work was prepared, to which over all Tender variation shall be\napplied.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0263",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 263,
    "page_start": 40,
    "page_end": 40,
    "char_start": 85841,
    "char_end": 86135,
    "char_count": 294,
    "text": "c)\nIf rates cannot be worked out on the basis of (a) and (b) above, then rates shall be derived\non the basis of actual cost of materials used, labour engaged, hire charges of machinery\nused and all that is necessary for the work, plus a margin of 10 % towards Contractor’s\nprofit and overheads.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0264",
