    "paragraph_index": 267,
    "page_start": 41,
    "page_end": 41,
    "char_start": 86465,
    "char_end": 86778,
    "char_count": 313,
    "text": "1.\nMobilisation Advance will NOT be paid for the work.\n2.\nPAYMENT OF WAGES TO THE WORKERS shall be made only through bank\ntransactions and proof thereof to be submitted along with the bill. Payment of\nwages to the staff of the contractor shall not be linked to the clearance of bills by\nFEDO/FACT\n3.\nRUNNING BILLS",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0268",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 268,
    "page_start": 41,
    "page_end": 41,
    "char_start": 86780,
    "char_end": 86965,
    "char_count": 185,
    "text": "Interim payment will be made against running bills for the value of part of WORK\nexecuted and for which tests prescribed, if any, are  completed, after deductions\non following accounts:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0269",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 269,
    "page_start": 41,
    "page_end": 41,
    "char_start": 86967,
    "char_end": 87222,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "a) Cost of departmental issues proportionate to quantity used in WORK,\nmeasured and billed for, including wastage and losses.\nb) Hire charges for OWNER'S Construction Equipment used till date of respective\nrunning bills.\nc) Income Tax at prevailing rates.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0270",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 270,
    "page_start": 41,
