    "text": "WHEREAS M/s Fertilizers and Chemicals, Travancore, Ltd, Udyogamandal P.O. Kerala (hereinafter referred\nto as the Company) has placed a Work Order No………….. dtd………………with ……………………\n(Hereinafter called the Contractor) for the work- …………………… (Name of work) and whereas it is one of\nthe conditions of the said work order that the contractor shall either remit a sum of Rs.…………../- (Rupees\n………………….. only) or furnish a bank guarantee for Rs..…………../- (Rupees ………………….. only) as\nSecurity Deposit for the due fulfillment of the said work order by the said Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0282",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 282,
    "page_start": 43,
    "page_end": 43,
    "char_start": 90450,
    "char_end": 91161,
    "char_count": 711,
    "text": "In consideration of the Company having agreed to accept a Bank guarantee from us towards such security\ndeposit in lieu of the cash deposit in accordance with the terms and conditions of the above work order, we\nThe ………………..(Name of Bank) the Bank (hereinafter referred to as the Bank) do hereby undertake to\npay the Company merely on demand any sum or sums from time to time demanded by the Company up to a\nmaximum of Rs.…………../- (Rupees ………………….. only) being the amount of the security deposit\nagainst any loss or damage caused to or suffered by or would be caused to or suffered by the Company by\nreason of any breach by the said Contractor of any of the terms and conditions contained in the said WORK\nORDER.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0283",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 283,
    "page_start": 43,
    "page_end": 43,
    "char_start": 91163,
    "char_end": 91671,
    "char_count": 508,
    "text": "We, the said Bank, do hereby undertake to pay the amount so demanded by the Company without any\ndemur merely on a demand from the Company stating that the amount claimed is due by way of loss or\ndamage caused to or suffered or would be caused to or suffered by the Company by reason of breach by\nthe said contractor of any of the terms and conditions contained in the said contract.  Any such demand\nmade on the Bank shall be conclusive as regards the amount due and payable by the Bank under this\nguarantee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC068-0284",
    "doc_id": "DOC-068",
    "paragraph_index": 284,
