    "text": "Any notice by way of request, demand or otherwise hereunder may be sent by post to the Bank addressed\nas aforesaid and if sent by post, it shall be deemed to have been given at the time when it would be\ndelivered in due course of post and in proving such notices when given by post, it shall be sufficient to prove\nthat the envelope containing the notice was posted and certificate signed by an officer of the Company that\nthe envelope was so posted, shall be conclusive.",
