    "char_end": 23561,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "v)\ndelay on the part of other contractors or tradesmen engaged by Engineer-in-Charge\nin executing work not forming part of the Contract, or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC069-0057",
    "doc_id": "DOC-069",
    "paragraph_index": 57,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 23563,
    "char_end": 23651,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "(vi)\nnon-availability of stores, which are the responsibility of Government to supply or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
