    "char_end": 573,
    "char_count": 200,
    "text": "Technical Specifications\n\nPage 2 of 28\n\nINDEX\nSl.\nNo.\nDescription\nPage\nNo.\nNo. of\nPages\n1.\nPART – A (Additional Conditions of Contract (ACC)).\n03-18\n16\n2.\nPART – B (Technical Specifications.)\n19-28\n10",
