    "char_start": 11041,
    "char_end": 11298,
    "char_count": 257,
    "text": "Page 7 of 28\n\n8.3. In case the Contractor fails to submit the Security Deposit cum Performance Guarantee of\nthe requisite amount within the stipulated period or extended period, letter of intent will\nstand withdrawn and EMD of Contractor shall be forfeited.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
