    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 39,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16103,
    "char_end": 16224,
    "char_count": 121,
    "text": "Page 9 of 28\n\n15.1.2.\nThe bidder/contractor must submit as a compliance of GST Act, the invoices in\nGST compliant format.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0040",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 40,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16226,
    "char_end": 16558,
    "char_count": 332,
    "text": "15.1.3.\nContractor’s price/rates shall be inclusive of all taxes and including GST\n@18%. Contractor shall submit to EPI the GST compliant tax invoice/debit\nnote/revised tax invoice on the basis of which EPI will claim the input tax credit in its\nreturn. Since this is a works contract, the GST rate shall be as applicable presently.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0041",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 41,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16560,
    "char_end": 16962,
    "char_count": 402,
    "text": "15.1.4.\nGST charged in the tax invoice/debit note/revised tax invoice by the contractor\nshall be released separately to the contractor only after contractor files the outward\nsupply details in GSTR-1 on GSTN portal and input tax credit of such invoice is\nmatched with time of filing the monthly return. TDS under GST shall be deducted at\nprevailing rates on gross invoice value from the running bills).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0042",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 42,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16964,
    "char_end": 17328,
    "char_count": 364,
    "text": "15.1.5.\nLabourcess / LWF- Labour welfare fund shall be deposited by EPI @ 1% of value\nof work done or as applicable from to time as per the directions of Government of\nTamil Nadu by EPI. However, all the documentations and Labour records shall be\nmaintained properly by the contractor. It shall be produced to EPI / MSME / Govt\nAuthorities as and when is required.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0043",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 43,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 17330,
    "char_end": 17765,
    "char_count": 435,
    "text": "15.1.6.\nSeigniorage / Royalty Charges: The rate quoted by bidder shall be inclusive of\nall royalty / seigniorages. If any royalty/ fee is payable to local authority, such royalty/\nfee shall also be borne by the Contractor. Disposal shall be carried out strictly as per\nthe regulations of local authority. However, the above materials shall not be removed\nout of Site premises without prior written authorization of the Project Manager.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
