    "char_start": 18660,
    "char_end": 19048,
    "char_count": 388,
    "text": "Page 10 of 28\n\nthe differential amount from the amounts due to the contractor. Further in case of any\nincrease in rate of taxes in future or the project losing exemption status prior to last\ndate of bid submission or afterwards, the said increase of taxes shall be paid /\nreimbursed to the contractor, subject to the conditions that the client reimburses the\nsaid increased taxes to EPIL.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
