    "paragraph_index": 48,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19050,
    "char_end": 19523,
    "char_count": 473,
    "text": "15.1.10. The rates quoted by the contractor shall be inclusive of all taxes and duties.\nHowever such duties, taxes, levies, etc. which shall be notified after the last date of\nsubmission of bid and/or any increase/decrease over the rate existing on the last date\nof submission of Bid shall be reimbursed/recovered by the company on production of\ndocumentary evidence in support of payment actually made to the concerned\nauthorities subject to reimbursed the same by client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
