    "char_start": 19525,
    "char_end": 19713,
    "char_count": 188,
    "text": "15.1.11.\n16.\nINSURANCE\nThe following shall be also read in conjunction with GCC clause no.17\n CAR Policy & ER Policy   –NA-.\n However the bidder should submit the WC policy as per standard",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0050",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 50,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19715,
    "char_end": 20210,
    "char_count": 495,
    "text": "16.1. THIRD PARTY INSURANCE\nContractor is required to take third party insurance cover for an amount of 5%(five percent)\nof Contract Value from an Approved Insurance Company for insurance against any\ndamage, injury or loss which may occur to any person or property including that of EPI,\narising out of the execution of the works or temporary works. Wherever required by EPI the\nContractor shall produce the policy or the policies of Insurance and the receipt of payment\nof the current premiums.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
