    "char_start": 20854,
    "char_end": 21268,
    "char_count": 414,
    "text": "Page 11 of 28\n\nand the same have been derived on the basis of last few years demand of the hospital &\nexecution at site which may increase/ decrease or deviate from the given Quantity, items &\nworks. The quantities given in the contract may change to any extent (both in plus\nside and minus side). The quoted rates for individual items shall remain firm irrespective of\nany variations in the individual quantities.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
