    "char_start": 21270,
    "char_end": 21455,
    "char_count": 185,
    "text": "18.2. No compensation becomes payable in case the variation of the final executed contract\nvalue is within the limit of plus/Minus (+/-) 20% Twenty Percentage)of awarded contract\nvalue.",
