    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22082,
    "char_end": 22365,
    "char_count": 283,
    "text": "19.2. In case of any emergency works arise / situation warrants at any establishment against\ncomplaints / end users/ ESIC/EPIL, which are not in original agreement /BOQ , which shall\nbe  carried out (if needed) as DSR/SSR/MR analysis with the consent of Engineer –in-\ncharge of EPIL.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
