    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22367,
    "char_end": 22630,
    "char_count": 263,
    "text": "19.3. Latest CPWD Schedule Rate (1st preference)/ latest PWD Schedule Rate, TWAD Board\nRate, TN (2nd preference)/ Market Rate [for the item which are not available at CPWD/\nPWD Schedule] (3rd preference) will be considered for finalizing item rate not in the BOQ.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
