    "paragraph_index": 69,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 25345,
    "char_end": 25869,
    "char_count": 524,
    "text": "Extension of time for completion\nThe contract period may be extended / pre-closed as per the requirement of EPI/ESIC. The\nRepair and Maintenance contract may be extended on the written mutual consent of both EPIL\nand Contractor for a further reasonable period.  However, employer reserves to right to\nterminate the Repair and Maintenance contract by giving 15 days notice at any time during the\ncurrency of the contract if the services of the agency are not satisfactory as per the opinion of\nemployer or its representative.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
