    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 26331,
    "char_end": 27141,
    "char_count": 810,
    "text": "30.\nFINAL BILL: The final bill will be submitted by the contractor within 90 days from the date of\nacceptance of completion of work accompanied by the following documents:\n30.1. Completion certificate (or) Final Acceptance Certificate issued by the EPI/ESIC\nspecifying the handing over of the work including list of inventories (fittings & fixtures).\n30.2. No claim certificate by the Contactor.\n30.3. Duly approved by the EPI/ESIC ‘As built’ drawings in required sets if any & if applicable.\n30.4. Certified Measurements for the work executed.\n30.5. All statutory approvals from various state/central govt. local bodies, if required for\ncompletion & handing over of the work as included in scope of Contractor.\n30.6. Manufacture’s guarantee of various machines / equipment’s installed as part of works if\nany.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
