    "char_start": 27309,
    "char_end": 27907,
    "char_count": 598,
    "text": "32.\nTECHNICAL STAFF FOR WORK:\n\nClause 27.0 of GCC stands modified as under.\n\nThe Contractor shall employ at his cost the adequate number of technical staff (apart from\nthe number of staff /operators mentioned in BOQ) during the execution of this work\ndepending upon the requirement of work. For this purpose the numbers to be deployed, their\nqualification, experience as decided by EPI shall be final and binding on Contractor. The\nContractor shall not be entitled for any extra payment in this regard. The technical staff\nshould be available at Site, whenever required by EPI to take instructions.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
