    "char_start": 29789,
    "char_end": 30055,
    "char_count": 266,
    "text": "37.\nGATEPASS AND PERMITS:\nThe contractor shall make own arrangements for obtaining the necessary gate pass / entry\nand exit permits for men, material, labours and construction machinery etc as applicable/\nrequired to complete the work without any extra cost to EPI..",
