    "char_start": 31422,
    "char_end": 31704,
    "char_count": 282,
    "text": "3.30.1 Conciliation and Arbitration:\nBefore resorting to arbitration as per the clause given below, the parties if they so\nagree may explore the possibility of conciliation as per the provisions of Part III of\nthe Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996 as amended by Arbitration and",
