    "paragraph_index": 90,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 31858,
    "char_end": 33002,
    "char_count": 1144,
    "text": "3.30.2 Except where otherwise provided for in the contract, any disputes and\ndifferences relating to the meaning of the Specifications, Design, Drawing and\nInstructions herein before mentioned and as to the quality of workmanship or\nmaterials used in the work or as to any other questions, claim, right, matter or\nthings whatsoever in any way arising out of or relating to the Contract,\nDesigns, Drawings, Specifications, Estimates, Instructions, or these\nconditions or otherwise concerning the works of the execution or failure to\nexecute the same whether arising during the progress of the work or after the\ncompletion or abandonment thereof shall be referred to the Sole Arbitrator\nmutually agreed and appointed by both the parties as per the provisions of\nArbitration and Conciliation Act, 2015 or any statutory modification or re-\nenactment thereof and the rules made thereunder. The person approached\nfor appointment as Arbitrator shall disclose in writing circumstances, in terms\nof Sub-Section (1) of Section (12) of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\nas amended by Arbitration and Conciliation (Amendment) Act, 2015 as\nfollows:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0091",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 91,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33004,
    "char_end": 33332,
    "char_count": 328,
    "text": "(i) such as the existence either direct or indirect, of any past or present\nrelationship with or interest in any of the parties or in relation to the\nsubject-matter in dispute, whether financial, business, professional or\nother kind, which is likely to give rise to justifiable doubts as to his\nindependence or impartiality; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0092",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 92,
