    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33334,
    "char_end": 33521,
    "char_count": 187,
    "text": "(ii) which are likely to affect his ability to devote sufficient time to the\narbitration and in particular his ability to complete the entire arbitration\nwithin a period of twelve months.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0093",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 93,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33523,
    "char_end": 33681,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "3.30.3 The Arbitrator shall be appointed within 30 days of the receipt of letter of\ninvocation of arbitration duly satisfying the requirements of this clause.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0094",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 94,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33683,
    "char_end": 34033,
    "char_count": 350,
    "text": "a) If the arbitrator so appointed resigns or is unable or unwilling to act due to\nany reason whatsoever, or dies, the parties may mutually appoint a new\narbitrator in accordance with these terms and conditions of the contract, to\nact in his place and the new arbitrator so appointed may proceed from the\nstage at which it was left by his predecessor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0095",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 95,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 34035,
    "char_end": 34271,
    "char_count": 236,
    "text": "b) It is a term of the contract that the party invoking the arbitration shall\nspecify the dispute/ differences or questions to be referred to the Arbitrator\nunder this clause together with the amounts claimed in respect of each\ndispute.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0096",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 96,
