    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 34273,
    "char_end": 34446,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "Page 17 of 28\n\nc) The Arbitrator may proceed with the arbitration ex-parte, if either party, in\nspite of a notice from the arbitrator, fails to take part in the proceedings.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
