    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 34809,
    "char_end": 35176,
    "char_count": 367,
    "text": "g) Subject to the aforesaid, the provisions of the Arbitration and Conciliation\nAct, 1996 as amended by Arbitration and Conciliation (Amendment) Act,\n2015 or any statutory modifications or re-enactment thereof and the Rules\nmade there under and for the time being in force shall apply to the\narbitration proceedings and Arbitrator shall publish his Award accordingly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
