    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 35178,
    "char_end": 35338,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "42.1. Clause no. 76.3 is amended as under,\nThe courts in Chennai alone will have jurisdiction to deal with matters arising from the\ncontract.\n43. MAKE IN INDIA:",
