    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 37098,
    "char_end": 37509,
    "char_count": 411,
    "text": "SIGNATURE OF THE CONTRACTOR\n\nPage 19 of 28\n\nPART - B\nTECHNICAL SPECIFICATION\n\n1.0\nThe work in general shall be carried out as per latest CPWD Specifications for Civil\nWorks for all the DSR items and TN PWD specification for PWD SOR items, Market\nRate Analysis for other items, unless otherwise specified in the nomenclature of the\nindividual item or in the particular specifications of concerned items of works.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0111",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 111,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 37511,
    "char_end": 37923,
    "char_count": 412,
    "text": "2.0\nThermo Mechanically Treated bars conforming to IS: 1786, Fe 500 grade as required,\nfrom approved manufacturers viz SAIL/RINL/TISCO shall be used. In case of non-\navailability of steel of these makes, TMT bars of other manufacturers as per IS 1786, Fe\n500 grade as required, may be allowed to be used with the prior approval of Engineer-in-\ncharge The other provisions of clause 45.2 of GCC remains unchanged.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0112",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 112,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 37925,
    "char_end": 38274,
    "char_count": 349,
    "text": "3.0\nFlooring works shall be executed as per the approved drawings / design & specifications.\nThe pattern shown in the drawings, if any, and be modified as per the site requirements\nby Engineer-in-charge/ESIC within the proportions of the flooring materials to be\nprovided and nothing extra whatsoever shall be payable over and above the rate quoted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0113",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 113,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 38276,
    "char_end": 38581,
    "char_count": 305,
    "text": "4.0\nThe water proofing for the terraces, underground tanks / toilet floor etc, shall be got\nexecuted only through the authorized applicators of the manufacturers and the\nguarantee for the same shall be in the name of EPI / Owner for a period of Ten Years\n(or) as directed by EPI, on the prescribed format.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0114",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 114,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 38583,
    "char_end": 38721,
    "char_count": 138,
    "text": "5.0\nSCI pipes for sanitary and GI pipes for water supply if fixed in RCC members like\ncolumns, beams etc. shall be fixed with scrub plugs.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0115",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 115,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 38723,
    "char_end": 39017,
    "char_count": 294,
    "text": "6.0\nWelding wherever required in the work like in grill, railing etc. shall be done in full length\nof the contract area and grinding shall be done properly to get an even surface, SGRC\ncovers for manholes etc. if provided, shall have name of owner / client and year of\nmanufacturer as engraved.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0116",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 116,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 39019,
    "char_end": 39179,
    "char_count": 160,
