    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0162",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 162,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 46838,
    "char_end": 46980,
    "char_count": 142,
    "text": "21. Manpower Attendance Register is to be maintained properly.\n22. Uniform, ID Card have to be provided to each and every staff by the agency.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0163",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 163,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 46981,
    "char_end": 47208,
    "char_count": 227,
    "text": "23. Number of manpower to deploy at site will be increased or decreased as per the\nrequirement of ESIC/ EPI Limited. Supervisor required to be deploying at site by\nCONTRACTOR at his own cost for smooth function of work at site.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0164",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 164,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 47209,
    "char_end": 47345,
    "char_count": 136,
    "text": "24. The CONTRACTOR should deploy Man Power as per the EPI / ESIC guidelines\nand finalized in consultation with EPI/ Competent Authority.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0165",
    "doc_id": "DOC-070",
    "paragraph_index": 165,
    "page_start": 22,
    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 47346,
    "char_end": 47656,
    "char_count": 310,
    "text": "25. Ensuring that the CONTRACTOR(s) implement required Health, Safety &\nEnvironmental (HSE) practices at the Maintenance/Construction Sites and they\nalso comply with all statutory obligations relate to workmen deployed at the Site\nlike compliance of Labour laws, minimum wages as per CLC, ESI, EPF & Bonus\netc.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
