    "char_start": 47658,
    "char_end": 48541,
    "char_count": 883,
    "text": "Page 23 of 28\n\n26. All liabilities arising out of accident or death of labour while on duty shall be borne\nby the contractor.\n27. Manpower Wages has been calculated on the basis of minimum wages of\nIndustrial Workers of CLC as on date which may vary in future.\n28. Changed amount of wages will be reimbursed to the contractor after payment of\nsame to their workers.\n29. Payment shall be made for actual days of engagement of the workers.\n30. Reimbursement of Bonus (if applicable) @ 8.33% of basic\nwages\nas\nper\nBonus Act (Latest Version by GOI) shall be made to the contractor after payment\nof same to the workers concerned.\n31. Details category of manpower under different works have been mentioned in\nSchedule of Manpower Supply given in the price bid. However, Contractor shall be\nbound to pay as per CLC rate to their employees irrespective of their quoted rates\ntowards manpower",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
