    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 801,
    "char_end": 1315,
    "char_count": 514,
    "text": "………………. [Insert name of the RE Power Developer], a Company incorporated under the\nCompanies Act 1956 or Companies Act 2013, having its registered office at ………….. [Insert\naddress of the registered office of RE Power Developer] (hereinafter referred to as “RTC Power\nGenerator” or RTC-PG or “RE Power Developer” or “RTC Power Developer” or “RPD”,\nwhich expression shall, unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof, be deemed to include\nits successors and permitted assigns) as a Party of the First Part;\nAnd",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1317,
    "char_end": 1742,
    "char_count": 425,
    "text": "Solar Energy Corporation of India Limited, a company incorporated under the Companies Act\n1956, having its registered office at 1st Floor, A-Wing, D-3, District Centre, Saket, New Delhi-\n110017 (hereinafter referred to as “SECI”, or “Intermediary Procurer” or “Buyer” which expression\nshall, unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof, be deemed to include its successors and\nassignees) as a Party of the Second Part;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1744,
    "char_end": 1843,
    "char_count": 99,
    "text": "The RPD and SECI are individually referred to as ‘Party’ and collectively referred to as ‘Parties’.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1845,
    "char_end": 1853,
    "char_count": 8,
    "text": "WHEREAS:",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1855,
    "char_end": 2716,
    "char_count": 861,
    "text": "A. The Government of India has announced the Policy for promotion of the renewable energy\nbased project installation in the country and has provided a target to achieve an aggregate\ninstalled capacity of 175 GW by the year 2022.\nB. The Ministry of Power, Government of India has issued the Guidelines for Tariff Based\nCompetitive Bidding Process for Procurement of Round-The-Clock Power from ISTS-\nconnected Renewable (RE) Power Projects (‘RE Projects’), complemented/balanced with\npower from coal based ISTS-connected Thermal Power Projects (‘Thermal Projects’), vide\nGazette Resolution dated 22.07.2020, including subsequent amendments and clarifications\nthereto.\nC. SECI has been designated as a Nodal Agency for developing and facilitating the establishment\nof the Grid connected RE Power capacity in India in terms of the Policy of the Government of\nIndia;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 2718,
    "char_end": 2883,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "SECI-RPD PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                         Page 3 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 2885,
    "char_end": 3352,
    "char_count": 467,
    "text": "D. SECI had initiated a Tariff Based Competitive Bid Process for procurement of 5000 MW of\nthe power generated from the ISTS-connected RE Power Project to be complemented /\nbalanced with Power from Coal Based ISTS-connected Thermal Power Projects (Thermal\nProjects) on the terms and conditions contained in the Request for Selection (hereinafter\nreferred to as `RfS) issued by SECI vide RfS No……………..dated……………. including its\nsubsequent amendments and clarifications.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0016",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 16,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 3353,
    "char_end": 4110,
    "char_count": 757,
    "text": "E. The RPD has been selected in the Competitive Bidding Process for supply of Contracted\nCapacity of _________________MW through development, generation and supply of\nelectricity from the ……………. [Insert proposed combined installed RE Capacity] MW\nRE Power Project to be established by RPD in India with an obligation on the RPD to arrange\nfor and ensure the Power generation and supply from ISTS-connected Thermal Projects to\ncomplement / balance the above RE Power for Round the Clock [RTC] supply to SECI as an\nIntermediary Agency to enable the onward supply of such electricity by SECI to the Buying\nUtility(ies) [as defined] on back to back basis under Power Sale Agreement(s) to be finalized\nand entered into between SECI and such Buying Utility (ies);",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4111,
    "char_end": 4693,
    "char_count": 582,
    "text": "F. SECI has issued the Letter of Award (LoA) vide No…………….. dated…………in favour of\nthe RPD  for the above purpose and for the development and establishment RE Project in the\nState(s) of ………………. and in the ………….. territory [Insert name of the RLDC], for a\nContracted Capacity of  ……………MW  as per the terms and conditions contained in the RfS\nincluding amendments and clarifications thereto, the standard draft of this Power Purchase\nAgreement circulated at the time of the bidding and other bidding documents as well as the\nconditions contained in the  aforementioned Letter of Award;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4694,
    "char_end": 5235,
    "char_count": 541,
    "text": "G. The RPD vide its Agreement(s) dated_____________ has tied up for the requirement of\nThermal Power to be complemented from the existing Coal based Thermal Power Project\nlocated at ____________of __________ (Name of the Thermal Generator)  [hereinafter\nreferred to as ‘Thermal Generator’] and in the ………..territory [Insert the name of RLDC]\nfor a capacity of ______MW for supply under this Agreement and the RPD has assumed the\nentire obligations to arrange for and duly maintain the supply from both sources of power to\nensure RTC supply ;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 5236,
    "char_end": 5601,
    "char_count": 365,
    "text": "H. The RPD has executed an agreement with the Thermal Generator for confirmation of its\nobligations to complement /balance the RE Power Generation in the manner specified in this\nAgreement (read alongwith RfS Documents) to ensure the Round The Clock Power availability\nand the agreement is attached to this Agreement as Schedule 6. .Further, the coal being utilized",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 5603,
    "char_end": 5768,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "SECI-RPD PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                         Page 4 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 5770,
    "char_end": 7474,
    "char_count": 1704,
    "text": "in the Thermal Project shall be of ________(domestic/imported) nature, for the Term of this\nAgreement.\nI. SECI has agreed to purchase such RE Power complemented / balanced from Thermal Power\nProjects as an Intermediary Procurer for onward back-to-back sale to Buying Utility(ies) to be\nidentified and with whom SECI is to duly conclude/has concluded a binding and enforceable\nPower Sale Agreement with due regulatory approvals required to be taken by the Buying\nUtility(ies), as per the Conditions Precedent contained in this Agreement;\nJ. In terms of the RfS and the Bidding Documents, the RPD has furnished the Performance Bank\nGuarantee/ Payment on Order Instrument, as the case may be, in the sum of Rs……….. in\nfavour of SECI as per the format provided as a part of the Bidding Documents and a copy of\nthe Bank Guarantee (/ Payment on Order Instrument / Letter of Undertaking as per RfS, as\napplicable) provided is in Schedule – 1 (/ Schedule-2) to this Agreement;\nK. The RPD has fulfilled the terms of the bidding and the terms of the Letter of Award for signing\nthis Power Purchase Agreement as a definitive agreement, subject to the Conditions Precedent\ncontained in this Agreement;\nL. The Parties have agreed to execute this Power Purchase Agreement in terms of the provisions\nof the RfS, the bidding documents and the Letter of Award in regard to the terms and conditions\nfor establishment of the RE Power Project at ……, [Insert name of state and region] and for\ngeneration and supply of electricity complemented / balanced with Power from Thermal\nProject(s) to SECI at the tariff of Rs ……./kWh  for onward sale to the Buying Entities on back\nto back basis under respective Power Sale Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 7476,
    "char_end": 7648,
    "char_count": 172,
    "text": "Now therefore, in consideration of the premises and mutual agreements, covenants and\nconditions set forth herein, it is hereby agreed by and between the Parties as follows:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7650,
    "char_end": 7815,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "SECI-RPD PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                         Page 5 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7817,
    "char_end": 7875,
    "char_count": 58,
    "text": "ARTICLE 1: DEFINITIONS AND INTERPRETATION\n\n1.1\nDefinitions",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7877,
    "char_end": 9639,
    "char_count": 1762,
    "text": "The terms used in this Agreement, unless as defined below or repugnant to the context, shall have\nthe same meaning as assigned to them by the Electricity Act, 2003 and the rules or regulations\nframed thereunder, including those issued/framed by the Appropriate Commission (as defined\nhereunder), as amended or re-enacted from time to time.\n“Act” or “Electricity\nAct, 2003”\nshall mean the Electricity Act, 2003 and include any modifications,\namendments and substitution from time to time;\n“Adjusted Equity”\nshall mean the Equity funded in Indian Rupees restricted to the RE\nProject and adjusted on the first day of the current month (the\n“Reference Date”), in the manner set forth below, to reflect the change\nin its value on account of depreciation and variations in Wholesale\nPrice Index (WPI), and for any Reference Date occurring between the\nfirst day of the month of Appointed Date (the date of achievement of\nFinancial Closure) and the Reference Date;\nOn or before Commercial Operation Date (COD), the Adjusted Equity\nshall be a sum equal to the Equity funded in Indian Rupees and\nexpended on the Project, revised to the extent of one half of the\nvariation in WPI occurring between the first day of the month of\nAppointed Date and Reference Date;\nii. An amount equal to the Adjusted Equity as on COD shall be deemed\nto be the base(the “Base Adjusted Equity”);\niii. After COD, the Adjusted Equity hereunder shall be a sum equal to\nthe Base Adjusted Equity, reduced by 0.333% (zero point three three\nthree percent) thereof at the commencement of each month following\nthe COD [reduction of 1% (one percent) per quarter of an year] and the\namount so arrived at shall be revised to the extent of variation in WPI\noccurring between the COD and the Reference Date;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0026",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 26,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 9640,
    "char_end": 10019,
    "char_count": 379,
    "text": "For the avoidance of doubt, the Adjusted Equity shall, in the event of\ntermination, be computed as on the Reference Date immediately\npreceding the Transfer Date; provided that no reduction in the\nAdjusted Equity shall be made for a period equal to the duration, if\nany, for which the PPA period is extended, but the revision on account\nof WPI shall continue to be made.\nAffiliate",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0027",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 27,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 10022,
    "char_end": 10292,
    "char_count": 270,
    "text": "shall mean a person who controls, is controlled by, or is under the\ncommon control with such Company. The expression ‘control’ shall\nmean the ownership, directly or indirectly, of more than 50% of the\nvoting shares of such Company or right to appoint majority Directors;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
