    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 10461,
    "char_end": 11626,
    "char_count": 1165,
    "text": "“Agreement” or\n“Power Purchase\nAgreement” or\n“PPA”\nshall mean this Power Purchase Agreement including its recitals and\nSchedules, amended or modified from time to time in accordance with\nthe terms hereof;\n“Appropriate\nCommission”\nUnless otherwise stated or the context requires, Appropriate\nCommission shall mean Central Electricity Regulatory Commission;\n“Availability”\nAvailability of the Contract Capacity to its full capacity shall, in\nrespect of any 15-minute period or any duration as directed by CERC\nfrom time to time (time-block), mean the capacity of the Power (in\nMW) to the extent it is offered by the RPD to generate and supply\nelectrical power equal to a maximum of Contracted Capacity at the\nDelivery Point, after accounting for auxiliary consumption, and\ntransmission losses upto the Delivery Point, and for any month or\nContract Year, as the case may be, the total such time block during that\nmonth or Contract Year. In case of multiple points of injection\ncomprising the Delivery Point, Availability shall be reckoned to the\nextent of electrical power offered at each point of injection, subject to\na maximum capacity equal to Contracted Capacity.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0030",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 11628,
    "char_end": 12005,
    "char_count": 377,
    "text": "For the avoidance of doubt, the Parties agree that Availability shall,\nduring the month and the Contract Year when COD  /part\ncommissioning occurs, be determined with reference to the number of\nremaining time block in such month / Contract Year corresponding to\nsuch commissioned full / part Contracted Capacity and shall be\ndetermined likewise for any single day of operation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 12007,
    "char_end": 12269,
    "char_count": 262,
    "text": "It shall be the obligation of the RPD to arrange for the declaration of a\ncomposite availability of the RE Power and the Thermal Power to\nensure the RTC supply of the declared availability of the total quantum\nof power in MW, as per provisions of this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 12271,
    "char_end": 13010,
    "char_count": 739,
    "text": "The Parties also agree that the determination of Availability here under\nshall be solely for the purposes of this Agreement and shall not in any\nmanner affect the rights and obligations of the Supplier for and in\nrespect of scheduling and dispatch of electricity under Applicable\nLaws and the rules and regulations thereunder.\n“Awarded capacity”\nShall mean …………. MW [enter the capacity as awarded by SECI as\nper the LoA]\n“Backdown”\nMeans part of Contracted capacity available for scheduling but not\nscheduled based on instructions from /Buying Utility/SLDC /RLDC,\nas the case may be;\n\"Bill Dispute\nNotice\"\nshall mean the notice issued by a Party raising a Dispute regarding a\nMonthly Bill or a Supplementary Bill issued by the other Party;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0033",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 33,
