    "text": "on prorate basis without creating any liability to either parties. In such case, if such\nreduced capacity turns out to be less than 50% of the awarded Capacity and the RPD\ndesires to abandon/ exit the PPA for such capacity also, RPD shall be allowed to\nexit this Agreement without any liability to either parties and Instruments provided\nby the RPD for the Performance of this Agreement i.e. Performance Bank Guarantee\nshall be released by SECI without any deduction.",
