    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 76085,
    "char_end": 76264,
    "char_count": 179,
    "text": "(i) The RPD has complied with the complete application formalities as per RfS,\n(ii) The RPD has adhered to the applicable Procedure in this regard as notified by\nthe CERC/CTU, and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0120",
