    "char_start": 76265,
    "char_end": 76583,
    "char_count": 318,
    "text": "(iii) The delay in grant of connectivity/LTA by the CTU and/or delay in readiness\nof the ISTS substation at the Delivery Point, including readiness of the power\nevacuation and transmission infrastructure of the ISTS network, is solely\nattributable to the CTU/transmission licensee and is beyond the control of the RPD;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
