    "paragraph_index": 121,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 76585,
    "char_end": 77112,
    "char_count": 527,
    "text": "The above shall be treated as delays beyond the control of the RPD and SCD for\nsuch Projects shall be revised as the date as on 30 days subsequent to the readiness\nof the Delivery Point and power evacuation infrastructure and/or operationalization\nof LTA. Decision on requisite extension on account of the above factor shall be\ntaken by SECI. Provided that delay in commissioning / operationalization of the\nThermal Power Project, if any, shall not be admissible among the factors\nwarranting an extension in SCD of the Project.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
