    "char_start": 78762,
    "char_end": 79795,
    "char_count": 1033,
    "text": "4.6      Liquidated Damages not amounting to penalty for delay in Commissioning\n4.6.1 The Project shall be fully commissioned within the Scheduled Commercial\nOperation Date as defined in this Agreement. If the RPD is unable to commission\nthe Project by the Scheduled Commercial Operation Date for any of the reasons\nother than those specified in Article 4.5.1, and 4.5.2, the RPD shall pay to SECI,\ndamages for the delay in such commissioning and making the Contracted Capacity\navailable for dispatch by the Scheduled Commercial Operation Date as per the\nfollowing:\n (a) Delay beyond the Scheduled Commercial Operation Date upto (& including) the\ndate as on 6 months after the Scheduled Commercial Operation Date or the\nextended SCD, if applicable: The total PBG / POI amount shall be encashed on\nper day basis and proportionate to the balance capacity not commissioned. In case\nof calculation of liquidated damages, a ‘month’ shall comprise 30 days. For\nexample, in case of a Contracted Capacity of 640 MW capacity, if commissioning",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
