    "char_start": 81370,
    "char_end": 81797,
    "char_count": 427,
    "text": "4.7\nAcceptance/Performance Test\n4.7.1 Prior to synchronization of the Power Project, the RPD shall be required to get / ensure\nthe\nRE\nProject\n/\nThermal\nComponent\ncertified\nfor\nthe\nrequisite\nacceptance/performance test as may be laid down by Central Electricity Authority\nor an agency identified by the central government to carry out testing and\ncertification for the RE power projects and / or Thermal Project (as applicable).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0128",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 128,
    "page_start": 34,
    "page_end": 34,
    "char_start": 81799,
    "char_end": 82235,
    "char_count": 436,
    "text": "4.8\nThird Party Verification\n4.8.1  The RPD shall be further required to provide entry to the sites of the Project (from\nwhich power under this Agreement is being made available) free of all\nencumbrances at all times during the Term of the Agreement to SECI and a third\nParty nominated by any Indian Governmental Instrumentality for inspection and\nverification of the works being carried out by the RPD at the site of the Power\nProject.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0129",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 129,
    "page_start": 35,
    "page_end": 35,
    "char_start": 82237,
    "char_end": 82401,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 35 of 90",
