    "paragraph_index": 132,
    "page_start": 35,
    "page_end": 35,
    "char_start": 84384,
    "char_end": 84739,
    "char_count": 355,
    "text": "Provision\nfor\nGeneration\nCompensation\nGrid unavailability beyond 175 hours in\na Contract Year\nGeneration Compensation =\n((Composite Tariff x RE power (MW)\noffered\nbut\nnot\nscheduled\nby\nProcurer) + (Fixed Charge x Thermal\npower (MW) offered but not scheduled\nby Procurer)) X 1000 X No. of hours\nof grid unavailability\nContract Year, as defined in Article 1)",
