    "page_end": 37,
    "char_start": 89419,
    "char_end": 89903,
    "char_count": 484,
    "text": "intimation to SECI. In addition, the RPD will inject in-firm power to grid time to\ntime to carry out operational/ functional test prior to commercial operation. For\navoidance of doubt, it is clarified that Synchronization / Connectivity of the Project\nwith the grid shall not to be considered as Commissioning of the Project.\n5.1.5 The RPD shall commission the Project as detailed in “Schedule 3: Commissioning\nProcedure” within ……………Months of the Effective Date. Declaration of COD /",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
