    "paragraph_index": 158,
    "page_start": 41,
    "page_end": 41,
    "char_start": 97280,
    "char_end": 97987,
    "char_count": 707,
    "text": "thermal power shall be supplied to the SECI at the same Tariff as per the terms of\nthis Agreement. In case the transmission and other incidental charges, including but\nnot limited to application fees for open access, RLDC/SLDC charges, etc.,\napplicable from the alternative source of thermal power supply are higher than the\napplicable Transmission Charges from the Injection Point to the Delivery Point, the\nRPD would be liable to bear such additional charges. Further, the RPD shall provide\ndocumentary evidence for establishing the source of supply for such tie up.\n6.2.10 DSM charges or any other charges including grid support related charges as per the\nCERC/SERC regulations shall be borne by the RPD.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0159",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 159,
    "page_start": 42,
    "page_end": 42,
    "char_start": 97989,
    "char_end": 98153,
