  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0165",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 165,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 101127,
    "char_end": 101948,
    "char_count": 821,
    "text": "ARTICLE 8: INSURANCES\n\n8.1\nInsurance\n\n8.1.1 The RPD shall effect and maintain or cause to be effected and maintained, at its own\ncost and expense, throughout the Term of PPA, Insurances against such risks to keep\nthe RE Project in good condition and shall take Industrial All Risk insurance policy\ncovering risks against any loss or damage, with such deductibles and with such\nendorsements and co-insured(s), which the Prudent Utility Practices would\nordinarily merit maintenance of and as required under the Financing Agreements,\nImplementation and Support Agreement (if applicable) and under the applicable\nlaws. Further, RPD shall also ensure that necessary Insurance coverage is also\nmaintained for the thermal component as per the requirement and compliances of\napplicable laws.\n8.2\nApplication of Insurance Proceeds",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0166",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 166,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 101950,
    "char_end": 102304,
    "char_count": 354,
    "text": "8.2.1 In case of the RE Project not being implemented through Financing Agreement(s),\nsave as expressly provided in this Agreement or the Insurances, the proceeds of any\ninsurance claim made due to loss or damage to the Power Project or any part of the\nPower Project shall be first applied to reinstatement, replacement or renewal of such\nloss or damage.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0167",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 167,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 102306,
    "char_end": 102616,
    "char_count": 310,
    "text": "In case of the RE Project being financed through Financing Agreement(s), save as\nexpressly provided in this Agreement or the Insurances, the proceeds of any\ninsurance claim made due to loss or damage to the RE Power Project or any part of\nthe RE Power Project shall be applied as per such Financing Agreements.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0168",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 168,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 102618,
    "char_end": 103021,
    "char_count": 403,
    "text": "8.2.2 If a Force Majeure Event renders the RE Power Project no longer economically and\ntechnically viable and the insurers under the Insurances make payment on a “total\nloss” or equivalent basis, SECI shall have claim on such proceeds of such Insurance\nlimited to outstanding dues of SECI against the Buying Utility(ies) as per PSA\nentered into and any other dues of the Buying Utility(ies) against RPD.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0169",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 169,
    "page_start": 44,
    "page_end": 44,
    "char_start": 103023,
    "char_end": 103512,
    "char_count": 489,
    "text": "8.3\nEffect on liability of SECI\n8.3.1 Notwithstanding any liability or obligation that may arise under this Agreement, any\nloss, damage, liability, payment, obligation or expense which is insured or not or for\nwhich the RPD can claim compensation, under any Insurance shall not be charged\nto or payable by Buyer. It is for the RPD to ensure that appropriate insurance\ncoverage is taken for payment by the insurer for the entire loss and there is no under\ninsurance or short adjustment etc.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0170",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 170,
    "page_start": 45,
    "page_end": 45,
    "char_start": 103514,
    "char_end": 103678,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 45 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0171",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 171,
    "page_start": 45,
    "page_end": 45,
    "char_start": 103680,
    "char_end": 105044,
    "char_count": 1364,
    "text": "ARTICLE 9: APPLICABLE TARIFF\n\n9.1 Subsequent to commercial operation of first part capacity of the Contracted Capacity,\nand supply of the RE Power and Thermal Power on the terms contained in this\nAgreement, the RPD shall be entitled to receive the Composite Tariff of Rs.\n…………../ kWh [Insert the Tariff discovered through the bidding process conducted\nby SECI] for the entire term of this Agreement, with effect from the SCD, as per\nprovisions of this Agreement. 25% of the aforementioned Composite Tariff shall be\nindexed and adjusted with the index of Domestic Coal or the Imported Coal, as\napplicable, as per the notification issued by the Central Electricity Regulatory\nCommission in this regard and accordingly, the adjusted Composite tariff shall be the\nApplicable Tariff for such period. Subject to the provisions of this Agreement, the\nRenewable Energy supplied shall be paid at Applicable Tariff. For Thermal component\nof power, 50% of the Applicable Tariff shall deemed to be the Thermal Fixed Charge\nTariff and balance 50% of the Applicable Tariff shall deemed to be the Thermal\nVariable Charge Tariff. Subject to the provisions of this Agreement, the Fixed Charge\nshall be paid based on the offered thermal capacity shall be at 50 % of the Applicable\nTariff whereas for the thermal energy dispatched same shall be paid at 50 % of the\nApplicable Tariff.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0172",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 172,
    "page_start": 45,
    "page_end": 45,
    "char_start": 105046,
    "char_end": 105270,
    "char_count": 224,
    "text": "9.2\nWith respect to indexation of the Composite tariff, in case the RPD does not supply any\nthermal power during any particular billing month, no indexation will be provided in\nthe Composite tariff for that particular month.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0173",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 173,
    "page_start": 45,
    "page_end": 45,
    "char_start": 105272,
    "char_end": 105847,
    "char_count": 575,
    "text": "9.2   During any Contract Year, the RPD shall be obliged to make the Annual Availability\n(at least 85%) and Annual Peak Hour Availability (at least 85%) as per provisions of\nthis Agreement. Further, the RPD shall also be obliged to offer at least 51% of the\nannual energy during any Contract Year through RE Power. Non-compliance of any of\naforementioned provision shall attract damages as per Article 4.4.3 of this Agreement.\nThe Buying Utility shall be entitled to use the RE power supplied under this Agreement\nfor fulfillment of its RPO of each RE component respectively.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0174",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 174,
    "page_start": 45,
    "page_end": 45,
    "char_start": 105849,
    "char_end": 106106,
    "char_count": 257,
    "text": "9.3 The RPD shall be permitted for full commissioning as well as part commissioning of the\nProject even prior to the Scheduled Commercial Operation Date, subject to availability\nof transmission connectivity and Long-Term Access (LTA). Early commissioning of",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0175",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 175,
    "page_start": 46,
    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 106108,
    "char_end": 106272,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 46 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0176",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 176,
    "page_start": 46,
    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 106274,
    "char_end": 106906,
    "char_count": 632,
    "text": "the Project will be allowed solely at the risk and cost of the RPD, and SECI shall\npurchase the energy from such early commissioned Project at the PPA Tariff, only in\ncase the Buying Utility agrees to purchase power from the Project at an earlier date,\nand at the PPA tariff plus trading margin. In case SECI does not agree to purchase such\nenergy, early part/full commissioning of the Project shall still be allowed and the RPD\nwill be free to sell such energy to a third party until Scheduled Commercial Operation\nDate or the date of commencement of procurement of power from the Project as\nnotified by SECI, whichever is earlier.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0177",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 177,
    "page_start": 47,
    "page_end": 47,
    "char_start": 106908,
    "char_end": 107072,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 47 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0178",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 178,
    "page_start": 47,
    "page_end": 47,
    "char_start": 107074,
    "char_end": 108001,
    "char_count": 927,
    "text": "ARTICLE 10: BILLING AND PAYMENT\n\n10.1\nGeneral\n\n10.1.1 Pursuant to Article 4.1.1 (k), SECI shall set up a payment security fund for RE Projects\nin order to ensure timely payment. This fund will have a corpus to cover 3 months’\npayment.\n10.1.2 From the commencement of supply of power, SECI shall pay to the RPD the monthly\nTariff Payments subject to the adjustments as per provisions of this Agreement\nincluding Article 6, in accordance with Article 9. All Tariff Payments by SECI shall\nbe in Indian Rupees.\n10.1.3 Void.\n10.1.4 The RPD shall be required to make arrangements and payments for import of energy\nand other charges (if any) required for supply / offer of the contracted capacity under\nthis Agreement as per applicable regulations.\n10.1.5. The obligation of SECI shall be to pay the Applicable Tariff to RPD and it shall be\nentirely for the RPD to deal with and discharge the charges payable to the Thermal\nGenerator.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0179",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 179,
    "page_start": 47,
    "page_end": 47,
    "char_start": 108003,
    "char_end": 108899,
    "char_count": 896,
    "text": "10.2\nDelivery and Content of Monthly Bills/Supplementary Bills\n\n10.2.1 The RPD shall issue to SECI hard copy of a signed Monthly Bill/Supplementary Bill\nfor the immediately preceding Month/relevant period based on the issuance of\nEnergy Accounts along with all relevant documents (payments made by RPD for\ndrawal of power, payment of reactive energy charges, Metering charges or any other\ncharges as per guidelines of SERC/CERC, if applicable.\nEach Monthly Bill shall include all charges as per this Agreement for the energy\nsupplied for the relevant Month based on Energy Accounts issued by RPC or any\nother competent authority which shall be binding on both the Parties. The Monthly\nBill amount shall be the product of the energy as per Energy Accounts and the\nApplicable Tariff. Energy drawn from the grid will be regulated as per the\nregulations of respective State the Project is located in.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0180",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 180,
    "page_start": 47,
    "page_end": 47,
    "char_start": 108901,
    "char_end": 109128,
    "char_count": 227,
    "text": "10.2.2 As per applicable regulation(s) of the Appropriate Commission(s)/respective\nSERC(s), all charges pertaining to obtaining open access and scheduling of power,\nif any, upto the Delivery Point(s), shall be borne by the RPD.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0181",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 181,
    "page_start": 48,
    "page_end": 48,
    "char_start": 109130,
    "char_end": 109294,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 48 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0182",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 182,
    "page_start": 48,
    "page_end": 48,
    "char_start": 109296,
    "char_end": 109513,
    "char_count": 217,
    "text": "10.3\nPayment of Monthly Bills\n\n10.3.1 SECI shall pay the amount payable under the Monthly Bill/Supplementary Bill by\nthe Due Date to such account of the RPD, as shall have been previously notified by\nthe RPD as below.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0183",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 183,
    "page_start": 48,
    "page_end": 48,
    "char_start": 109515,
    "char_end": 109873,
    "char_count": 358,
    "text": "10.3.2 All  payments  required  to  be  made  under  this  Agreement  shall  also  include\nany deduction or set off for:\ni) deductions required by the Law; and\nii) amount claimed by SECI, if any, from the RPD , will be adjusted from the\nmonthly energy payment. In case of any excess payment adjustment, 1.25%\nsurcharge will be applicable on day to day basis.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0184",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 184,
    "page_start": 48,
    "page_end": 48,
    "char_start": 109875,
    "char_end": 110645,
    "char_count": 770,
    "text": "The RPD shall open a bank account (the “RPD’s Designated Account\") for all Tariff\nPayments (including Supplementary Bills) to be made by SECI to the RPD and\nnotify SECI of the details of such account at least ninety (90) Days before the\ndispatch of the first Monthly Bill. SECI shall also designate a bank account at New\nDelhi (\"SECI Designated Account\") for payments to be made by the RPD to SECI,\nif any, and notify the RPD of the details of such account ninety (90) Days before the\nScheduled Commercial Operation Date. SECI and the RPD shall instruct their\nrespective bankers to make all payments under this Agreement to the RPD’s\nDesignated Account or SECI’s Designated Account, as the case may be, and shall\nnotify either Party of such instructions on the same day.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0185",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 185,
    "page_start": 48,
    "page_end": 48,
    "char_start": 110647,
    "char_end": 111431,
    "char_count": 784,
    "text": "10.3.3 Late Payment Surcharge\n\nIn the event of delay in payment of a Monthly Bill by SECI beyond the Due Date, a\nLate Payment Surcharge shall be payable to the RPD at the rate of 1.25% per month\non the outstanding amount calculated on a day to day basis subject to such late\npayment surcharge being duly received by SECI under the PSA from the Buying\nEntity(ies). The Late Payment Surcharge shall be claimed by the RPD through the\nSupplementary Bill.\n10.3.4 Subject to the Article 9 of this Agreement, in the event of early Commissioning of\nthe Project and subject to acceptance by SECI, the payment for the power fed to the\ngrid may be accounted from the date of UCOD, and RPD would be allowed to raise\nBills against such power as per Article 10.2.1. However, payment against the 1st",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0186",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 186,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 111433,
    "char_end": 111597,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 49 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0187",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 187,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 111599,
    "char_end": 111689,
    "char_count": 90,
    "text": "such bill raised by the RPD, will be made subject to acceptance of the bill by the\nDiscom.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0188",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 188,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 111691,
    "char_end": 112436,
    "char_count": 745,
    "text": "10.3.5 Rebate\n\nFor payment of any Bill on or before Due Date, the following Rebate shall be paid\nby the RPD to SECI in the following manner.\na) A Rebate of 1.5% shall be payable to the SECI for the payments made within\na period of 10 (ten) days of the presentation of hard copy of Bill.\nb) Any payments made after ten (10) days of the date of presentation of Bill\nthrough hard copy up to the 45th day shall be allowed a rebate of 1 %.\nc) For the above purpose, the date of presentation of Bill shall be the next\nBusiness Day of delivery of the physical copy of the Bill at SECI.\nd) No Rebate shall be payable on the Bills raised on account of Change in Law\n(except annuity payment) relating to taxes, duties, cess etc. and on\nSupplementary Bill.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0189",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 189,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 112438,
    "char_end": 112613,
    "char_count": 175,
    "text": "For the above purpose date of presentation of bill shall be the same day of delivery\nin hard copy. However, for consideration of rebate, next business day shall be\nconsidered.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0190",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 190,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 112615,
    "char_end": 112646,
    "char_count": 31,
    "text": "10.4\nPayment Security Mechanism",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0191",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 191,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 112648,
    "char_end": 112670,
    "char_count": 22,
    "text": "Letter of Credit (LC):",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0192",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 192,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 112672,
    "char_end": 112960,
    "char_count": 288,
    "text": "10.4.1 SECI shall provide to the RPD, in respect of payment of its Monthly Bills and/or\nSupplementary Bills, a monthly unconditional, revolving and irrevocable letter of\ncredit (“Letter of Credit”), opened and maintained which may be drawn upon by the\nRPD in accordance with this Article.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0193",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 193,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 112962,
    "char_end": 113347,
    "char_count": 385,
    "text": "10.4.2 Subject to Article 10.4.1, not later than one (1) Month before the start of supply,\nSECI through a scheduled bank open a Letter of Credit in favour of the RPD, to be\nmade operative from a date prior to the Due Date of its first Monthly Bill under this\nAgreement. The Letter of Credit shall have a term of twelve (12) Months and shall\nbe renewed annually, for an amount equal to:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0194",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 194,
    "page_start": 49,
    "page_end": 49,
    "char_start": 113349,
    "char_end": 113460,
    "char_count": 111,
    "text": "i) for the first Contract Year, equal to (85% X 720Hrs X Commissioned Contracted\nCapacity X Applicable Tariff);",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0195",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 195,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 113462,
    "char_end": 113626,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 50 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0196",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 196,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 113628,
    "char_end": 113742,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "ii)  for each subsequent Contract Year, equal to the average of the monthly billing\nof the previous Contract Year.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0197",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 197,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 113744,
    "char_end": 113944,
    "char_count": 200,
    "text": "10.4.3 Provided that the RPD shall not draw upon such Letter of Credit prior to the Due\nDate of the relevant Monthly Bill and/or Supplementary Bill, and shall not make\nmore than one drawal in a Month.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0198",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 198,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 113946,
    "char_end": 114156,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "10.4.4 Provided further that if at any time, such Letter of Credit amount falls short of the\namount specified in Article 10.4.2 due to any reason whatsoever, SECI shall restore\nsuch shortfall before next drawl.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0199",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 199,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 114158,
    "char_end": 114322,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "10.4.5 SECI shall cause the scheduled bank issuing the Letter of Credit to intimate the RPD,\nin writing regarding establishing of such irrevocable Letter of Credit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0200",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 200,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 114324,
    "char_end": 114431,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "10.4.6 SECI shall ensure that the Letter of Credit shall be renewed not later than its current\nexpiry date.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0201",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 201,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 114433,
    "char_end": 114530,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "10.4.7 All costs relating to opening, maintenance of the Letter of Credit shall be borne by\nSECI.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0202",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 202,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 114532,
    "char_end": 115047,
    "char_count": 515,
    "text": "10.4.8 If SECI fails to pay undisputed Monthly Bill or Supplementary Bill or a part thereof\nwithin and including date as on the Due Date, then, subject to Article 10.4.6 &\n10.5.2, the RPD may draw upon the Letter of Credit, and accordingly the bank shall\npay without any reference or instructions from SECI, an amount equal to such\nMonthly Bill or Supplementary Bill or part thereof, in accordance with Article\n10.4.3 above, by presenting to the scheduled bank issuing the Letter of Credit, the\nfollowing documents:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0203",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 203,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 115049,
    "char_end": 115356,
    "char_count": 307,
    "text": "i) a copy of the Monthly Bill or Supplementary Bill (only for energy related\nbills) which has remained unpaid to RPD and;\nii) a certificate from the RPD to the effect that the bill at item (i) above, or\nspecified part thereof, is in accordance with the Agreement and has remained\nunpaid beyond the Due Date;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0204",
