    "page_end": 59,
    "char_start": 134921,
    "char_end": 135553,
    "char_count": 632,
    "text": "completion of the period of 180 (one hundred and eighty) Days from the date\nof the Force Majeure Notice.\nb) Notwithstanding anything in Article 11.6, on termination of the PPA\npursuant to Article 11.10.2(a):\ni.\nThe Buying Entity shall pay to the RPD for RE Project(s), ‘Force Majeure\nTermination Compensation’ equivalent to the amount of the Debt Due and\nthe 110% (one hundred and ten per cent) of the Adjusted Equity, as\ndefined in the PPA, for the RE Projects and takeover the RE Project assets.\nii.\nThe RPD shall be eligible for undisputed payments under outstanding\nMonthly Bill(s), before the occurrence of Force Majeure Event.",
