    "char_count": 338,
    "text": "ARTICLE 13: EVENTS OF DEFAULT AND TERMINATION\n\n13.1\nRPD Event of Default\n\n13.1.1 The occurrence and/or continuation of any of the following events, unless any such\nevent occurs as a result of a Force Majeure Event or a breach by SECI or Buying\nEntity(ies) of its obligations under this Agreement, shall constitute an RPD Event\nof Default:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0255",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
