    "char_end": 148249,
    "char_count": 504,
    "text": "13.3\nProcedure for cases of RPD Event of Default\n\n13.3.1  Upon the occurrence and continuation of any RPD Event of Default under Article\n13.1, SECI shall have the right to deliver to the RPD , with a copy to the\nrepresentative of the lenders to the RPD with whom the RPD has executed the\nFinancing Agreements, a notice stating its intention to terminate this Agreement\n(SECI Preliminary Default Notice), which shall specify in reasonable detail, the\ncircumstances giving rise to the issue of such notice.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
