    "page_end": 65,
    "char_start": 148251,
    "char_end": 148512,
    "char_count": 261,
    "text": "13.3.2 Following the issue of a SECI Preliminary Default Notice, the Consultation Period\nof ninety (90) days or such longer period as the Parties may agree, shall apply and\nit shall be the responsibility of the Parties to discuss as to what steps shall be taken",
