    "char_end": 151693,
    "char_count": 429,
    "text": "13.3.6 The lenders in concurrence with the Buying Utility and SECI, may seek to exercise\nright of substitution under Article 13.3.5 by an amendment or novation of the PPA\nin favour of the selectee. The RPD shall cooperate with SECI/ Lenders to carry out\nsuch substitution and shall have the duty and obligation to continue to operate the\nPower Project in accordance with this PPA till such time as the substitution is\nfinalized..",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0275",
