  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0283",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 283,
    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 154750,
    "char_end": 155537,
    "char_count": 787,
    "text": "ARTICLE 14: LIABILITY AND INDEMNIFICATION\n\n14.1\nIndemnity\n\n14.1.1 The RPD shall indemnify, defend and hold SECI harmless against:\na) any and all third party claims against SECI for any loss of or damage to property\nof such third party, or death or injury to such third party, arising out of a breach\nby the RPD of any of its obligations under this Agreement; and\nb) any and  all  losses, damages, costs  and  expenses including legal  costs, fines,\npenalties and  interest actually suffered or incurred by SECI from third party\nclaims arising  by reason of a breach by the RPD of any of its obligations under\nthis Agreement, (provided that this Article 14 shall not apply to such breaches\nby the  RPD ,  for  which  specific  remedies  have  been   provided   for  under\nthis Agreement).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0284",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 284,
    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 155539,
    "char_end": 156416,
    "char_count": 877,
    "text": "14.1.2 SECI shall cause the Buying Entity(ies) to indemnify, defend and hold the RPD\nharmless against:\na) any and all third party claims against the RPD, for any loss of or damage to\nproperty of such third party, or death or injury to such third party, arising out of\na breach by Buying Entity(ies) of any of their obligations under this Agreement;\nand\nb) any and all losses, damages, costs and expenses including legal costs, fines,\npenalties and interest (‘Indemnifiable Losses’) actually suffered or incurred by\nthe RPD from third party claims arising by reason of a breach by Buying\nEntity(ies) of any of its obligations. SECI shall incorporate appropriate\ncovenants in the PSA for the above obligations of Buying Entity(ies). In so far\nas indemnity to RPD is concerned, Buying Entity(ies) shall be the indemnifying\nparty and not SECI.\n14.2\nProcedure for claiming Indemnity",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0285",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 285,
    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 156418,
    "char_end": 156759,
    "char_count": 341,
    "text": "14.2.1 Third party claims\n\na. Where the Indemnified Party is entitled to indemnification from the Indemnifying\nParty pursuant to Article 14.1.1(a) or 14.1.2(a), the Indemnified Party shall promptly\nnotify the Indemnifying Party of such claim referred to in Article 14.1.1(a) or\n14.1.2(a) in respect of which it is entitled to be indemnified.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0286",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 286,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 156761,
    "char_end": 156925,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 70 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0287",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 287,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 156927,
    "char_end": 157202,
    "char_count": 275,
    "text": "Such notice shall be given as soon as reasonably practicable after the Indemnified\nParty becomes aware of such claim. The Indemnifying Party shall be liable to settle\nthe indemnification claim within thirty (30) days of receipt of the above notice.\nProvided however that, if:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0288",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 288,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 157204,
    "char_end": 157403,
    "char_count": 199,
    "text": "i) the Parties choose to refer the dispute in accordance with Article 16.3.2; and\nii) the claim amount is not required to be paid/ deposited to such third party\npending the resolution of the Dispute,",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0289",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 289,
