    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 157405,
    "char_end": 157667,
    "char_count": 262,
    "text": "the  Indemnifying  Party  shall  become  liable  to  pay  the  claim  amount  to the\nIndemnified Party or to the third party, as the case may be, promptly following the\nresolution of the Dispute, if such Dispute is not settled in favour of the Indemnified\nParty.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0290",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 290,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 157669,
    "char_end": 158171,
    "char_count": 502,
    "text": "b. The Indemnified Party may contest the claim by referring to the Appropriate\nCommission for which it is entitled to be Indemnified under Article 14.1.1(a) or\n14.1.2(a) and the Indemnifying Party shall reimburse to the Indemnified Party all\nreasonable costs and expenses incurred by the Indemnified party. However, such\nIndemnified Party shall not settle or compromise such claim without first getting the\nconsent of the Indemnifying Party, which consent shall not be unreasonably\nwithheld or delayed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0291",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 291,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 158173,
    "char_end": 158586,
    "char_count": 413,
    "text": "An Indemnifying Party may, at its own expense, assume control of the defence of\nany proceedings brought against the Indemnified Party if it acknowledges its\nobligation to indemnify such Indemnified Party, gives such Indemnified Party\nprompt notice of its intention to assume control of the defence, and employs an\nindependent legal counsel at its own cost that is reasonably satisfactory to the\nIndemnified Party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0292",
