    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 158588,
    "char_end": 159100,
    "char_count": 512,
    "text": "14.3\nIndemnifiable Losses\n\n14.3.1 Where an Indemnified Party is entitled to Indemnifiable Losses from the\nIndemnifying Party pursuant to Article 14.1.1(b) or 14.1.2(b), the Indemnified Party\nshall promptly notify the Indemnifying Party of the Indemnifiable Losses actually\nincurred by the Indemnified Party. The Indemnifiable Losses shall be reimbursed\nby the Indemnifying Party within thirty (30) days of receipt of the notice seeking\nIndemnifiable Losses by the Indemnified Party. In case of nonpayment of such",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0293",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
