    "char_start": 159268,
    "char_end": 160473,
    "char_count": 1205,
    "text": "losses after a valid notice under this Article 14.3, such event shall constitute a\npayment default under Article 13.\n14.4\nLimitation on Liability\n14.4.1 Except as expressly provided in this Agreement, neither the RPD nor SECI nor\nBuying Entity(ies) nor its/ their respective officers, directors, agents, employees or\naffiliates (or their officers, directors, agents or employees), shall be liable or\nresponsible to the other Party or its affiliates, officers, directors, agents, employees,\nsuccessors or permitted assigns or their respective insurers for incidental, indirect or\nconsequential damages, connected with or resulting from performance or non-\nperformance of this Agreement, or anything done in connection herewith, including\nclaims in the nature of lost revenues, income or profits (other than payments\nexpressly required and properly due under this Agreement), any increased  expense\nof, reduction in or loss of power generation or equipment used therefore, irrespective\nof whether such claims are based upon breach of warranty, tort (including\nnegligence, whether of Buying Entity(ies), the RPD or others), strict liability,\ncontract, breach of statutory duty, operation of law or otherwise.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0295",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 295,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 160475,
    "char_end": 160917,
    "char_count": 442,
    "text": "14.4.2 SECI shall have no recourse against any officer, director or shareholder of the RPD\nor any Affiliate of the RPD or any of its officers, directors or shareholders for such\nclaims excluded under this Article. The RPD shall have no recourse against any\nofficer, director or shareholder of Buyer or Buying Entity(ies), or any affiliate of\nBuyer or any of its officers, directors or shareholders for such claims excluded under\nthis Article.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0296",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 296,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 160919,
    "char_end": 161694,
    "char_count": 775,
    "text": "14.5 SECI’s Liability\n14.5.1  Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, the Parties\nacknowledge and accept that the SECI is an Intermediary Company to purchase and\nresell the electricity to the Buying Utility(ies) to enable them to fulfill the Renewable\nPurchase Obligations (RPO) and power demand, therefore, the performance of the\nobligations of SECI under this Agreement shall be subject to the ability of SECI to\nenforce the corresponding obligations assumed by the Buying Utility(ies) on re-sale\nunder the Power Sale Agreement to be entered into by the Buying Utility(ies) with\nSECI. It is however, specifically agreed that in the event of the Buying Entity(ies)\ndefaulting or delaying the payment of the amount becoming due to SECI to enable",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0297",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 297,
    "page_start": 72,
    "page_end": 72,
    "char_start": 161696,
    "char_end": 161860,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 72 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
