    "paragraph_index": 300,
    "page_start": 72,
    "page_end": 72,
    "char_start": 163085,
    "char_end": 163707,
    "char_count": 622,
    "text": "14.5.2 The parties agree that in respect of the obligations other than the tariff payment\nobligation specifically mentioned herein above, in the event the RPD has any claim\nagainst the SECI in regard to the performance of any obligation of SECI under this\nAgreement or enforcement of any right of the RPD against the SECI under this\nAgreement, the same shall be subject to the ability of the SECI to enforce the\ncorresponding obligations assumed by the Buying Utility(ies) under the Power Sale\nAgreement to be entered into between the SECI and the Buying Utility(ies) on resale\non mutatis mutandis basis and not otherwise.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0301",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 301,
    "page_start": 72,
    "page_end": 72,
    "char_start": 163709,
    "char_end": 163871,
    "char_count": 162,
    "text": "14.6 Duty to Mitigate\n\n14.6.1 The Parties shall endeavour to take all reasonable steps so as mitigate any loss or\ndamage which has occurred under this Article 14.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0302",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 302,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 163873,
    "char_end": 164037,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 73 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0303",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 303,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 164039,
    "char_end": 164092,
    "char_count": 53,
    "text": "ARTICLE 15: ASSIGNMENTS AND CHARGES\n\n15.1\nAssignments",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0304",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 304,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 164094,
    "char_end": 165817,
    "char_count": 1723,
    "text": "This Agreement shall be binding upon, and inure to the benefit of the Parties and\ntheir respective successors and permitted assigns. This Agreement shall not be\nassigned by any Party, except to the Project Lenders or Lender’s Representative as\nsecurity for their debt under the Financing Agreements, other than by mutual\nconsent between the Parties to be evidenced in writing. Such assignment shall be\nagreed to by SECI subject to the compliance of provisions contained in this\nAgreement and more specifically to the provisions of Article 4.1.1 of this\nAgreement. In no case, such assignment shall be permissible prior to the declaration\nof COD.\nProvided that, SECI shall permit assignment of any of RPD’s rights and obligations\nunder this Agreement in favour of the lenders to the RPD, if required under the\nFinancing Agreements.\nProvided that, such consent shall not be withheld if SECI seeks to transfer to any\ntransferee all of its rights and obligations under this Agreement.\nThe enforcement of the rights and obligation between the RPD and the Buying\nUtility (ies) provided in this Agreement and in the PSA shall not be treated as an\nassignment but an enforcement of the terms agreed under this Agreement.\nProvided further that any successor(s) or permitted assign(s) identified after mutual\nagreement between the Parties may be required to execute a new agreement on the\nsame terms and conditions as are included in this Agreement. An amount of Rs. 15\nLakh per Transaction as Facilitation Fee (non-refundable) shall be deposited by the\nRPD to SECI. Provided further that, such consent shall not be withheld by the RPD\nif SECI seeks to transfer to any affiliate all of its rights and obligations under this\nAgreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0305",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 305,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 165819,
    "char_end": 166035,
    "char_count": 216,
    "text": "15.2\nPermitted Charges\n15.2.1 The RPD shall not create or permit to subsist any encumbrance over all or\nany of its rights and benefits under this Agreement, other than as set forth in Article\n15.1 and the Guidelines.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0306",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 306,
    "page_start": 74,
    "page_end": 74,
    "char_start": 166037,
    "char_end": 166201,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 74 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0307",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 307,
    "page_start": 74,
    "page_end": 74,
    "char_start": 166203,
    "char_end": 166520,
    "char_count": 317,
    "text": "ARTICLE 16: GOVERNING LAW AND DISPUTE RESOLUTION\n\n16.1\nGoverning Law\n\n16.1.1 This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the Laws of\nIndia. Any legal proceedings in respect of any matters, claims or disputes under this\nAgreement shall be under the jurisdiction of appropriate courts in Delhi.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0308",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 308,
    "page_start": 74,
    "page_end": 74,
    "char_start": 166522,
    "char_end": 166965,
    "char_count": 443,
    "text": "16.2\nAmicable Settlement and Dispute Resolution\n\n16.2.1 Amicable Settlement\n\ni.\nEither Party is entitled to raise any claim, dispute or difference of whatever nature\narising under, out of or in connection with this Agreement (“Dispute”) by giving a\nwritten notice (Dispute Notice) to the other Party, which shall contain:\n(a)\na description of the Dispute;\n(b)\nthe grounds for such Dispute; and\n(c)\nall written material in support of its claim.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0309",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 309,
    "page_start": 74,
    "page_end": 74,
    "char_start": 166967,
    "char_end": 167806,
    "char_count": 839,
    "text": "ii.\nThe other Party shall, within thirty (30) days of issue of Dispute Notice issued\nunder Article 16.2.1(i), furnish:\n(a)\ncounter-claim and defences, if any, regarding the Dispute; and\n(b)\nall written material in support of its defences and counter-claim.\niii.\nWithin thirty (30) days of issue of Dispute Notice by any Party pursuant to Article\n16\n(i) if the other Party does not furnish any counter claim or defence under Article\n16\n(ii) or thirty (30) days from the date of furnishing counter claims or defence by\nthe other Party, both the Parties to the Dispute shall meet to settle such Dispute\namicably. If the Parties fail to resolve the Dispute amicably within thirty (30)\ndays from the later of the dates mentioned in this Article 16.2.1.\n(iii) the Dispute shall be referred for dispute resolution in accordance with Article\n16.3.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0310",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 310,
    "page_start": 75,
    "page_end": 75,
    "char_start": 167808,
    "char_end": 167972,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 75 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0311",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 311,
    "page_start": 75,
    "page_end": 75,
    "char_start": 167974,
    "char_end": 168999,
    "char_count": 1025,
    "text": "16.3\nDispute Resolution\n16.3.1Dispute Resolution by the Appropriate Commission\ni)\nWhere any Dispute or differences arises in relation to this agreement of any nature\nwhatsoever including the construction, interpretation or implementation of the\nprovisions of this agreement as well as claim made by any Party for any change\nin or determination of the Tariff or any matter related to Tariff or claims made by\nany Party which partly or wholly relate to any change in the Tariff or\ndetermination of any of such claims could result in change in the Tariff, and\nrelates to any matter agreed to be referred to the Central  Electricity Regulatory\nCommission, shall be submitted to adjudication by the Central Electricity\nRegulatory Commission. Appeal against the decisions of the Central Electricity\nRegulatory Commission shall be made only as per the provisions of the Electricity\nAct, 2003, as amended from time to time.  All other disputes shall be resolved by\narbitration under the Indian Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0312",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 312,
    "page_start": 75,
    "page_end": 75,
    "char_start": 169001,
    "char_end": 169386,
    "char_count": 385,
    "text": "ii)\nSECI shall be entitled to co-opt the Buying Entity(ies) and/or the lenders (if any)\nas a supporting party in such proceedings before the Appropriate Commission.\n16.3.2 MNRE vide its Order No.283/124/2018-GRID SOLAR dated 18.06.2019 has set up\na Dispute Resolution Committee (DRC). The RPD may approach DRC for resolving\ndisputes as per provisions notified by MNRE in regard to DRC.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0313",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 313,
    "page_start": 75,
    "page_end": 75,
    "char_start": 169388,
    "char_end": 169742,
    "char_count": 354,
    "text": "16.4\nParties to Perform Obligations\n\n16.4.1 Notwithstanding the existence of any Dispute and difference referred to the\nAppropriate Commission and save as the Appropriate Commission may otherwise\ndirect by a final or interim order, the Parties hereto shall continue to perform their\nrespective obligations (which are not in dispute) under this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0314",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 314,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 169744,
    "char_end": 169908,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 76 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0315",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 315,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 169910,
    "char_end": 170065,
    "char_count": 155,
    "text": "ARTICLE 17: MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS\n\n17.1\nAmendment\n\n17.1.1 This Agreement may only be amended or supplemented by a written agreement\nbetween the Parties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0316",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 316,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 170067,
    "char_end": 170459,
    "char_count": 392,
    "text": "17.2\nThird Party Beneficiaries\n\n17.2.1 Subject to provisions contained in this agreement relating to back to back\nimplications of the PPA as well as PSA, this Agreement is solely for the benefit of\nthe Parties and their respective successors and permitted assigns and shall not be\nconstrued as creating any duty, standard of care or any liability to, any person not a\nparty to this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0317",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 317,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 170461,
    "char_end": 170725,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "17.3\nWaiver\n\n17.3.1 No  waiver  by  either  Party  of  any  default  or  breach  by  the  other  Party  in  the\nperformance of any of the provisions of this Agreement shall be effective unless in\nwriting duly executed by an authorised representative of such Party.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0318",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 318,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 170727,
    "char_end": 171139,
    "char_count": 412,
    "text": "17.3.2 Neither the failure by either Party to insist on any occasion upon the performance of\nthe terms, conditions and provisions of this Agreement nor time or other indulgence\ngranted by one Party to the other Parties shall act as a waiver of such breach or\nacceptance of any variation or the relinquishment of any such right or any other right\nunder this Agreement, which shall remain in full force and effect.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0319",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 319,
    "page_start": 76,
    "page_end": 76,
    "char_start": 171141,
    "char_end": 171643,
    "char_count": 502,
    "text": "17.4\nConfidentiality\n\n17.4.1 The Parties undertake to hold in confidence this Agreement and not to disclose the\nterms and conditions of the transaction contemplated hereby to third parties, except:\na) to their professional advisors;\nb) to their officers, contractors, employees, agents or representatives, financiers,\nwho need to have  access to such information for the proper performance of their\nactivities; or\nc) disclosures required under Law, without the prior written consent of the other\nParty.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0320",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 320,
    "page_start": 77,
    "page_end": 77,
    "char_start": 171645,
    "char_end": 171809,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 77 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0321",
