    "paragraph_index": 332,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 173522,
    "char_end": 173715,
    "char_count": 193,
    "text": "17.6.5 Any Party may by notice of at least fifteen (15) days to the other Party change the\naddress and/or addresses to which such notices and communications to it are to be\ndelivered or mailed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0333",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 333,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 173717,
    "char_end": 174030,
    "char_count": 313,
    "text": "17.7\nLanguage\n\n17.7.1 All agreements, correspondence and communications between the Parties relating to\nthis Agreement and all other documentation to be prepared and supplied under the\nAgreement shall be written in English, and the Agreement shall be construed and\ninterpreted in accordance with English language.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0334",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 334,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 174032,
    "char_end": 174289,
    "char_count": 257,
    "text": "17.7.2 If any of the agreements, correspondence, communications or documents are\nprepared in any language other than English, the English translation of such\nagreements, correspondence, communications or documents shall prevail in matters\nof interpretation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0335",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 335,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 174291,
    "char_end": 174747,
    "char_count": 456,
    "text": "17.8\nRestriction of Shareholders / Owners’ Liability\n\n17.8.1 Parties expressly agree and acknowledge that none of the shareholders of the Parties\nhereto shall be liable to the other Parties for any of the contractual obligations of the\nconcerned Party under this Agreement. Further, the  financial  liabilities  of  the\nshareholder(s)  of  each  Party  to  this  Agreement,  shall  be  restricted  to  the\nextent provided in the Indian Companies Act, 2013.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0336",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 336,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 174749,
    "char_end": 175081,
    "char_count": 332,
    "text": "17.9\nTaxes and Duties\n\n17.9.1 The RPD shall bear and promptly pay all statutory taxes, duties, levies and cess,\nassessed/ levied on the RPD, contractors or their employees that are required to be\npaid by the RPD as per the Law in relation to the execution of the Agreement and\nfor supplying power as per the terms of this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0337",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 337,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 175083,
    "char_end": 175247,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "17.9.2 SECI shall be indemnified and held harmless by the RPD against any claims that\nmay be made against SECI in relation to the matters set out in Article 17.9.1.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0338",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 338,
    "page_start": 78,
    "page_end": 78,
    "char_start": 175249,
    "char_end": 175407,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "17.9.3 SECI shall not be liable for any payment of, taxes, duties, levies, cess whatsoever\nfor discharging any obligation of the RPD by SECI on behalf of RPD.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0339",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 339,
    "page_start": 79,
    "page_end": 79,
    "char_start": 175409,
    "char_end": 175573,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 79 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0340",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 340,
    "page_start": 79,
    "page_end": 79,
    "char_start": 175575,
    "char_end": 175705,
    "char_count": 130,
    "text": "17.10   Independent Entity\n\n17.10.1   The RPD shall be an independent entity performing its obligations pursuant to the\nAgreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0341",
