    "page_end": 79,
    "char_start": 175707,
    "char_end": 176349,
    "char_count": 642,
    "text": "17.10.2 Subject to the provisions of the Agreement, the RPD shall be solely responsible\nfor the manner in which its obligations under this Agreement are to be performed.\nAll employees and representatives of the RPD or contractors engaged by the RPD\nin connection with the performance of the Agreement shall be under the complete\ncontrol of the RPD and shall not be deemed to be employees, representatives,\ncontractors of SECI and nothing contained in the Agreement or in any agreement\nor contract awarded by the RPD shall be construed to create any contractual\nrelationship between any such employees, representatives or contractors and\nSECI.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0342",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 342,
    "page_start": 79,
    "page_end": 79,
    "char_start": 176351,
    "char_end": 177596,
    "char_count": 1245,
    "text": "17.11 Compliance with Law\nDespite anything contained in this Agreement but without prejudice to this\nArticle, if any provision of this Agreement shall be in deviation or inconsistent\nwith or repugnant to the provisions contained in the Electricity Act, 2003, or any\nrules and regulations made there under, such provision of this Agreement shall be\ndeemed to be amended to the extent required to bring it into compliance with the\naforesaid relevant provisions as amended from time to time.\n17.12.The duly executed Power Sale Agreement between SECI and Buying entity(s) as\nattached to this Agreement shall be read along with this Agreement as a\ncomposite back to back agreement for Generation and supply of electricity to the\nBuying entity(ies), particularly, to fulfill the Renewable Purchase Obligations\nunder the provisions of the Electricity Act, 2003 and the Regulations notified\nthereunder.\n17.13  Breach of Obligations\nThe Parties acknowledge that a breach of any of the obligations contained herein\nwould result in injuries. The Parties further acknowledge that the amount of the\nliquidated damages or the method of calculating the liquidated damages specified\nin this Agreement is a genuine and reasonable pre-estimate of the damages that",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0343",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 343,
    "page_start": 80,
    "page_end": 80,
    "char_start": 177598,
    "char_end": 177762,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "SECI-RPD- PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                      Page 80 of 90",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
