    "paragraph_index": 345,
    "page_start": 80,
    "page_end": 80,
    "char_start": 177854,
    "char_end": 178268,
    "char_count": 414,
    "text": "17.14  Order of priority in application\n\nIn case of inconsistencies between the agreement(s)executed between the\nParties, applicable Law including rules and regulations framed  thereunder,  the\norder of priority as between them shall be the order in which  they are placed\nbelow:\ni. applicable Law, rules and regulations framed thereunder;\n ii.  the Grid Code; and\n iii. the terms and conditions of this Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
