    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 179103,
    "char_end": 180752,
    "char_count": 1649,
    "text": "In consideration of the ----- [Insert name of the Bidder] (hereinafter referred to as selected RE\nPower Developer') submitting the response to RfS inter alia for selection of the Project of the\ncapacity\nof\n………..\nMW,\nat\n…………[Insert\nname\nof\nthe\nplace]\nunder\n……………………[Insert name of the RfS], for supply of power there from on long term\nbasis, in response to the RfS dated………… issued by Solar Energy Corporation of India Ltd.\n(hereinafter referred to as SECI) and SECI considering such response to the RfS of\n………[insert the name of the selected RETC Power Developer] (which expression shall\nunless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include its executers, administrators,\nsuccessors and assignees) and selecting the RE Power  Project of the RE  Power Developer\nand issuing Letter of Award No ------- to (Insert Name of selected RE  Power Developer) as\nper terms of RfS and the same having been accepted by the selected RPD resulting in a Power\nPurchase Agreement (PPA) to be entered into, for purchase of Power [from selected RE\nPower Developer or a Project Company, M/s ------------- {a Special Purpose Vehicle (SPV)\nformed for this purpose}, if applicable ]. As per the terms of the RfS, the _______________\n[insert name & address of bank] hereby agrees unequivocally, irrevocably and\nunconditionally to pay to SECI at [Insert Name of the Place from the address of the SECI]\nwithout demure forthwith on demand in writing from SECI or any Officer authorized by it in\nthis behalf, any amount up to and not exceeding Rupees------ [Total Value] only, on behalf of\nM/s __________ [Insert name of the selected RE Power\nDeveloper / Project Company]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0352",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 352,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 180754,
    "char_end": 181401,
    "char_count": 647,
    "text": "This guarantee shall be valid and binding on this Bank up to and including………..  and shall\nnot be terminable by notice or any change in the constitution of the Bank or the term of\ncontract or by any other reasons whatsoever and our liability hereunder shall not be impaired\nor discharged by any extension of time or variations or alternations made, given, or agreed\nwith or without our knowledge or consent, by or between parties to the respective agreement.\nOur liability under this Guarantee is restricted to Rs. ___________________ only.\nOur Guarantee shall remain in force until…………….. SECI shall be entitled to invoke this\nGuarantee till ……….",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0353",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 353,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 181403,
    "char_end": 181551,
    "char_count": 148,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank hereby agrees and acknowledges that SECI shall have a right to invoke\nthis BANK GUARANTEE in part or in full, as it may deem fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0354",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 354,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 181553,
    "char_end": 181798,
    "char_count": 245,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank hereby expressly agrees that it shall not require any proof in addition to\nthe written demand by SECI, made in any format, raised at the above mentioned address of\nthe Guarantor Bank, in order to make the said payment to SECI.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
