    "paragraph_index": 356,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 181968,
    "char_end": 182415,
    "char_count": 447,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank shall make payment hereunder on first demand without restriction or\nconditions and notwithstanding any objection by -------------[Insert name of the selected RE\nPower Developer / Project Company as applicable] and/or any other person. The Guarantor\nBank shall not require SECI to justify the invocation of this BANK GUARANTEE, nor shall\nthe Guarantor Bank have any recourse against SECI in respect of any payment made\nhereunder.",
