    "paragraph_index": 358,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 182555,
    "char_end": 182784,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank represents that this BANK GUARANTEE has been established in such\nform and with such content that it is fully enforceable in accordance with its terms as against\nthe Guarantor Bank in the manner provided herein.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0359",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 359,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 182786,
    "char_end": 183562,
    "char_count": 776,
    "text": "This BANK GUARANTEE shall not be affected in any manner by reason of merger,\namalgamation, restructuring or any other change in the constitution of the Guarantor Bank.\nThis BANK GUARANTEE shall be a primary obligation of the Guarantor Bank and\naccordingly SECI shall not be obliged before enforcing this BANK GUARANTEE to take\nany action in any court or arbitral proceedings against the selected RE  Power Developer /\nProject Company , to make any claim against or any demand on the selected RE Power\nDeveloper / Project Company or to give any notice to the selected RE Power Developer /\nProject Company or to enforce any security held by SECI or to exercise, levy or enforce any\ndistress, diligence or other process against the selected RE Power Developer / Project\nCompany .",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC071-0360",
    "doc_id": "DOC-071",
    "paragraph_index": 360,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 183564,
    "char_end": 183770,
    "char_count": 206,
    "text": "This BANK GUARANTEE shall be effective only when the Bank Guarantee issuance\nmessage is transmitted by the issuing Bank through SFMS to IDFC First Bank and a\nconfirmation in this regard is received by SECI.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
