    "char_end": 3102,
    "char_count": 305,
    "text": "D. SECI had initiated a Tariff-Based Competitive Bid Process for procurement of 1000\nMW of the power generated from the ISTS connected Solar Power Projects on the\nterms and conditions contained in the Request for Selection (herein after referred to\nas ‘RfS’ issued by SECI vide RfS No…………….. dated……………. .",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
