    "char_start": 3103,
    "char_end": 3725,
    "char_count": 622,
    "text": "E. ……………..[Insert name of the Bidding Company] has been selected in the\nCompetitive Bidding Process, {in case Bidding Company is executing the Project\nthrough SPV} has constituted a Special Purpose Vehicle,………….. [Insert the\nname of SPV, if applicable] (hereinafter referred to as ‘SPD’) for development,\ngeneration and supply of electricity from the ……………MW Solar Power Project\nto be established by SPD anywhere in India and for supply of such electricity by\nSECI as an Intermediary Agency to the Buying Utility(ies) (as defined) under a\nPower Sale Agreement to be entered into between SECI and such Buying Utility\n(ies).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
