    "page_start": 3,
    "page_end": 3,
    "char_start": 4222,
    "char_end": 4558,
    "char_count": 336,
    "text": "G. SECI has agreed to purchase such Solar Power from the SPD as an Intermediary\nProcurer and sell it to Buying Utility on back-to-back basis as per the provisions of\nthe RfS. Accordingly, SECI has agreed to sign/has signed a Power Sale Agreement\nwith the Buying Utility to sell such power as per the provisions of the above said\nscheme.",
