    "char_end": 17197,
    "char_count": 409,
    "text": "\"Grid Code\" or\n“Indian Electricity\nGrid Code” or\n“IEGC”\nor “State Grid\nCode”\nshall mean the Central Electricity Regulatory Commission (Indian\nElectricity Grid Code) Regulations, 2023, as specified by the CERC\nunder Clause (h) of Sub-section (1) of Section 79 of the Electricity\nAct, as amended from time to time, and/or the State Grid Code as\nspecified by the concerned State Commission, referred under Clause",
