    "char_start": 38767,
    "char_end": 39222,
    "char_count": 455,
    "text": "Article 4.5, SECI shall encash the Performance Bank Guarantee/ POI equivalent to the\namount calculated as per penalties applicable under Article 4.6 as on the date of\nencashment without prejudice to the other rights of SECI under this Agreement.  It is\nto be noted that the damages/dues recovered by SECI by encashing the PBG/ POI,\nupon the default of the SPD under the PPA, shall be credited to the payment security\nfund maintained by SECI under the PPA.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
