    "char_count": 252,
    "text": "ARTICLE\n5:\nSYNCHRONIZATION,\nCOMMERCIAL\nOPERATION\nAND\nCOMMENCEMENT OF SUPPLY OF POWER\n5.1\nThe SPD shall give the concerned RLDC/SLDC and SECI and also to the Buying\nEntity at least sixty (60) days’ advanced preliminary written notice and at least thirty",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
