  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0120",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 120,
    "page_start": 36,
    "page_end": 36,
    "char_start": 78827,
    "char_end": 79827,
    "char_count": 1000,
    "text": "ARTICLE 8: INSURANCES\n8.1       Insurance\n8.1.1    The SPD shall effect and maintain or cause to be effected and maintained, at its own\ncost and expense, throughout the Term of PPA, Insurances against such risks to keep\nthe Project in good condition and shall take Industrial All Risk insurance policy\ncovering risks against any loss or damage, with such deductibles and with such\nendorsements and co-insured(s), which the Prudent Utility Practices would ordinarily\nmerit maintenance of and as required under the Financing Agreements,\nImplementation and Support Agreement and under the applicable laws.\n8.2       Application of Insurance Proceeds\n8.2.1   In case of the Project not being implemented through Financing Agreement(s), save\nas expressly provided in this Agreement or the Insurances, the proceeds of any\ninsurance claim made due to loss or damage to the Power Project or any part of the\nPower Project shall be first applied to reinstatement, replacement or renewal of such\nloss or damage.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0121",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 121,
    "page_start": 36,
    "page_end": 36,
    "char_start": 79829,
    "char_end": 81044,
    "char_count": 1215,
    "text": "In case of the Project being financed through Financing Agreement(s), save as\nexpressly provided in this Agreement or the Insurances, the proceeds of any insurance\nclaim made due to loss or damage to the Power Project or any part of the Power\nProject shall be applied as per such Financing Agreements.\n8.2.2   If a Force Majeure Event renders the Project no longer economically and technically\nviable and the insurers under the Insurances make payment on a “total loss” or\nequivalent basis, SECI shall have claim on such proceeds of such Insurance limited\nto outstanding dues of SECI against the Buying Utility(ies) as per PSA entered into\nand any other dues of the Buying Utility(ies) against SPD.\n8.3       Effect on liability of SECI\n8.3.1 Notwithstanding any liability or obligation that may arise under this Agreement, any\nloss, damage, liability, payment, obligation or expense which is insured or not or for\nwhich the SPD can claim compensation, under any Insurance shall not be charged to\nor payable by SECI or Buying Entity(ies). It is for the SPD to ensure that appropriate\ninsurance coverage is taken for payment by the insurer for the entire loss and there is\nno under insurance or short adjustment etc.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0122",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 122,
    "page_start": 37,
