    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 130,
    "page_start": 39,
    "page_end": 39,
    "char_start": 87726,
    "char_end": 88326,
    "char_count": 600,
    "text": "10.3.1 SECI shall pay the amount payable under the Monthly Bill/Supplementary Bill by the\nDue Date to such account of the SPD, as shall have been previously notified by the\nSPD as below.\n10.3.2 All  payments  required  to  be  made  under  this  Agreement  shall  also  include  any\ndeduction or set off for:\ni)\ndeductions required by the Law; and\nii)\namount claimed by SECI, if any, from the SPD, will be adjusted from the\nmonthly energy payment. In case of any excess payment adjustment, the interest\napplicable will be same as rate of Late Payment surcharge will be applicable on\nday to day basis.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0131",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 131,
    "page_start": 40,
