    "char_start": 92907,
    "char_end": 93357,
    "char_count": 450,
    "text": "billing of the previous Contract Year.\n10.4.3 Provided that the SPD shall not draw upon such Letter of Credit prior to the Due Date\nof the relevant Monthly Bill and/or Supplementary Bill, and shall not make more than\none drawal in a Month.\n10.4.4 Provided further that if at any time, such Letter of Credit amount falls short of the\namount specified in Article 10.4.2 due to any reason whatsoever, SECI shall restore\nsuch shortfall before next drawl.",
