    "char_start": 98597,
    "char_end": 99466,
    "char_count": 869,
    "text": "10.7  Payment of Supplementary Bill\n10.7.1 SPD may raise a (\"Supplementary Bill\") for payment on account of:\ni)       Adjustments required by the Energy Accounts (if applicable); or\nii)      Change in Law as provided in Article 12, or\niii)      Payment under Article 4.10,\nAnd such Supplementary Bill shall be paid by the other Party.\n10.7.2 SECI shall remit all amounts due under a Supplementary Bill raised by the SPD to the\nSPD’s Designated Account by the Due Date, except open access charges, RLDC or\nscheduling charges and transmission charges (if applicable). Except for payment\nunder Article 10.7.1 (i), payment of Supplementary Bills will be made after realization\nof the same from the Buying Utility under the Power Sale Agreement. No Late\nPayment Surcharge will be applicable other than that on the monthly energy payment\nand associated debit and credit note.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0145",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
