    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 110761,
    "char_end": 110921,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "SECI-SPD PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                   Page 50 of 75",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0160",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 160,
    "page_start": 50,
    "page_end": 50,
    "char_start": 110923,
    "char_end": 112638,
    "char_count": 1715,
    "text": "Any such change, shall be considered upto three digits after the decimal point, and\nremaining digits, if any, shall be ignored.\nFor e.g. in case the change in tariff payable is calculated as Rs. 0.14678/kWh, it shall\nbe modified as Rs. 0.146/kWh\n12.2.6 The recovery of the impacted amount, in case of the fixed amount shall be,\na.       In case of generation project, within a period of one-hundred eighty months; or\nb.       In case of recurring impact, until the impact persists.\n12.2.7 The SPD shall, within thirty days of the coming into effect of the recovery of impact\nof change in law, furnish all relevant documents along with the details of calculation\nto the Appropriate Commission for adjustment of the amount of the impact in the\nmonthly tariff or charges.\n12.2.8 The Appropriate Commission shall verify the calculation and adjust the amount of the\nimpact in the monthly tariff or charges within sixty days from the date of receipt of\nthe relevant documents under clause 12.2.7.\n12.2.9 After the adjustment of the amount of the impact in the monthly tariff or charges under\nclause 12.2.8, the SPD, shall adjust the monthly tariff or charges annually based on\nactual amount recovered, to ensure that the payment to the affected party is not more\nthan the yearly annuity amount.\n12.2.10 In the event of any decrease in the project cost by the SPD or any income to the SPD\non account of any of the events as indicated above, SPD shall pass on the benefit of\nsuch reduction at a rate as provided in Article 12.2 to SECI which shall be further\npassed on to the Buying Entity. In the event of the SPD failing to comply with the\nabove requirement, SECI shall make such deductions in the monthly tariff payments",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
