    "char_start": 146221,
    "char_end": 146808,
    "char_count": 587,
    "text": "17.10.1The SPD shall be an independent entity performing its obligations pursuant to the\nAgreement.\n17.10.2 Subject to the provisions of the Agreement, the SPD shall be solely responsible for\nthe manner in which its obligations under this Agreement are to be performed. All\nemployees and representatives of the SPD or contractors engaged by the SPD in\nconnection with the performance of the Agreement shall be under the complete\ncontrol of the SPD and shall not be deemed to be employees, representatives,\ncontractors of SECI and nothing contained in the Agreement or in any agreement or",
