    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 149606,
    "char_end": 149905,
    "char_count": 299,
    "text": "SCHEDULE 1: FORMAT FOR PERFORMANCE BANK GUARANTEE (PBG)\n(to be submitted separately for each Project)\n(To be stamped in accordance with Stamp Act, the Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of Appropriate\nValue)\nReference: ……………………………….\nBank Guarantee No.: ........................…\nDate: ...................……...",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0227",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 227,
    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 149907,
    "char_end": 151538,
    "char_count": 1631,
    "text": "In consideration of the ----- [Insert name of the Bidder] (hereinafter referred to as ‘selected\nSolar Power Developer') submitting the response to RfS inter alia for ……….. [Insert name\nof the RfS] of the capacity of ……….. MW, at …………[Insert name of the place], for supply\nof power there from on long term basis, in response to the RfS dated………… issued by Solar\nEnergy Corporation of India Ltd (hereinafter referred to as SECI) and SECI considering such\nresponse to the RfS of ………[insert the name of the selected Solar Power Developer] (which\nexpression shall unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include its executers,\nadministrators, successors and assignees) and selecting the Solar Power Project of the Solar\nPower Developer and issuing Letter of Award No ------- to _____ (Insert Name of selected\nSolar Power Developer) as per terms of RfS and the same having been accepted by the selected\nSPD resulting in a Power Purchase Agreement (PPA) to be entered into, for purchase of Power\n[from selected Solar Power Developer or a Project Company, M/s ------------- {a Special\nPurpose Vehicle (SPV) formed for this purpose}, if applicable ].\nAs per the terms of the RfS, the _______________ [insert name & address of bank] hereby\nagrees unequivocally, irrevocably and unconditionally to pay to SECI at [Insert Name of the\nPlace from the address of the SECI] forthwith on demand in writing from SECI or any Officer\nauthorized by it in this behalf, any amount up to and not exceeding Indian Rupees------ [Total\nValue] only, on behalf of M/s __________ [Insert name of the selected Solar Power Developer\n/ Project Company].",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0228",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 228,
    "page_start": 69,
    "page_end": 69,
    "char_start": 151540,
    "char_end": 152107,
    "char_count": 567,
    "text": "This guarantee shall be valid and binding on this Bank up to and including………..  and shall\nnot be terminable by notice or any change in the constitution of the Bank or the term of contract\nor by any other reasons whatsoever and our liability hereunder shall not be impaired or\ndischarged by any extension of time or variations or alternations made, given, or agreed with\nor without our knowledge or consent, by or between parties to the respective agreement.\nOur liability under this Guarantee is restricted to INR ___________________ (Indian Rupees\n__________ only).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0229",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 229,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 152109,
    "char_end": 152275,
    "char_count": 166,
    "text": "SECI-SPD PPA\n(Insert Project ID)                                                                                                                         Page 70 of 75",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0230",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 230,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 152277,
    "char_end": 154016,
    "char_count": 1739,
    "text": "Our Guarantee shall remain in force until…………….. SECI shall be entitled to invoke this\nGuarantee till ……….\nThe Guarantor Bank hereby agrees and acknowledges that SECI shall have a right to invoke\nthis BANK GUARANTEE in part or in full, as it may deem fit.\nThe Guarantor Bank hereby expressly agrees that it shall not require any proof in addition to\nthe written demand by SECI, made in any format, raised at the above mentioned address of\nthe Guarantor Bank, in order to make the said payment to SECI.\nThe Guarantor Bank shall make payment hereunder on first demand without restriction or\nconditions and notwithstanding any objection by -------------[Insert name of the selected Solar\nPower Developer / Project Company as applicable] and/or any other person. The Guarantor\nBank shall not require SECI to justify the invocation of this BANK GUARANTEE, nor shall\nthe Guarantor Bank have any recourse against SECI in respect of any payment made\nhereunder.\nThis BANK GUARANTEE shall be interpreted in accordance with the laws of India and the\ncourts at Delhi shall have exclusive jurisdiction.\nThe Guarantor Bank represents that this BANK GUARANTEE has been established in such\nform and with such content that it is fully enforceable in accordance with its terms as against\nthe Guarantor Bank in the manner provided herein.\nThis BANK GUARANTEE shall not be affected in any manner by reason of merger,\namalgamation, restructuring or any other change in the constitution of the Guarantor Bank.\nThis BANK GUARANTEE shall be a primary obligation of the Guarantor Bank and\naccordingly SECI shall not be obliged before enforcing this BANK GUARANTEE to take\nany action in any court or arbitral proceedings against the selected Solar Power Developer /",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0231",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "paragraph_index": 231,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 154017,
    "char_end": 154856,
    "char_count": 839,
    "text": "Project Company , to make any claim against or any demand on the selected Solar Power\nDeveloper / Project Company or to give any notice to the selected Solar Power Developer /\nProject Company or to enforce any security held by SECI or to exercise, levy or enforce any\ndistress, diligence or other process against the selected Solar Power Developer / Project\nCompany .\nThis BANK GUARANTEE shall be effective only when the Bank Guarantee issuance message\nis transmitted by the issuing Bank through SFMS to IDFC First Bank and a confirmation in\nthis regard is received by SECI.\nThe Guarantor Bank acknowledges that this BANK GUARANTEE is not personal to SECI\nand may be assigned, in whole or in part, (whether absolutely or by way of security) by SECI\nto any entity to whom SECI is entitled to assign its rights and obligations under the PPA.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
