    "char_end": 49751,
    "char_count": 327,
    "text": "(i) The billing to Buying Entity shall be done by SECI for realization of amount for solar\nPower.\n(ii) The payments to be made by Buying Entity to SECI for the Solar Power in a Monthly\nInvoice shall comprise of amounts to be realized for Solar Power.\n(iii) The Bills shall be raised by SECI to Buying Entity as mentioned under:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
