    "char_start": 49997,
    "char_end": 50177,
    "char_count": 180,
    "text": "Ep = No. of units (kWh) as per the SEA/JMR\n\nTp = tariff (in Rs./kWh) of the respective Project as per Schedule B +  Trading Margin of\nSECI @ Rs 0.07/kWh i.e Rupees Seven Paisa/kWh)",
