    "text": "ARTICLE 2\nTERM OF AGREEMENT\n\n2.1\nEffective Date\n\n2.1.1\nThis Agreement shall come into effect from (Enter the date of signing of PPA) and\nsuch date shall be referred to as the Effective Date.",
