    "char_count": 324,
    "text": "2.2\nTerm of Agreement\n\n2.2.1\nSubject to Article 2.3 and 2.4 of this Agreement, this Agreement shall be valid for a\nterm from the Effective Date until the Expiry Date. This Agreement may be extended\nfor a further period at least one hundred eighty (180) days prior to the Expiry\nDate, on mutually agreed terms and conditions.",
