    "page_end": 59,
    "char_start": 119908,
    "char_end": 119994,
    "char_count": 86,
    "text": "For and on behalf of\n[NTPC]\nFor and on behalf of\n[SPD]\n\n59\nName:\nDesignation:\nAddress:",
