  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0270",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 270,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 120105,
    "char_end": 120229,
    "char_count": 124,
    "text": "SCHEDULE 1\n\nFormat for Performance Bank Guarantee\n\n(To be on non-judicial stamp paper of appropriate value as per Stamp Act)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0271",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 271,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 120231,
    "char_end": 121990,
    "char_count": 1759,
    "text": "In consideration of the ----- [Insert name of the Bidder] (hereinafter referred to as selected ‘Solar\nPower Developer’ or ‘SPD’) having its registered office at ……………………submitting the\nresponse to RfS inter alia for selection of the project of the capacity of ……….. MW, for supply\nof power there from on long term basis, in response to the RfS no. ………… dated ………….\nissued by NTPC Limited (hereinafter  referred to as NTPC) having Registered Office at NTPC\nBhawan, Core-7, SCOPE Complex, 7, Institutional Area, New Delhi – 110003 and NTPC\nconsidering such response to the RfS of ………[insert the name of the selected Solar Power\nDeveloper] (which expression shall unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include\nits executers, administrators, successors and assignees) and  selecting the Solar Power Project of\nthe developer and issuing Letter of Award No ------- Dated_____ to (Insert Name of selected\nSolar Power Developer) as per terms of RfS and the same having been accepted by the selected\nSPD resulting in a Power Purchase Agreement (PPA) to be entered into, for purchase of Power\n[from selected Solar Power Developer or a Project Company, ------------- {a Special Purpose\nVehicle (SPV) formed for this purpose}, if applicable]. As per the terms of the RfS, the\n_______________ [insert name & address of Bank] (hereinafter referred to as the ‘Guarantor\nBank’) hereby agrees unequivocally, irrevocably and unconditionally to pay to NTPC at [Insert\nName of the Place from the address of the NTPC] forthwith on demand in writing from NTPC or\nany Officer authorised by it in this behalf, any amount upto and not exceeding Rupees------\n[Total Value] only, on behalf of  __________ [Insert name of the selected Solar Power\nDeveloper / Project Company]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0272",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 272,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 121992,
    "char_end": 122479,
    "char_count": 487,
    "text": "This bank guarantee shall be valid and binding on this Guarantor Bank up to and including\n_________ and shall not be terminable by notice or any change in the constitution of the\nGuarantor Bank or the term of contract or by any other reasons whatsoever and our liability\nhereunder shall not be impaired or discharged by any extension of time or variations or\nalternations made, given, or agreed with or without our knowledge or consent, by or between\nparties to the respective agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0273",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 273,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 122481,
    "char_end": 122710,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "Our liability under this Bank Guarantee is restricted to Rs. ___________ (Rs.\n________________________ only). Our Bank Guarantee shall remain in force until\n______NTPC shall be entitled to invoke this Bank Guarantee till _______.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0274",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 274,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 122712,
    "char_end": 122863,
    "char_count": 151,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank hereby agrees and acknowledges that the NTPC shall have a right to invoke\nthis BANK GUARANTE in part or in full, as it may deem fit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0275",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 275,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 122865,
    "char_end": 123110,
    "char_count": 245,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank hereby expressly agrees that it shall not require any proof in addition to the\nwritten demand by NTPC, made in any format, raised at the above mentioned address of the\nGuarantor Bank, in order to make the said payment to NTPC.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0276",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 276,
    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "char_start": 123112,
    "char_end": 123295,
    "char_count": 183,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank shall make payment hereunder on first demand without restriction or\nconditions and notwithstanding any objection by ------------- [Insert name of the selected Solar",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0277",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 277,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 123297,
    "char_end": 123567,
    "char_count": 270,
    "text": "61\nPower Developer / Project Company as applicable] and/or any other person. The Guarantor\nBank shall not require NTPC to justify the invocation of this BANK GUARANTEE, nor shall\nthe Guarantor Bank have any recourse against NTPC in respect of any payment made hereunder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0278",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 278,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 123569,
    "char_end": 123705,
    "char_count": 136,
    "text": "This BANK GUARANTEE shall be interpreted in accordance with the laws of India and the\ncourts at Delhi shall have exclusive jurisdiction.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0279",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 279,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 123707,
    "char_end": 123936,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank represents that this BANK GUARANTEE has been established in such\nform and with such content that it is fully enforceable in accordance with its terms as against the\nGuarantor Bank in the manner provided herein.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0280",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 280,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 123938,
    "char_end": 124105,
    "char_count": 167,
    "text": "This BANK GUARANTEE shall not be affected in any manner by reason of merger,\namalgamation, restructuring or any other change in the constitution of the Guarantor Bank.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0281",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 281,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 124107,
    "char_end": 124725,
    "char_count": 618,
    "text": "This BANK GUARANTEE shall be a primary obligation of the Guarantor Bank and accordingly\nNTPC shall not be obliged before enforcing this BANK GUARANTEE to take any action in any\ncourt or arbitral proceedings against the selected Solar Power Developer / Project Company , to\nmake any claim against or any demand on the selected Solar Power Developer / Project\nCompany or to give any notice to the selected Solar Power Developer / Project Company or to\nenforce any security held by NTPC or to exercise, levy or enforce any distress, diligence or other\nprocess against the selected Solar Power Developer / Project Company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0282",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 282,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 124727,
    "char_end": 124991,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "The Guarantor Bank acknowledges that this BANK GUARANTEE is not personal to NTPC and\nmay be assigned, in whole or in part, (whether absolutely or by way of security) by NTPC to any\nentity to whom NTPC is entitled to assign its rights and obligations under the PPA.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0283",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 283,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 124993,
    "char_end": 125338,
    "char_count": 345,
    "text": "Notwithstanding anything contained hereinabove, our liability under this Bank Guarantee is\nrestricted to Rs. ___________ (Rs. ________________________ only) and it shall remain in\nforce until ________. We are liable to pay the guaranteed amount or any part thereof under this\nBank Guarantee only if NTPC serves upon us a written claim or demand.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0284",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 284,
    "page_start": 61,
