    "char_start": 125888,
    "char_end": 125983,
    "char_count": 95,
    "text": "SCHEDULE 2\nFORMAT OF PAYMENT ON ORDER INSTRUMENT TO BE ISSUED BY\nIREDA/REC/PFC (IN LIEW OF PBG)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0299",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 299,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 125985,
    "char_end": 125999,
    "char_count": 14,
    "text": "No.\nDate\n\nNTPC",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0300",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 300,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 126001,
    "char_end": 126002,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": ",",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0301",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 301,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 126004,
    "char_end": 126173,
    "char_count": 169,
    "text": "Reg:\nM/s\n(insert name of the PPA signing entity) (Project No……………………….\n\n(Insert Project ID issued by NTPC) – Issuance of Payment on\nOrder Instrument for an amount of Rs.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0302",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 302,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 126175,
    "char_end": 126395,
    "char_count": 220,
    "text": "Dear Sir,\n1.\nIt is to be noted that M/s.\n(Insert Name of the POI issuing Agency)\n(‘IREDA/REC/PFC’)\nhas\nsanctioned\na\nnon-fund-based\nlimit\nloan\nof\nRs………………….(Rupees……………………only) to M/s\n under\nthe Loan Agreement executed on",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0303",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 303,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 126397,
    "char_end": 126665,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "to execute Renewable Energy\nProjects.\n\n2.\nAt the request of M/s , on behalf of…………………. (insert name of the SPV), this\nPayment on Order Instrument (POI) for an amount of Rs……………….\n(Rupees……………. (In words)). This Payment on Order Instrument comes into force\nimmediately.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0304",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 304,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 126667,
    "char_end": 127651,
    "char_count": 984,
    "text": "3.\nIn consideration of the …………….[Insert name of the Bidder] (hereinafter referred to\nas selected Solar Power Developer') submitting the response to RfS inter alia for\nselection of Contracted Capacity of ………. MW, at [Insert name of the place] under\nRfS for……………….. [Insert name of the RfS], for supply of power there from on\nlong term basis, in response to the RfS dated…………………..issued by REC Power\nDevelopment and Consultancy Limited on behalf of NTPC Ltd (hereinafter referred to as\nNTPC) and NTPC considering such response to the RfS of [insert the name of the selected\nSolar Power Developer] (which expression shall unless repugnant to the context or\nmeaning thereof include its executers, administrators, successors and assignees) and\nselecting the Solar Power Project of the Solar Power Developer and issuing Letter of\nAward No…………… to (Insert Name of selected Solar Power Developer) as per terms\nof RfS and the same having been accepted by the selected SPD resulting in a Power",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0305",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 305,
    "page_start": 64,
    "page_end": 64,
    "char_start": 127653,
    "char_end": 128340,
    "char_count": 687,
    "text": "64\nPurchase Agreement (PPA) to be entered into, for purchase of Power [from selected\nSolar Power Developer or a Project Company, M/s ------------- {a Special Purpose\nVehicle (SPV) formed for this purpose}, if applicable]. As per the terms of the RfS,\nthe………….\n[insert name & address of IREDA/PFC/REC] hereby agrees\nunequivocally, irrevocably and unconditionally to pay to NTPC at [Insert Name of the\nPlace from the address of the NTPC] forthwith on demand in writing from NTPC or any\nOfficer authorized by it in this behalf, any amount up to and not exceeding Rupees------\n[Total Value] only, on behalf of M/s…………………. [Insert name of the selected\nSolar Power Developer / Project Company]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0306",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 306,
    "page_start": 64,
    "page_end": 64,
    "char_start": 128342,
    "char_end": 128547,
    "char_count": 205,
    "text": "4.\nIn consideration of the above facts, IREDA/REC/PFC, having its registered office\nat…………………….agrees to make payment for the sum of Rs………………… lakhs\n(in words……………….) to NTPC on the following conditions: -",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0307",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 307,
    "page_start": 64,
    "page_end": 64,
    "char_start": 128549,
    "char_end": 128794,
    "char_count": 245,
    "text": "(a)\nIREDA/REC/PFC agrees to make payment of the above said amount\nunconditionally, without demur and without protest within a period of           days\nof receipt of request from NTPC within the validity period of this letter as\nspecified herein;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0308",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 308,
    "page_start": 64,
    "page_end": 64,
    "char_start": 128796,
    "char_end": 129287,
    "char_count": 491,
    "text": "(b)\nThe commitment of IREDA/REC/PFC, under this Payment on Order Instrument\nwill have the same effect as that of the commitment under the Bank Guarantee\nissued by any Public Sector Bank and shall be enforceable in the same manner as\nin the case of a Bank Guarantee issued by a Bank and the same shall be\nirrevocable and shall be honored irrespective of any agreement or its breach\nbetween IREDA/REC/PFC or its constituents notwithstanding any dispute that\nmay be raised by them against NTPC;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0309",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 309,
    "page_start": 64,
    "page_end": 64,
    "char_start": 129289,
    "char_end": 130100,
    "char_count": 811,
    "text": "(c)\nThe liability of IREDA/REC/PFC continues to be valid and binding on\nIREDA/REC/PFC and shall not be terminated, impaired and discharged, by virtue\nof change in its constitution and specific liability under letter of undertaking shall\nbe binding on its successors or assignors;\n(d)\nThe liability of IREDA/REC/PFC shall continue to be valid and binding on\nIREDA/REC/PFC and shall not be terminated/ impaired/ discharged by any\nextension of time or variation and alternation made given or agreed with or\nwithout knowledge or consent of the parties (NTPC and Bidding Party), subject to\nthe however to the maximum extent of amount stated herein and\nIREDA/REC/PFC is not liable to any interest or costs etc.;\n(e)\nThis Payment of Order Instrument can be invoked either partially or fully, till the\ndate of validity;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
