    "paragraph_index": 317,
    "page_start": 66,
    "page_end": 66,
    "char_start": 131908,
    "char_end": 132690,
    "char_count": 782,
    "text": "66\nSCHEDULE 3\nCOMMISSIONING SCHEDULE\n\nPlant shall be commissioned in 18 months from the date of execution of PPA. Subject to\nArticle 11 of the PPA, delay in commissioning, beyond the Scheduled Commissioning\nPeriod shall involve penalties, on the SPD, as detailed below\n1. For Delay in commissioning upto 6 (six) months from SCD, encashment of\nPerformance Bank Guarantee (PBG) on per day basis and proportionate to the capacity\nnot commissioned.\n2. For Delay in commissioning beyond six months from SCD, Generator Event of Default,\nas per Article 13.1 of the PPA, shall be considered to have occurred and the contracted\ncapacity shall stand reduced to the project capacity commissioned upto SCD + 6 (six)\nmonths. The PPA for the balance capacity not commissioned shall be terminated.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0318",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "paragraph_index": 318,
    "page_start": 66,
    "page_end": 66,
    "char_start": 132692,
    "char_end": 132825,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "COMMISSIONING PROCEDURE\n\n Capacity of Solar PV Projects:\n\ni)\nThe Project configuration shall be allowed as per the following matrix:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
