    "text": "Sr. No.\nSolar PV\nProject\nCapacity Bid\nMinimum DC\nArrays Capacity\nto be installed\nMinimum Rated\nInverter Capacity*\nMaximum AC\nCapacity Limit at\nDelivery point\n1\n300 MW\n300 MW\n300 MW\n300 MW\n2\n350 MW\n350 MW\n350 MW\n350 MW\n3\n400 MW\n400 MW\n400 MW\n400 MW\n4\n450 MW\n450 MW\n450 MW\n450 MW\n5\n500 MW\n500 MW\n500 MW\n500 MW\n6\n550 MW\n550 MW\n550 MW\n550 MW\n7\n600 MW\n600 MW\n600 MW\n600 MW\n8\n650 MW\n650 MW\n650 MW\n650 MW\n9\n700 MW\n700 MW\n700 MW\n700 MW",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0320",
