    "char_start": 133625,
    "char_end": 133903,
    "char_count": 278,
    "text": "*In case the rated inverter capacity is mentioned in kVA, the IEC test certificate\ndeclaring the power factor of the Inverter/PCU at rated power has to be submitted and\nthe power factor shall be multiplied by the kVA rating to calculate the rated capacity\nof the inverter in kW.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
