    "paragraph_index": 323,
    "page_start": 67,
    "page_end": 67,
    "char_start": 134078,
    "char_end": 134332,
    "char_count": 254,
    "text": "iii) Higher DC capacity arrays can also be allowed, subject to the condition that the AC\ncapacity limit as mentioned in (i) above for scheduling at the Delivery Point as per\nArticle 4.4 “Right to Contracted Capacity & Energy” of the PPA is complied with.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
