    "paragraph_index": 324,
    "page_start": 67,
    "page_end": 67,
    "char_start": 134334,
    "char_end": 134666,
    "char_count": 332,
    "text": "iv) For commissioning of the Project, cumulative capacity of DC arrays and cumulative\ncapacity of the inverters installed shall be considered. In case of part commissioning of\nthe Project, it shall be required to have the DC Arrays Capacity and inverters capacity\nbe installed not less than the proposed part commissioning capacity.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
