    "char_start": 4049,
    "char_end": 4209,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "(vi) Key Peformance Indicators for Concessioning Authority (Appendix 18);\n(vii) Clarity provided on beginning date of payment of licence fees (Article 9.1); and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 4210,
    "char_end": 4811,
    "char_count": 601,
    "text": "(viii) Deemed Peformance Security for entire duration of concession in line with\nother sectors (Article 4.2).\n7.\nAccordingly, the Model Concession Agreement, 2021 and the Guiding Note\nthereon for Major Ports are enclosed herewith for necessary implementation with\neffect from the date of issue of this letter..\n7.1 The Model Concession Agreement, 2021 will also be applicable to the PPP\nProjects, which are already approved by the Government and are still under bidding\nstage.\n8.\nThe Model Concession Agreement,202l may be circulated to all stakeholders\nand also be given wide publicity.\n(Page 2 of 3)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
