    "char_end": 40846,
    "char_count": 401,
    "text": "(b) from COD and until the 4th (fourth) anniversary thereof, an amount equal to the Adjusted Equity\nas on COD shall be deemed to be the base (the “Base Adjusted Equity”) and the Adjusted\nEquity hereunder shall be a sum equal to the Base Adjusted Equity, revised at the\ncommencement of each month following COD to the extent of variation in Price Index occurring\nbetween COD and the Reference Date; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
