    "text": "(a) the Concessionaire shall have a right to match the highest bid, if its bid is within [10.00%] of the\nhighest bid that may be offered at that time in accordance with the terms and conditions of the\nbidding documents issued at such time;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0151",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 151,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 77381,
    "char_end": 77526,
    "char_count": 145,
    "text": "(b) the Affiliate(s) of the Concessionaire shall not be qualified, either directly or indirectly, to\nparticipate in any such bidding process; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0152",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 152,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 77527,
    "char_end": 78998,
    "char_count": 1471,
    "text": "(c) it is clarified the Concessionaire shall be deemed to be qualified to submit the financial bid without\nbeing required to participate in the pre- qualification process and shall not be required to submit\nany documents for pre-qualification.\nProvided further that, in the event the Concessionaire has been in material default of the provisions of\nthis Agreement as a result of which the cumulative damages imposed upon him under the provisions\nof this Agreement [20%] of the Performance Security, then, the Concessioning Authority shall not be\nunder any obligation to extend the Concession Period or provide the right to match the highest bid to\nthe Concessionaire in accordance with this Clause 2.2. In any event, at all times, any decision\nconcerning the extension of the Concession Period shall vest with the Concessioning Authority.\n2.3\nAcceptance of the Concession\nThe Concessionaire hereby accepts the Concession and agrees and undertakes to implement the\nProject and to provide Project Facilities and Services in accordance with the provisions of this\nAgreement. Subject to and in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement and Applicable\nLaws and Applicable Permits, the Concessionaire shall at its costs, charges, expenses and risk\nincluding but not limited to foreign exchange variation risk if any, conceptualize, design, engineer,\nfinance, construct, equip, operate, maintain and replace the Project/ Project Facilities and Services.\n2.4\nPort’s Assets",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0153",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 153,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 78999,
    "char_end": 79418,
    "char_count": 419,
    "text": "(a) In consideration of the Concessionaire agreeing to perform and discharge its obligations as set\nforth in this Agreement, the Concessioning Authority hereby grants to the Concessionaire, the\nexclusive right to enter upon, occupy and use the Project Site and Port’s Assets for the purpose\nof implementing the Project and provision of Project Facilities and Services pursuant thereto in\naccordance with this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0154",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 154,
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 32,
    "char_start": 79419,
    "char_end": 79743,
    "char_count": 324,
    "text": "(b) The Concessionaire shall at its costs, charges and expenses make such development and\nimprovements in the Project Site and Port’s Assets as may be necessary or appropriate for\nimplementing the Project and providing Project Facilities and Services in accordance with the\nAgreement, Applicable Laws and Applicable Permits.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
