    "char_end": 81577,
    "char_count": 351,
    "text": "(b) satisfied itself as to the nature of the climatic, hydrological and general physical conditions of the\nProject Site/Port's Assets, the nature of the ground and subsoil, the form and nature of the\nProject Site/Port's Assets, and the nature of the design, work and materials necessary for the\nperformance of its obligations under this Agreement; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0159",
