    "char_start": 81578,
    "char_end": 82054,
    "char_count": 476,
    "text": "(c) obtained for itself all necessary information as to the risks, contingencies and all other\ncircumstances which may influence or affect the Concessionaire and its rights and obligations\nunder or pursuant to this Agreement.\n2.8\nPeaceful Occupation\nThe Concessioning Authority warrants that the Concessionaire shall, subject to complying with the\nterms and conditions of this Agreement, remain in occupation of the Project Site and Port’s Assets\nduring the Concession Period.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
