    "text": "ARTICLE 6\nPROJECT IMPLEMENTATION\n6.1\nPreparation of Designs and Drawings\nThe Concessionaire shall at its cost, charges and expenses, prepare the Designs and Drawings in\nconformity with the Scope of Work.\n6.2\nReview of the Designs and Drawings",
