    "char_start": 98900,
    "char_end": 99151,
    "char_count": 251,
    "text": "(a) The Concessionaire shall submit the Designs and Drawings as set out in Appendix 6 for the\nreview of the Independent Engineer. Simultaneously, the Concessionaire shall also provide the\nConcessioning Authority with a set of the Designs and Drawings.",
