    "char_end": 99489,
    "char_count": 337,
    "text": "(b) The Independent Engineer shall review the Designs and Drawings submitted by the\nConcessionaire and provide its comments/observations and suggestions on the same including\nthe comments/observations of the Concessioning Authority in respect thereof within 21 (twenty\none) Days from the date of the receipt of such Designs and Drawings.",
