    "text": "(c) In the event that the Independent Engineer/ Concessioning Authority has observed that the\nDesigns and Drawings are not in conformity with the Scope of Work , the Concessionaire shall\npromptly and without any undue delay revise and resubmit the Designs and Drawings or satisfy\nthe Independent Engineer and Concessioning Authority with regards its compliance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
