    "char_start": 99852,
    "char_end": 100297,
    "char_count": 445,
    "text": "(d) If\nthe\nIndependent\nEngineer\n/Concessioning\nAuthority\ndoes\nnot\nmake\nany\nobservation/comments with respect to the Designs and Drawings submitted to it by the\nConcessionaire within 21 (twenty one) Days of the submission, it shall be deemed that the\nIndependent Engineer/ Concessioning Authority has no suggestions to make with respect to the\nDesigns and Drawings and the Concessionaire shall been titled to proceed with the Project\naccordingly.",
