    "text": "(b) make available all records of sub-soil investigations carried out on its behalf in the Port’s Assets,\nif requested by the Concessionaire. It is clarified that the Concessionaire shall be solely\nresponsible for determining the adequacy or otherwise of such investigations and will not in\nreliance of such records, be entitled to claim any relief under this Agreement;",
