    "char_end": 108379,
    "char_count": 357,
    "text": "(c) upon satisfaction as to completion and receipt of Provisional Certificate issued by the\nIndependent Engineer promptly obtain approval of the Collector of Customs, publish requisite\nnotifications in the Official Gazette and declare the Project Facilities and Services as ready for\noperation in accordance with the provisions of Section 26 of the MPA Act.",
