    "char_end": 108687,
    "char_count": 307,
    "text": "(d) upon written request from the Concessionaire, assist the Concessionaire, on a best effort basis,\nin obtaining immigration clearances, employment permits and residential premises for any\nforeign personnel engaged or employed by the Concessionaire in connection with the\nimplementation of the Project; and",
