    "char_end": 109400,
    "char_count": 366,
    "text": "(a) Upon recommendation of the Independent Engineer to this effect, the Concessioning Authority\nmay by notice require the Concessionaire to suspend forthwith the whole or any part of the\nConstruction Works if, in the reasonable opinion of the Concessioning Authority, such work\nthreatens the safety of the Users or any other person on or about the Project. Provided,",
