    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 109528,
    "char_end": 110367,
    "char_count": 839,
    "text": "(b) The Concessionaire shall, pursuant to the notice under the foregoing provision suspend the\nConstruction Works or any part thereof for such time and in such manner as may be specified\nby the Concessioning Authority and thereupon represent to the Concessioning Authority /\nIndependent Engineer, the remedial measures to remedy the defects notified. The\nConcessionaire may by notice require the Independent Engineer to inspect such remedial\nmeasures forthwith and make a report to the Concessioning Authority recommending whether\nor not the suspension hereunder may be revoked. Any dispute as regards the suspension of\nworks or the remedial measures proposed, if cannot resolved within 30 (thirty) Days of the\nsuspension or proposal of the remedial measures, shall be submitted for dispute resolution in\naccordance with Article 19 hereof.",
