    "page_start": 46,
    "page_end": 46,
    "char_start": 110802,
    "char_end": 111531,
    "char_count": 729,
    "text": "(d) If suspension of Construction Works is for reasons not attributable to the Concessionaire, the\nIndependent Engineer shall determine any extension of the dates set forth in the project\ncompletion schedule to which the Concessionaire is reasonably entitled, and shall notify the\nConcessioning Authority accordingly whereupon the Concessioning Authority shall extend such\nproject completion schedule dates in accordance with the recommendations of the Independent\nEngineer. In the event that the Scheduled Completion Date is extended pursuant hereto, the\nConcession Period shall be deemed to be extended by a period equal in length to the period of\nextension of the Scheduled Completion Date.\n6.7\nIssue of Completion Certificate",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
