    "text": "consultation with the Concessionaire and notified to the Concessioning Authority who may\ndesignate its representative to witness the Tests. The Concessionaire shall provide such\nassistance as the Independent Engineer may reasonably require for conducting the Tests. In\nthe event of the Concessionaire and the Independent Engineer failing to mutually agree on the\ndates for conducting the Tests, the Concessionaire shall fix the dates by not less than 10 (ten)\nDays’ notice to the Independent Engineer;",
