    "text": "(b) make efforts to maximise cargo handled so as to achieve optimal utilization of the Project\nFacilities and Services;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0255",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 255,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 124505,
    "char_end": 124601,
    "char_count": 96,
    "text": "(c) ensure compliance of the Project Facilities and Services at least as per the Scope of Work.;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0256",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 256,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 124602,
    "char_end": 124857,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "(d) be free to deploy higher capacity equipment/facilities/ technology, etc. and induct new\ntechnology and carry out value engineering for improved productivity and/or improved utilization\nand/or cost saving of Project assets during the concession period;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0257",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 257,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 124858,
    "char_end": 125076,
    "char_count": 218,
    "text": "(e) ensure that the Project Facilities and Services shall adhere to the Operations and Maintenance\nStandards and Safety Standards and there is safe, smooth and uninterrupted flow of traffic\nnormal operating conditions;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0258",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 258,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 125077,
    "char_end": 125366,
    "char_count": 289,
    "text": "(f) minimise disruption to traffic in the event of accidents or other incidents affecting the safety and\nuse of the Project Facilities and Services by providing a rapid and effective response and\nmaintaining liaison with emergency services of the Concessioning Authority or other agencies;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0259",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 259,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 125367,
    "char_end": 125577,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "(g) make available all necessary financial, technical, technological, managerial and other resources\nfor operation, maintenance, repair and replacement of the Project Facilities and Services in a\ntimely manner;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0260",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 260,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 125578,
    "char_end": 125741,
    "char_count": 163,
    "text": "(h) ensure maintenance of proper and accurate record/data/accounts relating to operations of the\nProject Facilities and Services and the revenue earned there from;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0261",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 261,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 125742,
    "char_end": 125927,
    "char_count": 185,
    "text": "(i) obtain, maintain and comply with Applicable Permits and comply with the Applicable Laws\nincluding those relating but not limited to dock side safety, health, environment and labour;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0262",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 262,
    "page_start": 51,
    "page_end": 51,
    "char_start": 125928,
    "char_end": 126174,
    "char_count": 246,
    "text": "(j) subject to the provisions of this Agreement, perform, undertake or provide, in connection with\nthe Project, all services which the Concessioning Authority is authorized to perform, undertake\nor provide under the provisions of the MPA Act; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0263",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 263,
