    "page_end": 56,
    "char_start": 139079,
    "char_end": 139334,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "(c) waterside safety and safety of navigation;\n(d) maintenance of the dredged draft alongside the berth at [●]m, provided this draft may be\nincreased in future at the cost and risk of the Concessionaire subject to the approval from\nConcessioning Authority",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
