    "paragraph_index": 299,
    "page_start": 57,
    "page_end": 57,
    "char_start": 140499,
    "char_end": 141472,
    "char_count": 973,
    "text": "(iii) Additional Land, Utilities and facilities\nIn the event of land, utilities and facilities are found to be insufficient by the Concessionaire for\nproviding services as per the Scope of Work at any time during the concession period, the\nConcessionaire may approach the Concessioning Authority for providing additional land, utilities and\nfacilities. Concessioning Authority on being approached by Concessionaire with due justification of\nthe additional land, utilities, facilities requirement as applicable shall consider, subject to availability\nand provide additional land, utilities and facilities if considered necessary for providing project\nfacilities as per Scope of Work. Even if authority is not in a position to provide additional land, utilities\nand services, the Concessionaire would not be entitled to any relaxation on the grounds that land,\nutilities and services are found to be insufficient my Concessionaire for providing services as per\nScope of Work.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0300",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 300,
    "page_start": 57,
    "page_end": 57,
    "char_start": 141473,
    "char_end": 142093,
    "char_count": 620,
    "text": "(iv) Reference to Adjudicatory Board\nIn the event of Project becoming a Stressed project, Concessioning Authority may make a\nreference to Adjudicatory Board, after its constitution as per Article 19.4 of this Agreement, for\nappraisal and review of the Project to suggest measures to revive the Project.\n7.1(d) Rights of Concessioning Authority\n(i)\nIf in the reasonable opinion of the Concessioning Authority, the Concessionaire is in material\nbreach of its obligations under this Agreement for handling of cargo at the Project, the\nConcessioning Authority may, without prejudice to any of its rights under this Agreement",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
