    "char_end": 142933,
    "char_count": 678,
    "text": "(ii) In the event that the Concessionaire, upon notice as per 7.1(d)(i) above fails to handle cargo at\nthe Project as per Agreement within a reasonable period, the Concessioning Authority may\ntake over the performance of any or all the obligations of the Concessionaire to the extent\ndeemed necessary by it for handling of cargo at the Project, at the risk and cost of the\nConcessionaire and to recover any costs and expenses incurred by the Concessioning\nAuthority in discharge of its obligations hereunder from the Concessionaire; provided that such\ntaking over by the Concessioning Authority shall be of no greater scope and of no longer\nduration than is reasonably required.",
