    "char_start": 147657,
    "char_end": 148904,
    "char_count": 1247,
    "text": "ARTICLE 8\nTARIFF\n8.1\nApplicable Tariff\nConcessionaire shall fix the Tariff based on market conditions and on such other conditions, if any, as\nmay be notified and made applicable by a competent authority, under the provisions of the MPA Act.\n8.2\nLevy and Recovery of the Tariff\nThe Concessionaire shall be entitled to recover Tariff from the users of the Project Facilities and\nServices as per the Tariff set by the Concessionaire as per Clause 8.1. The Concessionaire shall,\nsubject to Clause8.3 hereunder, deposit all Tariff and other receipts in relation to the Project\nFacilities and Services in the Escrow Account and shall not make any such deposits to any other\naccount either of the Concessionaire or of any other person.\n8.3\nCollection of Cesses and Charges\nThe Concessionaire shall collect all cesses and charges including infrastructure cess, if any levied\non the users as notified by a competent authority, and as may be requested by the Concessioning\nAuthority, on behalf of the Concessioning Authority and remit the same to the Concessioning\nAuthority. Provided, the Concessionaire shall be duly authorized by the Concessioning Authority or\nsuch other authority as may be competent in this regard, for the purpose of such collection.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0316",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 316,
    "page_start": 61,
    "page_end": 61,
    "char_start": 148906,
    "char_end": 148908,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "57",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
