    "char_end": 149248,
    "char_count": 338,
    "text": "ARTICLE 9\nPAYMENTS TO THE CONCESSIONING AUTHORITY\n9.1\nLicense Fee\n(a) The Concessionaire shall, as consideration for the use, in its capacity as a bare licensee of the\nProject Site and the equipment comprised in the Port’s Assets, made available in accordance\nwith Article 2.4, pay to the Concessioning Authority Re 1 (the “License Fee”).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
