    "char_start": 149249,
    "char_end": 149481,
    "char_count": 232,
    "text": "(b) The License Fee shall be due and payable in advance every year starting from [Date of\nAward of Concession or any other date specified by Concessioning Authority falling after\nDate of Award of Concession].\n9.2\nPayments of Royalty",
