    "char_end": 149983,
    "char_count": 501,
    "text": "(a) The Concessionaire shall pay to the Concessioning Authority Royalty per Month equal to\nRs.****** per {MT of cargo/ TEUs}26 handled during the month. (“the Royalty”), provided if\nactual annual cargo/TEUs handled is lesser than Minimum Guaranteed Cargo as per Clause\n7.1 a (xii) the Minimum Guaranteed Cargo shall be considered for calculation of applicable\nRoyalty and any shortfall in Royalty thus calculated shall be payable along with the Royalty\npayment of the last month of the Financial Year.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
