    "char_count": 258,
    "text": "(b) In case any discount or incentives are mandated by Government Authorities to be applicable\non certain cargo types or nature of cargoes, the Royalty Payments for such cargo types\nhandled by the Concessionaire shall be subjected to same level of discounts.",
