    "char_end": 161669,
    "char_count": 617,
    "text": "ARTICLE 11\nSHAREHOLDING\n11.1 Ownership Structure\nThe Applicant/Consortium has caused the Concessionaire to be incorporated as a special purpose\ncompany to implement, operate and maintain the Project/Project Facilities and Services in\naccordance with this Agreement. The shareholding pattern of Concessionaire/each member of the\nConsortium in the Concessionaire is [●].\n11.2 Shareholding\nThe Concessionaire shall ensure that the Applicant/ members of the Consortium maintain\nManagement Control at least until expiry of the one (1) year after COD as also maintain their equity\nholding in the Concessionaire such that27:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
