    "paragraph_index": 356,
    "page_start": 67,
    "page_end": 67,
    "char_start": 161670,
    "char_end": 162394,
    "char_count": 724,
    "text": "(a) Selected Bidder/Consortium Members together with its/their Associates hold not less than 51%\nof its issued and paid up equity and that no member of Consortium whose technical and\nfinancial capacity was evaluated for the purposes of Pre-qualifications in response to Request\nfor Qualification shall hold less than 26% of such equity until expiry of one (1) year after COD. At\nany time, after expiry of the aforesaid share holding period, lead member can approach\nConcession Authority for approval proposing a new entity/ consortium. Concession Authority\nmay at its sole discretion consider and approve it subject to the entity/consortium meeting the\neligibility criteria as prescribed in Bid Document for the Project; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
