    "text": "(b) M/s [●] (“Lead Member”) of the Consortium (original or new as the case may be) legally and\nbeneficially holds at any time not less than 50% of the Consortium’s holding in the paid-up\nequity capital of the Concessionaire.\nAny Transfer of shareholding in the Concessionaire and/or direct or indirect change in the\nManagement Control of the Concessionaire, including by way of a restructuring or\namalgamation, shall only be with the prior written approval of the Concessioning Authority which\nconsent shall not be withheld except (i) for reasons of national security; or (ii) [if the Person\nproposed for assuming such Management Control would by virtue of the restrictions imposed\nunder the Applicable Law or the conditions of bidding (including restrictions to avoid anti-\ncompetitive and monopolistic practice) and/or public policy be disqualified from undertaking the\nProject.]",
