    "text": "ARTICLE 12\nGENERAL RIGHTS, DUTIES AND OBLIGATIONS\n12.1 Of the Concessionaire\n(a) Applicable Permits\nThe Concessionaire shall at all times during the Concession Period maintain and comply with the\nApplicable Permits.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0363",
