    "char_end": 167932,
    "char_count": 1075,
    "text": "(b)\nloss, damage or destruction of the Project Facilities and Services, at replacement value;\n(c)\ncomprehensive third-party liability insurance including injury or death to personnel of the\nConcessioning Authority and others who may enter the Project Site or the Port’s Assets;\n(d)\nworkmen’s compensation insurance;\n(e)\nmarine cum storage cum erection insurance; and\n(f)\nany other insurance that may be necessary to protect the Concessionaire, its employees and\nits assets and the Concessioning Authority, its employees and agents engaged in or\nconnected to the Project and the Project Site and Port Assets (against loss, damage or\ndestruction at replacement value) including all Force Majeure Events that are insurable and\nnot otherwise covered in items (a) to (e).\n(ii)\nInsurance Cover & Insurance Companies\nThe Concessionaire shall insure all insurable assets comprised in the Port’s Assets and/or the\nProject Facilities and Services and all insurable risks associated with the Project to the extent\nadvisable in accordance with Good Industry Practice (“Insurance Cover”).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0367",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 367,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 167933,
    "char_end": 168239,
    "char_count": 306,
    "text": "(iii) Evidence of Insurance Cover\nThe Concessionaire shall, from time to time, provide to the Concessioning Authority copies of\nall insurance policies (or appropriate endorsements, certifications or other satisfactory\nevidence of insurance) obtained by the Concessionaire in accordance with this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0368",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 368,
    "page_start": 70,
    "page_end": 70,
    "char_start": 168240,
    "char_end": 169624,
    "char_count": 1384,
    "text": "(iv) Application of Insurance Proceeds\nSubject to the provisions of the Financing Documents, all moneys received under insurance\npolicies shall be promptly applied by the Concessionaire towards repair or renovation or\nrestoration or substitution of the Port Assets and the Project Facilities and Services or any part\nthereof which may have been damaged or destroyed and in respect of which the claim is\nlodged. The Concessionaire may designate the Senior Lenders as the loss payees under the\ninsurance policies/assign the insurance policies in their favour as security for the Financial\nAssistance. The Concessionaire shall carry out such repair or renovation or restoration or\nsubstitution to the extent possible in such manner that the Project Facilities and Services or\nany part thereof, shall, after such repair or renovation or restoration or substitution be as far as\npossible in the same condition as they were before such damage or destruction, normal wear\nand tear excepted.\n(v)\nValidity of the Insurance Cover\nThe Concessionaire shall pay the premium payable on such insurance policy(ies) so as to\nkeep the policy(ies) in force and valid throughout the Concession Period and furnish copies of\nthe same to the Concessioning Authority. Each insurance policy shall provide that the same\nshall not be cancelled or terminated unless 10 (ten) Days’ clear notice of cancellation is",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0369",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 369,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 169626,
    "char_end": 169628,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "67",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0370",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 370,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 169630,
    "char_end": 170198,
    "char_count": 568,
    "text": "provided to Concessioning Authority in writing. If at any time the Concessionaire fails to\npurchase and maintain in full force and effect any and all of the insurances required under this\nAgreement, the Concessioning Authority may at its option purchase and maintain such\ninsurance and all sums incurred by the Concessioning Authority therefor shall be reimbursed\nwith interest @ 3% above Bank Rateper annum by the Concessionaire forthwith on demand,\nfailing which the same shall be recovered by the Concessioning Authority by exercising right\nof set off or otherwise.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0371",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 371,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 170199,
    "char_end": 170810,
    "char_count": 611,
    "text": "(vi) Waiver of Subrogation\nAll insurance policies procured in terms of the provisions hereof shall include a waiver of any\nright of subrogation of the insurers there under against, inter alia, the Concessioning Authority\nand its assigns and successors and their respective subsidiaries, affiliates, employees and of\nany right of the insurers of any set-off or counterclaim or any other deduction, whether by\nattachment or otherwise, in respect of any liability of any such person insured under any such\npolicy or in any way connected with any loss, liability or obligation covered by such policies of\ninsurance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0372",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 372,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 170811,
    "char_end": 171514,
    "char_count": 703,
    "text": "(vii) Concessionaire’s waiver\nThe Concessionaire hereby further releases, assigns and waives any and all rights of\nsubrogation or recovery against, inter alia, the Concessioning Authority and its assigns,\nundertakings and their subsidiaries, affiliates, employees, successors, insurers and\nunderwriters, which the Concessionaire may otherwise have or acquire in or from or in any\nway connected with any loss, liability or obligation covered by policies of insurance maintained\nor required to be maintained by the Concessionaire pursuant to this Agreement (other than\nthird party liability insurance policies) or because of deductible clauses in or inadequacy of\nlimits of any such policies of insurance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0373",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 373,
    "page_start": 71,
    "page_end": 71,
    "char_start": 171515,
    "char_end": 172347,
    "char_count": 832,
    "text": "(d) Indemnification\n(i) The Concessionaire shall indemnify, defend, save and hold harmless the Concessioning\nAuthority and its officers, servants, agents, Government Instrumentalities, Designated GOI\nAgencies and Concessioning Authority owned and/or controlled entities/enterprises, (the\n“Government Indemnified Persons”) against any and all suits, proceedings, actions, demands\nand claims from third parties for any loss, damage, cost and expense of whatever kind and\nnature, whether arising out of any breach by the Concessionaire of any of its obligations under\nthis Agreement or any related agreement or on account of any defect or deficiency in the\nprovision of services by the Concessionaire to the Concessioning Authority or any User or\nfrom any negligence of the Concessionaire under contract or tort, or on any other ground",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0374",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
