    "char_start": 172588,
    "char_end": 173626,
    "char_count": 1038,
    "text": "(ii) The Concessioning Authority shall indemnify, defend, save and hold harmless the\nConcessionaire against any and all suits, proceedings, actions, demands and claims from\nthird parties for any loss, damage, cost and expense of whatever kind and nature arising out\nof (a) defect in title and/or the rights of the Concessioning Authority in the land comprised in\nthe Site, and/or (b) breach by the Concessioning Authority of any of its obligations under this\nAgreement or any related agreement, which materially and adversely affect the performance\nby the Concessionaire of its obligations under this Agreement, save and except that where\nany such claim, suit, proceeding, action, and/or demand has arisen due to a negligent act or\nomission, or breach of any of its obligations under any provision of this Agreement or any\nrelated agreement and/or breach of its statutory duty on the part of the Concessionaire, its\nsubsidiaries, assigns, affiliates, contractors, servants or agents, the same shall be the liability\nof the Concessionaire.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0377",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 377,
    "page_start": 72,
    "page_end": 72,
    "char_start": 173627,
    "char_end": 174674,
    "char_count": 1047,
    "text": "(e)  Engagement of Contractors\nThe Concessionaire may engage any Person possessing the requisite skill, expertise and capability\nof designing, engineering, procurement and construction of civil/ mechanical/electrical engineering\nstructures/equipment, and /or operation and maintenance of the Project Facilities and Services.\nProvided:\n(i)\nthe Concessionaire shall at all times be solely responsible for all its obligations under this\nAgreement notwithstanding any such engagement and anything contained in any Project\nContracts or any other agreement, and no default under any Project Contract or agreement\nshall excuse the Concessionaire from its obligations or liability hereunder and the\nConcessionaire shall at all times be solely responsible for nonperformance or for any defect,\ndeficiency or delay in the construction and erection and/or installation of the\nstructures/equipment or any part thereof and for the operation and maintenance of the\nProject/the Project Facilities and Services in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0378",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 378,
