    "text": "(iii) the Concessionaire shall ensure that the Project Contracts contain provisions that entitle the\nConcessioning Authority to step into such contract in its sole discretion in substitution of the\nConcessionaire in the event of termination or suspension of this Agreement; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
