    "paragraph_index": 382,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 175252,
    "char_end": 176493,
    "char_count": 1241,
    "text": "(f)  Condition Survey\n(i)\nThe Concessionaire agrees that at least 6 (six)28 Months prior to the expiry by efflux of time of\nthe Concession Period, it shall, cause to be conducted at its cost by an Independent Engineer,\na condition survey and an inventory of the entire Project Facilities and Services. If, as a result of\nsuch survey, the Expert shall observe/notice that the Port’s Assets and/or the Project Facilities\nand Services or any part thereof have/has not been operated and maintained in accordance\nwith the requirements therefor under this Agreement (normal wear and tear excepted) the\nConcessionaire shall, at its cost and expenses, take all necessary steps to put the same in\ngood working condition well before the Transfer Date. In the event the Concessionaire fails to\ncomply with this provision, the Concessioning Authority may itself cause the condition survey\nand inventory of the Port’s Assets and Project Facilities and Services to be conducted and\nremove any defect or deficiency. The Concessioning Authority shall be promptly reimbursed by\nthe Concessionaire for the costs incurred in conducting such survey and preparation of\ninventory as also in putting the Project Facilities and Services in a good working condition.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
