    "char_start": 176494,
    "char_end": 176652,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "(ii) Deleted\n(g) Compliance to Green Ports Policy\nThe Concessionaire shall comply with the measures set out in Appendix 20\n12.2 Of the Concessioning Authority",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0384",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 384,
    "page_start": 73,
    "page_end": 73,
    "char_start": 176653,
    "char_end": 177109,
    "char_count": 456,
    "text": "(a)  Assistance in Obtaining Approvals, Permits and Licenses\nThe Concessioning Authority shall, at the written request of the Concessionaire, but without\nguarantees and/or without assuming any responsibility in that behalf, issue recommendatory letters\nand make best efforts to assist the Concessionaire in obtaining all the Applicable Permits including\nrenewals thereof. Provided that, nothing contained in this Article shall relieve the Concessionaire of",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0385",
