    "text": "(ii) Upon determination of the occurrence of an Unforeseen Event, the Parties shall make a\nreference to the Committee   For avoidance of doubt, under this provision, it is hereby clarified\nthat the Independent Engineer shall also be a mandatory member of the Committee.",
