    "page_end": 84,
    "char_start": 199814,
    "char_end": 199925,
    "char_count": 111,
    "text": "(e) any event or circumstance of a nature analogous to any of the foregoing.\n14.5 Notice of Force Majeure Event",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0447",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 447,
    "page_start": 84,
    "page_end": 84,
    "char_start": 199926,
    "char_end": 200369,
    "char_count": 443,
    "text": "(a) The Affected Party shall give written notice to the other Party in writing of the occurrence of any\nof the Force Majeure Event (the “Notice”) as soon as the same arises or as soon as reasonably\npracticable and in any event within 7 (seven) Days after the Affected Party knew, or ought\nreasonably to have known, of its occurrence and the adverse effect it has or is likely to have on\nthe performance of its obligations under this Agreement.",
