    "page_start": 84,
    "page_end": 84,
    "char_start": 200370,
    "char_end": 200537,
    "char_count": 167,
    "text": "(b) The Notice shall inter-alia include full particulars of:\n(i) the nature, time of occurrence and extent of the Force Majeure Event with evidence in\nrespect thereof;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
