    "page_start": 84,
    "page_end": 84,
    "char_start": 200913,
    "char_end": 201470,
    "char_count": 557,
    "text": "(iv) any other relevant information.\n(c) So long as the Affected Party continues to claim to be affected by a Force Majeure Event, it\nshall provide the other Party with periodic (fortnightly/monthly) written reports containing the\ninformation called for by Article 14.5(b) and such other information as the other Party may\nreasonably request.\n14.6 Period of Force Majeure\nPeriod of Force Majeure shall mean the period from the time of occurrence specified in the Notice\ngiven by the Affected Party in respect of the Force Majeure Event until the earlier of:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
