    "page_end": 85,
    "char_start": 202864,
    "char_end": 203074,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "(a) Upon occurrence of any Force Majeure Event prior to the Date of Award of Concession, the\nParties shall bear their respective costs and no Party shall be required to pay to the other Party\nany costs thereof.",
