    "char_end": 203850,
    "char_count": 351,
    "text": "(ii) upon occurrence of an Other Event, all Force Majeure Costs attributable to such Other Event,\nand not exceeding the Insurance Cover for such Other Event, shall be borne by the\nConcessionaire, and to the extent Force Majeure Costs exceed such Insurance Cover, one\nhalf of such excess amount shall be reimbursed by the Concessioning Authority to the",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0459",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
