    "page_end": 86,
    "char_start": 204895,
    "char_end": 205151,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "(a) Upon the occurrence of any Force Majeure Event prior to the Date of Award of Concession, the\nperiod set forth in Clause 3.2 for fulfilment of Conditions Precedent shall be extended by a period\nequal in length to the duration of the Force Majeure Event.",
