    "paragraph_index": 466,
    "page_start": 87,
    "page_end": 87,
    "char_start": 206405,
    "char_end": 207042,
    "char_count": 637,
    "text": "14.10 Termination Due to Force Majeure Event\nIf the period of Force Majeure continues or is in the reasonable judgment of the Parties likely to\ncontinue beyond a period of 120 (one hundred and twenty) Days, the Parties may mutually decide\nto terminate this Agreement or continue this Agreement on mutually agreed revised terms. If the\nParties are unable to reach an agreement in this regard, the Affected Party shall after the expiry of\nthe said period of 120 (one hundred and twenty ) Days be entitled to terminate the Agreement in\nwhich event, the provisions of Articles 16 and 17 shall, to the extent expressly made applicable,\napply.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0467",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 467,
    "page_start": 88,
    "page_end": 88,
    "char_start": 207044,
    "char_end": 207046,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "84",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
