    "text": "(b) The Concessioning Authority Event of Default\n(i)\nthe Concessioning Authority’s failure to perform or discharge its obligations in accordance\nwith the provisions of this Agreement unless such failure has occurred as a consequence of\nany Concessionaire Event of Default or a Force Majeure Event.\n(ii)\nany representation made, or warranties given by the Concessioning Authority under this\nAgreement is found to be false or misleading.\n(iii)\nappointment of a provisional liquidator, administrator or receiver of the whole or part of the\nPort’s Assets in any legal proceedings initiated against the Concessioning Authority (unless\nsuch proceedings are initiated as a consequence of any Concessionaire Event of Default).\n(iv)\nlevy of an execution or restraint on the Port’s Assets in any proceedings against the\nConcessioning Authority (unless such proceedings are initiated as a consequence of any",
