    "page_start": 90,
    "page_end": 90,
    "char_start": 212073,
    "char_end": 212299,
    "char_count": 226,
    "text": "(a) Upon the occurrence of the Concessionaire Event of Default, the Concessioning Authority shall\nwithout prejudice to any other rights and remedies available to it under this Agreement be\nentitled to terminate this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0480",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 480,
    "page_start": 90,
    "page_end": 90,
    "char_start": 212300,
    "char_end": 213975,
    "char_count": 1675,
    "text": "(b) Upon the occurrence of the Concessioning Authority Event of Default, the Concessionaire shall\nwithout prejudice to any other rights and remedies available to it under this Agreement be\nentitled to terminate this Agreement.\nProvided that before proceeding to terminate this Agreement, the Party entitled to do so shall give\ndue consideration and shall have due regard to the nature of the underlying Event of Default, its\nimplication on the performance of the respective obligations of Parties under this Agreement and\nthe circumstances in which the same has occurred.\n15.3 Consultation Notice\nEither Party exercising its right under Article 15.2, shall issue to the other Party a notice in writing\nspecifying in reasonable detail the underlying Event of Default(s) and proposing consultation\namongst the Parties and the Senior Lenders to consider possible measures of curing or otherwise\ndealing with the underlying Event of Default (“Consultation Notice”).\n15.4 Remedial Process\nFollowing the issue of Consultation Notice by either Party, within a period not exceeding 90 (ninety)\nDays or such extended period as the Parties may agree (“Remedial Period”) the Parties shall, in\nconsultation with the Senior Lenders, endeavour to arrive at an agreement as to the manner of\nrectifying or remedying the underlying Event of Default. Without prejudice to this, if the underlying\nevent is a Concessionaire Event of Default, the Concessioning Authority shall in consultation with\nthe Senior Lenders endeavour to arrive at an agreement as to one or more of the following\nmeasures and/or such other measures as may be considered appropriate by them in the attendant\ncircumstances:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0481",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
