    "text": "(b) the replacement of the Concessionaire by a new operator (“Selectee”) proposed by the Senior\nLenders (in terms of the Substitution Agreement), and the specific terms and conditions of such\nreplacement which shall include:\n(i)\nthe criteria for selection of the Selectee;",
