    "char_end": 219777,
    "char_count": 371,
    "text": "upon the Concessionaire to furnish the following information to enable the Concessioning Authority\nto estimate the likely Termination Payment payable by the Concessioning Authority to the\nConcessionaire and/or to finalise the items of Concessionaire’s assets comprised in the Project\nFacilities and Services to be handed over to/taken over by the Concessioning Authority.",
