    "paragraph_index": 499,
    "page_start": 94,
    "page_end": 94,
    "char_start": 220558,
    "char_end": 221462,
    "char_count": 904,
    "text": "(a) The Concessionaire agrees that on the service of a Termination Notice or at least 6 (six) months\nprior to the expiry of the Concession Period, as the case may be, it shall conduct or cause to be\nconducted under the Concessioning Authority’s supervision, a condition survey of the Project\nFacilities and Services including the Project Site and/or the Port’s Assets to ascertain the\ncondition thereof, verifying compliance with the Concessionaire’s obligations under this\nAgreement and to prepare an inventory of the assets comprised in the Project Facilities and\nServices. During this period, the designated key personnel of the Concessioning Authority shall\nbe associated with the operations of the Project Facilities and Services (except when the same\nis impossible due to a Force Majeure Event) in order to facilitate smooth takeover of the same\nby the Concessioning Authority on the Transfer Date.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0500",
