    "page_end": 94,
    "char_start": 221463,
    "char_end": 221957,
    "char_count": 494,
    "text": "(b) If, as a result of the condition survey, the Concessioning Authority shall observe/notice that the\nProject Site and/or the Port’s Assets and/or the Project Facilities and Services or any part\nthereof have/has not been operated and maintained in accordance with the requirements\ntherefor under this Agreement (normal wear and tear excepted) the Concessionaire shall, at its\ncost and expenses, take all necessary steps to put the same in good working conditions well\nbefore the Transfer Date.",
