    "page_start": 94,
    "page_end": 94,
    "char_start": 221958,
    "char_end": 222433,
    "char_count": 475,
    "text": "(c) In the event the Concessionaire fails to comply with the provisions of this Agreement, the\nConcessioning Authority may itself cause the condition survey and inventory of Port’s Assets\nand the Project Facilities and Services to be conducted. The Concessioning Authority shall be\ncompensated by the Concessionaire for any costs incurred in conducting such survey and\npreparation of inventory as also in putting the Project Facilities and Services in good working\ncondition.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
