    "paragraph_index": 503,
    "page_start": 95,
    "page_end": 95,
    "char_start": 222439,
    "char_end": 223809,
    "char_count": 1370,
    "text": "16.5 Consequences of Termination\nWithout prejudice to any other consequences or requirements under this Agreement or under any\nlaw:\n(a) the Concessionaire shall transfer all the assets and rights upon expiry of the Concession Period\nby efflux of time or termination of the Agreement due to a Force Majeure Event or on account of\nan Event of Default in accordance with Article 18;\n(b) the Concessioning Authority shall be entitled to encash any subsisting bank guarantee(s)\nprovided by the Concessionaire against any amounts owing to the Concessioning Authority by\nthe Concessionaire.\nNotwithstanding anything contained in this Agreement, except for ensuring the deposit of the\nTermination Payment payable to the Concessionaire in accordance with Article 17 in the Escrow\nAccount, the Concessioning Authority shall not, as a consequence of termination or otherwise, have\nany obligation whatsoever to any third party including but not limited to obligations as to\ncompensation for loss of employment, continuance or regularization of employment, absorption or\nre-employment on any ground, in relation to any person in the employment of or engaged by the\nConcessionaire in connection with the Project, and the handback of the Project Site/Port\nAssets/Project Facilities & Services by the Concessionaire to the Concessioning Authority shall be\nfree from any such obligation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0504",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 504,
    "page_start": 96,
    "page_end": 96,
    "char_start": 223811,
    "char_end": 223813,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "92",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0505",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 505,
    "page_start": 96,
    "page_end": 96,
    "char_start": 223815,
    "char_end": 225611,
    "char_count": 1796,
    "text": "ARTICLE 17\nCOMPENSATION\n17.1 Compensation\n(a) Termination due to Force Majeure Event\n(i) If the termination is due to a Non Political Event, Termination Payment payable to the\nConcessionaire shall be 90% of the Debt Due LESS any amount due to the Concessioning\nAuthority by the Concessionaire under this Agreement LESS all insurance claims received or\nadmitted.\n(ii) If the termination is due to an Other Event, Termination Payment payable to the Concessionaire\nshall be aggregate of:\na. Debt Due less Insurance Cover; provided that if any insurance claims forming part of the\nInsurance Cover are not admitted and paid, then 80% of such unpaid claims shall be\nincluded in the computation of Debt Due;\nb. 110% of the Adjusted Equity; and\nc. an amount equivalent to the Additional Termination Payment less Insurance Cover;\nprovided that if any insurance claims forming part of the Insurance Cover are not admitted\nand paid, then 80% of such unpaid claims shall be included in computation of the amount\npayable hereunder.\n(iii) If termination is due to a Political Event, Termination Payment payable to the Concessionaire\nshall be the same as that stipulated for termination due to a Concessioning Authority Event of\nDefault under Article 17.1 (c).\nProvided, no Termination Payment shall be payable to the Concessionaire if the Concessionaire\nfails to maintain Insurance Cover as contemplated under Article 12 of this Agreement.\n(b) Termination due to Concessionaire Event of Default\n(i) If the termination is after the COD, due to a Concessionaire Event of Default, the Termination\nPayment payable by the Concessioning Authority to the Concessionaire shall be an amount\nequal to:\na. 90% of the Debt Due less Insurance Cover; and\nb. 70% of the amount representing the Additional Termination Payment:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0506",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 506,
    "page_start": 97,
    "page_end": 97,
    "char_start": 225613,
    "char_end": 225615,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "93",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0507",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 507,
    "page_start": 97,
    "page_end": 97,
    "char_start": 225617,
    "char_end": 226033,
    "char_count": 416,
    "text": "Provided that if any insurance claims forming part of the Insurance Cover are not admitted and\npaid, then 80% of such unpaid claims shall be included in the computation of Debt Due.\nFor the avoidance of doubt, the Concessionaire hereby acknowledges that no Termination\nPayment shall be due or payable on account of a Concessionaire Default occurring prior to COD,\nsave and except as provided in Clause 17.1 (b) (ii).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0508",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 508,
    "page_start": 97,
    "page_end": 97,
    "char_start": 226034,
    "char_end": 227059,
    "char_count": 1025,
    "text": "(ii) Upon termination on account of Concessionaire Default during the Construction Period, no\nTermination Payment shall be due and payable for and in respect of expenditure comprising\nthe first 30% of the Total Project Cost and in the event of expenditure exceeding such 30% and\nforming part of Debt Due, the provisions of Clause 42.3.1 shall, to the extent applicable to Debt\nDue, apply in respect of the expenditure exceeding such 30%. For the avoidance of doubt and\nby way of illustration, the Parties agree that if the total expenditure incurred prior to termination\nis 90%of the Total Project Cost, the expenditure eligible for computation of Termination\nPayment hereunder shall be 60% of the Total Project Cost and the Termination Payment due\nand payable in such event shall not exceed 54% of the Total Project Cost or 90% of the Debt\nDue.\nProvided, no Termination Payment shall be payable to the Concessionaire if the Concessionaire\nfails to maintain Insurance Cover as contemplated under Article 12 of this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
