    "char_start": 227060,
    "char_end": 227295,
    "char_count": 235,
    "text": "(c) Termination due to Concessioning Authority Event of Default\nIf the termination is due to a Concessioning Authority Event of Default, the Termination Payment\npayable by the Concessioning Authority shall be equal to the aggregate of:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0510",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 510,
    "page_start": 97,
    "page_end": 97,
    "char_start": 227296,
    "char_end": 227768,
    "char_count": 472,
    "text": "(i)   Debt Due less Insurance Cover;\n(ii)   150% of the Adjusted Equity; and\n(iii)  115% of the amount representing the Additional Termination Payment\n17.2 No Compensation on Expiry of Concession Period\nIn the event of expiry of Concession by efflux of time (the Concession having run its full course), the\nConcessionaire shall hand over/ transfer peaceful possession of the Project Site, Port’s Assets and\nthe Project Facilities and Services free of cost and Encumbrance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
