    "char_end": 228004,
    "char_count": 230,
    "text": "17.3 Transfer Fee and Charges\nTransfer costs, stamp duties, notary fees and taxes, if applicable, for the transfer of the Project\nFacilities and Services consequent to the expiry or termination of this Agreement shall be borne by:",
