    "page_end": 98,
    "char_start": 228005,
    "char_end": 228128,
    "char_count": 123,
    "text": "(a) the Concessionaire in the event of expiry of Concession Period or termination due to a\nConcessionaire Event of Default;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0514",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 514,
    "page_start": 98,
    "page_end": 98,
    "char_start": 228129,
    "char_end": 228262,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "(b) the Concessioning Authority in the event of termination due to a Concessioning Authority Event\nof Default or Political Event; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0515",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 515,
    "page_start": 98,
    "page_end": 98,
    "char_start": 228263,
    "char_end": 230039,
    "char_count": 1776,
    "text": "(c) by both parties equally in case of termination due to Change in Law or Non-Political Event or\nOther Event.\n17.4 Payment of Compensation to Senior Lenders\nThe Concessionaire hereby irrevocably authorises the Concessioning Authority to pay to the Senior\nLenders or at their instruction to any designated bank account in India the Termination Payment\npayable to the Concessionaire. The Concessionaire confirms that upon such payment being made,\nthe Concessioning Authority shall stand duly discharged of its obligations regarding payment of\nTermination Payment under this Agreement and the charge created by the Concessionaire in\nfavour of the Senior Lenders on any of its assets taken over by the Concessioning Authority shall\nstand satisfied and all such assets shall on and from the Transfer Date be free from such charge.\nThe Concessionaire further confirms that payment of Termination Payment by Concessioning\nAuthority in accordance with this Article 17.4 shall be a valid discharge to the Concessioning\nAuthority in respect of Concessioning Authority’s obligation regarding payment of Termination\nPayment to the Concessionaire under this Agreement.\nProvided\nnotwithstanding\nanything\ninconsistent\ncontained\nin\nthis\nAgreement,\nthe\nConcessionaire/the Senior Lenders as the case may be shall be entitled to remove at its/ their cost\nall such moveables which are not taken over by the Concessioning Authority and to deal with the\nsame in accordance with their respective rights under law.\nProvided further, if there are no amounts outstanding under the Financing Documents and a\ncertificate to that effect issued by the Senior Lenders is furnished by the Concessionaire to the\nConcessioning Authority, the Termination Payment shall be paid by the Concessioning Authority to",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0516",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 516,
