    "text": "ARTICLE 18\nTRANSFER ON EXPIRY OF THE CONCESSION PERIOD\n18.1 General Scope of Transfer/Payment\nThe Parties shall perform/discharge their respective obligations to be performed or discharged\nunder the provisions of this Agreement on the Transfer Date in entirety. Without prejudice to the\ngenerality of this provision and the provisions of Article 16, the transactions to be consummated and\nthe formalities to be completed by the Parties on the Transfer Date shall be as set out in Articles\n18.2 and 18.3.\n18.2 Concessionaire’s Obligations\nThe Concessionaire shall;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
