    "page_start": 102,
    "page_end": 102,
    "char_start": 236522,
    "char_end": 238309,
    "char_count": 1787,
    "text": "(g) at its cost, remove within 90 (ninety) days from expiry of the Concession Period, from the\nProject Site/Port’s Assets, any moveable assets that are not taken over by or not to be\ntransferred to the Concessioning Authority in terms of the provisions of this Agreement.\n18.3 Concessioning Authority’s Obligations\nExcept in the event of expiry of the Concession by efflux of time, the Concessioning Authority shall\npay Termination Payment payable to the Concessionaire in accordance with Article 17.1 of this\nAgreement, to the Senior Lenders, or deposit the same in the Escrow Account or on the written\ninstructions of the Senior Lenders to any designated bank account in India, or to the\nConcessionaire, as the case may be. The Concessionaire confirms that upon such payment being\nmade, the Concessioning Authority shall stand duly discharged of its obligations regarding payment\nof compensation under this Agreement and the charge created by the Concessionaire in favour of\nthe Senior Lenders on any of the assets shall stand satisfied and all such assets shall on and from\nthe Transfer Date be free from such charge.\nThe Concessionaire further confirms that payment of compensation by Concessioning Authority in\naccordance with this Article 18.3 shall be a valid discharge to the Concessioning Authority in\nrespect of Concessioning Authority’s obligation regarding payment of compensation to the\nConcessionaire under this Agreement.\n18.4 Risk\nUntil transfer in accordance with this Article 18, the Port’s Assets and the Project Facilities and\nServices shall remain at the sole risk of the Concessionaire except for any loss or damage caused\nto or suffered by the Concessionaire due to any act or omission or negligence on the part of the\nConcessioning Authority under this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0534",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 534,
    "page_start": 102,
    "page_end": 102,
    "char_start": 238310,
    "char_end": 238854,
    "char_count": 544,
    "text": "18.5 Vesting Certificate\nThe divestment of all rights, title and interest in the Project shall be deemed to be complete on the\ndate when all of the obligations under Clause 18.2 and 18.3 hereinabove have been fulfilled, and the\nConcessioning Authority shall, without unreasonable delay, thereupon issue a certificate substantially\nin the form set forth in Appendix23 (the “Vesting Certificate”), which will have the effect of constituting\nevidence of divestment by the Concessionaire of all of its rights, title and interest in the Project, and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0535",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 535,
    "page_start": 103,
