    "page_end": 103,
    "char_start": 238860,
    "char_end": 239295,
    "char_count": 435,
    "text": "their vesting in the Concessioning Authority pursuant hereto. It is expressly agreed that any defect or\ndeficiency in the obligations under Clause 18.2 and 18.3 shall not in any manner be construed or\ninterpreted as restricting the exercise of any rights by the Concessioning Authority or its nominee on,\nor in respect of, the Project on the footing that all obligations under Clause 18.2 have been complied\nwith by the Concessionaire.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
