    "char_end": 249472,
    "char_count": 493,
    "text": "20.3 Disclosure\nIn the event that any occurrence or circumstance comes to the attention of either Party that renders\nany of its aforesaid representations or warranties untrue or incorrect, such Party shall immediately\nnotify the other Party of the same. Such notification shall not have the effect of remedying any breach\nof the representation or warranty that has been found to be untrue or incorrect nor shall it adversely\naffect or waive any obligation of either Party under this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
