    "char_count": 298,
    "text": "Tariff therefore, (b) Tariff charged and received, and other revenues derived from the Project and\nany other assets associated with the Project and earned directly by the Concessionaire (c) such\nother information as the Concessioning Authority may reasonably require.\n21.2.2 Appointment of Auditors",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0576",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 576,
    "page_start": 110,
    "page_end": 110,
    "char_start": 252191,
    "char_end": 252626,
    "char_count": 435,
    "text": "(a) The Concessionaire shall appoint, and have during the subsistence of this Agreement as its\nStatutory Auditors, a firm chosen by it from the mutually agreed list of 5 (five) reputable firms of\nchartered accountants (“Panel of Chartered Accountants”), such list to be prepared substantially\nin accordance with the criteria set forth in Appendix22. All fees and expenses of the Statutory\nAuditors shall be borne by the Concessionaire.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0577",
