    "paragraph_index": 577,
    "page_start": 110,
    "page_end": 110,
    "char_start": 252627,
    "char_end": 252879,
    "char_count": 252,
    "text": "(b) The Concessionaire may terminate the appointment of its Statutory Auditors after a notice of 45\n(forty-five) days to the Concessioning Authority, subject to the replacement Statutory Auditors\nbeing appointed from the Panel of Chartered Accountants.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
