    "char_start": 275712,
    "char_end": 276168,
    "char_count": 456,
    "text": "or the Concessionaire’s shares. It is hereby acknowledged by the Parties that the rights of the\nSenior Lenders/Senior Lenders’ Representative are irrevocable and shall not be contested in\nany proceedings before any court or Concessioning Authority and the Concessionaire shall\nhave no right or remedy to prevent, obstruct or restrain the Concessioning Authority or the\nSenior Lenders/Senior Lenders’ Representative from effecting or causing the transfer by",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
