    "char_start": 285265,
    "char_end": 285716,
    "char_count": 451,
    "text": "APPENDIX 4\nSCOPE OF WORK\n[This Appendix shall contain the key project requirements and the Construction Standards,\nOperations and Maintenance Standards and Safety Standards. The indicative standards and\nnorms in this regard have been set out in the annexure.]\nProject Facilities and Services:\nA brief description of Project Facilities and Services shall be provided. Also, certain key project\nfacilities shall be set out, for example:\n(i) Berth length",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
