    "char_start": 308000,
    "char_end": 308652,
    "char_count": 652,
    "text": "APPENDIX 5\nPROJECT SCHEDULE\n(Project Specific – key milestones shall be specified by the Concessioning Authority for example\nmilestone dates for completion of Construction Works including installation of equipment etc.\nThese should be easily identifiable and measurable. Following is an indicative table.)\nMilestone date\nActivity/level of completion of project\n[●] Days from Date of Award of Concession\n[25% of Construction Works should have\nbeen completed]\n[●] Days from Date of Award of Concession\n[50% of Construction Works should have\nbeen completed]\n[●] Days from Date of Award of Concession\n[100% of Construction Works should have\nbeen completed]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0673",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 673,
    "page_start": 143,
