    "char_count": 376,
    "text": "furnished in their editable digital format or in such other medium or manner as may be\nacceptable to the Concessioning Authority.\n11.6 Wherever no period has been specified for delivery of services by the Independent\nEngineer, the Independent Engineer shall act with the efficiency and urgency necessary for\ndischarging its functions in accordance with Good Industry Practice.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
