    "char_start": 326675,
    "char_end": 328342,
    "char_count": 1667,
    "text": "APPENDIX 9\nPERFORMANCE GUARANTEE\n(PROFORMA OF BANK GUARANTEE)33\nTHIS DEED OF GUARANTEE executed on this the ---- day of ----- at ------ by ---------\n--------------------------------- (Name of the Bank) having its Head/Registered office at ------\n------------------------------------------------------------- hereinafter referred to as “the Guarantor” which\nexpression shall unless it be repugnant to the subject or context thereof include its successors\nand assigns;\nIn favor of\nTHE ____________TRUST, a body corporate constituted under the provisions of the Major Port\nAuthorities Act, 2021 and having its Administrative Office at\n__________________________________________ (hereinafter referred to as “the Board” or\n“the Concessioning Authority”) which expression shall, unless repugnant to the context or\nmeaning thereof include its administrators, successors or assigns.\nWHEREAS\n(a) The Board, vide its Request for Proposal dated [●] (“the RFP”) invited duly short-listed\nbidders to implement a project envisaging\n__________________________________________________________________\n_____ (more particularly described in Appendix 1 and hereinafter referred to as\n“the Project”);\n(b) After evaluation of the bids received in response to the RFP, the Board accepted the bid of\nthe consortium comprising of __________, ________ and\n__________ (“the Consortium”) OR the Board accepted the bid of _________\nLtd. (“the Applicant”) and issued the Letter of Intent No _______________dated __________\n(“LOI”) to the Consortium/Applicant requiring, inter alia, the execution of the Concession\nAgreement, (“the Concession Agreement”) the draft whereof was provided in the RFP;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0707",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 707,
    "page_start": 151,
    "page_end": 151,
    "char_start": 328344,
    "char_end": 328388,
    "char_count": 44,
    "text": "33To be issued by a Scheduled Bank in India.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0708",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 708,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 328390,
    "char_end": 328393,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "148",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0709",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 709,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 328395,
    "char_end": 328738,
    "char_count": 343,
    "text": "(c) Pursuant to the LOI the Applicant/Consortium has promoted and incorporated a special\npurpose company _______________ (“the Concessionaire”), to enter into the Concession\nAgreement for undertaking, inter alia, the work with respect to the Project referred to in\nRecital (a) above and to perform and discharge all its obligations thereunder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0710",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 710,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 328739,
    "char_end": 329123,
    "char_count": 384,
    "text": "(d) In terms of the LOI and the Concession Agreement, the Concessionaire is required to\nfurnish to the Board, a Performance Guarantee being an unconditional and irrevocable Bank\nGuarantee from a Scheduled Bank for a sum of Rs. [●] (Rupees [●] only) as security for due\nand punctual performance/discharge of its obligations under the Concession Agreement\nduring the Construction Phase,",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0711",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 711,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 329124,
    "char_end": 329467,
    "char_count": 343,
    "text": "(e) At the request of the Concessionaire, and for valid consideration the Guarantor has agreed\nto provide guarantee, being these presents guaranteeing the due and punctual\nperformance/discharge by the Concessionaire of its obligations under the Concession\nAgreement during the Construction Phase.\nNOW THEREFORE THIS DEED WITNESSETH AS FOLLOWS:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0712",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 712,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 329468,
    "char_end": 329598,
    "char_count": 130,
    "text": "1. Capitalized terms used herein but not defined shall have the meaning assigned to them\nrespectively in the Concession Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0713",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 713,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 329599,
    "char_end": 329842,
    "char_count": 243,
    "text": "2. The Guarantor hereby irrevocably and unconditionally guarantees the due execution and\npunctual performance by M/s.__________________ (“the Concessionaire”) of all its\nobligations under the Concession Agreement during the Construction Phase.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0714",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 714,
    "page_start": 152,
    "page_end": 152,
    "char_start": 329843,
    "char_end": 330978,
    "char_count": 1135,
    "text": "3. The Guarantor shall, without demur or protest, pay to the Board sums not exceeding in\naggregate Rs. [●] (Rupees [●] only) within five (5) calendar Days of receipt of a written\ndemand therefor from the Board stating that the Concessionaire has failed to meet its\nperformance obligations under the Concession Agreement during the Construction Phase.\nThe Guarantor shall not go into the veracity of any breach or failure on the part of the\nConcessionaire or validity of demand so made by the Board and shall pay the amount\nspecified in the demand notwithstanding any direction to the contrary given or any dispute\nwhatsoever raised by the Concessionaire or any other Person before any court, tribunal,\nexpert, arbitrator or similar proceedings. The Guarantor’s obligations hereunder shall subsist\nuntil all such demands of the Board are duly met and discharged in accordance with the\nprovisions hereof. Any such demand made on the Guarantor by the Board shall be\nconclusive, absolute and unequivocal as regards the amount due and payable by the\nGuarantor under this Agreement. The Concessioning Authority shall at all times at its sole",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0715",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 715,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 330980,
    "char_end": 330983,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "149",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0716",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 716,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 330985,
    "char_end": 331103,
    "char_count": 118,
    "text": "discretion have the absolute and unconditional right to call upon the Guarantor to pay the\namount under the Guarantee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0717",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 717,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 331104,
    "char_end": 331918,
    "char_count": 814,
    "text": "4. In order to give effect to this Guarantee, the Board shall be entitled to treat the Guarantor as\nthe principal debtor. The obligations of the Guarantor shall not be affected by any variations\nin the terms and conditions of the Concession Agreement or other documents or by the\nextension of time for performance granted by the Board or postponement/non exercise/\ndelayed exercise of any of its rights by the Board or any indulgence shown by the Board to\nthe Concessionaire and the Guarantor shall not be relieved from its obligations under this\nGuarantee on account of any such variation, extension, postponement, non-exercise or\ndelayed exercise by the Board of any of the Board’s rights or any indulgence shown by the\nBoard; provided nothing contained herein shall enlarge the Guarantor’s obligation\nhereunder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0718",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 718,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 331919,
    "char_end": 332308,
    "char_count": 389,
    "text": "5. This Guarantee shall be unconditional and irrevocable and shall remain in full force and\neffect until Scheduled Project Completion Date and for a period of twelve months thereafter\nunless discharged/released earlier by the Board in accordance with the provisions of the\nConcession Agreement. The Guarantor’s liability in aggregate shall be limited to a sum of\nRs. [●] (Rupees [●] only).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0719",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 719,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 332309,
    "char_end": 332586,
    "char_count": 277,
    "text": "6. This Guarantee shall not be affected by any change in the constitution or winding up,\ninsolvency, bankruptcy, dissolution or liquidation of the Concessionaire/ the Guarantor or\nany absorption, merger or amalgamation of the Concessionaire/the Guarantor with any\nother Person.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0720",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 720,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 332587,
    "char_end": 332792,
    "char_count": 205,
    "text": "7. Any payment made hereunder shall be made free and clear of, and without deduction for or\non account of taxes, levies, imposts, duties, charges, fees, deductions, or withholding of any\nnature whatsoever.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0721",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 721,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 332793,
    "char_end": 332931,
    "char_count": 138,
    "text": "8. The Guarantor hereby irrevocably and unconditionally undertakes, agrees and\nacknowledges that its obligations as a Guarantor hereunder:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0722",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 722,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 332932,
    "char_end": 333117,
    "char_count": 185,
    "text": "(a) shall not be affected by the existence of or release or variation of any other guarantee or\nsecurity for any of the obligations of the Concessionaire under the Concession\nAgreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0723",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 723,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 333118,
    "char_end": 333244,
    "char_count": 126,
    "text": "(b) shall not be affected by any failure by the Concessioning Authority to perform any of its\nobligations under the Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0724",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 724,
    "page_start": 153,
    "page_end": 153,
    "char_start": 333245,
    "char_end": 333376,
    "char_count": 131,
    "text": "(c) shall not be affected by any failure or delay in payment of any fee or other amount\npayable to the Guarantor in respect hereof;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0725",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 725,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 333378,
    "char_end": 333381,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "150",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0726",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 726,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 333383,
    "char_end": 333596,
    "char_count": 213,
    "text": "(d) shall not be affected by any exercise or non-exercise of any right, remedy, power or\nprivilege of any person under or in respect of any payment obligations of the\nConcessionaire under the Concession Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0727",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 727,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 333597,
    "char_end": 333815,
    "char_count": 218,
    "text": "(e) shall not be affected by any failure, omission or delay on the Concessioning Authority’s\npart to enforce, assert or to exercise any right, power or remedy conferred on the\nConcessioning Authority in this Guarantee;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0728",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 728,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 333816,
    "char_end": 334066,
    "char_count": 250,
    "text": "(f) shall not be affected by any act, omission, matter or thing which, but for this clause\nwould reduce, release or prejudice the Guarantor from any of the obligations under this\nGuarantee or prejudice or diminish the obligations in whole or in part.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0729",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 729,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 334067,
    "char_end": 334538,
    "char_count": 471,
    "text": "9. The obligations, covenants, agreements and duties herein shall not be subject to any\ncounterclaims, cross claims, set offs, deductions, withholdings, diminutions, abatements,\nrecoupments, suspensions, deferments, reductions or defense for any reason whatsoever\nand the Guarantor, shall have no right to terminate this Guarantee or to be released,\nrelieved or discharged from any of its obligations, covenants, agreements and duties\nhereunder for any reason whatsoever.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0730",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 730,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 334539,
    "char_end": 334758,
    "char_count": 219,
    "text": "10. The Guarantor has power to issue this guarantee and discharge the obligations\ncontemplated herein, and the undersigned is duly authorized to execute this Guarantee\npursuant to the power granted under ______________.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0731",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 731,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 334759,
    "char_end": 335807,
    "char_count": 1048,
    "text": "11. This Guarantee shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India.\nThe Guarantor hereby irrevocably submits to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Court of\n_______ for the purposes of any suit, action, or other proceeding arising out of this\nGuarantee, or the subject matter hereof, brought by the Concessioning Authority or its\nsuccessors or assigns. To the extent permitted by Applicable Law, the Guarantor or its\nsuccessors or assigns hereby waive, and shall not assert, by way of motion, as defense, or\notherwise, in any such suit, action, or proceeding any claim that such suit, action, or\nproceedings is brought in an inconvenient forum, or that the value of such suit, action, or\nproceeding is improper, or that the subject matter hereof may not be enforced in or by such\ncourt.\nIN WITNESS WHEREOF THE GUARANTOR HAS SET ITS HANDS HEREUNTO ON THE\nDAY, MONTH AND YEAR FIRST HEREINABOVE WRITTEN\nSIGNED AND DELIVERED by\n________________ Bank by the hand of Shri ________________ its_______________ and\nauthorized official.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0732",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 732,
    "page_start": 155,
    "page_end": 155,
    "char_start": 335809,
    "char_end": 335812,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "151",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0733",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 733,
    "page_start": 155,
    "page_end": 155,
    "char_start": 335814,
    "char_end": 336758,
    "char_count": 944,
    "text": "APPENDIX 10\nCERTIFICATES\nCOMPLETION CERTIFICATE\n1. I, [●] (Name of the Independent Engineer), acting as Independent Engineer, under and in\naccordance with the Agreement dated [●], for the [●] Project on build, operate and transfer\n(BOT) basis, through [(Name of Concessionaire)], hereby certify that the Tests specified in\nArticle [●] and Schedule-[●] of the Agreement have been successfully undertaken to\ndetermine compliance of the Project with the provisions of the Agreement, and I am satisfied\nthat the Project can be safely and reliably placed in commercial service of the users thereof.\n2. It is certified that, in terms of the aforesaid Agreement, all works forming part of the Project\nhave been completed, and the Project is hereby declared fit for entry into commercial\noperation on this the [●] day of [●] 20[●].\nSIGNED, SEALED AND DELIVERED For and on behalf of\nthe INDEPENDENT ENGINER by:\n(Signature)\n(Name)\n(Designation)\n(Address)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0734",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 734,
    "page_start": 156,
    "page_end": 156,
    "char_start": 336760,
    "char_end": 336763,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "152",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0735",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 735,
    "page_start": 156,
    "page_end": 156,
    "char_start": 336765,
    "char_end": 338550,
    "char_count": 1785,
    "text": "PROVISIONAL CERTIFICATE\n1. I, [[●] (Name of the Independent Engineer)], acting as Independent Engineer, under and in\naccordance with the Agreement dated [●], for the Project on build, operate and transfer\n(BOT) basis through [● (Name of Concessionaire)], hereby certify that the Tests specified in\nArticle [●] and Schedule-[●] of the Agreement have been undertaken to determine\ncompliance of the Project with the provisions of the Agreement.\n2. Construction Works that were found to be incomplete and/or deficient have been specified in\nthe Punch List appended to the Provisional Certificate, and the Concessionaire has agreed\nand accepted that it shall complete and/or rectify all such works in the time and manner set\nforth in the Agreement. [Some of the incomplete works have been delayed as a result of\nreasons attributable to the Concessioning Authority or due to Force Majeure and the\nProvisional Certificate cannot be withheld on this account. Though the remaining incomplete\nworks have been delayed as a result of reasons attributable to the Concessionaire,] I am\nsatisfied that having regard to the nature and extent of such incomplete works, it would not\nbe prudent to withhold commercial operation of the Project, pending completion thereof.\n3. In view of the foregoing, I am satisfied that the Project can be safely and reliably placed in\ncommercial service of the users thereof, and in terms of the Agreement, the Project is\nhereby provisionally declared fit for entry into commercial operation on this the [●] day of [●]\n20[●].\nACCEPTED, SIGNED, SEALED AND\nSIGNED, SEALED AND DELIVERED\nDELIVERED For and on behalf of\nFor and on behalf of INDEPENDENT\nCONCESSIONAIRE by:\nENGINEER by:\n(Signature)\n(Signature)\n(Name and Designation)\n(Name and Designation)\n(Address)\n(Address)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
