    "char_start": 348770,
    "char_end": 349081,
    "char_count": 311,
    "text": "1. [● LIMITED], a company incorporated under the provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 and\nhaving its registered office at [●] (hereinafter referred to as the “Concessionaire” which\nexpression shall, unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof, include its\nsuccessors, permitted assigns and substitutes);",
