    "char_count": 434,
    "text": "2. [● (name and particulars of Senior Lenders' Representative)] and having its registered office\nat [●] acting for and on behalf of the Senior Lenders as their duly authorised agent with\nregard to matters arising out of or in relation to this Agreement (hereinafter referred to as the\n“Senior Lenders' Representative” which expression shall, unless repugnant to the context or\nmeaning thereof, include its successors and substitutes);",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
