    "char_start": 349517,
    "char_end": 349772,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "3. [● (name and particulars of the Escrow Bank)] and having its registered office at [●]\n(hereinafter referred to as the “Escrow Bank” which expression shall, unless repugnant to\nthe context or meaning thereof, include its successors and substitutes); and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
