    "paragraph_index": 766,
    "page_start": 166,
    "page_end": 166,
    "char_start": 349773,
    "char_end": 350302,
    "char_count": 529,
    "text": "4. BOARD OF TRUSTEES for __________________ PORT, a body corporate constituted\nunder the provisions of the Major Port Authorities Act, 2021 and having its Administrative\nOffice at _____________________________________\n__________________________________________________________________\n_____________________________________________________, hereinafter referred to as\n“the Concessioning Authority” (which expression shall, unless repugnant to the context or\nmeaning thereof, include its successors and permitted assigns);\nWHEREAS:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0767",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 767,
    "page_start": 166,
    "page_end": 166,
    "char_start": 350303,
    "char_end": 350479,
    "char_count": 176,
    "text": "A. The Concessioning Authority has entered into a Concession Agreement dated [●] with the\nConcessionaire (the “Concession Agreement”) for undertaking the Project (as defined in",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0768",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 768,
    "page_start": 167,
    "page_end": 167,
    "char_start": 350481,
    "char_end": 350484,
    "char_count": 3,
