    "char_start": 351984,
    "char_end": 353717,
    "char_count": 1733,
    "text": "“Parties” means the parties to this Agreement collectively and “Party” shall mean any of the\nParties to this Agreement individually;\n“Payment Date” means, in relation to any payment specified in Clause 4.1, the date(s)\nspecified for such payment; and\n“Quarter” means, any three-month period from 1stApril to 30thJune, 1stJuly to30th September,\n1stOctober to 31stDecember or 1stJanuary to 31stMarch.\n1.2\nInterpretation\n1.2.1 References to Senior Lenders' Representative shall, unless repugnant to the context or\nmeaning thereof, mean references to the Senior Lenders' Representative, acting for and on\nbehalf of Senior Lenders.\n1.2.2 The words and expressions beginning with capital letters and defined in this Agreement\nshall have the meaning ascribed thereto herein, and the words and expressions used in this\nAgreement and not defined herein but defined in the Concession Agreement shall, unless\nrepugnant to the context, have the meaning ascribed thereto in the Concession Agreement.\n1.2.3 References to Articles are, unless stated otherwise, references to Articles of this\nAgreement.\n1.2.4 The rules of interpretation stated in Articles 1.3, 1.4 and 1.5 of the Concession Agreement\nshall apply, mutatis mutandis, to this Agreement.\n2. ESCROW ACCOUNT\n2.1\nEscrow Bank to act as Trustee\n2.1.1 The Concessionaire hereby settles in trust with the Escrow Bank a sum of Rs. 100\n(Rupees Hundred Only) appoints the Escrow Bank to act as trustee for the Concessioning\nAuthority, the Senior Lenders, the Senior Lenders' Representative and the Concessionaire in\nconnection herewith and authorises the Escrow Bank to exercise such rights, powers,\nauthorities and discretion as are specifically delegated to the Escrow Bank by the terms hereof",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0772",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 772,
    "page_start": 169,
    "page_end": 169,
    "char_start": 353719,
    "char_end": 353722,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "165",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0773",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 773,
    "page_start": 169,
    "page_end": 169,
    "char_start": 353724,
    "char_end": 355488,
    "char_count": 1764,
    "text": "together with all such rights, powers, authorities and discretion as are reasonably incidental\nhereto, and the Escrow Bank accepts such appointment pursuant to the terms hereof.\n2.1.2 The Concessionaire hereby declares that all rights, title and interest in and to the Escrow\nAccount shall be vested in the Escrow Bank and held in trust for the Concessioning Authority,\nthe Senior Lenders, the Senior Lenders' Representative and the Concessionaire, and applied in\naccordance with the terms of this Agreement. No person other than the Concessioning\nAuthority, the Senior Lenders/Senior Lenders' Representative and the Concessionaire shall\nhave any rights hereunder as the beneficiaries of, or as third-party beneficiaries under this\nAgreement.\n2.2\nAcceptance of Escrow Bank\nThe Escrow Bank hereby agrees to act as such and to accept all payments and other amounts\nto be delivered to and held by the Escrow Bank pursuant to the provisions of this Agreement.\nThe Escrow Bank shall hold and safeguard the Escrow Account during the term of this\nAgreement and shall treat the amount in the Escrow Account as monies deposited by the\nConcessionaire, Senior Lenders or the Concessioning Authority with the Escrow Bank. In\nperforming its functions and duties under this Agreement, the Escrow Bank shall act in trust for\nthe benefit of, and as agent for, the Concessioning Authority, the Senior Lenders'\nRepresentative and the Concessionaire or their nominees, successors or assigns, in\naccordance with the provisions of this Agreement.\n2.3\nEstablishment and Operation of Escrow Account\n2.3.1 Within 30 (thirty) Days from the date of this Agreement, and in any case prior to the Date\nof Award of Concession, the Concessionaire shall open and establish the Escrow Account with",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0774",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 774,
    "page_start": 169,
    "page_end": 169,
    "char_start": 355489,
    "char_end": 356926,
    "char_count": 1437,
    "text": "the [(name of Branch)] Branch of the Escrow Bank. The Escrow Account shall be denominated\nin Rupees.\n2.3.2 The Escrow Bank shall maintain the Escrow Account in accordance with the terms of this\nAgreement and its usual practices and applicable regulations and pay the maximum rate of\ninterest payable to similar customers on the balance in the said account from time to time.\n2.3.3 The Concessionaire shall submit to the Escrow Bank a Budget within 7 (seven) Days of\nthe commencement of each Financial Year. Till the pendency of the financing Documents, such\nBudget shall be approved by the Senior Lenders/Senior Lenders Representative and thereafter\nby the Concessioning Authority.\n2.3.4 The Escrow Bank and the Concessionaire shall, after consultation with the Senior\nLenders' Representative, agree on the detailed mandates, terms and conditions, and operating\nprocedures for the Escrow Account, but in the event of any conflict or inconsistency between\nthis Agreement and such mandates, terms and conditions, or procedures, this Agreement shall\nprevail.\n2.4\nEscrow Bank's Fee\nThe Escrow Bank shall be entitled to receive its fee and expenses in an amount, and at such\ntimes, as may be agreed between the Escrow Bank and the Concessionaire. For the avoidance\nof doubt, such fee and expenses shall form part of the operating and maintaining expenses and\nshall be appropriated from the Escrow Account in accordance with Article 4.1.1 (c).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0775",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 775,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 356928,
    "char_end": 356931,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "166",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0776",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 776,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 356933,
    "char_end": 357830,
    "char_count": 897,
    "text": "2.5\nRights of the Parties\nThe rights of the Concessioning Authority, the Senior Lenders (through the Senior Lenders'\nRepresentative) and the Concessionaire in the monies held in the Escrow Account are set forth\nin their entirety in this Agreement and the Concessioning Authority, the Senior Lenders' and the\nConcessionaire shall have no other rights against or to the monies in the Escrow Account.\n2.6\nSubstitution of the Concessionaire\nThe Parties hereto acknowledge and agree that upon substitution of the Concessionaire with\nthe Selectee, pursuant to the Substitution Agreement, it shall be deemed for the purposes of\nthis Agreement that the Selectee is a Party hereto and the Selectee shall accordingly be\ndeemed to have succeeded to the rights and obligations of the Concessionaire under this\nAgreement on and with effect from the date of substitution of the Concessionaire with the\nSelectee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0777",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 777,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 357831,
    "char_end": 358004,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "3. DEPOSITS INTO ESCROW ACCOUNT\n3.1\nDeposits by the Concessionaire\nThe Concessionaire agrees and undertakes that it shall deposit into and/or credit the Escrow\nAccount with:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0778",
