    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358005,
    "char_end": 358120,
    "char_count": 115,
    "text": "(a) all monies received in relation to the Project from Banks, other lenders, shareholders and\ninsurance companies;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0779",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 779,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358121,
    "char_end": 358280,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "(b) all Tariff and any other revenues from or in respect of the Project, including the proceeds of\nany rentals, deposits, capital receipts or insurance claims;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0780",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 780,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358281,
    "char_end": 358398,
    "char_count": 117,
    "text": "(c) all Tariff collected by the Concessioning Authority in exercise of its rights under the\nConcession Agreement; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0781",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 781,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358399,
    "char_end": 358511,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "(d) all payments by the Concessioning Authority, after deduction of any outstanding License\nFee and Royalty; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0782",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 782,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358512,
    "char_end": 358953,
    "char_count": 441,
    "text": "(e) termination Payment\nFor avoidance of doubt, all amounts received by the Concessionaire in respect of the\nProject/Project Facilities and Services excepting any amounts in respect of cesses and duties\ncollected by it from the users on behalf of the Concessioning Authority or such other authority in\naccordance with the Concession Agreement or pursuant to any other instructions in respect\nthereof shall be deposited in the Escrow Account.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0783",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 783,
    "page_start": 170,
    "page_end": 170,
    "char_start": 358954,
    "char_end": 359512,
    "char_count": 558,
    "text": "4. WITHDRAWALS FROM ESCROW ACCOUNT\n4.1.1 Withdrawals during Concession Period\nAt the beginning of every month, or at such shorter intervals as the Lenders' Representative and\nthe Concessionaire may by written instructions determine, the Escrow Bank shall withdraw\namounts from the Escrow Account and appropriate them in the following order by depositing\nsuch amounts in the relevant Sub-Accounts for making due payments, and if such payments are\nnot due in any month, then retain such monies in such Sub-Accounts and pay out therefrom on\nthe Payment Date(s):",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
