    "page_end": 171,
    "char_start": 360241,
    "char_end": 360547,
    "char_count": 306,
    "text": "(h) balance, if any, in accordance with the instructions of the Concessionaire.\n4.1.2 Withdrawals upon Termination\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, all amounts standing to\nthe credit of the Escrow Account shall, upon termination, be appropriated in the following order:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0792",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 792,
    "page_start": 171,
    "page_end": 171,
    "char_start": 360548,
    "char_end": 360634,
    "char_count": 86,
    "text": "(a) all taxes due and payable by the Concessionaire for and in respect of the Project;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
