    "text": "(a) towards taxes and statutory dues payable by the Concessionaire;\n(b) compensation to Senior Lenders in terms of the Financing Documents towards discharge of\nthe Concessionaire’s liability under such Financing Documents;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
