    "page_end": 172,
    "char_start": 362138,
    "char_end": 362426,
    "char_count": 288,
    "text": "(c) all amounts due to the Concessioning Authority and amounts payable towards transfer of\nthe Project Facilities and Services by the Concessionaire in accordance with this\nAgreement; and the Concessionaire shall be at liberty to withdraw any sums outstanding in\nthe Escrow Account after:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0801",
