    "paragraph_index": 802,
    "page_start": 172,
    "page_end": 172,
    "char_start": 362614,
    "char_end": 362741,
    "char_count": 127,
    "text": "(ii) the Escrow Agent has received a confirmation of final settlement by the Senior Lenders\nand/or Concessioning Authority; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0803",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 803,
    "page_start": 172,
    "page_end": 172,
    "char_start": 362742,
    "char_end": 363800,
    "char_count": 1058,
    "text": "(iii) Vesting Certificate has been issued by the Concessioning Authority under the provisions\nof Clause 18.5.\n4.2\nApplication of insurance proceeds\nNotwithstanding anything in this Agreement, the proceeds from all insurance claims, except life\nand injury, shall be deposited into and/or credited to the Escrow Account and utilised for any\nnecessary repair, reconstruction, reinstatement, replacement, improvement, delivery or\ninstallation of the Project/Project facilities and Services, and the balance remaining, if any, shall\nbe applied in accordance with the provisions contained in this behalf in the Financing\nDocuments.\n4.3\nWithdrawals during Suspension\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, in case the Escrow\nBank receives a notice in writing from the Concession Authority that the rights of the\nConcessionaire are suspended in accordance with the Concession Agreement or a Termination\nNotice is issued, the Escrow Bank shall until such notice is withdrawn, act only on the\ninstructions of the Concessioning Authority.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0804",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 804,
    "page_start": 172,
    "page_end": 172,
    "char_start": 363801,
    "char_end": 364155,
    "char_count": 354,
    "text": "5. OBLIGATIONS OF THE ESCROW BANK\n5.1\nSegregation of funds\nMonies and other property received by the Escrow Bank under this Agreement shall, until used\nor applied in accordance with this Agreement, be held by the Escrow Bank in trust for the\npurposes for which they were received, and shall be segregated from other funds and property\nof the Escrow Bank.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0805",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 805,
    "page_start": 173,
    "page_end": 173,
    "char_start": 364157,
    "char_end": 364160,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "169",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0806",
