    "paragraph_index": 806,
    "page_start": 173,
    "page_end": 173,
    "char_start": 364162,
    "char_end": 364697,
    "char_count": 535,
    "text": "5.2\nNotification of balances\n7 (seven) business Days prior to each Payment Date (and for this purpose the Escrow Bank\nshall be entitled to rely on an affirmation by the Concessionaire and/or the Senior Lenders'\nRepresentative as to the relevant Payment Dates), the Escrow Bank shall notify the Senior\nLenders' Representative of the balances in the Escrow Account as at the close of business on\nthe immediately preceding business day.\n5.3\nCommunications and notices\nIn discharge of its duties and obligations hereunder, the Escrow Bank:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
