    "page_end": 173,
    "char_start": 364698,
    "char_end": 364947,
    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "(a) may, in the absence of bad faith or gross negligence on its part, rely as to any matters of\nfact which might reasonably be expected to be within the knowledge of the Concessionaire\nupon a certificate signed by or on behalf of the Concessionaire;",
