    "char_start": 375853,
    "char_end": 375856,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "173",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0832",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 832,
    "page_start": 177,
    "page_end": 177,
    "char_start": 375858,
    "char_end": 376038,
    "char_count": 180,
    "text": "10.7 Survival\n10.7.1 Termination of this Agreement:\n(a) shall not relieve the Parties of any obligations hereunder which expressly or by implication\nsurvive termination hereof; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0833",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 833,
    "page_start": 177,
    "page_end": 177,
    "char_start": 376039,
    "char_end": 377826,
    "char_count": 1787,
    "text": "(b) except as otherwise provided in any provision of this Agreement expressly limiting the\nliability of either Party, shall not relieve either Party of any obligations or liabilities for loss· or\ndamage to the other Party arising out of, or caused by, acts or omissions of such Party prior\nto the effectiveness of such termination or arising out of such termination.\n10.7.2 All obligations surviving the cancellation, expiration or termination of this Agreement shall\nonly survive for a period of 3 (three) years following the date of such termination or expiry of this\nAgreement.\n10.8 Severability\nIf for any reason whatever any provision of this Agreement is or becomes invalid, illegal or\nunenforceable or is declared by any court of competent jurisdiction or any other instrumentality\nto be invalid, illegal or unenforceable, the validity, legality or enforceability of the remaining\nprovisions shall not be affected in any manner, and the Parties will negotiate in good faith with a\nview to agreeing to one or more provisions which may be substituted for such invalid,\nunenforceable or illegal provisions, as nearly as is practicable to such invalid, illegal or\nunenforceable provision. Failure to agree upon any such provisions shall not be subject to\ndispute resolution under Clause 10.1 of this Agreement or otherwise.\n10.9 Successors and assigns\nThis Agreement shall be binding on and shall inure to the benefit of the Parties and their\nrespective successors and permitted assigns.\n10.10 Notices\nUnless otherwise stated, notices to be given under this Agreement including but not limited to a\nnotice of waiver of any term or related or breach of any term of this Agreement shall be in\nwriting and shall be given by hand delivery, recognized international courier, mail, telex or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
