    "text": "APPENDIX 18\nKey Performance Indicators for Concessioning Authority\n[The project-specific minimum Performance Standards for Concessioning authority are\npresented in the below table]\nS. No.\nKey Performance Indicator\nIndicative norms\nDescription\n1",
