    "page_start": 224,
    "page_end": 224,
    "char_start": 438023,
    "char_end": 438116,
    "char_count": 93,
    "text": "terms. The Tribunal is not obliged to give reasons for such an award,\n40.2 The Parties shall:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-1046",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "paragraph_index": 1046,
