    "char_start": 441995,
    "char_end": 442179,
    "char_count": 184,
    "text": "2. Invitation for empanelment\n2.1 The Concessioning Authority shall invite offers from all reputed firms of Chartered\nAccountants who fulfil the following eligibility criteria, namely:",
