    "page_start": 227,
    "page_end": 227,
    "char_start": 442446,
    "char_end": 442603,
    "char_count": 157,
    "text": "(b) the firm should have at least 5 (five) practising Chartered Accountants on its rolls, each with\na minimum experience of 10 (ten) years in the profession;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-1055",
    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
