    "char_end": 443809,
    "char_count": 382,
    "text": "3. Evaluation and selection\n3.1 The information furnished by each firm shall be scrutinised and evaluated by the\nConcessioning Authority and 1 (one) point shall be awarded for each annual audit of the\ncompanies specified in Paragraph 2.2 above. (For the avoidance of doubt and by way of\nillustration, a firm which has conducted audit of the annual accounts of any such company for 5",
