    "char_start": 443810,
    "char_end": 444108,
    "char_count": 298,
    "text": "(five) years shall be awarded 5 (five) points).\n3.2  The Concessioning Authority shall prepare a list of all the eligible firms along with the points\nscored by each such firm and 5 (five) firms scoring the highest points shall be identified and\nincluded in the draft Panel of Chartered Accountants.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
