    "page_end": 228,
    "char_start": 444109,
    "char_end": 444616,
    "char_count": 507,
    "text": "4. Consultation with the Concessionaire\nThe Concessioning Authority shall convey the aforesaid panel of firms to the Concessionaire for\nscrutiny and comments, if any. The Concessionaire shall be entitled to scrutinise the relevant\nrecords of the Concessioning Authority to ascertain whether the selection of firms has been\nundertaken in accordance with the prescribed procedure and it shall send its comments, if any,\nto the Concessioning Authority within 15 (fifteen) days of receiving the aforesaid panel.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
