    "paragraph_index": 1062,
    "page_start": 228,
    "page_end": 228,
    "char_start": 444617,
    "char_end": 445213,
    "char_count": 596,
    "text": "5. Mutually agreed Panel\n5.1 The Concessioning Authority shall, after considering all relevant factors including the\ncomments, if any, of the Concessionaire, finalise and constitute a panel of 5 (five) firms which\nshall be deemed to be the mutually agreed Panel of Chartered Accountants.\n5.2  After completion of every 5 (five) years from the date of preparing the mutually agreed\nPanel of Chartered Accountants, or such earlier period as may be agreed between the\nConcessioning Authority and the Concessionaire, a new panel shall be prepared in accordance\nwith the provisions of this Appendix-22",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
