    "char_end": 446838,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "Name\nDesignation\nAddress\n\nIn presence of\n\nA)\nB)\n\nGuiding Note for Model Concession Agreement, 2021\nThe following table provides the Article-wise guiding notes for the different clauses under the\nMCA 2021:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
