    "text": "Government of India\nNITI Aayog\n(PPP Vertical)\nSansad Marg, New Delhi - 110001\n\nEngineering, Procurement and Construction of Civil Works - Model Agreement\n26 August 2019\nThe Model Agreement for Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) of Civil\nWorks\nis\nnow\navailable\non\nthe\nwebsite\nof\nNITI\nAayog\n(https://www.niti.gov.in/documents/model-agreements).\nStakeholders are requested to see the ‘EPC of Civil Works – Model Agreement’ and\nprovide written comments (if any) by or before 9 September 2019. The comments\ncan be sent in the enclosed format, preferably in electronic form, addressed to Mr.\nR. K. Bhatheja, Economic Officer (PPPAU),  on the email: rk.bhatheja@nic.in.",
