    "page_start": 29,
    "page_end": 29,
    "char_start": 40381,
    "char_end": 40604,
    "char_count": 223,
    "text": "bridge/under-bridge shall be deemed to be equal to the Damages payable under the\nprovisions of Clause 8.3 for delay in providing Right of Way for a length of 3 (three)\nkilometre for each such road over-bridge/under-bridge.]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0179",
