    "char_end": 41048,
    "char_count": 442,
    "text": "4.1.5 Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, the Parties\nexpressly agree that the aggregate Damages payable under Clauses 4.1.4, 8.3 and 9.2\nshall not exceed 3% (three per cent) of the Contract Price. For the avoidance of doubt,\nthe Damages payable by the Authority under the aforesaid Clauses shall not be additive\nif they arise concurrently from more than one cause but relate to the same part of the\nProject.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
