    "char_start": 43326,
    "char_end": 43630,
    "char_count": 304,
    "text": "Obligations relating to Operation & Maintenance\nThe Authority shall undertake the operation and maintenance of the facilities existing\nprior to the Appointed Date [including bridges, structures and signalling works] within\nthe Right of Way.\n4.3\nObligations relating to Environmental and Forest Clearances",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
