    "char_start": 60056,
    "char_end": 60243,
    "char_count": 187,
    "text": "5 The Authority may, in its discretion, omit Clause 7.5 and in lieu thereof increase the Performance Security under\nClause 7.1 from 5% (five per cent) to 7.5% (seven point five per cent).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
