    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n29\n\n7.5.1. Provided that the refund hereunder shall be made in tranches of not less than 1%\n(one per cent) of the Contract Price.\n7.5.4 Within 15 (fifteen) days of the date of issue of the Completion Certificate, the Authority\nshall discharge the bank guarantees, if any, furnished by the Contractor under the\nprovisions of Clause 7.5.3 and refund the balance of Retention Money remaining with\nthe Authority after adjusting the amounts appropriated under the provisions of Clause\n7.5.2 and the amounts refunded under the provisions of Clause 7.5.3.",
