    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "Provided that if Right of Way has not been provided within 240 (two hundred and forty)\ndays of the Appointed Date, for commencing construction on any part of the Site\nincluded in the Appendix, the affected Works shall be deemed to be withdrawn under",
