    "char_start": 129329,
    "char_end": 129492,
    "char_count": 163,
    "text": "$ The Authority shall transfer 75% (seventy five percent) of the amount so received to the first ranked bidder\nwhose bid shall have been matched by the Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0285",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 285,
    "page_start": 66,
    "page_end": 66,
    "char_start": 129494,
    "char_end": 130686,
    "char_count": 1192,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n55\n\nARTICLE 14\nTRAFFIC REGULATION6\n14.1\nTraffic regulation by the Contractor\n14.1.1 The Contractor shall take all the required measures and make arrangements for the\nsafety of Users during the construction of the Project or a Section thereof in accordance\nwith Good Industry Practice. It shall provide, erect and maintain all such barricades,\nsigns, markings, flags, and lights as may be required for the safety of the traffic passing\nthrough the Section under construction.\n14.1.2 All works shall be carried out in a manner creating least interference to the traffic\npassing through the Project or a Section thereof. In Sections where construction works\non the carriageway are taken up, the Contractor shall ensure that safe passage is\nprovided for the traffic. Where it is not possible or safe to allow traffic on part width of\nthe carriageway, a temporary diversion of reasonable specifications shall be constructed\nby the Contractor at its own cost. The Contractor shall take prior approval of the\nAuthority’s Engineer for any proposed arrangement for traffic regulation during the\nConstruction Period, which approval shall not be unreasonably withheld.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0286",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 286,
    "page_start": 66,
    "page_end": 66,
    "char_start": 130688,
    "char_end": 130792,
    "char_count": 104,
    "text": "6 This template is applicable to highway projects. It may be suitably revised in case of other projects.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0287",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 287,
    "page_start": 67,
    "page_end": 67,
