    "char_count": 606,
    "text": "(one hundred and ten per cent) of such instalment, substantially in the form provided at\nAnnex-III of Schedule-F, to remain effective till the complete and full repayment of\nsuch instalment and any interest thereon.\n17.2.4 The instalments of Advance Payment shall be paid by the Authority to the Contractor\nwithin 15 (fifteen) days of the receipt of its respective requests in accordance with the\nprovisions of this Clause 17.2.\n17.2.5 The Advance Payment shall be recovered through proportionate deductions to be made\nin the Interim Payments Certificates issued in accordance with the provisions of Clause",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0308",
