    "char_start": 220843,
    "char_end": 221098,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "after such constitution shall, instead of reference to arbitration under Clause 24.3, be\nadjudicated upon by such tribunal or other forum in accordance with Applicable Laws\nand all references to Dispute Resolution Procedure shall be construed accordingly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
