    "char_count": 508,
    "text": "the necessary particulars. In the event of delay beyond such period, the defaulting Party\nshall pay interest for the period of delay calculated at a rate equal to Bank Rate plus 3%\n(three per cent), save and except as otherwise specified in this Agreement. All interest\npayment under this Agreement shall, save and except as otherwise specified, be\ncalculated at quarterly rests, and recovery thereof shall be without prejudice to the rights\nof the Parties under this Agreement including Termination thereof.",
