    "text": "implied at law or by custom or otherwise arising out of any other agreement between\nthe Parties or any representation by either Party not contained in a binding legal\nagreement executed by both Parties.\n25.7\nSurvival\n25.7.1 Termination shall:\n(a)\nnot relieve the Contractor or the Authority, as the case may be, of any\nobligations hereunder which expressly or by implication survive Termination\nhereof; and\n(b)\nexcept as otherwise provided in any provision of this Agreement expressly\nlimiting the liability of either Party, not relieve either Party of any obligations",
