    "page_end": 122,
    "char_start": 249320,
    "char_end": 249564,
    "char_count": 244,
    "text": "“Request for Proposals” or “RFP” shall have the meaning as set forth in Recital (C);\n“Request for Qualification” or “RFQ” shall have the meaning as set forth in Recital (B);\n“Retention Money” shall have the meaning as set forth in Clause 7.5.1;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0430",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 430,
    "page_start": 122,
    "page_end": 122,
    "char_start": 249566,
    "char_end": 250003,
    "char_count": 437,
    "text": "“Right of Way” means the constructive possession of the Site free from encroachments and\nencumbrances, together with all way leaves, easements, unrestricted access and other rights of\nway, howsoever described, necessary for construction of the Project in accordance with this\nAgreement;\n“Safety Consultant” shall have the meaning as set forth in Clause 10.1.5;\n“Scheduled Completion Date” shall be the date as set forth in Clause 10.3.1;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0431",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 431,
    "page_start": 123,
