    "char_start": 257370,
    "char_end": 257603,
    "char_count": 233,
    "text": "S. No.\nLocation\nType\nFrom (km)\nTo (km)\nMasonry/cc\n(Pucca)\nEarthen\n(Kutcha)\n\n14\nMajor junctions\nThe details of major junctions are as follows:\nS.No.\nLocation\nAt\ngrade\nSeparated\nCategory of Cross Road\nFrom\n(km)\nTo (km)\nNH\nSH\nMDR\nOthers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
