    "paragraph_index": 452,
    "page_start": 131,
    "page_end": 131,
    "char_start": 257605,
    "char_end": 257957,
    "char_count": 352,
    "text": "(NH: National Highway, SH: State Highway, MDR: Major District Road)\n15\nMinor junctions\nThe details of the minor junctions are as follows:\nS. No.\nLocation\nType\nFrom (km)\nTo (km)\nT -junction\nCross road\n16\nBypasses\nThe details of the bypasses are as follows:\nS.\nNo.\nName of bypass\n(town)\nChainage (km)\n(From ---- to)\nLength\n(Km)\nCarriageway\nWidth (m)\nType",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
