    "char_start": 257959,
    "char_end": 258067,
    "char_count": 108,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n121\n\n[17\nOther structures]\n[Provide details of other structures, if any.]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0454",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 454,
    "page_start": 133,
    "page_end": 133,
    "char_start": 258069,
    "char_end": 258444,
    "char_count": 375,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n122\n\nAnnex - II\n(Schedule-A)\nDates for providing Right of Way\nThe dates on which the Authority shall provide Right of Way to the Contractor on\ndifferent Sections of the Site are specified below:\nS. No\nFrom km to km\nLength\n(km)\nWidth\n(m)\nDate of\nproviding\nROW@\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n(i) Full Right of Way\n(full width)\n(a)\nsection\n(b)\nsection\n(c) section",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
