    "page_end": 134,
    "char_start": 258704,
    "char_end": 258911,
    "char_count": 207,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n123\n\nAnnex - III\n(Schedule-A)\nAlignment Plans10\nThe existing alignment of the Project shall be modified in the following sections as per the\nalignment plan indicated below:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0458",
