    "char_start": 272407,
    "char_end": 272634,
    "char_count": 227,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n135\n\n7.3.5 Drainage system for bridge decks\n\nAn effective drainage system for bridge decks shall be provided as specified in\nparagraph 7.21 of the Manual\n7.3.6 Structures in marine environment",
