    "char_end": 276388,
    "char_count": 399,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n138\n\nSCHEDULE - C\n(See Clause 2.1)\nPROJECT FACILITIES13\n1\nProject Facilities\nThe Contractor shall construct the Project Facilities in accordance with the provisions\nof this Agreement. Such Project Facilities shall include:\n(a)\ntoll plaza[s];\n(b)\nroadside furniture;\n(c)\npedestrian facilities;\n(d)\ntree plantation;\n(e)\ntruck lay-byes;\n(f)\nbus-bays and bus shelters;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
