    "text": "(g)\nrest areas; and\n\n(h)\nothers to be specified\n2\nDescription of Project Facilities\nEach of the Project Facilities is described below:\nS. No.\nProject\nFacility\nLocation\nDesign\nRequirements\nOther essential\ndetails",
