    "text": "* The above list is illustrative and may require modification as per the scope of the work.\n1.3\nProcedure of estimating the value of work done\n1.3.1 Road works including approaches to minor bridges, Major Bridges and Structures\n(excluding service roads).\nProcedure for estimating the value of road work done shall be as follows:\nTable 1.3.1\nStage of Payment\nPercentage -\nweightage\nPayment Procedure\nA-Widening\nand\nstrengthening\n(1) Earthwork up to top of\nthe sub-grade",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0622",
    "doc_id": "DOC-079",
    "paragraph_index": 622,
