    "char_end": 308330,
    "char_count": 288,
    "text": "**\nCost of each Major Bridge\n(widening and repairs) shall\nbe determined on pro rata\nbasis with respect to the\ntotal linear length (m) of the\nMajor Bridges (widening\nand repairs). Payment shall\nbe made on completion of\neach stage of a Major\nBridge as per the weightage\ngiven in this table.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
