    "char_start": 321436,
    "char_end": 322147,
    "char_count": 711,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n166\n\nof State Highway No. …… (the “Project Highway”) on Engineering, Procurement and\nConstruction (EPC) basis through …………………. (Name of Contractor), hereby\ncertify that the Tests in accordance with Article 12 of the Agreement have been\nsuccessfully undertaken to determine compliance of the  Highway with the provisions\nof the Agreement, and I/We am/are satisfied that the Project Highway can be safely and\nreliably placed in service of the Users thereof.\n2\nIt is certified that, in terms of the aforesaid Agreement, all works forming part of\nHighway have been completed, and the Project Highway is hereby declared fit for entry\ninto operation on this the ……… day of ……… 20…..",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
