    "char_end": 337103,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "Draft for discussion purposes only\n173\n\nSCHEDULE - M\n(See Clauses 19.4.1, 19.6.1, and 19.8.1)\nFORMS OF PAYMENT STATEMENTS\n1.\nStage Payment Statement for Works",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC079-0695",
