    "char_start": 93702,
    "char_end": 94113,
    "char_count": 411,
    "text": "10 Calculated @ 5% (five per cent) of the Bid Project Cost. The Circular No. OM Mo. F. No. G-\n20016/01/2020-TF-II dated 17.11.2020 for the reduced Performance Security from existing 5% to 3%\nwas initially valid upto 31.12.2021, however, Circular No. COVID-19/RoadMap/ JS(H)/ 2020 dated\n11.04.2022 extended the applicability of the said circular upto 31.10.2022 of reduced Performance\nSecurity 3% (three percent)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0113",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
