    "text": "which the Contractor is required to effect under the Agreement or which the\nAuthority has effected in relation to the Facility and notified to the Contractor;\nand shall provide all assistance to the Authority in the application for, and\nfinalization of, such comprehensive insurance package;\n(e)\nregardless of the extent of settlement of claims by the underwriters or the\ntime taken for settlement of claims, the Contractor shall make good any loss,\nor damage at its own cost promptly;\n(f)\nprovide all assistance to the Authority in the application for, and finalization\nof, such comprehensive insurance package;\n(g)\npay the Contractor's share of the insurance premiums for insurance premiums\nallocated under such comprehensive insurance package policy to the\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
