    "char_start": 291855,
    "char_end": 292493,
    "char_count": 638,
    "text": "to replenish or extend the Performance Security and Additional Performance\nSecurity if any, claim the amount stipulated in Clause 7.1, as agreed pre-\ndetermined compensation to the Authority for any losses, delays and cost of\ncompleting the Works and Maintenance, if any;\n(b)\nencash and appropriate the Bank Guarantee, if any, for and in respect of the\noutstanding Advance Payment and interest thereon; and\n(c)\npay to the Contractor, by way of Termination Payment, an amount equivalent\nto the Valuation of Unpaid Works after adjusting any other sums payable or\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
