    "char_start": 335813,
    "char_end": 335952,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "149\nThe details of major junctions are as follows:\nS. No.\nLocation\nAt grade\nSeparated\nCategory of Cross Road\nFrom km\nto km\nNH\nSH\nMDR\nOthers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0342",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
    "paragraph_index": 342,
    "page_start": 181,
    "page_end": 181,
    "char_start": 335954,
    "char_end": 336150,
    "char_count": 196,
    "text": "(NH: National Highway, SH: State Highway, MDR: Major District Road)\n15.\nMinor junctions\nThe details of the minor junctions are as follows:\nS. No.\nLocation\nType\nFrom km\nTo km\nT -junction\nCross road",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0343",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
    "paragraph_index": 343,
