    "page_end": 181,
    "char_start": 336152,
    "char_end": 336318,
    "char_count": 166,
    "text": "16.\nBypasses\nThe details of the existing road sections proposed to be bypassed are as follows:\nS. No. Name of bypass\n(town)\nChainage (km) From km to\nkm\nLength (in Km)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
