    "char_end": 344150,
    "char_count": 334,
    "text": "(ix)\nGrade separated structures\n(a)\nGrade separated structures shall be provided as per provision of the relevant\nManual. The requisite particulars are given below:\n[Refer to the provision of relevant Manual and provide details]\nSl.\nNo.\nLocation of structure Length\n(m)\nNumber and length\nof spans (m)\nApproach\ngradient\nRemarks, if\nany",
