    "text": "(xi)\nTypical cross-sections of the Project Highway\n[Give typical cross-sections of the Project Highway by reference to the Manual]\n3.\nIntersections and Grade Separators\nAll intersections and grade separators shall be as per the provision of relevant\nManual. Existing intersections which are deficient shall be improved to the prescribed\nstandards.\n[Refer to the provision of relevant Manual and specify the requirements. Explain\nwhere necessary with drawings/sketches/general arrangement]\nProperly designed intersections shall be provided at the locations and of the types\nand features given in the tables below:\n(i)\nAt-grade intersections\nSl. No.\nLocation of intersection\nType\nof intersection\nOther features",
