    "text": "6.\nRoadside Drainage\nDrainage system including surface and subsurface drains for the Project Highway\nshall be provided as per the provision of relevant Manual.\n7.\nDesign of Structures\n(i)\nGeneral\n(a)\nAll bridges, culverts and structures shall be designed and constructed in\naccordance with the provision of relevant Manual and shall conform to the\ncross- sectional features and other details specified therein.\n(b)\nWidth of the carriageway of new bridges and structures shall be as follows:\n[Refer to the provision of relevant Manual and specify the width of carriageway\nof new bridges and structures of more than 60 (sixty) metre length, if the\ncarriageway width is different from 7.5 (seven point five) metres in the table\nbelow.]\nSl. No.\nBridge at km\nWidth of carriageway and\ncross-sectional features*",
