    "char_end": 354533,
    "char_count": 247,
    "text": "8.\nTraffic Control Devices and Road Safety Works\n(i)\nTraffic control devices and road safety works shall be provided in accordance with the\nprovision of relevant Manual.\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
