    "text": "Joint Defects\n11\nJoint Seal Defects\nloss\nor\ndamage\nL = Length as % total\njoint length\n0\nDifficult to discern.\nShort Term\nLong Term\nNo action.\nNot Applicable\n1\nDiscernible, L< 25% but\nof\nlittle\nimmediate\nconsequence with regard\nto ingress of water or\ntrapping incompressible\nmaterial.\nClean joint, inspect later.\n3\nNotable.\nL\n>\n25%\ninsufficient\nprotection\nagainst ingress of water\nand\ntrapping\nincompressible material.\nClean and reapply sealant in\nselected locations.\nWithin 7 days\n5\nSevere;\nw\n>\n3\nmm\nnegligible\nprotection\nagainst ingress of water\nClean, widen and reseal the joint.\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
