    "text": "205\nAsset\nType\nPerformance\nParameter\nLevel of Service (LOS)\nFrequency of\nMeasuremen\nt\nTesting Method\nRecommended\nRemedial\nmeasures\nTime limit for\nRectification\nSpecification\ns and\nStandards\nOther\nProject\nFacilities\nand\nApproac\nh roads\nDamage or deterioration in Approach Roads,\npedestrian facilities, truck lay-bys, bus-bays, bus-\nshelters, cattle crossings, Traffic Aid Posts, Medical\nAid Posts and other works\nDaily\n-\nRectification\n15 days\nIRC:SP\n84-\n2014\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
