    "text": "clause\n2800\nDelamination\nof\nconcrete not more\nthan 0.25 sq.m.\nCracks\nwider\nthan 0.3 mm not\nmore than 1m\naggregate length\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
