    "text": "Table 4: Maintenance Criteria for Structures and Culverts:\n\nsq.m, damage to\nsolid\napron\n(concrete\napron)\nnot\nmore\nthan\n1\nsq.m\nweeks\nbefore\nonset\nof\nrainy\nseason\nwhichever\nis earlier.\nNote: Any Structure during the entire contract period which is found that does not complies with all requirements of this Table will be prepared,\nrehabilitated or even reconstructed under the scope of the contractor.\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
