    "page_end": 245,
    "char_start": 400047,
    "char_end": 400225,
    "char_count": 178,
    "text": "Note: For all tables 1 to 5 above, latest BIS & IRC standards (even those not indicated\nherewith) along with MoRTH specifications shall be binding for all maintenance\nactivities.",
