    "text": "225\nreleased earlier by the Authority pursuant to the provisions of the Agreement.\n12.\nThis guarantee shall also be operatable at our…… ………….. Branch at New\nDelhi, from whom, confirmation regarding the issue of this guarantee or\nextension / renewal thereof shall be made available on demand. In the\ncontingency of this guarantee being invoked and payment thereunder claimed,\nthe said branch shall accept such invocation letter and make payment of\namounts so demanded under the said invocation.\n13.\nThe guarantor/bank hereby confirms that it is on the SFMS (Structural Finance\nMessaging System) platform & shall invariably send an advice of this Bank\nGuarantee to the designated bank of NHAI, detail of which is as under:\nS. No. Particulars\nDetails\n6.\nName of Beneficiary\nNational Highways Authority of India\n7.\nName of Bank\nCanara Bank\n8.\nAddress of Bank Branch\nDwarka, Sector 10 Branch\n9.\nAccount No.\n8598201005819\n10.\nIFSC Code\nCNRB0008598\n14.",
