    "text": "243\nStage of Payment\nPerce\nntage\n-\nweig\nhtage\nPayment Procedure\nC.1-\nReconstruction/\nNew service road\n(Flexible\npavement)\n(1) Earthwork up to\ntop of the sub-grade",
