    "char_end": 435584,
    "char_count": 386,
    "text": "[**]\nUnit of measurement is linear\nlength. Payment of each stage shall\nbe made on pro rata basis on\ncompletion of a stage in full length\nor 5(five) km. length, whichever is\nless..\n(2) Sub Base Course\n[**]\n(3) Non-Bituminous\nCourse\n[**]\n(4) Bituminous Base\nCourse\n[**]\n(5) Wearing Coat\n[**]\nC.2-\nReconstruction/\nNew service road\n (Rigid pavement)\n(1) Earthwork up to\ntop of the sub-grade",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
