  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0653",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
    "paragraph_index": 653,
    "page_start": 275,
    "page_end": 275,
    "char_start": 435586,
    "char_end": 435908,
    "char_count": 322,
    "text": "[**]\nUnit of measurement is linear\nlength. Payment of each stage shall\nbe made on pro rata basis on\ncompletion of a stage in full length\nor 5(five) km. length, whichever is\nless..\n(2) Sub Base Course\n[**]\n(3)\nDry\nLean\nConcrete\n(DLC)\nCourse\n[**]\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
