    "text": "(i)  Foundation:  Cost\nof\neach\nROB/RUB\nshall be determined\non pro rata basis with\nrespect to the total\nlinear length (m) of\nthe\nROBs/RUBs.\nPayment\nagainst\nfoundation shall be\nmade\non\npro-rata\nbasis on completion\nof a stage i.e. not less\nthan 25% of the scope\nof foundation of the\nROB/RUB subject to\ncompletion of atleast\ntwo foundations of\nthe ROB/RUB .",
