    "page_start": 300,
    "page_end": 300,
    "char_start": 461533,
    "char_end": 461818,
    "char_count": 285,
    "text": "validly prepared Stage Payment Statements for an amount not less than 70% (seventy\nper cent) of the Contract Price and should have started construction of all project\nfacilities.\n5.\nScheduled Completion Date\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0827",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
    "paragraph_index": 827,
    "page_start": 301,
    "page_end": 301,
    "char_start": 461820,
    "char_end": 462433,
    "char_count": 613,
    "text": "269\n(i)\nThe Scheduled Completion Date shall occur on the [Scheduled Construction Period]\nday from the Appointed Date.\n(ii)\nOn or before the Scheduled Completion Date, the Contractor shall have completed\nconstruction in accordance with this Agreement.\n6.\nExtension of time\nUpon extension of any or all of the aforesaid Project Milestones or the Scheduled\nCompletion Date, as the case may be, under and in accordance with the provisions of\nthis Agreement, the Project Completion Schedule shall be deemed to have been\namended accordingly.\nDraft No. DFA/54028\nAttachment:Annexure C- Revised Standard EPC Agreement.pdf",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0828",
    "doc_id": "DOC-080",
    "paragraph_index": 828,
