    "char_end": 193757,
    "char_count": 254,
    "text": "from the date of the measurement, then such measurements recorded in his absence\nby the Client / Engineer-In-Charge or his representative shall be deemed to be accepted\nby the contractor. The contractor shall, without extra charge, provide all assistance",
