    "char_start": 214740,
    "char_end": 215043,
    "char_count": 303,
    "text": "same to the supplies and all costs which may require such removal and substitution shall be\nborne by the contractor.\nThe contractor shall ensure that the materials are brought to site in original sealed containers\nor packing bearing manufacturer’s markings and brands (except where the quantity required",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC081-0170",
    "doc_id": "DOC-081",
    "paragraph_index": 170,
    "page_start": 82,
