    "text": "69.2 The time for the completion of the work shall, in the event of any  deviations resulting\nin additional cost  over the tendered value sum being  ordered be extended, if requested\nby the contractor, as follows:\n(i)\nin the proportion which the additional cost of the altered, additional or substituted\nwork bears to the original tendered value plus",
