    "char_start": 273959,
    "char_end": 274559,
    "char_count": 600,
    "text": "(iii)  Fails to complete the work(s) or items of work with individual dates of completion, on\nor before the date(s) so determined, and does not complete them within the period\nspecified in the notice given in writing in that behalf by the Engineer-In-Charge.\nThe Client / Engineer-In-Charge without invoking action under clause 11.0 of\ncontract may, without prejudice to any other right or remedy against the contractor\nwhich have either accrued or accrue thereafter to EPI, by a notice in writing to\ntake the part work / part incomplete work of any item(s) out of his hands and\nshall have powers to:",
