    "char_end": 288077,
    "char_count": 625,
    "text": "money arising out of or under any other contract made by the contractor with the\nClient / Engineer-In-Charge or EPI.\nIt is an agreed term of the contract that the sum of money so withheld or retained\nunder this clause by the Client / Engineer-In-Charge or EPI will be kept withheld or\nretained as such by the Client / Engineer-In-Charge or EPI or till his claim arising out\nof the same contract or any other contract is either mutually settled or determined by\nthe Arbitrator or Competent court as the case may be, and that the contractor shall\nhave no claim for interest or damages whatsoever on this account or on any other",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
