    "page_end": 102,
    "char_start": 291617,
    "char_end": 291819,
    "char_count": 202,
    "text": "service of a written notice from one party to the other party (ies), hold a meeting with  an\neffort  to  resolve the  dispute  in good  faith and the dispute may be mutually settled\nbetween the parties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC081-0233",
    "doc_id": "DOC-081",
    "paragraph_index": 233,
    "page_start": 103,
