    "text": "wherever applicable, Insurance, Agreed Time Schedule, Compensation for delay and all\nother terms and conditions contained in EPI’s Letter of Acceptance No. ...................................\ndated. …………………. are to be read in conjunction with other aforesaid Contract Documents.\nThe contract shall be duly performed by the contractor strictly and faithfully in accordance with\nthe terms of this contract.",
