    "char_start": 413172,
    "char_end": 413805,
    "char_count": 633,
    "text": "the payment of aforementioned amount directly to ……………………(name of the subcontractor /\nvendor) by EPI, the Contractor has agreed to execute an indemnity bond in favour of EPI.\nNOW, THEREFORE, THIS INDEMNITY BOND PROVIDES AS FOLLOWS:\n1)\nThat the Contractor undertakes / certifies that the amount of Rs ................ to be released\ndirectly to .................... (name of the subcontractor / vendor) by EPI has been verified and is\nfound to be payable.\n2)\nThat the Contractor agrees to the said amount of Rs. .................. being deducted / adjusted\nfrom any / all payment due or that may become due to the Contractor from EPI.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
