    "text": "DOC No: EPI/CO/CON/GCC-EPC/001, Rev - 1\nGCC FOR EPC WORKS\n160\nNotwithstanding anything contained herein above, our liability under this guarantee shall be restricted\nto Rs…………………. (Rupees………………………………. only) and this guarantee will expire on any\nclaim under this guarantee must be received by us within 12 months after the date of expiry.\nFor and on behalf of Bank\nPlace……………\nDate……………….\nWitness 1: …………………….\nWitness 2: …………………….",
