    "char_start": 658,
    "char_end": 862,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "__________, Company/University incorporated under _______ and having its\nregistered office at __________________________, hereinafter referred to as\nLicensee, of the Second Part, represented by _________.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 864,
    "char_end": 973,
    "char_count": 109,
    "text": "The aforesaid institutions are hereinafter referred to individually as Party and\ncollectively as the Parties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 975,
    "char_end": 1108,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "Witnesseth\n\nWhereas, IITK owns _____ rights in ______ process/technology relating to ______,\nand is interested in licensing the same;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1110,
    "char_end": 1234,
    "char_count": 124,
    "text": "Whereas, Licensee desires to acquire rights in and to the process/technology upon\nthe terms and conditions herein set forth;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1236,
    "char_end": 1380,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "Now therefore, in consideration of the mutual covenants contained herein and\nintending to be legally bound hereby, the parties agree as follows:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1382,
    "char_end": 1462,
    "char_count": 80,
    "text": "1.  Certain Definitions (Defined Terms)\n\n1.1 Define specific words in technology",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1464,
    "char_end": 1552,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "1.2\nApplication\nmeans\nthe\nindustrial\nscale\napplication\nof\n________\n(Process/Technology).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1554,
    "char_end": 1973,
    "char_count": 419,
    "text": "1.3 Affiliates mean any person, corporation, association or other entity which directly\nor indirectly controls, or is controlled by or is under common control with the party in\nquestion. As used in this definition of affiliates, the term control shall mean power or\nauthority through direct or indirect beneficial ownership of more than 50% of the\nvoting or income interest in such corporation or other business entity.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1975,
    "char_end": 2322,
    "char_count": 347,
    "text": "1.4 Copyrights shall mean IITK's copyrights in the Licensed Technology.\n\n1.5 Derivative means any material that is derived from or based upon the Material,\nwhether modified, or unmodified or computer software or other intellectual property\ndeveloped by Licensee, which includes, or is based in whole or in part on, the\nLicensed Process/Technology.",
