    "char_start": 2324,
    "char_end": 2556,
    "char_count": 232,
    "text": "1.6 Patent(s) shall mean any patent, continuation, continuation-in-part, divisional, or\nreissue thereof in India or in any other country, which issues to IITK and is based on\nintellectual property in existence on the Effective Date.",
