    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7764,
    "char_end": 7942,
    "char_count": 178,
    "text": "the right to grant either exclusive or non-exclusive licenses for the Licensed\nTechnology other than the Field of Use/in fields of use for which the license\nhereunder is granted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0035",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 35,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 7944,
    "char_end": 8396,
    "char_count": 452,
    "text": "2.7 IITK shall disclose to Licensee, on a non-exclusive basis, to the extent that IITK\nhas the right to do so, in the English language, and in a manner readily\nunderstandable to Licensee, all Process Information/Technology which has not\npreviously been disclosed or furnished to Licensee by direct supply of drawings,\ndata, manuals, or any other information or by any means that IITK deems necessary\nfor Licensee’s better use of the process/technology.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0036",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 36,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 8398,
    "char_end": 8963,
    "char_count": 565,
    "text": "2.8 In order to IITK effectively communicate the Process Information/Technology to\nLicensee and Licensee to effectively communicate the improvements to IITK, duly\nauthorized and technically qualified representative (his team) of the recipients shall\nbe given access to other’s Site/Project respectively. The number of personnel,\ntiming, duration and other details of each such visit shall be mutually agreed upon.\nEach party shall bear all travel, living, and other incidental expenses of its personnel\nincurred for each of such visits to the other’s Site/ Project.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0037",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 37,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 8965,
    "char_end": 9376,
    "char_count": 411,
    "text": "2.9 For the avoidance of doubt, LICENSEE hereby warrants, undertakes and agrees\nthat it shall use the Process Information/Technology and the Improvements, if any,\ndisclosed by IITK, and the Patents licensed hereunder, solely for the purpose of the\nengineering, erection, installation and operation of the ____ Project, and production\nof the Products in accordance with the terms and conditions contained herein.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0038",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 38,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 9378,
    "char_end": 9813,
    "char_count": 435,
    "text": "3.  Term of this Agreement\n\nTerm of this Agreement shall conclude at the end of twenty (20) years from the\nEffective Date, or on the expiration date of the last-to-expire Patent, whichever\ncomes later, unless otherwise terminated pursuant to provisions of this Agreement.\nOr\nTerm of this Agreement shall conclude at the end of _______ years from the\nEffective Date, unless otherwise terminated pursuant to provisions of this\nAgreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0039",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 39,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 9815,
    "char_end": 9986,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "4. Minimum Performance Requirements\n\n4.1. Licensee shall use its best efforts to effect introduction of Licensed Technology\ninto the commercial market as soon as possible.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
