    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 9988,
    "char_end": 10209,
    "char_count": 221,
    "text": "4.2. Licensee must achieve the following milestones:\n\n4.3. Licensee's failure to perform in accordance with Sections 4.1 or 4.2 herein shall\nbe grounds for IITK to terminate this Agreement pursuant to Section 10.2 herein.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0041",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 41,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 10211,
    "char_end": 10556,
    "char_count": 345,
    "text": "5.  Royalties and Payment Terms\n\n5.1. Royalties payable by Licensee to IITK shall be ___ percent (%) of Net Sales\nreceived by Licensee or Licensee’s Affiliates. (However, no Royalties from\nDispositions of Licensed Products by Licensee under this Section shall be due and\npayable to IITK for a period of _____ years following the Effective Date.)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
