    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 10771,
    "char_end": 10978,
    "char_count": 207,
    "text": "5.3. All Royalties hereunder shall be paid in (Indian Rupee/U.S. Dollars) and shall be\nmade by _______ (Mode of payment) to IITK account No. _______, or by cheque\ndrawn in favour of the Director, IIT Kanpur.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
