    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 44,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 10980,
    "char_end": 11333,
    "char_count": 353,
    "text": "5.4. All Royalties payable hereunder which are overdue shall bear interest until paid\nat a rate ___ % per annum. Total amount payable will be royalty payable as of that\ndate plus interest payable. This provision for interest shall not be construed as a\nwaiver of any IITK’s rights as a result of Licensee's failure to make timely payment\nof any amounts.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0045",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 45,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 11335,
    "char_end": 11470,
    "char_count": 135,
    "text": "6.  Reports and Audits\n\n6.1. Licensee shall report Quarterly to IITK its Net Sales and Revenues, which are\nsubject to Royalty payments.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0046",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 46,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 11472,
    "char_end": 11973,
    "char_count": 501,
    "text": "6.2. Licensee shall maintain accurate books and records such that the Royalties due\nand payable hereunder can be easily ascertained.  Such books and records shall be\nmaintained at Licensee's principal place of business and shall be available for\ninspection by IITK or its representatives during the normal business day upon not\nless than _____ days prior written notice, provided that IITK or its representatives\nagree to protect the confidentiality of the information as to the customers of\nLicensee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0047",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 47,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 11975,
    "char_end": 12577,
    "char_count": 602,
    "text": "6.3. Licensee shall make available Licensee's books and records for audit by an\naccounting firm or representative of IITK's selection and Licensee agrees to\ncooperate fully in any such audit, provided that the auditors agree to protect the\nconfidentiality of the information as to the customers of Licensee.  Any such audit\nshall not be more frequent than annually.  In the event that such audit determines\nthat the amount of Royalties paid to IITK was in error by more than _______\n(__ %), Licensee shall pay the costs of the audit, in addition to promptly making\npayments to eliminate the deficiency.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0048",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 48,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 12579,
    "char_end": 12746,
    "char_count": 167,
    "text": "6.4. Licensee shall report to IITK the date of first commercial Disposition of a\nLicensed Product in each country within ______ days of commencement of this\nagreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC083-0049",
    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 49,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 12748,
    "char_end": 13130,
    "char_count": 382,
    "text": "6.5. Within _______ days after the end of each of Licensee's fiscal years, Licensee\nshall furnish IITK with a written report on the progress of its efforts during the\nimmediately preceding calendar year to develop and commercialize Licensed\nProducts. The report shall also contain a discussion of intended efforts and sales\nprojections for the year in which the report is submitted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
