    "text": "8. Patents and Other Intellectual Property\n\nIntellectual property rights to Licensed Technology such as Patent(s) and Copyrights\nexisting or which may be obtainable will remain the property of IITK. Trademarks\nexisting on the Effective Date belong to IITK.",
