    "char_start": 16497,
    "char_end": 16793,
    "char_count": 296,
    "text": "9.2. Licensee shall have marked the appropriate portions of all Licensed Product with\nany applicable Patent numbers in accordance with the applicable laws of the\ncountries in which the materials are intended to be used.  Licensee shall neither\nregister nor use any IITK trademarks or trade names.",
