    "char_start": 16795,
    "char_end": 17137,
    "char_count": 342,
    "text": "9.3. Licensee acknowledges that it does not have any rights or any title whatsoever\nin or to IITK's technology, trade name or in or to any of IITK’s trademarks, except\nas provided under this Agreement.  Any reference by Licensee to IITK beyond the\nabove may only be done with express written permission of Dean, Research and\nDevelopment IITK.",
