    "doc_id": "DOC-083",
    "paragraph_index": 60,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 17728,
    "char_end": 18201,
    "char_count": 473,
    "text": "10.2. In the event that either party to this Agreement defaults in the performance of\nany of its obligations hereunder (other than the default referred to in Section 10.1.\n(Termination), hereof) and fails to cure such default within ____ days after written\nnotice of such default from such other party, the other party shall have the right by\nwritten notice to the defaulting party within ____ days after the expiration of such\n_____ day period to terminate this Agreement.",
