    "char_start": 22915,
    "char_end": 23159,
    "char_count": 244,
    "text": "14.2 With respect to any information not related to the Licensed Technology which is\nsought by IITK to be Confidential Information subject to this Agreement, IITK shall\nmark such information as \"Confidential\" prior to disclosing it to Licensee.",
