    "char_start": 23161,
    "char_end": 23504,
    "char_count": 343,
    "text": "14.3 With respect to any oral communication not related to the Licensed Technology\nwhich is deemed by IITK to be Confidential Information subject to this Agreement,\nIITK shall notify Licensee of such fact and within _____ days thereafter IITK shall\nsend a memorandum to Licensee outlining the information deemed to be\nConfidential Information.",
