    "char_count": 323,
    "text": "15.  Indemnification\n\nLicensee hereby agrees to defend, indemnify and hold harmless IITK, its trustees,\nofficers, employees, attorneys and agents from all claims, demands, any liability,\nloss, claim, action, suit, damage made against them (and any related losses,\nexpenses or attorneys' fees) arising out of or relating to:",
