    "paragraph_index": 82,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 26429,
    "char_end": 26876,
    "char_count": 447,
    "text": "18.  Prior Agreement\n\nThis Agreement supersedes all previous agreements relating to the subject matter\nhereof, whether oral or in a writing, and constitutes the entire agreement of the\nparties hereto and shall not be amended or altered in any respect except in writing\nexecuted by the parties. Notwithstanding the foregoing, any obligations of\nconfidentiality arising under any separate confidentiality agreement between the\nparties shall survive.",
