    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "21.3. Notwithstanding the pendency of any infringement (or other) claim or action\nby or against Licensee, Licensee shall have no right to terminate or suspend (or\nescrow) payment of any amounts required to be paid to IITK pursuant to this\nAgreement.",
