    "char_end": 15894,
    "char_count": 310,
    "text": "Page 10 of 50\nMeitY has also prepared a document to assist government organizations in procuring Cloud\nServices through the Government eMarketplace (GeM) platform. This document may be seen\non\nthe\nMeghRaj\nwebpage\nat\nhttps://www.meity.gov.in/writereaddata/files/Guidelines_Procurement_Cloud%20Services_v2.\n2.pdf",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
