    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 24654,
    "char_end": 24987,
    "char_count": 333,
    "text": "1.1.3. Measurements and Arithmetic Conventions\nAll measurements and calculations shall be in the metric system and calculations done to two\ndecimal places, with the third digit of five or above being rounded up and below five being\nrounded down except in money calculations where such amounts shall be rounded off to the\nnearest INR.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0059",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 59,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 24988,
    "char_end": 26073,
    "char_count": 1085,
    "text": "1.1.4. Ambiguities within Agreement\nIn case of ambiguities or discrepancies within this Agreement, the following principles shall\napply:\na) as between two Clauses of this Agreement, the provisions of a specific Clause relevant\nto the issue under consideration shall prevail over those in a general Clause;\nb) as between the provisions of this Agreement and the Schedules/Annexures, the\nAgreement shall prevail, save and except as expressly provided otherwise in the\nAgreement or the Schedules/Annexures; and\nc) as between any value written in numerals and that in words, the value in words shall\nprevail.\n1.2.\nTerm and Duration of the Engagement\nThis Agreement shall come into effect on <***> 201- (hereinafter the ‘Effective Date’) and shall\ncontinue till operation and maintenance completion date which shall be the date of the\ncompletion of the operation and maintenance to the Purchaser or its nominated agencies,\nunless terminated earlier (as per Clause 1.13), in which case the contract will get terminated\non fulfillment of all obligations mentioned as per Clause 1.13 and 1.23.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
