    "page_end": 22,
    "char_start": 45973,
    "char_end": 46413,
    "char_count": 440,
    "text": "1.11.2. Use of Services\na) The Purchaser as the case may be or its nominated agencies, will undertake and use the\nServices in accordance with any instructions or procedures as set out in this\nAgreement or any agreement that may be entered into between the Parties from\ntime to time;\nb) The Purchaser as the case may be or its nominated agencies shall be responsible for the\noperation and use of the Deliverables resulting from the Services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
