    "text": "Page 24 of 50\nf) In consideration of the Services and subject to the provisions of this Agreement, the\nPurchaser shall pay the Managed Service Provider for the Services rendered in pursuance\nof this Agreement.\ng) Payments shall be subject to the application of liquidated damages or SLA penalties\nand its adjustments/corrections as may be provided for in the Agreement and the SLA.\nh) Save and except as otherwise provided for herein or as agreed between the Parties in\nwriting, the Purchaser shall not be required to make any payments in respect of the\nServices (or, without limitation to the foregoing, in respect of the Managed Service\nProvider performance of any obligations under this Agreement or the SLA) other\nthan those covered in this Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
