    "char_start": 51716,
    "char_end": 51911,
    "char_count": 195,
    "text": "1.12.2. Invoicing and Settlement\na) Subject to the specific terms of the Agreement and the SLA, the Managed Service\nProvider shall submit its invoices in accordance with the following principles:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
