    "page_end": 24,
    "char_start": 51912,
    "char_end": 52178,
    "char_count": 266,
    "text": "(i) The Purchaser shall be invoiced by the Managed Service Provider for the\nServices. Generally and unless otherwise agreed in writing between the Parties\nor expressly set out in the SLA, the Managed Service Provider shall raise an\ninvoice as per this Agreement; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0095",
