    "char_end": 87737,
    "char_count": 203,
    "text": "Offerings of CSP with MeitY, the Managed Service Provider shall allow the Purchaser /\nany agency authorized by the Purchaser to conduct audit of its services including\nunderlying CSP’s Cloud environment.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
