    "text": "1.20. Liquidated Damages\nTime is the essence of the Agreement and the delivery dates are binding on the Managed\nService Provider. In the event of delay or any gross negligence in implementation of the\nProject, for causes solely attributable to the Selected Managed Service Provider, in meeting\nthe deliverables, the Purchaser shall be entitled at its option to recover from the Managed",
