    "text": "1.21. Insurance Cover\n1.21.1. Obligation to Maintain Insurance\n(i)\nIn connection with the provision of the Services, the Managed Service Provider must\nhave and maintain:\na) for the Agreement Period, valid and enforceable insurance coverage for:",
