    "char_end": 93293,
    "char_count": 356,
    "text": "1.21.2. Certificates of currency\nThe Managed Service Provider must, on request by the Purchaser, provide current relevant\nconfirmation of insurance documentation from its insurance brokers certifying that it has\ninsurance as required by this Clause 1.21. The Managed Service Provider agrees to replace\nany coverage prior to the date of expiry/cancellation.",
