    "char_start": 93294,
    "char_end": 93671,
    "char_count": 377,
    "text": "1.21.3. Non-compliance\nPurchaser or its nominated agencies may, at its election, terminate this Agreement as per\nClause 1.13, upon the failure of Managed Service Provider or notification of such failure,\nto maintain the required insurance coverage. Inadequate insurance coverage for any\nreason shall not relieve Managed Service Provider of its obligations under this Agreement.",
