    "paragraph_index": 158,
    "page_start": 38,
    "page_end": 38,
    "char_start": 93672,
    "char_end": 94420,
    "char_count": 748,
    "text": "1.22. Changes in Cloud Service Offerings\n(i)\nThe Managed Service Provider shall inform the Purchaser, at least 3 months in advance,\nabout the material changes that the Managed Service Provider is planning to\nimplement in the Cloud Service being consumed by the Purchaser.\n(ii)\nThe Managed Service Provider is not allowed to discontinue offering a Cloud Service\nthat is being consumed by the Purchaser, unless it poses a security threat, during the\nentire duration of the project. If the Cloud Service Offering is being discontinued due\nto the security threats, the Managed Service Provider has to first get this Cloud Service\nOffering de-empaneled from MeitY as per the guidelines specified by MeitY and\nprovide a 3 months’ notice to the Purchaser.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0159",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 159,
