    "char_start": 99117,
    "char_end": 99442,
    "char_count": 325,
    "text": "1.25. Suspension\n(i)\nThe Managed Service Provider shall not suspend the right to access or use the Cloud\nServices without providing a written notice, 30 days in advance, to the Purchaser, unless\nthe use of the Cloud service offerings by the Purchaser poses security risk to the Cloud\nServices being consumed by the Purchaser.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
