    "char_start": 99443,
    "char_end": 99903,
    "char_count": 460,
    "text": "1.26. Conflict of Interest\n(i)\nThe Managed Service Provider shall furnish an affirmative statement as to the absence\nof, actual or potential conflict of interest on the part of the Managed Service Provider\nor any prospective subcontractor due to prior, current, or proposed contracts,\nengagements, or affiliations with the Purchaser. Additionally, such disclosure shall\naddress any / all potential elements (time frame for service delivery, resource, financial",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
