    "char_end": 107258,
    "char_count": 832,
    "text": "1.30.  Trademarks and Publicity\nNeither Party may use the trademarks of the other Party without the prior written consent of\nthe other Party except that Managed Service Provider may, upon completion, use the Project\nas a reference for credential purpose. Except as required by law or the rules and regulations of\neach stock exchange upon which the securities of one of the Parties is listed, neither Party shall\npublish or permit to be published either alone or in conjunction with any other person any\npress release, information, article, photograph, illustration or any other material of whatever\nkind relating to this Agreement, the service levels or the business of the Parties without prior\nreference to and approval in writing from the other Party. Such approval shall apply to each\nspecific case and relate only to that case.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0177",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 177,
    "page_start": 43,
    "page_end": 43,
    "char_start": 107259,
    "char_end": 107380,
    "char_count": 121,
    "text": "1.31.  Data Ownership\nAll the data created as the part of the project shall be owned by Purchaser without any\nexceptions.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0178",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 178,
    "page_start": 43,
    "page_end": 43,
    "char_start": 107381,
    "char_end": 107641,
    "char_count": 260,
    "text": "1.32. Backup\nThe Managed Service Provider shall configure, schedule and manage backups of all the data\nincluding but not limited to files, folders, images, system state, databases and enterprise\napplications as per the policy defined by the Purchaser or MeitY.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0179",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 179,
    "page_start": 43,
    "page_end": 43,
    "char_start": 107642,
    "char_end": 107897,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "1.33. Compliance with IS Security Policy\nThe Managed Service Provider shall comply with the Purchaser’s IT Policy & IS policy in key\nconcern areas relevant to the Project, details of which will be shared with the finally selected\nManaged Service Provider.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0180",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "paragraph_index": 180,
