  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0244",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 244,
    "page_start": 62,
    "page_end": 62,
    "char_start": 141722,
    "char_end": 143503,
    "char_count": 1781,
    "text": "ARTICLE 14: COMPLETION CERTIFICATE\n14.1\nTests\n14.1.1 At least 30 (thirty) days prior to the likely completion of the XXX Ropeway, the Concessionaire\nshall notify the Independent Engineer of its intent to subject the XXX Ropeway to Tests. The\ndate and time of each of the Tests shall be determined by the Independent Engineer in\nconsultation with the Concessionaire and notified to the Authority who may designate its\nrepresentative to witness the Tests. The Concessionaire shall provide such assistance as the\nIndependent Engineer may reasonably require for conducting the Tests. In the event of the\nConcessionaire and the Independent Engineer failing to mutually agree on the dates for\nconducting the Tests, the Concessionaire shall fix the dates by giving not less than 10(ten)day\nnotice to the Independent Engineer. For the avoidance of doubt, it is agreed that the provisions\nof this Article 14 shall not apply to Real Estate Development.\n14.1.2 All Tests shall be conducted in accordance with Schedule-J. The Independent Engineer shall\nobserve, monitor and review the results of the Tests to determine compliance of the XXX\nRopeway with Specifications and Standards and if it is reasonably anticipated or determined by\nthe Independent Engineer during the course of any Test that the performance of the XXX\nRopeway or any part thereof does not meet the Specifications and Standards, it shall have the\nright to suspend or delay such Test and require the Concessionaire to remedy and rectify the\ndefects or deficiencies. Upon completion of each Test, the Independent Engineer shall provide\nto the Concessionaire and the Authority copies of all Test data including detailed Test results.\nFor the avoidance of doubt, it is expressly agreed that the Independent Engineer may require",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0245",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 245,
    "page_start": 62,
    "page_end": 62,
    "char_start": 143504,
    "char_end": 145243,
    "char_count": 1739,
    "text": "the Concessionaire to carry out or cause to be carried out additional Tests, in accordance with\nGood Industry Practice, for determining the compliance of the XXX Ropeway with\nSpecifications and Standards.\n14.2\nCompletion Certificate\nUpon completion of Construction Works and the Independent Engineer determining the Tests\nto be successful, it shall forthwith issue to the Concessionaire and the Authority a certificate\nsubstantially in the form set forth in Schedule-K (the “Completion Certificate”).\n14.3\nProvisional Certificate\n14.3.1 The Independent Engineer may, at the request of the Concessionaire, issue a provisional\ncertificate of completion substantially in the form set forth in Schedule-K (the “Provisional\nCertificate”) if the Tests are successful and the XXX Ropeway can be safely and reliably\nplaced in commercial operation though certain associated works and / or facilities for Users\nforming part thereof are outstanding and not yet complete. In such an event, the Provisional\nCertificate shall have appended thereto a list of outstanding items signed jointly by the\nIndependent Engineer and the Concessionaire (the “Punch List”); provided that the\nIndependent Engineer shall not withhold the Provisional Certificate for reason of any work\nremaining incomplete if the delay in completion thereof is attributable to the Authority.\n14.3.2 The Parties hereto expressly agree that a Provisional Certificate under this Clause 14.3 may,\nupon request of the Concessionaire to this effect, be issued for operating part of a line, if at least\n75% (seventy five percent) of the total length of such line has been completed. Upon issue of\nsuch provisional certificate, the provisions of Article 15 shall apply to such completed part.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0246",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 246,
    "page_start": 63,
    "page_end": 63,
    "char_start": 145245,
    "char_end": 145250,
    "char_count": 5,
    "text": "DRAFT",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0247",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 247,
    "page_start": 63,
