    "text": "also conform to Good Industry Practice. For the avoidance of doubt, it is agreed that the rights\nof the Concessionaire hereunder shall be subject to Applicable Laws, as in force and effect from\ntime to time, and no compensation shall be claimed on account thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
