    "char_start": 189367,
    "char_end": 189713,
    "char_count": 346,
    "text": "ARTICLE 20: KEY PERFORMANCE INDICATORS\n21.1\nKey Performance Indicators\n\nWithout prejudice to the obligations specified in this Agreement, the Concessionaire shall\noperate the XXX Ropeways such that it achieves or exceeds the performance indicators\nspecified in this Article 21 (the “Key Performance Indicators”)\n21.2\nOperation of Ropeway Carriers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0325",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 325,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 189715,
    "char_end": 190587,
    "char_count": 872,
    "text": "21.2.1 The XXX Ropeways shall be operated such that the service shall operate between [XXX hours]\nand [YYY hours] at the service levels specified in this Clause 21.2; provided that the duration\nof services may be customized as per the requirements specified in RFP.\n21.2.2 The rope speed is variable and can be adjusted to meet the traffic requirements subject to a\nmaximum of 6 (six) meters/second for monocable systems, 8 (eight) meters/second for tricable\nsystems, 12 (twelve) meters/second for aerial tramway systems and 14 (fourteen)\nmeters/second for cable liners (automated people mover) systems.\n21.2.3 The Concessionaire shall at all times ensure that:\n(a)\nthe ropeway carriers are clean, hygienic and free of odour; and\n(b)\nthere is adequate lighting within the carrier and Station in conformity with the\nSpecifications and Standards.\n21.3\nProvisions of Carriers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0326",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 326,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 190589,
    "char_end": 190703,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "The number of passengers shall not exceed the design capacity of the carriers.\n21.4\nOperation of Terminal Stations",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0327",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 327,
    "page_start": 82,
    "page_end": 82,
    "char_start": 190705,
    "char_end": 191826,
    "char_count": 1121,
    "text": "21.4.1 The Parties hereto agree that the primary purpose of the Station is to provide space for the\nUsers who normally stay at a Station for a period of time no longer than necessary, to wait for\nand enter the carriersor to exit the Station or after exiting from the carriers.\n21.4.2 The design, construction, operation and maintenance of the Stations shall be such that:\n(a)\na User alighting at the platform should be able to reach a point outside the Station in\nnot more than [3 (three)] minutes of brisk walking and a User crossing the fee\ncollection point should be able to reach the platform in not more than [2 (two)] minutes\nof brisk walking; and\n(b)\nin case of Emergency, evacuation from any point on the platform to a point of safety\nin an open space within or outside the Station shall not exceed [100 (one hundred)]\nmeters.\n21.4.3 The entry and exit gates, including the automatic ticket verification machines, shall be so\ndesigned and operated that the waiting time for the Users shall not exceed [2 (two)] minutes.\n21.4.4 The Concessionaire shall provide adequate number of ticket vending machines and ticket",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0328",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 328,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 191828,
    "char_end": 191833,
    "char_count": 5,
    "text": "DRAFT",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0329",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 329,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 191835,
    "char_end": 191837,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "83",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0330",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 330,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 191839,
    "char_end": 192800,
    "char_count": 961,
    "text": "counters such that waiting time for the Users shall not exceed [2 (two)] minutes.\n21.4.5 The Concessionaire shall at all times ensure that:\n(a)\nthe Stations and its toilets are clean, hygienic and free of odour;\n(b)\nthere is adequate lighting within the Stations in conformity with the Specifications and\nStandards;\n(c)\nthe temperature in common areas within the Station is maintained in accordance with\nMaintenance Requirements;\n(d)\nall entry and exit points, passages, circulation areas and vehicular traffic are so\nmanaged that they do not have a queue with a waiting time exceeding [5 (five)]\nminutes;\n(e)\nall lifts, escalators, walkalators, train information systems, public address systems and\nlighting systems function efficiently, and their availability is no less than 98% (ninety-\neight per cent) in a month; and\n(f)\n50% (fifty) percent of all phone calls relating to the XXX Ropeway are answered within\n30 (thirty) seconds.\n21.5\nMonthly status report",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0331",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 331,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 192802,
    "char_end": 193259,
    "char_count": 457,
    "text": "During Operation Period, the Concessionaire shall, no later than 7 (Seven) days after the close\nof each month, furnisha monthly report stating in detail the compliance with all the Key\nPerformance Indicators specified in this Article 21 along with an analysis of the reasons for\nfailures, if any, and the strategies for addressing the same and for otherwise improving the\noperational performance of the XXX Ropeway.\n21.6\nPenalty for shortfall in performance",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0332",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 332,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 193261,
    "char_end": 194127,
    "char_count": 866,
    "text": "The Concessionaire shall ensure and procure compliance of each of the Key Performance\nIndicators specified in this Article 21 and for any shortfall in average performance during a\nquarter, it shall pay Damages within 30 (thirty) days of the quarter in which the shortfall\noccurred. The Damages due and payable under this Clause 21.6 shall be determined at the rate\nof [1% (one per cent) of the total revenue from fee in the respective quarter for every shortfall\nof 10% (ten per cent)] in any single performance indicator specified  in this Article 21;\nprovided, however, that the Authority may waive the Damages, in part or full, if it is satisfied\nthat the Concessionaire has been carrying out its obligations diligently and efficiently and that\nthe shortfall to be waived was on account of reasons beyond the control of the Concessionaire.\n[21.7\nISO certification",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0333",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 333,
    "page_start": 83,
    "page_end": 83,
    "char_start": 194129,
    "char_end": 194424,
    "char_count": 295,
    "text": "21.7.1 The Concessionaire shall, within 6 (six) months from COD, achieve and thereafter maintain\nthroughout the Concession Period, ISO 9001:2015certification or a substitute thereof for all the\nfacilities at the XXX Ropeway, and shall provide a certified copy thereof to the Authority\nforthwith.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0334",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
