    "char_end": 203275,
    "char_count": 1380,
    "text": "Engineer. Upon receipt of such representation, the Authority shall hold a tripartite meeting\nwith the Concessionaire and Independent Engineer for an amicable resolution of the\nDispute, and if any difference or disagreement between the Authority and the\nConcessionaire remains unresolved, the Dispute shall be settled in accordance with the\nDispute Resolution Procedure. In the event that the appointment of the Independent\nEngineer is terminated hereunder, the Authority shall appoint forthwith another\nIndependent Engineer in accordance with Clause 24.1.\n24.5\nAuthorised signatories\nThe Authority shall require the Independent Engineer to designate and notify to the\nAuthority and the Concessionaire up to 2 (two) persons employed in its firm to sign for\nand on behalf of the Independent Engineer, and any communication or document required\nto be signed by the Independent Engineer shall be valid and effective only if signed by any\nof the designated persons; provided that the Independent Engineer may, by notice in\nwriting, substitute any of the designated persons by any of its employees.\n24.6\nDispute resolution\nIf either Party disputes any advice, instruction, decision, direction or award of the\nIndependent Engineer, or, as the case may be, the assertion or failure to assert jurisdiction,\nthe Dispute shall be resolved in accordance with the Dispute Resolution Procedure.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0352",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 352,
    "page_start": 92,
    "page_end": 92,
    "char_start": 203277,
    "char_end": 203279,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "92",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
