    "char_start": 222077,
    "char_end": 222171,
    "char_count": 94,
    "text": "ARTICLE 30: EFFECT OF VARIATIONS IN TRAFFIC GROWTH\n30.1\nEffect of variations in traffic growth",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0396",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 396,
    "page_start": 104,
    "page_end": 104,
    "char_start": 222173,
    "char_end": 222740,
    "char_count": 567,
    "text": "30.1.1 The Authority and the Concessionaire acknowledge that the traffic on the last day of the\nmonth of [month, year] (the “Target Date 1”)9 is estimated to be ***** passengers per\nday (the “Target Traffic 1”)10 and hereby agree that for determining the modifications to\nthe Concession Period under this Article 30, the actual traffic on Target Date 1 shall be\nderived by computing the average of the traffic, on the date that falls one year prior to the\nTarget Date 1, on Target Date 1 and on the first anniversary of Target Date 1 (the “Actual\nAverage Traffic 1”).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0397",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 397,
    "page_start": 104,
    "page_end": 104,
    "char_start": 222742,
    "char_end": 223499,
    "char_count": 757,
    "text": "30.1.2 Further, the Authority and the Concessionaire acknowledge that the traffic on the last day\nof the month of [month, year] (the “Target Date 2”)11 is estimated by increasing the Actual\nAverage Traffic 1 by 5% (five per cent) per annum from the Target Date 1 till Target Date\n2 (the “Target Traffic 2”) and hereby agree that for determining the modifications to the\nrevised Concession Period, modified as per Target Traffic 1 and Actual Average Traffic 1\nin Clause 30.2.1 (A) ) or Clause 30.2.2 (A) ), the actual traffic on Target Date 2 shall be\nderived by computing the average of the traffic , on the date that falls one year prior to the\nTarget Date 2, on Target Date 2 and on the first anniversary of Target Date 2 (the “Actual\nAverage Traffic 2”).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0398",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 398,
    "page_start": 104,
    "page_end": 104,
    "char_start": 223501,
    "char_end": 223967,
    "char_count": 466,
    "text": "30.1.3 In the event that the Actual Average Traffic 1 shall have fallen short of the Target Traffic\n1 by more than [2.5% (two point five per cent)] thereof or exceeded the Target Traffic 1\nby more than [2.5% (two point five per cent)] thereof, the Concession Period shall be\ndeemed to be modified in accordance with Clause 30.2  For the avoidance of doubt, in the\nevent of any Dispute relating to Actual Average Traffic, the Dispute Resolution Procedure\nshall apply.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0399",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 399,
    "page_start": 104,
    "page_end": 104,
    "char_start": 223969,
    "char_end": 224477,
    "char_count": 508,
    "text": "30.1.4 In the event that the Actual Average Traffic 2 shall have fallen short of the Target Traffic\n2 by more than [2.5% (two point five per cent)] thereof or exceeded the Target Traffic 2\nby more than [2.5% (two point five per cent)] thereof, the Concession Period shall be\ndeemed to be modified in accordance with Clause 30.2 For the avoidance of doubt, in the\nevent of any Dispute relating to Actual Average Traffic, the Dispute Resolution Procedure\nshall apply.\n30.2\nModification in the Concession Period",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
