    "char_start": 224479,
    "char_end": 224637,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "30.2.1  Subject to the provisions of Clause 30.1.2 or 30.1.3 in case Actual Average Traffic falls\nshort of Target Traffic, the modification shall be as under:",
