    "char_end": 224824,
    "char_count": 185,
    "text": "(A)\nIn the event Actual Average Traffic 1 shall have fallen short of the respective Target Traffic\n1, then for every 1% (one per cent) shortfall as compared to the Target Traffic 1, the",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
