    "paragraph_index": 402,
    "page_start": 104,
    "page_end": 104,
    "char_start": 224826,
    "char_end": 225412,
    "char_count": 586,
    "text": "9 The Target Date 1 to be specified here shall be between 7 (seven) and 10 (ten) years from the date of this\nAgreement.\n10 The Target Traffic 1 shall be a number based on the traffic report prepared by the Technical Consultant for\nthe XXX Ropeway. [It shall be based on 5% Compounded Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) over the base traffic\nestimated by the Technical Consultant for the XXX Ropeway].\n11 The Target Date 2 to be specified here shall be the minimum of 10 (ten) years from Target Date 1 or 7\n(seven) years prior to the date of expiry of the Concession Period, whichever is earlier.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
