    "paragraph_index": 404,
    "page_start": 105,
    "page_end": 105,
    "char_start": 225419,
    "char_end": 226239,
    "char_count": 820,
    "text": "Concession Period shall, subject to payment of Concession Fee in accordance with this\nAgreement, be increased by 1.5% (one point five per cent) thereof; provided that such\nincrease in Concession Period shall not in any case exceed 20% (twenty per cent) of the\nConcession Period. For the avoidance of doubt, and by way of illustration, it is agreed that\nin the event of a shortfall of 10.6% (ten point six per cent) in Target Traffic 1, the\nConcession Period shall be increased by 15% (fifteen per cent) thereof. Notwithstanding\nanything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, the Authority and the Concessionaire\nagree and acknowledge that upon modification as per Target Traffic 1 and Actual Average\nTraffic 1, the modified Concession Period shall become the Concession Period for the\npurpose of this XXX Ropeway.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
