    "page_end": 109,
    "char_start": 235572,
    "char_end": 236093,
    "char_count": 521,
    "text": "Upon commissioning of the Competing Facility, the Concessionaire shall continue to\ncollect the Fee, and shall not offer any discounts or reductions in such Fee except with the\nprior written consent of the Authority; provided that the Concessionaire may continue, in\nthe same form and manner, any discounts or reductions that it had offered to any general\nor special class of Users for a continuous period of three years prior to the opening of the\nCompeting Facility to traffic.\n31.4    Minimum Fee for Competing Facility",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0422",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 422,
    "page_start": 109,
    "page_end": 109,
    "char_start": 236095,
    "char_end": 236408,
    "char_count": 313,
    "text": "The Authority agrees and undertakes to procure that the fee to be levied and collected from\nany person using the Competing Facility during the subsistence of this Concession shall at\nno time be less than 25% (twenty five per cent) higher than the Fee levied and collected\nfrom similar Users using the XXX Ropeway.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
