    "text": "for submitting his assessment within 30 (thirty) days of his appointment hereunder;\nand\n(c)      [20% (twenty per cent)] of the sum of Total Project Cost and Equity Support, if\nany.\n38.6\nSurvival of rights\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, but subject to the\nprovisions of Clause 38.3 , any Termination pursuant to the provisions of this Agreement\nshall be without prejudice to the accrued rights of either Party including its right to claim\nand recover money damages, insurance proceeds, security deposits, and other rights and\nremedies, which it may have in law or contract. All rights and obligations of either Party\nunder this Agreement, including Termination Payments and Divestment Requirements,\nshall survive the Termination to the extent such survival is necessary for giving effect to\nsuch rights and obligations.",
