    "char_start": 326705,
    "char_end": 326708,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "154",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0541",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 541,
    "page_start": 154,
    "page_end": 154,
    "char_start": 326710,
    "char_end": 328254,
    "char_count": 1544,
    "text": "ARTICLE 46: DISCLOSURE\n46.1\nDisclosure of Specified Documents\nThe Concessionaire shall make available for inspection by any person, copies of this\nConcession Agreement, the Maintenance Manual, the Maintenance Programme and the\nMaintenance Requirements (hereinafter collectively referred to as the “Specified\nDocuments”), free of charge, during normal business hours on all working days at the\nConcessionaire’s Registered Office. The Concessionaire shall provide copies of the same\nto any person upon payment of copying charges on a ‘no profit no loss’ basis.\n46.2\nDisclosure of Documents relating to safety\nThe Concessionaire shall make available for inspection by any person copies of all\nDocuments and data relating to safety of the XXX Ropeway, free of charge, during normal\nbusiness hours on all working days, at the Concessionaire’s Registered Office. The\nConcessionaire shall make copies of the same available to any person upon payment of\ncopying charges on a ‘no profit no loss’ basis.\nNotwithstanding the provisions of Clauses 46.1 and 46.2, the Authority shall be entitled to\ndirect the Concessionaire, from time to time, to withhold the disclosure of Protected\nDocuments (as defined hereinbelow) to any person in pursuance of the aforesaid Clauses.\nExplanation:\nThe expression Protected Documents shall mean such of the Specified Documents or\ndocuments referred to in Clauses 46.1 and 46.2, or portions thereof, the disclosure of which\nthe Authority is entitled to withhold under the provisions of the Right to Information Act,\n2005.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0542",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 542,
    "page_start": 155,
