    "char_count": 194,
    "text": "SCHEDULE – A\n(See Clause 10.1)\nSITE OF THE PROJECT\n1\nThe Site\n\n1.1\nSite of the XXX Ropeway shall include the land, buildings, structures and road works as\ndescribed in Annex-I of this Schedule-A",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
