    "paragraph_index": 623,
    "page_start": 180,
    "page_end": 180,
    "char_start": 383238,
    "char_end": 383570,
    "char_count": 332,
    "text": "1.2\nAn inventory of the Site including the land, buildings, structures, road works, trees and any\nother immovable property on, or attached to, the Site shall be prepared jointly by the\nAuthority Representative and the Concessionaire, and such inventory shall form part of the\nmemorandum referred to in Clause 10.3.1of the Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0624",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 624,
    "page_start": 180,
    "page_end": 180,
    "char_start": 383572,
    "char_end": 384851,
    "char_count": 1279,
    "text": "2\nAdditional land for System Augmentation\n2.1\nAdditional land required for System Augmentation has been described in Annex-II of this\nSchedule-A. Such land shall be acquired by the Authority, at its own cost, no later than 3\n(three) years prior to the Scheduled System Augmentation Date, and shall thereupon form\npart of the Site. Any delay in granting Right of Way in respect of the land included in\nAnnex-II or part thereof shall entitle the Concessionaire to Damages in accordance with\nClause 10.3.4.\n2.2\nIf any land not forming part of this Schedule-A is required for construction of any\nunderbridge, overbridge, electric sub-station, maintenance depot, ancillary building or any\nother structure forming part of System Augmentation, the same shall be acquired by the\nAuthority no later than four years prior to the Scheduled System Augmentation  Date. The\nlocation and alignment of such land shall be determined by the Authority, in consultation\nwith the Concessionaire, before proceedings for its acquisition are initiated. In the event of\nany delay in the acquisition of land hereunder, the Concessionaire shall be entitled to\ncomplete and commission the Construction Works thereon within a period of three years\nfrom the date of such acquisition.\n3\nReal Estate Development",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0625",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 625,
    "page_start": 180,
    "page_end": 180,
    "char_start": 384853,
    "char_end": 385161,
    "char_count": 308,
    "text": "The land earmarked for Real Estate Development has been described in Annex-II of this\nSchedule-A, and such land shall form part of the Site.\n[Note: Through suitable drawings and description in words, the land, buildings, structures and\nroadworks comprising the Site shall be specified briefly but precisely.]",
