    "char_count": 219,
    "text": "SCHEDULE – C\n (See Clause 2.1)\nPROJECT FACILITIES\n1\nProject Facilities\n\nThe Concessionaire shall construct the Project Facilities in accordance with the provisions\nof this Agreement.\n2\nProject Facilities for XXX Ropeway",
