    "char_end": 392852,
    "char_count": 851,
    "text": "Annex - II\n(Schedule-C)\nProject Facilities for System Augmentation\n\n1\nProject Facilities\nThe Concessionaire shall construct the Project Facilities described in this Annex-II to form\npart of the System Augmentation. The Project Facilities shall include:\n(a)\nTicketing counters/ booths;\n(b)       ticket vending machines;\n(c)\npedestrian facilities;\n(d)\ntoilets;\n(e)\ntree plantation;\n(f)\nfacilities for disabled;\n(g)\nlifts and escalators at Stations;\n(h)\npublic address system at Stations;\n(i)\npublic information systems at Stations;\n(j)\nrefreshment facilities at Stations;\n(k)\npublic access telephones; and\n(l)\nothers (to be specified)]\n2\nDescription of Project Facilities\n[Each of the Project Facilities is briefly described below:]\n[To be described briefly.]\n[Note: This Annex-II may be omitted if two-stage capacity augmentation is not\ncontemplated.]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
