    "char_start": 395142,
    "char_end": 395145,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "208",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0672",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 672,
    "page_start": 208,
    "page_end": 208,
    "char_start": 395147,
    "char_end": 396187,
    "char_count": 1040,
    "text": "Annex - II\n(Schedule-D)\nSpecifications and Standards for System Augmentation\n1\nManual of Specifications and Standards to apply\nSubject to the provisions of Paragraph 2 of this Annex-II, System Augmentation shall\nconform to the Manual of Specifications and Standards for XXX Ropeway published by\nthe Authority. (An authenticated copy of the Manual has been provided to the\nConcessionaire as part of the bid documents.)\n 2\n[Deviations from the Manual\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in the aforesaid Manual, the following\nSpecifications and Standards shall apply to the System Augmentation, and for purposes of\nthis Agreement, the aforesaid Manual shall be deemed to be amended to the extent set forth\nbelow:]\n[Note 1: Deviations from the aforesaid Manual shall be listed out here. Such deviations\nshall be specified only if they are considered essential in view of project-specific\nrequirements.]\n [Note 2: See Note 1 below Schedule-D.]\n[Note 3: This Annex-II may be omitted if two-stage augmentation is not contemplated.]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0673",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 673,
    "page_start": 209,
    "page_end": 209,
    "char_start": 396189,
    "char_end": 396192,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "209",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0674",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 674,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 396194,
    "char_end": 396197,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "210",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0675",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 675,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 396199,
    "char_end": 396528,
    "char_count": 329,
    "text": "SCHEDULE –E\n(See Clause 4.1.3)\nAPPLICABLE PERMITS\n1\nApplicable Permits\n1.1\nThe Concessionaire shall obtain, as required under the Applicable Laws, the following\nApplicable Permits on or before the Appointed Date, save and except to the extent of a\nwaiver granted by the Authority in accordance with Clause 4.1.3 of the Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0676",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 676,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 396530,
    "char_end": 396794,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "Unless otherwise specified in this Agreement, Applicable Permits, if any, relating to\nenvironmental protection and conservation with respect to XXX Ropeways, excluding the\nReal Estate Development, shall have been procured by the Authority as a Condition\nPrecedent.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0677",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 677,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 396796,
    "char_end": 398196,
    "char_count": 1400,
    "text": "Sr.\nNo.\nDescription\nApprovals Required.\n1.\nNo Objection Certificate from the State Government.\n2.\nConsent to Establish and Consent to Operate under the Air (Prevention and\nControl of Pollution) Act, 1981 and Water (Prevention and Control of\nPollution) Act, 1974 from State Pollution Control Board (State and Centre).\n3.\nCompliance under the Building and Other Construction Workers (Regulation\nof Employment and Conditions of Service) Act, 1996.\n4.\nForest clearance from Ministry of Environment and Forest.\n5.\nNo-Objection certificate from relevant panchayat in whose territorial limits\nthe project is located, if applicable.\n6.\nClearance of fire safety standards and protection apparatus and system under\nthe Factories Act, 1948, and standards mandated by the local fire department,\nif applicable from Chief Inspector of Factories or any other designated\nauthority appointed.\n7.\nCompliance under Maternity Benefit Act, 1961.\n8.\nLicense for usage and storage of fuel oil storage tank, pressurized vessels,\nexplosive and inflammable liquids, gases and chemicals under (a) Explosives\nAct, 1884 read with Explosives Rules, 2008 and Gas Cylinder Rules, 2004;\nand (b) Petroleum Act, 1934 read with Petroleum Rules, 2002, if applicable\nfrom Chief Controller of Explosives, GoI, if applicable.\n9.\nApproval under the Electricity Act 2003 for electrical installations and works\nform Chief Electrical Inspector.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0678",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 678,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 398197,
    "char_end": 398492,
    "char_count": 295,
    "text": "10. Other facilitation that could be obtained from the nodal agency is statutory\nclearances from Govt. Departments/Agencies, Evacuation approval from\nState Transmission Utility (STU), Connectivity to the substation of STU,\nclearances from State Pollution Control Board (SPCB), whenever feasible.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0679",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 679,
    "page_start": 210,
    "page_end": 210,
    "char_start": 398493,
    "char_end": 398708,
    "char_count": 215,
    "text": "11. Certificate of Registration from the labour department issued under the Inter-\nState Migrant Workmen (Regulations of Employment and Conditions of\nServices) Act, 1979 in relation to employment of migrant workmen.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0680",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 680,
    "page_start": 211,
    "page_end": 211,
    "char_start": 398710,
    "char_end": 398713,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "211",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0681",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 681,
    "page_start": 211,
    "page_end": 211,
    "char_start": 398715,
    "char_end": 399421,
    "char_count": 706,
    "text": "12. Registration under Section 7 of Contract Labour (Regulation and Abolition)\nAct, 1970.\n13. Registration under Employees Provident Fund and Miscellaneous Provisions\nAct, 1952.\n14. Authorization for management and handling of hazardous waste under\nHazardous Waste (Management, Handling & Transboundary Movement)\nRules, 2016.\n15. Registration under Employee State Insurance Act, 1948.\n16. Consent for Right of Way under applicable law.\n17. NOC for height clearance from directorate of air traffic management, Airport\nAuthority of India when project lies within 20Kms radius of air strips/funnel.\n18. Approval under Ancient Monuments and Archaeological Sites and Remains\nAct, 1958 with subsequent amendments",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0682",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 682,
    "page_start": 211,
    "page_end": 211,
    "char_start": 399423,
    "char_end": 399660,
    "char_count": 237,
    "text": "1.2\nApplicable Permits, if any, relating to environmental protection and conservation during\nthe development of the XXX Ropeway, excluding the Real Estate Development, shall have\nbeen procured by the Authority [as a Condition Precedent].",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0683",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 683,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 399662,
    "char_end": 399665,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "212",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0684",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 684,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 399667,
    "char_end": 399741,
    "char_count": 74,
    "text": "SCHEDULE –F\n(See Clause 9.1)\nPERFORMANCE SECURITY\n\nThe Chairman,\nAuthority",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0685",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 685,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 399743,
    "char_end": 399751,
    "char_count": 8,
    "text": "WHEREAS:",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0686",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 686,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 399753,
    "char_end": 400208,
    "char_count": 455,
    "text": "(A)\n……………….. (the “Concessionaire”) and The Department of Tourism/Ministry of\nTourism including Agencies Urban Transport/Urban Local Body, XXX State (the\n“Authority”) have entered into a Concession Agreement dated ……………... (the\n“Agreement”) whereby the Authority has agreed to the Concessionaire undertaking XXX\nRopeway on design, build, finance, operate and transfer (the “DBFOT”) basis, subject to\nand in accordance with the provisions of the Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0687",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 687,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 400210,
    "char_end": 400549,
    "char_count": 339,
    "text": "(B)\nThe Agreement requires the Concessionaire to furnish a Performance Security to the\nAuthority in a sum of Rs. ***** cr. (Rupees ***** crore) (the “Guarantee Amount”) as\nsecurity for due and faithful performance of its obligations, under and in accordance with\nthe Agreement, during the Construction Period (as defined in the Agreement).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0688",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 688,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 400551,
    "char_end": 400688,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "(C)\nWe, …………………... through our Branch at …………………. (the “Bank”) have\nagreed to furnish this Bank Guarantee by way of Performance Security.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0689",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 689,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 400690,
    "char_end": 400790,
    "char_count": 100,
    "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, the Bank hereby, unconditionally and irrevocably, guarantees and affirms\nas follows:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0690",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 690,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 400792,
    "char_end": 401422,
    "char_count": 630,
    "text": "1.\nThe Bank hereby unconditionally and irrevocably guarantees the due and faithful\nperformance of the Concessionaire’s obligations during the Construction Period, under and\nin accordance with the Agreement, and agrees and undertakes to pay to the Authority, upon\nits mere first written demand, and without any demur, reservation, recourse, contest or\nprotest, and without any reference to the Concessionaire, such sum or sums upto an\naggregate sum of the Guarantee Amount as the Authority shall claim, without the Authority\nbeing required to prove or to show grounds or reasons for its demand and/or for the sum\nspecified therein.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0691",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 691,
    "page_start": 212,
    "page_end": 212,
    "char_start": 401424,
    "char_end": 402301,
    "char_count": 877,
    "text": "2.\nA letter from the Authority, under the hand of an Officer not below the rank of Deputy\nSecretary, that the Concessionaire has committed default in the due and faithful\nperformance of all or any of its obligations under and in accordance with the Agreement\nshall be conclusive, final and binding on the Bank. The Bank further agrees that the\nAuthority shall be the sole judge as to whether the Concessionaire is in default in due and\nfaithful performance of its obligations during the Construction Period under the Agreement\nand its decision that the Concessionaire is in default shall be final, and binding on the Bank,\nnotwithstanding any differences between the Authority and the Concessionaire, or any\nDispute between them pending before any court, tribunal, arbitrators or any other authority\nor body, or by the discharge of the Concessionaire for any reason whatsoever.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0692",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 692,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 402303,
    "char_end": 402306,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "213",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0693",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 693,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 402308,
    "char_end": 402684,
    "char_count": 376,
    "text": "3.\nIn order to give effect to this Guarantee, the Authority shall be entitled to act as if the Bank\nwere the principal debtor and any change in the constitution of the Concessionaire and/or\nthe Bank, whether by their absorption with any other body or corporation or otherwise,\nshall not in any way or manner affect the liability or obligation of the Bank under this\nGuarantee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0694",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 694,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 402686,
    "char_end": 402876,
    "char_count": 190,
    "text": "4.\nIt shall not be necessary, and the Bank hereby waives any necessity, for the Authority to\nproceed against the Concessionaire before presenting to the Bank its demand under this\nGuarantee.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0695",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 695,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 402878,
    "char_end": 404128,
    "char_count": 1250,
    "text": "5.\nThe Authority shall have the liberty, without affecting in any manner the liability of the\nBank under this Guarantee, to vary at any time, the terms and conditions of the Agreement\nor to extend the time or period for the compliance with, fulfilment and/ or performance of\nall or any of the obligations of the Concessionaire contained in the Agreement or to\npostpone for any time, and from time to time, any of the rights and powers exercisable by\nthe Authority against the Concessionaire, and either to enforce or forbear from enforcing\nany of the terms and conditions contained in the Agreement and/or the securities available\nto the Authority, and the Bank shall not be released from its liability and obligation under\nthese presents by any exercise by the Authority of the liberty with reference to the matters\naforesaid or by reason of time being given to the Concessionaire or any other forbearance,\nindulgence, act or omission on the part of the Authority or of any other matter or thing\nwhatsoever which under any law relating to sureties and guarantors would but for this\nprovision have the effect of releasing the Bank from its liability and obligation under this\nGuarantee and the Bank hereby waives all of its rights under any such law.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0696",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 696,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 404130,
    "char_end": 404448,
    "char_count": 318,
    "text": "6.\nThis Guarantee is in addition to and not in substitution of any other guarantee or security\nnow or which may hereafter be held by the Authority in respect of or relating to the\nAgreement or for the fulfilment, compliance and/or performance of all or any of the\nobligations of the Concessionaire under the Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0697",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 697,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 404450,
    "char_end": 405062,
    "char_count": 612,
    "text": "7.\nNotwithstanding anything contained hereinbefore, the liability of the Bank under this\nGuarantee is restricted to the Guarantee Amount and this Guarantee will remain in force\nuntil the earlier of the 1st (first) anniversary of the Appointed Date or compliance of the\nconditions specified in paragraph 8 below and unless a demand or claim in writing is made\nby the Authority on the Bank under this Guarantee, no later than 6 (six) months from the\ndate of expiry of this Guarantee, all rights of the Authority under this Guarantee shall be\nforfeited and the Bank shall be relieved from its liabilities hereunder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0698",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 698,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 405064,
    "char_end": 405686,
    "char_count": 622,
    "text": "8.\nThe Performance Security shall cease to be in force and effect when the Concessionaire\nshall have expended on Project construction an aggregate sum not less than 20% (twenty\nper cent) of the Total Project Cost which is deemed to be Rs.*** cr. (Rupees ***** crore)\nfor the purposes of this Guarantee, and provided the Concessionaire is not in breach of this\nAgreement. Upon request made by the Concessionaire for release of the Performance\nSecurity along with the particulars required hereunder, duly certified by a statutory auditor\nof the Concessionaire, the Authority shall release the Performance Security forthwith.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0699",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 699,
    "page_start": 213,
    "page_end": 213,
    "char_start": 405688,
    "char_end": 405969,
    "char_count": 281,
    "text": "9.\nThe Bank undertakes not to revoke this Guarantee during its currency, except with the\nprevious express consent of the Authority in writing and declares and warrants that it has\nthe power to issue this Guarantee and the undersigned has full powers to do so on behalf\nof the Bank.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0700",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 700,
    "page_start": 214,
    "page_end": 214,
    "char_start": 405971,
    "char_end": 405974,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "214",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0701",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 701,
    "page_start": 214,
    "page_end": 214,
    "char_start": 405976,
    "char_end": 406595,
    "char_count": 619,
    "text": "10.\nAny notice by way of request, demand or otherwise hereunder may be sent by post\naddressed to the Bank at its above referred Branch, which shall be deemed to have been\nduly authorised to receive such notice and to effect payment thereof forthwith, and if sent\nby post it shall be deemed to have been given at the time when it ought to have been\ndelivered in due course of post and in proving such notice, when given by post, it shall be\nsufficient to prove that the envelope containing the notice was posted and a certificate\nsigned by an officer of the Authority that the envelope was so posted shall be conclusive.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0702",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 702,
    "page_start": 214,
    "page_end": 214,
    "char_start": 406597,
    "char_end": 406851,
    "char_count": 254,
    "text": "11.\nThis Guarantee shall come into force with immediate effect and shall remain in force and\neffect for a period of one year and six months from the date hereof or until it is released\nearlier by the Authority pursuant to the provisions of the Agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0703",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 703,
    "page_start": 214,
    "page_end": 214,
    "char_start": 406853,
    "char_end": 406911,
    "char_count": 58,
    "text": "Signed and sealed this ………. day of ………..., 20……… at ………...",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0704",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
