    "char_start": 472565,
    "char_end": 472574,
    "char_count": 9,
    "text": "(Address)",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0872",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 872,
    "page_start": 252,
    "page_end": 252,
    "char_start": 472576,
    "char_end": 472595,
    "char_count": 19,
    "text": "In the presence of:",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0873",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 873,
    "page_start": 252,
    "page_end": 252,
    "char_start": 472597,
    "char_end": 472599,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "1.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0874",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 874,
    "page_start": 252,
    "page_end": 252,
    "char_start": 472601,
    "char_end": 472603,
    "char_count": 2,
    "text": "2.",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0875",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 875,
    "page_start": 253,
    "page_end": 253,
    "char_start": 472605,
    "char_end": 472608,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "253",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0876",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 876,
    "page_start": 254,
    "page_end": 254,
    "char_start": 472610,
    "char_end": 473650,
    "char_count": 1040,
    "text": "254\n\nSCHEDULE – O\n (See Clause 24.3.1)\nTRAFFIC SAMPLING\n1\nTraffic sampling\nThe Authority may, in its discretion and at its own cost, undertake traffic sampling,\npursuant to Clause 24.3, in order to determine the actual traffic on the XXX Ropeway. In\nparticular, the Authority may undertake traffic sampling for determining PHPDT. Such\ntraffic sampling shall be undertaken through the Independent Engineer in the manner set\nforth below or in such manner as the Parties hereto may agree upon.\n2\nManual traffic count\nThe Independent Engineer shall employ the required number of enumerators who shall\ncount, classify and record all the Users as they pass by, and divide the survey into fixed\ntime periods. The count stations shall be located near the Fee collection gates at all s tations\nof the XXX Ropeway. The survey shall be conducted continuously for a minimum of 24\n(twenty four) hours and maximum of 7 (seven) days at a time. Special surveys may also be\nundertaken for determining the PHPDT and such surveys may be carried out for upto 4",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0877",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 877,
    "page_start": 254,
    "page_end": 254,
    "char_start": 473651,
    "char_end": 475098,
    "char_count": 1447,
    "text": "(four) Peak Hours in a day for a continuous period of 7 (seven) days. The count period\nshall be 15 (fifteen) minutes with results summarised hourly. All surveys shall be\nconducted substantially in the manner specified in this Schedule – O or in such manner as\nthe Parties may agree upon.\n3\nAutomatic traffic count\nFor automatic traffic count to be conducted on intermittent (non-continuous) basis, the\nIndependent Engineer shall use suitable and standardised equipment to classify and record\nthe Users passing through the Fee collection gates and the gates. For this purpose, the\ncounter shall be checked with at least [1,000 (one thousand)] Users to ensure that Users are\nbeing counted and classified correctly.\n4\nVariation between manual and automatic count\nAverage Daily Traffic (ADT) shall be determined separately by the aforesaid two methods\nand in the event that the number of Users, as counted by the manual method, varies by\nmore than 1% (one per cent) of the number of such Users as counted by the automatic\nmethod, the manual and automatic count shall be repeated, and in the event of any\ndiscrepancy between the two counts in the second enumeration, the average thereof shall\nbe deemed to be the actual traffic. For the avoidance of doubt, it is expressly agreed that\nthe Authority may, in consultation with the Concessionaire, adopt modified or alternative\nprocesses of traffic sampling for improving the reliability of such sampling.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0878",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 878,
    "page_start": 255,
    "page_end": 255,
    "char_start": 475100,
    "char_end": 476885,
    "char_count": 1785,
    "text": "255\n\nSCHEDULE – P\n(See Clause 44.3)\nSUBSTITUTION AGREEMENT\nTHIS SUBSTITUTION AGREEMENT is entered into on this the ……………. day of ……….\n20….\nAMONGST\n1\nThe Chairman, Department of Tourism, XXX State and having its principal offices at xxx,\nState Capital – Pin code (hereinafter referred to as the “Authority” which expression shall\nunless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include its administrators, successors\nand assigns);\n2\n…………………. LIMITED, a company incorporated under the provisions of the\nCompanies Act, 1956 or Companies Act, 2013, as the case may be and having its registered\noffice at …………….., (hereinafter referred to as the “Concessionaire” which expression\nshall unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include its successors and\npermitted assigns and substitutes);\n3\n……………………..name and particulars of Lenders’ Representative and having its\nregistered office at ……………………, acting for and on behalf of the Senior Lenders as\ntheir duly authorised agent with regard to matters arising out of or in relation to this\nAgreement (hereinafter referred to as the “Lenders’ Representative”, which expression\nshall unless repugnant to the context or meaning thereof include its successors and\nsubstitutes);\nWHEREAS:\n(A)\nThe Authority has entered into a Concession Agreement dated ……………… with the\nConcessionaire (the “Concession Agreement”) for ***** ropeway (“XXX Ropeway”) on\ndesign, build, finance, operate and transfer basis (the “DBFOT”), and a copy of which is\nannexed hereto and marked as Annex-A to form part of this Agreement.\n(B)\nSenior Lenders have agreed to finance the Project in accordance with the terms and\nconditions set forth in the Financing Agreements.\n(C)\nSenior Lenders have requested the Authority to enter into this Substitution Agreement for",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0879",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 879,
    "page_start": 255,
    "page_end": 255,
    "char_start": 476886,
    "char_end": 477658,
    "char_count": 772,
    "text": "securing their interests through assignment, transfer and substitution of the Concession to\na Nominated Company in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement and the\nConcession Agreement.\n(D)\nIn order to enable implementation of the Project including its financing, construction,\noperation and maintenance, the Authority has agreed and undertaken to transfer and assign\nthe Concession to a Nominated Company in accordance with the terms and conditions set\nforth in this Agreement and the Concession Agreement.\n NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the foregoing and the respective Covenants and\nagreements set forth in this Agreement, the receipt and sufficiency of which is hereby\nacknowledged, and intending to be legally bound hereby, the Parties agree as follows:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0880",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 880,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 477660,
    "char_end": 477663,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "256",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0881",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 881,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 477665,
    "char_end": 477907,
    "char_count": 242,
    "text": "1\nDEFINITIONS AND INTERPRETATION\n1.1       Definitions\n\nIn this Substitution Agreement, the following words and expressions shall, unless\nrepugnant to the context or meaning thereof, have the meaning hereinafter respectively\nassigned to them:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0882",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 882,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 477909,
    "char_end": 478048,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "“Agreement” means this Substitution Agreement and any amendment thereto made in\naccordance with the provisions contained in this Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0883",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 883,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 478050,
    "char_end": 478267,
    "char_count": 217,
    "text": "“Financial Default” means occurrence of a material breach of the terms and conditions of\nthe Financing Agreements or a continuous default in Debt Service by the Concessionaire\nfor a minimum period of 3 (three) months;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0884",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 884,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 478269,
    "char_end": 478381,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "“Lenders’ Representative” means the person referred to as the Lenders’ Representative\nin the foregoing Recitals;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0885",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 885,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 478383,
    "char_end": 478654,
    "char_count": 271,
    "text": "“Nominated Company” means a company, incorporated under the provisions of the\nCompanies Act, 1956, selected by the Lenders’ Representative, on behalf of Senior\nLenders, and proposed to the Authority for assignment/transfer of the Concession as\nprovided in this Agreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0886",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 886,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 478656,
    "char_end": 478746,
    "char_count": 90,
    "text": "“Notice of Financial Default” shall have the meaning ascribed thereto in Clause 3.2.1; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0887",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 887,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 478748,
    "char_end": 479754,
    "char_count": 1006,
    "text": "“Parties” means the parties to this Agreement collectively and “Party” shall mean any of\nthe Parties to this Agreement individually.\n1.2       INTERPRETATION\n1.2.1\nReferences to Lenders’ Representative shall, unless repugnant to the context or meaning\nthereof, mean references to the Lenders’ Representative, acting for and on behalf of Senior\nLenders.\n1.2.2\nReferences to Clauses are, unless stated otherwise, references to Clauses of this Agreement.\n1.2.3\nThe words and expressions beginning with capital letters and defined in this Agreement\nshall have the meaning ascribed thereto herein, and the words and expressions used in this\nAgreement and not defined herein but defined in the Concession Agreement shall, unless\nrepugnant to the context, have the meaning ascribed thereto in the Concession Agreement.\n1.2.4\nThe rules of interpretation stated in Clauses 1.2, 1.3 and 1.4 of the Concession Agreement\nshall apply, mutatis mutandis, to this Agreement.\n2\nASSIGNMENT\n2.1\nAssignment of rights and title",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0888",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 888,
    "page_start": 256,
    "page_end": 256,
    "char_start": 479756,
    "char_end": 480091,
    "char_count": 335,
    "text": "The Concessionaire hereby agrees to assign the rights, title and interest in the Concession\nto, and in favour of, the Lenders’ Representative pursuant to and in accordance with the\nprovisions of this Agreement and the Concession Agreement by way of security in respect\nof financing by the Senior Lenders under the Financing Agreements.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0889",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 889,
    "page_start": 257,
    "page_end": 257,
    "char_start": 480093,
    "char_end": 481832,
    "char_count": 1739,
    "text": "257\n\n3\nSUBSTITUTION OF THE CONCESSIONAIRE\n3.1\nRights of substitution\n3.1.1\nPursuant to the rights, title and interest assigned under Clause 2.1, the Lenders’\nRepresentative shall be entitled to substitute the Concessionaire by a Nominated Company\nunder and in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement and the Concession\nAgreement.\n3.1.2\nThe Authority hereby agrees to substitute the Concessionaire by endorsement on the\nConcession Agreement in favour of the Nominated Company selected by the Lenders’\nRepresentative in accordance with this Agreement. For the avoidance of doubt, the Senior\nLenders or the Lenders’ Representative shall not be entitled to operate and maintain the\nXXX Ropeway as Concessionaire either individually or collectively.\n3.2\nSubstitution upon occurrence of Financial Default\n3.2.1\nUpon occurrence of a Financial Default, the Lenders’ Representative may issue a notice to\nthe Concessionaire (the “Notice of Financial Default”) along with particulars thereof and\nsend a copy to the Authority for its information and record. A Notice of Financial Default\nunder this Clause 3 shall be conclusive evidence of such Financial Default and it shall be\nfinal and binding upon the Concessionaire for the purposes of this Agreement.\n3.2.2\nUpon issue of a Notice of Financial Default hereunder, the Lenders’ Representative may,\nwithout prejudice to any of its rights or remedies under this Agreement or the Financing\nAgreements, substitute the Concessionaire by a Nominated Company in accordance with\nthe provisions of this Agreement.\n3.2.3\nAt any time after the Lenders’ Representative has issued a Notice of Financial Default, it\nmay by notice require the Authority to suspend all the rights of the Concessionaire and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0890",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 890,
    "page_start": 257,
    "page_end": 257,
    "char_start": 481833,
    "char_end": 483401,
    "char_count": 1568,
    "text": "undertake the operation and maintenance of the XXX Ropeway in accordance with the\nprovisions of Article 40 of the Concession Agreement, and upon receipt of such notice, the\nAuthority shall undertake Suspension under and in accordance with the provisions of the\nConcession Agreement. The aforesaid Suspension shall be revoked upon substitution of\nthe Concessionaire by a Nominated Company, and in the event such substitution is not\ncompleted within 180 (one hundred and eighty) days from the date of such Suspension, the\nAuthority may terminate the Concession Agreement forthwith by issuing a Termination\nNotice in accordance with the provisions of the Concession Agreement; provided that upon\nwritten request from the Lenders’ Representative and the Concessionaire, the Authority\nmay extend the aforesaid period of 180 (one hundred and eighty) days by a period not\nexceeding 90 (ninety) days.For the avoidance of doubt, the Authority expressly agrees and\nundertakes to terminate the Concession Agreement forthwith, upon receipt of a written\nrequest from the Lenders’ Representative at any time after 240 (two hundred and forty)\ndays from the date of Suspension hereunder.\n3.3\nSubstitution upon occurrence of Concessionaire Default\n3.3.1  Upon occurrence of a Concessionaire Default, the Authority shall, by a notice, inform the\nLenders’ Representative of its intention to issue a Termination Notice and grant 15 (fifteen)\ndays’ time to the Lenders’ Representative to make a representation, stating the intention to\nsubstitute the Concessionaire by a Nominated Company.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0891",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 891,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 483403,
    "char_end": 483406,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "258",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0892",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 892,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 483408,
    "char_end": 485137,
    "char_count": 1729,
    "text": "3.3.2\nIn the event that the Lenders’ Representative makes a representation to the Authority within\nthe period of 15 (fifteen) days specified in Clause 3.3.1, stating that it intends to substitute\nthe Concessionaire by a Nominated Company, the Lenders’ Representative shall be entitled\nto undertake and complete the substitution of the Concessionaire by a Nominated Company\nin accordance with the provisions of this Agreement within a period of 180 (one hundred\nand eighty) days from the date of such representation, and the Authority shall either\nwithhold Termination or undertake Suspension for the aforesaid period of 180 (one\nhundred and eighty) days; provided that upon written request from the Lenders’\nRepresentative and the Concessionaire, the Authority shall extend the aforesaid period of\n180 (one hundred and eighty) days by a period not exceeding 90 (ninety) days.\n3.4       Procedure for substitution\n3.4.1\nThe Authority and the Concessionaire hereby agree that on or after the date of Notice of\nFinancial Default or the date of representation to the Authority under Clause 3.3.2, as the\ncase may be, the Lenders’ Representative may, without prejudice to any of the other rights\nor remedies of the Senior Lenders, invite, negotiate and procure offers, either by private\nnegotiations or public auction or tenders for the take over and transfer of the XXX Ropeway\nincluding the Concession to the Nominated Company upon such Nominated Company’s\nassumption of the liabilities and obligations of the Concessionaire towards the Authority\nunder the Concession Agreement and towards the Senior Lenders under the Financing\nAgreements.\n3.4.2\nTo be eligible for substitution in place of the Concessionaire, the Nominated Company",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0893",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 893,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 485138,
    "char_end": 485704,
    "char_count": 566,
    "text": "shall be required to fulfil the eligibility criteria that were laid down by the Authority for\nshortlisting the bidders for award of the Concession; provided that the Lenders’\nRepresentative may represent to the Authority that all or any of such criteria may be waived\nin the interest of the Project, and if the Authority determines that such waiver shall not have\nany Material Adverse Effect on the Project, it may waive all or any of such eligibility\ncriteria.\n3.4.3\nUpon selection of a Nominated Company, the Lenders’ Representative shall request the\nAuthority to:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0894",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 894,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 485706,
    "char_end": 485877,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "(a)\naccede to transfer to the Nominated Company the right to construct, operate and\nmaintain the XXX Ropeway in accordance with the provisions of the Concession\nAgreement;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0895",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 895,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 485879,
    "char_end": 486018,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "(b)\nendorse and transfer the Concession to the Nominated Company, on the same\nterms and conditions, for the residual Concession Period; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0896",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 896,
    "page_start": 258,
    "page_end": 258,
    "char_start": 486020,
    "char_end": 486802,
    "char_count": 782,
    "text": "(c)\nenter into a Substitution Agreement with the Lenders’ Representative and the\nNominated Company on the same terms as are contained in this Agreement.\n3.4.4  If the Authority has any objection to the transfer of Concession in favour of the Nominated\nCompany in accordance with this Agreement, it shall within 15 (fifteen) days from the date\nof proposal made by the Lenders’ Representative, give a reasoned order after hearing the\nLenders’ Representative. If no such objection is raised by the Authority, the Nominated\nCompany shall be deemed to have been accepted. The Authority thereupon shall transfer\nand endorse the Concession within 15 (fifteen) days of its acceptance/deemed acceptance\nof the Nominated Company; provided that in the event of such objection by the Authority,",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0897",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 897,
    "page_start": 259,
    "page_end": 259,
    "char_start": 486804,
    "char_end": 486807,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "259",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0898",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 898,
    "page_start": 259,
    "page_end": 259,
    "char_start": 486809,
    "char_end": 488568,
    "char_count": 1759,
    "text": "the Lenders’ Representative may propose another Nominated Company whereupon the\nprocedure set forth in this Clause 3.4 shall be followed for substitution of such Nominated\nCompany in place of the Concessionaire.\n3.5\nSelection to be binding\nThe decision of the Lenders’ Representative and the Authority in selection of the\nNominated Company shall be final and binding on the Concessionaire. The Concessionaire\nirrevocably agrees and waives any right to challenge the actions of the Lenders’\nRepresentative or the Senior Lenders or the Authority taken pursuant to this Agreement\nincluding the transfer/assignment of the Concession in favour of the Nominated Company.\nThe Concessionaire agrees and confirms that it shall not have any right to seek revaluation\nof assets of the Project or the Concessionaire’s shares. It is hereby acknowledged by the\nParties that the rights of the Lenders’ Representative are irrevocable and shall not be\ncontested in any proceedings before any court or Authority and the Concessionaire shall\nhave no right or remedy to prevent, obstruct or restrain the Authority or the Lenders’\nRepresentative from effecting or causing the transfer by substitution and endorsement of\nthe Concession as requested by the Lenders’ Representative.\n4\nPROJECT AGREEMENTS\n4.1       Substitution of Nominated Company in Project Agreements\nThe Concessionaire shall ensure and procure that each Project Agreement contains\nprovisions that entitle the Nominated Company to step into such Project Agreement, in its\ndiscretion, in place and substitution of the Concessionaire in the event of such Nominated\nCompany’s assumption of the liabilities and obligations of the Concessionaire under the\nConcession Agreement.\n5\nTERMINATION OF CONCESSION AGREEMENT\n5.1",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0899",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 899,
    "page_start": 259,
    "page_end": 259,
    "char_start": 488569,
    "char_end": 489719,
    "char_count": 1150,
    "text": "Termination upon occurrence of Financial Default\nAt any time after issue of a Notice of Financial Default, the Lenders’ Representative may\nby a notice in writing require the Authority to terminate the Concession Agreement\nforthwith, and upon receipt of such notice, the Authority shall undertake Termination under\nand in accordance with the provisions of Article 41 of the Concession Agreement.\n5.2\nTermination when no Nominated Company is selected\nIn the event that no Nominated Company acceptable to the Authority is selected and\nrecommended by the Lenders’ Representative within the period of 180 (one hundred and\neighty) days or any extension thereof as set forth in Clause 3.3.2, the Authority may\nterminate the Concession Agreement forthwith in accordance with the provisions thereof.\n5.3\nRealisation of Debt Due\nThe Authority and the Concessionaire hereby acknowledge and agree that, without\nprejudice to their any other right or remedy, the Lenders’ Representative is entitled to\nreceive from the Concessionaire, without any further reference to or consent of the\nConcessionaire, the Debt Due upon Termination of the Concession Agreement. For",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0900",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 900,
    "page_start": 260,
    "page_end": 260,
    "char_start": 489721,
    "char_end": 489724,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "260",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0901",
