    "page_start": 261,
    "page_end": 261,
    "char_start": 492615,
    "char_end": 493826,
    "char_count": 1211,
    "text": "the proceedings in the name of the Indemnified Party and shall bear all costs involved in\ncontesting the same. The Indemnified Party shall provide all cooperation and assistance in\ncontesting any claim and shall sign all such writings and documents as the Indemnifying\nParty may reasonably require.\n8\nDISPUTE RESOLUTION\n8.1        Dispute resolution\n8.1.1\nAny dispute, difference or claim arising out of or in connection with this Agreement which\nis not resolved amicably shall be decided by reference to arbitration to a Board of\nArbitrators comprising one nominee each of the Authority, Concessionaire and the\nLenders’ Representative. Such arbitration shall be held in accordance with the Rules of\nArbitration of the International Centre for Alternative Dispute Resolution, New Delhi (the\n“Rules”) or such other rules as may be mutually agreed by the Parties, and shall be subject\nto provisions of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996.\n8.1.2\nThe Arbitrators shall issue a reasoned award and such award shall be final and binding on\nthe Parties. The venue of arbitration shall be Delhi and the language of arbitration shall be\nEnglish.\n9\nMISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS\n9.1        Governing law and jurisdiction",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0906",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 906,
    "page_start": 261,
    "page_end": 261,
    "char_start": 493828,
    "char_end": 494075,
    "char_count": 247,
    "text": "This Agreement shall be construed and interpreted in accordance with and governed by the\nlaws of India, and the Courts at Delhi shall have jurisdiction over all matters arising out of\nor relating to this Agreement.\n9.2\nWaiver of sovereign immunity",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0907",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
