    "page_end": 261,
    "char_start": 494276,
    "char_end": 494634,
    "char_count": 358,
    "text": "(b)\nagrees that, should any proceedings be brought against it or its assets, property or\nrevenues in any jurisdiction in relation to this Agreement or any transaction\ncontemplated by this Agreement, no immunity (whether by reason of sovereignty\nor otherwise) from such proceedings shall be claimed by or on behalf of the\nAuthority with respect to its assets;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
