    "char_end": 495849,
    "char_count": 347,
    "text": "All additions, amendments, modifications and variations to this Agreement shall be\neffectual and binding only if in writing and signed by the duly authorised representatives\nof the Parties.\n9.5\nWaiver\n9.5.1\nWaiver by any Party of a default by another Party in the observance and performance of\nany provision of or obligations under this Agreement:",
