    "char_start": 496126,
    "char_end": 496619,
    "char_count": 493,
    "text": "(c)\nshall not affect the validity or enforceability of this Agreement in any manner.\n9.5.2  Neither the failure by either Party to insist on any occasion upon the performance of the\nterms, conditions and provisions of this Agreement or any obligation thereunder nor time\nor other indulgence granted by a Party to another Party shall be treated or deemed as waiver\nof such breach or acceptance of any variation or the relinquishment of any such right\nhereunder.\n9.6\nNo third party beneficiaries",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
