    "paragraph_index": 919,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 497499,
    "char_end": 498273,
    "char_count": 774,
    "text": "263\n\n9.8\nSeverability\n\nIf for any reason whatever any provision of this Agreement is or becomes invalid, illegal\nor unenforceable or is declared by any court of competent jurisdiction or any other\ninstrumentality to be invalid, illegal or unenforceable, the validity, legality or\nenforceability of the remaining provisions shall not be affected in any manner, and the\nParties will negotiate in good faith with a view to agreeing to one or more provisions which\nmay be substituted for such invalid, unenforceable or illegal provisions, as nearly as is\npracticable to such invalid, illegal or unenforceable provision. Failure to agree upon any\nsuch provisions shall not be subject to dispute resolution under Clause 8 of this Agreement\nor otherwise.\n9.9\nSuccessors and assigns",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0920",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 920,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 498275,
    "char_end": 498423,
    "char_count": 148,
    "text": "This Agreement shall be binding on and shall inure to the benefit of the Parties and their\nrespective successors and permitted assigns.\n9.10\nNotices",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0921",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 921,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 498425,
    "char_end": 499562,
    "char_count": 1137,
    "text": "All notices or other communications to be given or made under this Agreement shall be in\nwriting, shall either be delivered personally or sent by courier or registered post with an\nadditional copy to be sent by facsimile or e-mail. The address for service of each Party, its\nfacsimile number and e-mail address are set out under its name on the signing pages hereto.\nA notice shall be effective upon actual receipt thereof, save that where it is received after\n5.30 (five thirty) p.m. on any day, or on a day that is a public holiday, the notice shall be\ndeemed to be received on the first working day following the date of actual receipt. Without\nprejudice to the foregoing, a Party giving or making a notice or communication by\nfacsimile or e-mail shall promptly deliver a copy thereof personally or send it by courier\nor registered post to the addressee of such notice or communication. It is hereby agreed\nand acknowledged that any Party may by notice change the address to which such notices\nand communications to it are to be delivered or mailed. Such change shall be effective\nwhen all the Parties have notice of it.\n9.11\nLanguage",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0922",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 922,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 499564,
    "char_end": 499717,
    "char_count": 153,
    "text": "All notices, certificates, correspondence and proceedings under or in connection with this\nAgreement shall be in English.\n9.12\nAuthorised representatives",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0923",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 923,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 499719,
    "char_end": 500038,
    "char_count": 319,
    "text": "Each of the Parties shall by notice in writing designate their respective authorised\nrepresentatives through whom only all communications shall be made. A Party hereto shall\nbe entitled to remove and/or substitute or make fresh appointment of such authorised\nrepresentative by similar notice.\n9.13     Original Document",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0924",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 924,
    "page_start": 263,
    "page_end": 263,
    "char_start": 500040,
    "char_end": 500208,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "This Agreement may be executed in three counterparts, each of which when executed and\ndelivered shall constitute an original of this Agreement.\n[Signature page follows]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
