    "text": "(2)\nFee collected\n(in lakh Rs.)\n(3)\nNo. of\nUsers\n\n(4)\nFee\ncollected (in\nlakh Rs.)\n(5)\nFee per\nUser\n(in Rs.)\n(6)\nNo. of\nUsers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0994",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 994,
    "page_start": 274,
    "page_end": 274,
    "char_start": 517191,
    "char_end": 517362,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "(7)\nFee collected\n(in lakh Rs.)\n(8)\n\nNote 1: Monthly Fee Statements for Monthly Passes and Daily Passes have been prepared\nseparately in the above format and are enclosed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0995",
