    "page_start": 289,
    "page_end": 290,
    "char_start": 551856,
    "char_end": 551898,
    "char_count": 42,
    "text": "289\n\n290\n\nSCHEDULE – T\n(See Clause 34.2.1)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1054",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1054,
    "page_start": 290,
    "page_end": 290,
    "char_start": 551900,
    "char_end": 553191,
    "char_count": 1291,
    "text": "PANEL OF CHARTERED ACCOUNTANTS\n1.\nPanel of Chartered Accountants\nPursuant to the provisions of Clause 34.2.1 of the Agreement, the Authority and the\nConcessionaire shall prepare a mutually agreed panel of 10 (ten) reputable firms of\nChartered Accountants having their registered offices in India (the “Panel of Chartered\nAccountants”). The criteria for preparing such Panel and the procedure to be adopted in\nthis behalf shall be as set forth in this Schedule- T\n2.\nInvitation for empanelment\n2.1\nThe Authority shall invite offers from all reputable firms of Chartered Accountants who\nfulfil the following eligibility criteria, namely:\n(a)\nthe firm should have conducted statutory audit of the annual accounts of at least\none hundred companies registered under the Companies Act, 1956 or Companies\nAct 2013, as the case may be, of which at least ten should have been public sector\nundertakings;\n(b)\nthe firm should have at least 5 (five) practicing Chartered Accountants on its rolls,\neach with a minimum experience of ten years in the profession;\n(c)\nthe firm or any of its partners should not have been disqualified or black-listed by\nthe Comptroller and Auditor General of India or the Authority; and\n(d)\nthe firm should have an office in the State or in an adjacent State with at least 2",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1055",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1055,
    "page_start": 290,
    "page_end": 290,
    "char_start": 553192,
    "char_end": 553746,
    "char_count": 554,
    "text": "(two) practicing Chartered Accountants on its rolls in such State.\n2.2\nInterested firms meeting the eligibility criteria shall be required to submit a statement of\ntheir capability including the bio-data of all the practicing Chartered Accountants on its\nrolls. In particular, each firm shall be required to furnish year-wise information relating to\nthe names of all the companies with an annual turnover exceeding Rs. 25,00,00,000 (Rs.\ntwenty-five crore) whose annual accounts were audited by such firm in any of the\npreceding 5 (five) Accounting Years.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1056",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1056,
    "page_start": 290,
    "page_end": 290,
    "char_start": 553747,
    "char_end": 554682,
    "char_count": 935,
    "text": "3.          Evaluation and selection\n3.1\nThe information furnished by each firm shall be scrutinised and evaluated by the Authority\nand 1 (one) point shall be awarded for each annual audit of the companies specified in\nParagraph 2.2 above. (For the avoidance of doubt, a firm which has conducted audit of the\nannual accounts of any such company for five years shall be awarded five points).\n3.2\nThe Authority shall prepare a list of all the eligible firms along with the points scored by\neach such firm and 10 (ten) firms scoring the highest points shall be identified and included\nin the draft Panel of Chartered Accountants.\n4.\nConsultation with the Concessionaire\nThe Authority shall convey the aforesaid panel of firms to the Concessionaire for scrutiny\nand comments, if any. The Concessionaire shall be entitled to scrutinise the relevant\nrecords of the Authority to ascertain whether the selection of firms has been undertaken in",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1057",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1057,
    "page_start": 291,
    "page_end": 291,
    "char_start": 554684,
    "char_end": 555409,
    "char_count": 725,
    "text": "291\n\naccordance with the prescribed procedure and it shall send its comments, if any, to the\nAuthority within 15 (fifteen) days of receiving the aforesaid panel.\n5.\nMutually agreed panel\n5.1\nThe Authority shall, after considering all relevant factors including the comments, if any,\nof the Concessionaire, finalise and constitute a panel of 10 (ten) firms which shall be\ndeemed to be the mutually agreed Panel of Chartered Accountants.\n5.2\nAfter completion of every five years from the date of preparing the mutually agreed Panel\nof Chartered Accountants, or such earlier period as may be agreed between the Authority\nand the Concessionaire, a new panel shall be prepared in accordance with the provisions\nof this Schedule-T.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1058",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1058,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 555411,
    "char_end": 555495,
    "char_count": 84,
    "text": "292\n\nSCHEDULE- U\n(See Clause 22.8)\n\nPASSENGER CHARTER\n\nXXX Ropeways\n\nAt your service",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1059",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1059,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 555497,
    "char_end": 555878,
    "char_count": 381,
    "text": "Our Passenger Charter explains our commitments to you and sets out the targets that these are based\nupon. It is not legally binding and does not affect your legal rights, which are set under the\nApplicable Law. Copies of the conditions can be obtained from all staffed Stations or from our\ncustomer service center. They can also be viewed online at www [please mention the website]",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1060",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1060,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 555880,
    "char_end": 556194,
    "char_count": 314,
    "text": "Contents\n1\nIntroduction\n2\nOur standards for ropeway service performance\n3\nInformation and planning for your journey\n4\nPassengers who require assistance\n5\nBuying a ticket\n6\nYour journey\n7\nClaims for delays and cancellations\n8\nListening to your views\n1.\nIntroduction\nWe want to give our passengers excellent service!",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1061",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1061,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 556196,
    "char_end": 556370,
    "char_count": 174,
    "text": "This is a bold statement, but its intention is to focus the mind of every employee of the\n………… XXX Ropeway, on what is important - our passengers. We aim to provide you\nwith:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1062",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1062,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 556372,
    "char_end": 556529,
    "char_count": 157,
    "text": "i.\nSafe, clean, reliable services\nii.\nClean and safe Stations\niii.\nReliable, timely and easy to understand information\niv.\nPolite, friendly and helpful staff",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1063",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1063,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 556531,
    "char_end": 556704,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "Inevitably, there will be times when problems occur, and we are not able to achieve the\nstandards we aim for. Our charter explains what we will do for you when this happens.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1064",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1064,
    "page_start": 292,
    "page_end": 292,
    "char_start": 556706,
    "char_end": 556866,
    "char_count": 160,
    "text": "2.\nOur Standards for Ropeway Service Performance\nWe will continue to work hard at improving our performance to provide you with a\nconsistently reliable service.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1065",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1065,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 556868,
    "char_end": 557360,
    "char_count": 492,
    "text": "293\n\n2.1\n Peak Hour Operation\n\nThe Concessionaire will define the peak hours based on the RFP specifications and\nridership. Typically, [0600 and 1000] hours inclusive, or between [1700 and 2100]\ninclusive, Monday to Friday only are peak hours. The aforesaid time definition may be\nmodified from time to time depending on average daily traffic volumes during these hours.\nThe peak hour operation will be suitably dealt by increasing or decreasing the maximum\nspeed limit of the ropeway system.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1066",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1066,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 557362,
    "char_end": 557806,
    "char_count": 444,
    "text": "2.2\nReliability\n\nOur target is 99% (Ninety-nine) percent availability of the transport system for all the 7\n(seven) days of the week. You can view our performance results for the previous four\nweeks and 12 (twelve) months on ‘Track Record’ posters displayed at every Station of the\n…………   XXX Ropeway. The results are also available for inspection on request, at all\nour Stations and are published in our season ticket (discounted fee) section.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1067",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1067,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 557808,
    "char_end": 558012,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "The method of monitoring our performance is independently audited annually. We do not\ninclude disruption caused by matters out of the ropeway industry’s control, such as\ntrespass, vandalism and terrorism.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1068",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1068,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 558014,
    "char_end": 558358,
    "char_count": 344,
    "text": "3.\nInformation and Planning the Usage of the Ropeway\nWe will provide you with accurate information about the ropeway services, fees and\nfacilities to help you plan your journey. You can obtain this information in a number of\nways.\n………… Ropeway Enquiries - telephone: ………. (24 hours)\n…………  Ropeway Enquiries on the fees applicable for the system",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1069",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1069,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 558360,
    "char_end": 558581,
    "char_count": 221,
    "text": "Calls are charged at a local rate and may be monitored.\n\nYou can also obtain online information about train times and up-to-the- minute train-\nrunning information by visiting www. ………….\nCustomer Service Centre – Tel: …………",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1070",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1070,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 558583,
    "char_end": 558830,
    "char_count": 247,
    "text": "In addition to the ropeway enquiries, customer service centre also provides information on\nthe ropeway service. The customer service centre is open 24 hours a day except on national\nholidays. Calls are charged at a local rate and may be monitored.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1071",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1071,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 558832,
    "char_end": 559183,
    "char_count": 351,
    "text": "3.1\nAt Stations\n\nStaff in our ticket offices and travel centres can provide you with information to help you\nplan your journey. We will display up-to-date timetable posters at all Stations. These will\ninclude the locations serviced by the ropeway and connecting transport systems available\nat each ropeway Station locations to plan your journey ahead.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1072",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1072,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 559185,
    "char_end": 559438,
    "char_count": 253,
    "text": "3.2\nEngineering work\n\nPlanned engineering work\n\nFrom time to time, ………… XXX Ropeway has to carry out planned engineering and\nimprovement work to maintain the system. This can cause alterations to our services,\nespecially on weekends and public holidays.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1073",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1073,
    "page_start": 293,
    "page_end": 293,
    "char_start": 559440,
    "char_end": 559521,
    "char_count": 81,
    "text": "The maintenance work on ropeway systems is done during shutdown hours which means",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1074",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1074,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 559523,
    "char_end": 559526,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "294",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1075",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1075,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 559528,
    "char_end": 559848,
    "char_count": 320,
    "text": "that system functions at peak performance during the operation hours. However, in case of\nany specific instances when planned engineering work time extends beyond the shutdown\ntime viz affecting operations during service time, advance information along with\nnotification will be posted on the display system and website.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1076,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 559850,
    "char_end": 559945,
    "char_count": 95,
    "text": "Information on services will also be available from:\n\nRopeway Enquiries\nCustomer Service Centre",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1077,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 559947,
    "char_end": 560055,
    "char_count": 108,
    "text": "Under best effort circumstances, we will try to post information well in advance for you to\nplan your trips.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1078",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1078,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 560057,
    "char_end": 560201,
    "char_count": 144,
    "text": "3.3\nHelp and advice during your journey\n\nOur customer service helpline is available during operation hours and equipped to handle\nall enquiries.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1079",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1079,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 560203,
    "char_end": 560673,
    "char_count": 470,
    "text": "4.\nPassengers who Require Assistance\nWe are committed to meeting the travelling needs of our disabled passengers. We recognise\nthat many of our passengers may have special needs which require us to adjust the way we\nprovide our service. The ropeway Station is equipped to handle requirements of all riders\nand the ropeway system, carriers are designed to accommodate wheel chairs, baby prams,\nprosthetics etc. The design facilitates seamless travel from start to finish.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1080",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1080,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 560675,
    "char_end": 560836,
    "char_count": 161,
    "text": "4.1\nAdvance information and assistance for disabled passengers\n\nWe advise passengers who would like assistance to contact our customer service centre in\nadvance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1081",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1081,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 560838,
    "char_end": 560934,
    "char_count": 96,
    "text": "Telephone (24 hours): ………………\nFax: …………………\nTextphone: …………..\nRopeway Enquiries textphone: ……………….",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1082",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1082,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 560936,
    "char_end": 561101,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "4.2\nCar Parking\n\nEvery Station that has a tarmac or concrete surfaced car park for customers has designated\nparking spaces [for either blue or orange badge holders].",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1083",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1083,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 561103,
    "char_end": 561303,
    "char_count": 200,
    "text": "4.3\nOn-Board Information\n\nWe are committed to providing information to provide a safe and pleasurable ride in a\nvariety of ways so that it can be accessed by as wide a group of passengers as possible.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1084",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1084,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 561305,
    "char_end": 561545,
    "char_count": 240,
    "text": "Carriers are equipped with public address systems to provide audible announcements to\nhearing passengers and equipped with a passenger information system that uses visual\ndisplays to enable hearing-impaired passengers to access information.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1085",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1085,
    "page_start": 294,
    "page_end": 294,
    "char_start": 561547,
    "char_end": 561677,
    "char_count": 130,
    "text": "We recognize that good announcements are essential to visually impaired passengers, so\nour employees are trained to speak clearly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1086",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1086,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 561679,
    "char_end": 561682,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "295",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1087",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1087,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 561684,
    "char_end": 561797,
    "char_count": 113,
    "text": "4.4\nDisability awareness training\n\nAll our frontline staff and managers receive training in disability awareness.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1088",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1088,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 561799,
    "char_end": 562063,
    "char_count": 264,
    "text": "Further Information\n\n………… XXX Ropeway Disabled Persons’ Protection Policy (DPPP) sets out our full\narrangements for passengers with disabilities. It can be supplied in a range of formats (large\nprint, braille and audio), available from our customer service centre.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1089",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1089,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 562065,
    "char_end": 562255,
    "char_count": 190,
    "text": "We have also produced a leaflet containing useful information, called ‘Our Service for\nPassengers with Impairments’. It is available at staffed Stations and from our customer\nservice centre.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1090",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1090,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 562257,
    "char_end": 562436,
    "char_count": 179,
    "text": "5.\nBuying a ticket\nWe will sell you the most appropriate ticket for your journey. To purchase a ticket, visit\nany of our staffed Stations or telephone our customer service centre.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1091",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1091,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 562438,
    "char_end": 562779,
    "char_count": 341,
    "text": "5.1\nAt Stations\n\n•\nOur ticket office opening hours are displayed at every staffed Station. They are\nalso available from our website or by telephoning our customer service centre.\n•\nYou can pay by cash or major credit and debit cards.\n•\nMany Stations also have self-service ticket machines, which sell a range of tickets\nto main destinations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1092",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1092,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 562781,
    "char_end": 562989,
    "char_count": 208,
    "text": "We will try to ensure that you do not need to queue for more than five minutes at busy\ntimes and no more than three minutes during less busy times. Details of busy times are\ndisplayed at each staffed Station.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1093",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1093,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 562991,
    "char_end": 563119,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "At major Stations, our travel centres enable you to buy tickets, get travel information and\nalso purchase other travel services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1094",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1094,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 563121,
    "char_end": 563203,
    "char_count": 82,
    "text": "Tickets can also be purchased from our authorised travel agents.\n\n5.2\nBy Telephone",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1095",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1095,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 563205,
    "char_end": 563415,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "Season tickets can also be purchased over the telephone by calling our customer service\ncentre. We accept most major credit and debit cards. Please allow at least five working\ndays for delivery of your tickets.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1096",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1096,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 563417,
    "char_end": 563506,
    "char_count": 89,
    "text": "5.3\nTickets online\n\nYou can also buy your season ropeway tickets (Discounted Fee) online.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1097",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1097,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 563508,
    "char_end": 563621,
    "char_count": 113,
    "text": "5.4\nPenalty fees\n………… XXX Ropeway has a duty to its fee-paying passengers to ensure that no-one\ntravels for free.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1098",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1098,
    "page_start": 295,
    "page_end": 295,
    "char_start": 563623,
    "char_end": 563845,
    "char_count": 222,
    "text": "To help us achieve this, we operate a penalty fees scheme across our network. If you travel\nwithout a valid ticket you may be liable to a penalty fee of [Rs.200 or three times of the\nsingle fee (whichever is the greater)].",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1099",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1099,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 563847,
    "char_end": 563850,
    "char_count": 3,
    "text": "296",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1100",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1100,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 563852,
    "char_end": 564231,
    "char_count": 379,
    "text": "6.\nYour journey\nGetting a seat\n\nWe operate a ‘walk-on’ service, which means you can board the next arriving carrier\nprovided you have a valid ticket. The seat is guaranteed as the ropeway carrier is designed\nnot to allow more people to board than its capacity. In Aerial Tramway (ATW), Cable\nLiners (Automated People Movers) are designed to allow sitting and standing passengers.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1101",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1101,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564233,
    "char_end": 564345,
    "char_count": 112,
    "text": "6.1\nSecurity\n\nWe work very closely with the local authorities to improve security at our Stations and car\nparks.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1102",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1102,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564347,
    "char_end": 564462,
    "char_count": 115,
    "text": "We aim to reduce levels of crime, trespass and vandalism and we are investing to achieve\nthis. Initiatives include:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1103",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1103,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564464,
    "char_end": 564571,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "•\nTeams of Travel Safe Officers, trained and co-ordinated by the Police\n\n•\nInstallation of CCTV at Stations",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1104",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1104,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564573,
    "char_end": 564680,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "•\nInstallation of CCTV in the carriers\n\n•\nLighting at Stations and car parks\n\n•\nHelp points at our Stations",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1105",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1105,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564682,
    "char_end": 564799,
    "char_count": 117,
    "text": "•\nSecurity guards at key locations.\n\nMore information can be found in the safety and security section of our website.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1106",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1106,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564801,
    "char_end": 564929,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "6.2\nCycles\n\nWe welcome the opportunity to integrate ropeway and cycle travel by providing cycle\nparking at most of our Stations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1107",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1107,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 564931,
    "char_end": 565137,
    "char_count": 206,
    "text": "Cycles are also welcome on our services, except during peak hours.\n\nOur guards do have the right to refuse a cycle if there is insufficient space available or\nwhere the cycles cannot be accommodated safely.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1108",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1108,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 565139,
    "char_end": 565369,
    "char_count": 230,
    "text": "Our cycle policy is published in our timetable book and shows those services where cycles\nare not permitted. Information can be found at staffed Stations and from our customer\nservice centre, and in our travel information section.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1109",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1109,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 565371,
    "char_end": 565456,
    "char_count": 85,
    "text": "6.3\nSmoking\n\nSmoking is not permitted anywhere on the XXX Ropeway.\n\n6.4\nLost Property",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1110",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1110,
    "page_start": 296,
    "page_end": 296,
    "char_start": 565458,
    "char_end": 565666,
    "char_count": 208,
    "text": "Our lost property office at …………….. is open from 0730 -1900 Monday to Friday.\nTelephone the office on …………….... All property found on our services and at our\nStations is forwarded to our lost property office.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1111",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1111,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 565668,
    "char_end": 565756,
    "char_count": 88,
    "text": "297\n\nTo make an enquiry, complete our lost property online form.\n\n6.5\nService Disruption",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1112",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1112,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 565758,
    "char_end": 566051,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "Unfortunately, things do sometimes go wrong, causing disruption that cannot always be\nforeseen or avoided. Incase emergency maintenance is required, we will host the\ninformation on relevant media to ensure that the riders of the ropeway are informed well\nin advance to avoid any inconvenience.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1113",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1113,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566053,
    "char_end": 566162,
    "char_count": 109,
    "text": "Other causes of disruption include:\n\n•\nEmergency engineering work\n•\nTrespass and vandalism\n•\nSecurity alerts.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1114",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1114,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566164,
    "char_end": 566422,
    "char_count": 258,
    "text": "Under such circumstances we may have to make changes to our services without giving\nprior warning to protect your safety and that of our staff. We will always try to minimise\ndisruption, keep you informed and provide or recommend alternative means of travel.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1115",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1115,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566424,
    "char_end": 566557,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "If a problem does occur mid-way in the ropeway journey, we will ensure that you reach\nthe nearest Station with minimum inconvenience.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1116",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1116,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566559,
    "char_end": 566770,
    "char_count": 211,
    "text": "All our carriers are fitted with public address systems are equipped to provide all\ninformation on real time basis and most of our staff are linked by telephone systems. We\naim to let you know what is happening.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1117",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1117,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566772,
    "char_end": 566877,
    "char_count": 105,
    "text": "7.\nClaims for delays or cancellations\n7.1\nSeason Tickets Valid for one month or longer ‘Void’ day refunds",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1118",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1118,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 566879,
    "char_end": 567191,
    "char_count": 312,
    "text": "As a holder of a season ticket valid for one month or longer, we may provide you with the\nappropriate refund for exceptional days when there has been widespread serious, extended\ndisruption. This is known as a ‘void’ day. In these cases, the period of disruption will be\nexcluded from our performance statistics.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1119",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1119,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 567193,
    "char_end": 567302,
    "char_count": 109,
    "text": "When we have declared a ‘void’ day we will tell you through ‘Track Record’ posters\ndisplayed at key Stations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1120",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1120,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 567304,
    "char_end": 567583,
    "char_count": 279,
    "text": "When you renew your season ticket you will be advised by staff at your local ticket office\nto apply for ‘void’ day refunds if they have been declared. You will be given a ‘void’ day\nrefund application form, which you can complete and submit along with your expired\nseason ticket.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1121",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1121,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 567585,
    "char_end": 567890,
    "char_count": 305,
    "text": "7.2\nAvailability and Reliability discounts for Season Tickets (Discounted Fee)\n\nWe have certain performance standards for reliability. If we fail to meet these standards,\nwe will offer you a discount from the cost of your season ticket renewal. Discounts will be\npaid automatically at the time of renewal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1122",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1122,
    "page_start": 297,
    "page_end": 297,
    "char_start": 567892,
    "char_end": 568216,
    "char_count": 324,
    "text": "Delays and cancellations that are caused by incidents beyond the control of the ropeway\nindustry are excluded from our performance results. Incidents that are beyond our control\ninclude security alerts, vandalism and trespass. We will display the number of trains\naffected on posters at key Stations and also on our website.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1123",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1123,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 568218,
    "char_end": 568503,
    "char_count": 285,
    "text": "298\n\n5% discount\n\nWe will offer you a 5% discount if, on average, over the previous 12 months if there is\ndeficient service as per the performance parameters (system availability of 99%) has been\nmore than 10% below the standard or reliability has been more than 5% below the standard.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1124",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1124,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 568505,
    "char_end": 568644,
    "char_count": 139,
    "text": "10% discount\n\nWe will offer you a 10% discount if performance parameters for system availability are\nbelow these discount threshold levels.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1125",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1125,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 568646,
    "char_end": 568755,
    "char_count": 109,
    "text": "To obtain your discount, you must renew your season ticket within four weeks of the\nprevious ticket’s expiry.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1126",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1126,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 568757,
    "char_end": 568955,
    "char_count": 198,
    "text": "Other tickets and weekly seasons\n\nWe will treat all claims on their merits and give consideration to any problems you\nencounter. However, for your guidance, you can expect us to offer the following:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1127",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1127,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 568957,
    "char_end": 569122,
    "char_count": 165,
    "text": "Please send us your travel tickets to support your claim. This will also help to speed up\nyour claim. Completed claims should be sent to our customer service centre.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1128",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1128,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 569124,
    "char_end": 569282,
    "char_count": 158,
    "text": "8.\nListening to your views\nWe carry out and analyse passenger survey research to provide information about what you\nthink of different aspects of our service.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1129",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1129,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 569284,
    "char_end": 569585,
    "char_count": 301,
    "text": "We hold regular ‘Meet the Manager’ events, which enable you to speak directly to\nmanagers to put your views to them or ask them questions. Details of Meet the Manager\nevents will be advertised on Station posters, in our passenger magazine e-motion, through\nour customer service centre and also online.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1130",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1130,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 569587,
    "char_end": 569862,
    "char_count": 275,
    "text": "We will listen to your views and communicate through correspondence and by telephone.\nWe have a specially trained customer service centre team able to respond to you and we\nalso liaise with passenger representative bodies and user groups that exist to protect your\ninterests.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1131",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1131,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 569864,
    "char_end": 570443,
    "char_count": 579,
    "text": "Making a comment or complaint\n\nWe welcome your comments, suggestions, complaints and praise about any aspect of our\nservice. We also welcome comments about our charter. Senior managers monitor the\nnumber and type of complaints and comments that you make. They are also responsible\nfor delivering continuous improvement to customer service. Your feedback can therefore\nhelp us to achieve this. If you are commenting on a journey, please remember to include\nyour ropeway tickets and any other details, as this will help us to provide you with a swift\nresponse.\nFurther information:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1132",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1132,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 570445,
    "char_end": 570613,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "We have a full Customer Comments and Complaints Handling Procedure (CCCHP). copies\nwhich can be obtained from our customer service centre or from our website www.\n………….",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1133",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1133,
    "page_start": 298,
    "page_end": 298,
    "char_start": 570615,
    "char_end": 570701,
    "char_count": 86,
    "text": "Contacting our Customer Service Centre\n\nPlease visit ‘Contact Us’ section for details.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1134",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1134,
    "page_start": 299,
    "page_end": 299,
    "char_start": 570703,
    "char_end": 570841,
    "char_count": 138,
    "text": "299\n\nOur promised response times\n\nIf you write to us, you should hear from us within five working days of us receiving your\ncommunication.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1135",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1135,
    "page_start": 299,
    "page_end": 299,
    "char_start": 570843,
    "char_end": 571053,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "However, it may take longer to provide a full reply (e.g. if an investigation is required) and\nif this happens, we will send you an acknowledgement within five working days and reply\nwithin twenty working days.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1136",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1136,
    "page_start": 299,
    "page_end": 299,
    "char_start": 571055,
    "char_end": 571154,
    "char_count": 99,
    "text": "If a full reply cannot be made within twenty working days, we will contact you again to\nupdate you.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1137",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1137,
    "page_start": 299,
    "page_end": 299,
    "char_start": 571156,
    "char_end": 571318,
    "char_count": 162,
    "text": "If you are unhappy with our reply\n\nWe will work hard to deal with your concerns to your satisfaction but if you are unhappy\nwith our response, please let us know.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1138",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1138,
    "page_start": 299,
    "page_end": 299,
    "char_start": 571320,
    "char_end": 571422,
    "char_count": 102,
    "text": "Alternatively, you can approach the consumer courts or other similar for set up under\nApplicable Laws.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1139",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1139,
    "page_start": 300,
    "page_end": 300,
    "char_start": 571424,
    "char_end": 573188,
    "char_count": 1764,
    "text": "300\n\nSCHEDULE –V\n (See Clause 5.4.1)\nSHAREHOLDERS’ AGREEMENT\nTHIS SHAREHOLDERS’ AGREEMENT (the \"Agreement\") is made on this ……… day of\n………, 20………,\nAMONGST\n1.\n[THE GOVERNOR OF ***] represented by *** and having its principal offices at ***\n(hereinafter referred to as the \"Authority\" which expression shall, unless repugnant to the\ncontext or meaning thereof, include its administrators, successors and assigns) of One\nPart;\nand\n2.\nThe Parties listed in Annex I hereto (hereinafter individually referred to as \"Private\nParticipant\" and collectively referred to as \"Private Participants\") (which expression\nshall, unless it be repugnant or contrary to the subject or context thereof, be deemed to\nmean and include their respective legal representatives and successors) of the Second Part;\nand\n3.\n{............................ LIMITED} a company incorporated under the provisions of the\nCompanies Act, 1956 having its registered office at ……… (hereinafter referred to as the\n\"Company\" or the \"Concessionaire\", which expression shall, unless it be repugnant or\ncontrary to the subject or context thereof, be deemed to mean and include its legal\nrepresentatives, successors and permitted assign) of the Third Part.\nThe Private Participants, the Authority and the Concessionaire are hereinafter collectively\nreferred to as the \"Parties\" and individually as \"Party\". The Private Participants and the\nAuthority are collectively referred to as the \"Shareholders\" and individually as\n“Shareholder”.\nWHEREAS:\nA.\nThe Authority had procured the in-principle approval from Authority of India (hereinafter\nreferred to as “In-Principle Approval”) for establishment of a ropeway for public use at\n***** in the State of ***** (hereinafter referred to as “XXX Ropeway” or “Project”),",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1140",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1140,
    "page_start": 300,
    "page_end": 300,
    "char_start": 573189,
    "char_end": 574299,
    "char_count": 1110,
    "text": "subject to the terms and conditions stipulated in the In-Principle Approval, and the\nAuthority decided to undertake development of the XXX Ropeway through private\nparticipation on Design, Build, Finance, Operate and Transfer (the \"DBFOT\") basis.\nB.\nThe Authority invited proposals by its Request for Qualification No. *** dated ***  (the\n\"Request for Qualification\" or \"RFQ\") for short listing of bidders for construction,\noperation and maintenance of the XXX Ropeway on DBFOT basis and subsequently the\nAuthority had prescribed the technical and commercial terms and conditions, and invited\nbids (the \"Request for Proposals\" or the \"RFP\") from the bidders shortlisted pursuant\nto the RFQ, for selection of the successful bidder who would have the right to incorporate\na company to act as a special purpose vehicle to undertake the Project.\nC.\nThe Private Participants include the [Members of the] Selected Bidder, which had bid, and\nwas/ were thereafter short listed and eventually selected by Authority, pursuant to which\nthe Authority issued the Letter of Award No. …….. dated ……… to incorporate the special",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1141",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1141,
    "page_start": 301,
    "page_end": 301,
    "char_start": 574301,
    "char_end": 576094,
    "char_count": 1793,
    "text": "301\n\npurpose vehicle which would execute the Concession Agreement for undertaking the\nProject (the \"Concessionaire\").\nD.\nThe Selected Bidder has since promoted and incorporated the Concessionaire as a limited\nliability company under the Companies Act 2013, and has requested the Authority to accept\nthe Concessionaire as the entity which shall undertake and perform the obligations and\nexercise the rights of the concessionaire under the Concession Agreement and the\nAuthority has agreed to this request.\nE.\nAs part of the Request for Proposal it was contemplated that the Authority would hold one\nnon-transferable Golden Share (as defined hereinafter), on terms and conditions as set out\nin this Shareholders' Agreement.\nF.\nThe Authority and the Private Participants are therefore desirous of setting forth in this\nAgreement, the terms and conditions to govern the relationships in their mutual capacity\nas the Shareholders of the Concessionaire and to record their respective rights and\nobligations in relation to the management and functioning of the Concessionaire and other\nmatters incidental thereto.\nNOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the foregoing and the respective covenants and\nagreements set forth in this Agreement, the receipt and sufficiency of which is hereby\nacknowledged, and intending to be legally bound hereby, the Parties agree as follows:\n1\nDEFINITIONS AND INTERPRETATIONS\n1.1     Definitions\nIn this Agreement, (including any recitals, annexure, schedules or exhibit attached thereto),\nexcept where the context otherwise requires, the following words and expressions shall\nhave the following meaning:\n\"Affected Party\" shall have the meaning ascribed to the term in Clause 11.3 hereunder;\n\"Alternate Director\" shall have the meaning ascribed to the term in Clause 5.7.1",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1142",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1142,
    "page_start": 301,
