    "char_start": 576095,
    "char_end": 576759,
    "char_count": 664,
    "text": "hereunder;\n\"Board of Director(s)\" or \"Board\" means the board of director(s) of the Concessionaire;\n“Chairman” means chairman of the Board of the Company;\n\"Charter Documents\" means the memorandum of association and articles of association\nof the Concessionaire, incorporating as appropriate, and consistent with, to the extent\npermitted by law, the terms and conditions of this Agreement.\n\"Companies Act\" means the Companies Act, 2013, as amended from time to time, or any\nenactment substituting the said Companies Act;\n\"Concession Agreement\" shall mean the Concession Agreement entered into between the\nAuthority and the Concessionaire with respect to the Project;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
