    "text": "the approval of any and every resolution necessary or desirable to procure that the affairs\nof the Concessionaire are conducted in accordance with the Concession Agreement and\notherwise to give full effect to this Agreement, and likewise so as to ensure that no\nresolution is passed which is not in accordance with the Concession Agreement and/or the\nprovisions of this Agreement; provided, however, that except as expressly directed or as\notherwise contemplated by any provisions in this Agreement, each Shareholder shall have",
