    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1153,
    "page_start": 305,
    "page_end": 305,
    "char_start": 587934,
    "char_end": 588227,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "The Private Participants hereby undertake to be jointly and severally responsible for all\nobligations and liabilities relating to the Project, till such time as the Financial Close for\nthe Project is achieved in accordance with the Concession Agreement.\n5\nMANAGEMENT AND THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1154",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1154,
    "page_start": 305,
    "page_end": 305,
    "char_start": 588229,
    "char_end": 588748,
    "char_count": 519,
    "text": "5.1\nManagement\n\nThe Concessionaire shall be managed and governed under the overall superintendence,\ndirection and control of the Board. The Board shall have overall authority with respect to\ndevelopment and management of the Concessionaire and the Project. The officers of the\nConcessionaire shall have the authority and responsibilities specified by the Board of\nDirectors, consistent with the Charter Documents and this Agreement.\n5.2\nComposition of the Board\n5.2.1\nThe Board composition shall be determined as under:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1155",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1155,
    "page_start": 305,
    "page_end": 305,
    "char_start": 588750,
    "char_end": 589037,
    "char_count": 287,
    "text": "(a)\nThe Authority shall at all times be entitled to nominate a person of its choice for\nappointment as a Director on the Board of the Concessionaire, and upon such\nnomination, the Concessionaire shall appoint such person as a non-retiring Director\nin accordance with the Applicable Laws.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1156",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1156,
    "page_start": 305,
    "page_end": 305,
    "char_start": 589039,
    "char_end": 589407,
    "char_count": 368,
    "text": "(b)\nPrivate Participants and Shareholders other than the Authority shall have the right\nto nominate the remaining Directors.\n5.2.2\nThe Shareholders hereby acknowledge and agree to vote their respective shareholding in\nthe Concessionaire in such manner so as to ensure appointment of the nominee of Authority\nand the Private Participants, as Directors from time to time",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1157",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1157,
    "page_start": 306,
    "page_end": 306,
    "char_start": 589409,
    "char_end": 591162,
    "char_count": 1753,
    "text": "306\n\n5.3\nChairman\n\nThe Parties hereby undertake and agree that the Private Participants shall have the right to\nnominate the Chairman of the Concessionaire, who shall be appointed by the Board.\n5.4\nManaging Director\n5.4.1  The Private Participants shall also nominate the Managing Director of the Concessionaire,\nwho shall, following a Board resolution, be appointed by the Board.\n5.4.2  The Managing Director shall be responsible for day-to-day management of the\nConcessionaire and for implementing the Project. The Managing Director will exercise his\npowers subject to the overall superintendence, direction and control of the Board.\n5.5\nQualification\nThe Directors need not hold any qualification shares in the Concessionaire.\n5.6\nResignation and removal\nExcept where a Director is required under Applicable Law or the Charter Documents to\nvacate office, no Director shall be removed during the term for which he was elected\nwithout the consent of the Shareholder that recommended his appointment on the Board.\nNotwithstanding the foregoing, a Shareholder may ask for removal, substitution or recall\nfor any reason, of any of the Directors nominated by such Shareholder and such Director\nshall be bound by the direction of removal, substitution or recall. Each Shareholder agrees\nto co-operate with the other Shareholders in convening a meeting of the Shareholders of\nthe Concessionaire to effect such removal and to vote in favour thereof, if so required.\n5.7\nAlternate Director\n5.7.1\nA Director, other than the Managing Director, (the \"Original Director\") shall be entitled\nat any time and from time to time, to appoint any person to act as the Original Director's\nalternate (\"Alternate Director\") (and the Shareholders shall procure that the Board",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1158",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1158,
    "page_start": 306,
    "page_end": 306,
    "char_start": 591163,
    "char_end": 592389,
    "char_count": 1226,
    "text": "appoints such person as his alternate) and to direct the termination of the appointment of\nsuch Alternate Director (and the Shareholders shall procure that the Board terminates the\nappointment of such Alternate Director).\n5.7.2\nThe Alternate Director shall be entitled, while holding office as such, to receive notices of\nmeetings of the Board or any committee thereof to which the Original Director has been\nappointed, and to attend and vote as a Director at any such meetings at which the Original\nDirector is not present and generally to exercise all the powers, rights (other than the right\nto appoint an Alternate Director as provided in Clause 5.7.1), duties and authorities and to\nperform all the functions of the Original Director. Further, such Alternate Director shall be\nentitled to be counted for the purpose of constituting quorum, exercise the vote and sign a\nwritten resolution on behalf of the Original Director at any meeting of the Board or any\ncommittee thereof and to the extent permitted by Applicable Laws, his signature, vote,\npresence and consent shall be deemed to be that of himself (as if he is a Director in his own\nright) and the Original Director for whom he is an Alternate Director.\n5.8\nVacancy",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1159",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1159,
    "page_start": 306,
    "page_end": 306,
    "char_start": 592391,
    "char_end": 592651,
    "char_count": 260,
    "text": "If a vacancy in any such office should occur for whatever reason, or a Director is absent\nfor a continuous period of 1 (one) month from the place where meetings of the Board are\nregularly held and no Alternate Director has been appointed in his place, then the",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
