    "page_start": 307,
    "page_end": 307,
    "char_start": 592653,
    "char_end": 592925,
    "char_count": 272,
    "text": "307\n\nShareholder that nominated such Director shall be entitled to nominate a replacement\nDirector, and the Shareholders agree to vote their Shares unanimously for the removal of\nsuch Director and election of such replacement Director.\n5.9\nMode of conduct of Board meeting",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1161",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1161,
    "page_start": 307,
    "page_end": 307,
    "char_start": 592927,
    "char_end": 594717,
    "char_count": 1790,
    "text": "Board meetings shall be held at least once every quarter at such places in India as the Board\nmay determine and failing any such determination at the Concessionaire 's registered office\nlocated at ………. If and when permitted under Applicable Laws, a Director may\nparticipate in a Board meeting or a committee/sub-committee meeting of the Board by\nmeans of telephone, audio and/or video conferencing or other communication facilities,\nand a Director participating in such a meeting by such means shall be deemed for the\npurposes of this Agreement, to be present at that meeting.\n5.10\nNotice and Agenda for meeting\n5.10.1 Unless the requirement of notice is waived by all Directors, a minimum of 14 (fourteen)\ndays written notice (or such shorter period as all the Directors may agree) of the Board\nmeetings shall be given to all Directors and their Alternate Directors. Each notice of a\nmeeting of the Board shall contain, inter alia, an agenda specifying in reasonable detail,\nthe matters to be discussed at the relevant meeting and shall be accompanied by all\nnecessary written information.\n5.10.2 The Board shall only transact the business set out in the agenda accompanying the notice\nto the Directors. Provided however that with the unanimous consent of all the Directors\nwith Director nominated by Authority in attendance and voting in favour, the Board may\ntransact business that is not set out in the agenda.\n5.11\nQuorum for Board meetings\n5.11.1 The quorum for the meetings of the Board or any adjournment thereof shall necessarily\ninclude the Director nominated by Authority if any Reserved Matter is to be considered in\nsuch meeting; and no Reserved Matter shall be taken into consideration at such meeting if\nthe Director nominated by the Authority is not present at such meeting.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1162",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1162,
    "page_start": 307,
    "page_end": 307,
    "char_start": 594718,
    "char_end": 594880,
    "char_count": 162,
    "text": "5.11.2 All items of business transacted or decisions taken at meetings where the quorum is not so\nconstituted shall be null and void.\n5.12\nCommittees of the Board",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1163",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1163,
    "page_start": 307,
    "page_end": 307,
    "char_start": 594883,
    "char_end": 595868,
    "char_count": 985,
    "text": "If the Board finds it necessary to constitute a committee or sub-committee, the Board shall\ndetermine the powers (including scope, termination, amendment of and withdrawal\nthereof) of such committee or sub-committee. The committee or sub-committee shall be\nsubject to and be under the supervision of the Board. Notwithstanding anything to the\ncontrary contained herein, the Authority shall have the right to nominate its nominee to\neach and every committee and sub-committee constituted by the Board: Provided,\nhowever, that no Reserved Matters shall be delegated to such committee and/or sub-\ncommittee.\n5.13\nDecisions\n5.13.1 Subject to the provisions of the Companies Act, a resolution of the Board of Directors shall\nbe adopted by the affirmative vote of the simple majority of the Directors present at a\nmeeting at which a quorum of the Board of Directors is present. Provided, however, that\nall resolutions on the Reserved Matters to be passed in the meeting of Board of Directors",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
