    "char_start": 595870,
    "char_end": 596510,
    "char_count": 640,
    "text": "308\n\nof Concessionaire shall be subject to the affirmative vote of the Director nominated by the\nAuthority and no such resolution shall be passed if no such Director nominated by the\nAuthority is present and voting in favour of such resolution.\n5.13.2 The Concessionaire or any of its Directors, officers, agents or representatives shall not\nundertake any Reserved Matter without the prior approval by the Board in the manner\nprovided in Clause 5.13.1 above and any act done by the Concessionaire or any of its\nDirectors, officers, agents or representatives without such prior approval shall be null and\nvoid.\n5.14\nResolution by circulation",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1165",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1165,
    "page_start": 308,
    "page_end": 308,
    "char_start": 596512,
    "char_end": 597094,
    "char_count": 582,
    "text": "Subject to Applicable Laws and for matters other than Reserved Matters, resolutions of the\nBoard may be passed by circulation, if the resolution has been circulated in draft, together\nwith necessary papers, if any, to all the Directors, then in India or outside India, and has\nbeen signed by a majority of the Directors. Such resolutions may be signed by the Directors\nas single document or in counterparts.\n5.15\nAuthority\n Unless otherwise authorised by the Board, none of the Directors shall be empowered to\nbind the Concessionaire individually.\n5.16\nDisqualification of Directors",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1166",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1166,
    "page_start": 308,
    "page_end": 308,
    "char_start": 597096,
    "char_end": 598670,
    "char_count": 1574,
    "text": "Subject to Applicable Laws, a Director shall not be deemed disqualified to serve by reason\nof his being officer, director or shareholder of any other body corporate.\n5.17\nInspection and information\n5.17.1 It is hereby agreed between the Parties that the Authority shall have the right to examine\nthe books, records and accounts to be kept by the Concessionaire and shall be entitled to\nreceive all information, including monthly management accounts and operating statistics\nand other trading and financial information.\n5.17.2 Without prejudice to the generality of Clause 5.17.1, the Concessionaire shall supply the\nAuthority with copies of:\n(a)\naudited accounts of the Concessionaire (complying with all relevant legal\nrequirements); and\n(b)\nmonthly/quarterly management accounts of each principal division of the\nConcessionaire; these shall include a consolidated profit and loss account, balance\nsheet and cash flow statement broken down according to the principal divisions of\nthe Concessionaire including a statement of progress against the relevant business\nplan, a statement of any variation from the quarterly revenue budget and up-to-\ndate forecasts for the balance of the relevant Accounting Year and itemising all\nexpenditure in relation to the Concessionaire's capital programme entered into by\neach principal division of the Concessionaire during that period.\n6\nSHAREHOLDERS' RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS\n6.1\nGeneral Meeting and matters requiring the approval of Shareholders\n6.1.1\nThe Board may whenever it thinks fit convene a General Meeting of the Concessionaire.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1167",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1167,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 598672,
    "char_end": 599425,
    "char_count": 753,
    "text": "309\n\nThe Board shall also proceed to convene a General Meeting if so requisitioned by the\nShareholders of the Concessionaire in accordance with the provisions of the Companies\nAct and the Charter Documents.\n6.1.2\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement and the Charter\nDocuments, no decision shall be made and no action shall be taken by or with respect to a\nReserved Matter, which is subject to the affirmative vote rights of the Authority as provided\nin Clause 3.1.3 above, unless approved by an affirmative vote of authorized representative\nof the Authority. The Parties specifically agree that a resolution relating to the Reserved\nMatters shall be passed in a meeting of Shareholders only and not by way of circulation.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1168",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1168,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 599427,
    "char_end": 600106,
    "char_count": 679,
    "text": "6.1.3\nThe quorum for any Shareholders meetings or any adjournment thereof shall necessarily\ninclude a representative of the Authority if any Reserved Matter is to be considered in such\nmeeting; and no Reserved Matter shall be taken into consideration at such meeting, if a\nrepresentative of the Authority is not present at such meeting.\n6.1.4\nAll items of business transacted or decisions taken at meetings where the quorum is not so\nconstituted shall be null and void.\n7\nUNDERTAKINGS, REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTIES\n7.1\nEach of the Private Participants hereby warrant and represent to and for the benefit of\nAuthority, the Concessionaire and the other Private Participants that:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1169",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1169,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 600108,
    "char_end": 600296,
    "char_count": 188,
    "text": "(a)\nIt is duly organised and validly existing under law and has all requisite legal power\nand authority to execute this Agreement and carry out the terms, conditions and\nprovisions hereof;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1170",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1170,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 600298,
    "char_end": 600601,
    "char_count": 303,
    "text": "(b)\nthe execution and delivery by the Private Participant of this Agreement has been\nduly authorised by all requisite corporate and other action and will not contravene\nany provisions of or constitute a default under, any other agreement or instrument\nto which it is a party or by which it may be bound;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1171",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1171,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 600603,
    "char_end": 601308,
    "char_count": 705,
    "text": "(c)\nthis Agreement and all such other agreements and written obligations entered into\nand undertaken in connection with the transactions contemplated hereby to which\nit is a Party, constitute or will constitute following the execution and delivery\nthereof valid and legally binding obligations of such Private Participant,\nenforceable against it in accordance with its respective terms, subject as to\nenforcement of remedies to applicable bankruptcy, insolvency,  reorganisation and\nother laws affecting generally the enforcement of the rights of creditors and subject\nto a court's discretionary authority with respect to the granting of a decree ordering\nspecific performance or other equitable remedies;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1172",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1172,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 601310,
    "char_end": 601429,
    "char_count": 119,
    "text": "(d)\nit is not insolvent and no insolvency proceedings have been instituted, nor\nthreatened or pending by or against it;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1173",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1173,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 601431,
    "char_end": 601740,
    "char_count": 309,
    "text": "(e)\nit has complied with Applicable Laws in all material respects and has not been\nsubject to any fines, penalties, injunctive relief or any other civil or criminal\nliabilities which in the aggregate has or may have a material adverse effect on its\nability to perform its obligations under this Agreement; and",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1174",
    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "paragraph_index": 1174,
    "page_start": 309,
    "page_end": 309,
    "char_start": 601742,
    "char_end": 602004,
    "char_count": 262,
    "text": "(f)\nthere are no actions, suits, claims, proceedings or investigations pending or, to the\nbest of the Private Participant's knowledge, threatened in writing against it at law,\nin equity, or otherwise, whether civil or criminal in nature, before or by, any court,",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-1175",
