    "char_count": 284,
    "text": "BID DOCUMENT\n(Buyer Added Bid Specific ATC)\n\nFor Engagement of Manpower Agency for Outsourcing of Manpower Services (Sanitation/\nHousekeeping Services) along with Cleaning materials to Office of the Accountant General\n(Audit-II) M.P., 53, Arera Hills, Hoshangabad road, Bhopal (M.P.).",
