    "paragraph_index": 5,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 704,
    "char_end": 1229,
    "char_count": 525,
    "text": "E-tender (through GeM Portal) under a two-bid system from eligible outsourced manpower\n(Sanitation/ Housekeeping service) providers for providing Manpower services along with Cleaning\nmaterial to Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II) M.P., 53, Arera Hills, Hoshangabad\nroad, Bhopal (M.P.). for an initial period of total 13 months i.e. one month of FY 2023-24 (March\n2024) and for FY-2024-25 from 01.04.2024 to 31.03.2025 (extendable for two more terms of one\nyears each with mutual consent of both parties) is invited.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
