    "char_start": 1231,
    "char_end": 1576,
    "char_count": 345,
    "text": "Requirement/eligibilitycriteria Terms and Conditions of the contract have been clarified in the\nadditional documents. Bid documents are available online at GeM Portal as well as on the website\nof the Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II) M.P., 53, Arera Hills, Hoshangabad road,\nBhopal (M.P.).i.e. https://cag.gov.in/ag2/madhya-pradesh/en.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0007",
