    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1578,
    "char_end": 1851,
    "char_count": 273,
    "text": "However, for any clarification, bidders may seek the same through GeM portal or contact\nhttps://cag.gov.in/ag2/madhya-pradesh/en. Bidders are advised to read Bid documents\n(uploaded on the website and GeM portal) and check their eligibility before participating in the\nbid.",
