  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5075,
    "char_end": 5713,
    "char_count": 638,
    "text": "SCOPE OF WORK\n1. Scope of work:-\nThe prime object of cleaning services is to maintain the entire premises in neat, clean,\ntidy and hygienic conditions.\n 2. Area: The area of the office is 103093.29 Sq. feet and includes the followings:\nSl.\nNo.\nName of Building /Location\nArea\n(Sq.ft)\nRemarks\n1\nOffice building\n103093.29\nSq. Ft\nOffice building\nconsists of 4 floors\n(Ground + 3 Floors)\nhaving halls, officers/\nStaff cabins, Guest\nHouse, Canteen,\nLibrary, Store room\nand Toilets etc.\n2\nOpen space\n-\nOpen space consisting\nof garden, approach\nroad, internal roads,\nopen area surrounding\npremises of the above\nsaid buildings,\ndrainage & gutter.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5715,
    "char_end": 5832,
    "char_count": 117,
    "text": "3. Detailed Scope of work\n For the purpose of cleaning, the office shall be functional for 6 days in a week and Guest",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5834,
    "char_end": 5921,
    "char_count": 87,
    "text": "House for all 7 days in a week. The sanitation/ housekeeping staff has to ensure proper",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5923,
    "char_end": 6904,
    "char_count": 981,
    "text": "maintenance and up keep of the entire Office premises.\n4. Operations to be done:\na. The first round of cleaning and dusting work of the entire complex should be completed\nbefore 9:00 AM daily.\nb. Sweeping and wet mopping of the entire covered area of buildings including\ncorridors/verandah/lobby area daily. All the toilets must be mopped twice daily.\nc. Cleaning of the internal roads and open area daily.\nd. Removal of blockages and clogging in the wash basins and other sanitary fittings in the\ntoilets for smooth outflow of waste water.\n e. Cleaning of main gate, brass plates, Name Plates, Sign boards etc.\n f. Cleaning of drinking water cooler areas including attached sinks and tiles etc.\ng. Dusting of all furniture such as tables, chairs, sofas, almirahs etc., and all the electronic\ngadgets like computers, telephones, photo copier machines etc. on daily basis. The doors,\nwindows, partitions including the particle board, glass and aluminum channels in the entire office",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6906,
    "char_end": 7043,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7045,
    "char_end": 8542,
    "char_count": 1497,
    "text": "complex should be cleaned daily.\nh. Sweeping of terrace shall be completed once in a week.\n i. Collection of all the sweepings, garbage and waste and its proper disposal.\n j. Washing of urinal Pots/WC pans/sinks/wash basin and cleaning all sanitary fittings and\nfixtures with clean cloth.\n k. Filling of liquid soap in soap containers and putting of air freshener/sanitary\ncubes/naphthalene balls in urinal pots, urinal mats, etc.\n l. The sanitation/ housekeeping personnel shall be deployed on Saturdays also for the\nremoval of cobwebs in the corridors, rooms, chambers and lavatories, removal of dust\naccumulated on the walls, window panes and ventilators in the toilets and thorough washing,\nrubbing and cleaning of corridors.\nm. Shifting of furniture and other equipment, files etc. whenever required.\nn. Indoor plants pots, mats and carpets are to be cleaned and its periodical shifting (for\nexposure to sunlight)\no. It shall be ensured that while carrying out the activities of dusting and cleaning the\nfiles/papers/documents etc. and the electronic gadgets etc. are not tampered with in any manner.\nIn case such an incidence comes to the notice of the administration, strict action, as applicable\nshall be initiated against the person responsible.\n p. Sanitization of the entire office premises as and when ordered by administration.\nq. Cleaning of the sofas and other places and items as directed by the administration.\nr. Any other work assigned by the administration/authority concerned.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
