    "paragraph_index": 29,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 9380,
    "char_end": 9892,
    "char_count": 512,
    "text": "1.3. The Bidder should download the Bid document (Scope of Work, Buyer Added Bid Specific\nATC, General condition of Contract and Special condition of Contract) through GeM Portal\nand upload it again at the time of submission of the bid with signature and stamp in token of\nthe Bidder having acquainted himself/themselves and accepted the entire Bid document (Scope\nof Work, Buyer Added Bid Specific ATC, General condition of Contract and Special\ncondition of Contract) including various   conditions of contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0030",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 9894,
    "char_end": 10042,
    "char_count": 148,
    "text": "1.4. The bidder shall attach the copy of the authorization letter / power of Attorney as proof of\nauthorization for signing on behalf of the Bidder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10044,
    "char_end": 10384,
    "char_count": 340,
    "text": "1.5. All Bidders are hereby explicitly informed that conditional offers or offers with deviations\nfrom the conditions of Contract, the bids not meeting the minimum eligibility criteria,\nTechnical Bids, not accompanied with EMD of requisite amount/format, or any other\nrequirements, stipulated in the bid documents are liable to be rejected.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10386,
    "char_end": 10548,
    "char_count": 162,
    "text": "1.6. The parties to the Bid shall be the ‘Bidders’ (to whom the work is to be awarded) and the Office\nof the Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya Pradesh, Bhopal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
