  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0041",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 41,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 11688,
    "char_end": 11813,
    "char_count": 125,
    "text": "2. MINIMUM ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA\nThe following shall be the minimum eligibility criteria for selection of bidders technically.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0042",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 42,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 11815,
    "char_end": 12254,
    "char_count": 439,
    "text": "a. Legal Valid Entity: The Bidder shall necessarily be a legally valid entity either in the form of a\nLimited Company / a Private Limited Company registered under the Companies Act, 2013 or a\nLimited Liability Partnership (LLP) under the Limited Liability Partnership Act, 2008. Bidder\nin the form of JV/Consortium, Proprietorship, and Partnership is not permitted. Proof for\nsupporting the legal validity of the Bidder shall be submitted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0043",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 43,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 12256,
    "char_end": 13234,
    "char_count": 978,
    "text": "b. Registration: The Bidder should be registered with the Income Tax, Goods and Service Tax\nand also registered under the labour laws, Employees Provident Fund Organisation, Employees\nState Insurance Corporation under Bhopal jurisdiction.\nc. Clearance: The Bidder should also have clearance from GST, and Income Tax Department.\nRelevant proof in support shall be submitted.\nd. Establishment: The Bidder must have its registered office actively located in Bhopal,\nMadhya Pradesh. The Bidder should submit documentary proof for the same.\ne. Experience: The Bidder should have at least three years’ experience for providing\nManpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping) services in Ministries/ Departments under Govt.\nof India/ State Govt. Departments/ Public Sector Undertakings/ Autonomous Bodies. The\nbidder should have successfully executed/ completed similar services of providing\nManpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping) services, over the last three years, i.e., (F/Y 2020-21\nto 2022-23):-",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0044",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 44,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13235,
    "char_end": 13369,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "1. Three similar completed services costing not less than the amount equal to 40% of the\nestimated cost (i.e., more than 14 lakhs); or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0045",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 45,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13370,
    "char_end": 13502,
    "char_count": 132,
    "text": "2. Two similar completed services costing not less than the amount equal to 50% of the\nestimated cost (i.e., more than 18 lakhs); or",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0046",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 46,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 13503,
    "char_end": 14221,
    "char_count": 718,
    "text": "3. One similar completed services costing not less than the amount equal to 80% of the\nestimated cost (i.e., more than 29 lakhs).\nf. Turnover: The Bidder should have minimum average annual financial turnover of Rs\n11,00,000/- (Rupees Eleven lakh) in similar services of providing Manpower (Sanitation/\nHousekeeping) services during the last three years, ending 31 March 2023.\ng. The bidder should have its own trained Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping) services on their\nrolls. A Notarized affidavit and undertaking that the workers employed would be paid at least\nminimum wages as per orders of Government of India and oblige all statutory requirements\nwith respect to ESI, EPF etc., with reference to those workers.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0047",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 47,
    "page_start": 8,
    "page_end": 8,
    "char_start": 14223,
    "char_end": 14380,
    "char_count": 157,
    "text": "2.1 Documents supporting the Minimum Eligibility Criteria\n\n(i) In proof of having fully adhered to the minimum eligibility criteria at 2(a), attested copy of",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
