    "char_start": 14628,
    "char_end": 14857,
    "char_count": 229,
    "text": "(ii) In proof of having fully adhered to minimum eligibility criteria at 2(b), attested copy of PAN,\nGST Registration, EPF Registration, ESIC Registration and Labour Licence all under\nBhopal jurisdiction shall only be acceptable.",
