    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 14859,
    "char_end": 15056,
    "char_count": 197,
    "text": "(iii) In proof of having fully adhered to minimum eligibility criteria at 2(c), attested copy of ITR\nand GST Return for the last three Financial Years (2020-21 to 2022-23) shall only be\nacceptable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0052",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 52,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15058,
    "char_end": 15282,
    "char_count": 224,
    "text": "(iv) In proof of having fully adhered to the minimum eligibility criteria at 2(d), attested copy of\ndocumentary proof for registered office located (in the form of Gumasta) in Bhopal,\nMadhya Pradesh shall only be acceptable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
