    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 53,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15284,
    "char_end": 15603,
    "char_count": 319,
    "text": "(v) In proof of having fully adhered to minimum eligibility criteria at 2(e), attested copy of\ndocumentary proof of experience (copies of work orders along with work completion\ncertificates/experience certificates) in the Departments under Govt./ PSUs from F/Y\n2020-21 to 2022-23 shall also be required to be submitted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0054",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 54,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15605,
    "char_end": 15862,
    "char_count": 257,
    "text": "(vi) In proof of having fully adhered to minimum eligibility criteria at 2(f), attested copy of the\naudited balance sheets (audited by Chartered Accountant) for the completed three financial\nyears i.e., 2020-21, 2021-22 and 2022-23 shall only be acceptable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0055",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 55,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 15864,
    "char_end": 16767,
    "char_count": 903,
    "text": "(vii) Other documents as per Clause 6 of Annexure-2.\n3. EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT:\n\n3.1 The estimated value of Contract is Rs. 36,15,485 /- for the remaining period(one month\nMarch 24) of F/Y 2023-24 (Rs. 2,30,490/-) and F/Y 2024-25 (Rs. 33,84,995/-) (i.e. from 1st\nMarch 2024 to 31st March 2025). The Composite Contract which is inclusive of Manpower\n(Sanitation/ Housekeeping) services along with cleaning materials will commence from\n01.04.2024. The bids shall be accompanied by an Earnest Money Deposit in the form of\nDemand Draft/Fixed Deposit Receipt as per bid document of GeM, which is 3% of Estimated\nTender Value (i.e. Rs. 1,08,465/-). The validity of the Demand Draft/Fixed Deposit Receipt\nmust be beyond three months starting from the date of submission of the bids. The Demand\nDraft / Fixed Deposit Receipt shall be in favour of PAO (Office of Pr. AG(A&E)-I, M.P.)\nGwalior, payable at Gwalior\".",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0056",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 56,
    "page_start": 9,
    "page_end": 9,
    "char_start": 16769,
    "char_end": 17301,
    "char_count": 532,
    "text": "3.2 The Bidder should scan a copy of the earnest money deposit and upload it online through GeM\nPortal. The original copy of the earnest money deposit should be sent to Sr. Audit Officer\n(Admin-III), Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya Pradesh, Bhopal on or\nbefore the time of closing of the uploading of the Bids. The original EMD  can be sent by Speed\nPost or Registered Post. It can also be handed over in person. In the event  of non-receipt of the\nEMD before the closing of the Bids, the bid shall not be opened.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
