    "char_count": 103,
    "text": "GFRs, 2017, should submit documentary proof thereof along with technical bid online\nthrough GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0060",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 60,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17638,
    "char_end": 17842,
    "char_count": 204,
    "text": "3.4 No request for transfer of any previous deposit of earnest money or security deposit or\nadjustment against any pending bill held by the Department in respect of any previous work\nshall be entertained.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0061",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 61,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 17844,
    "char_end": 18130,
    "char_count": 286,
    "text": "3.5 Bidders shall not be permitted to withdraw their offer or modify the terms and conditions\nthereof. In case the bidder fails to observe and comply with the stipulations made herein or\nbacks out after quoting the rates, the aforesaid bid security shall be forfeited to the\nGovernment.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0062",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 62,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18132,
    "char_end": 18370,
    "char_count": 238,
    "text": "3.6 The bids without Earnest Money Deposit shall be summarily rejected.\n\n3.7 No claim shall lie against the Government / Department in respect of erosion in the value or\ninterest on the amount of earnest money deposit or security deposit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0063",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 63,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 18372,
    "char_end": 19050,
    "char_count": 678,
    "text": "3.8 The bid security (earnest money deposit) may be forfeited:\n\n(i) If the bidder withdraws his bid during the period of bid validity specified by the bidder in the\nbid form; or\n(ii) In case of successful bidder, if the bidder\n(a) Fails to sign the contract in accordance with the terms of the bid document.\n(b) Fails to furnish required performance security in accordance with the terms of bid\ndocument within the time frame specified by the Client.\n(c) Fails or refuses to honor his own quoted prices for the services or part thereof.\n(d) In such case, the bidder is also liable to be debarred from future tendering.\n3.9 No interest shall be paid on the earnest money deposit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0064",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 64,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19052,
    "char_end": 19190,
    "char_count": 138,
    "text": "4 VALIDITY OF BIDS\n\n4.1 Bids shall remain valid and open for acceptance for a period of 180 days from the last date\nof submission of Bids.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0065",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 65,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19192,
    "char_end": 19329,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "4.2 The Client may request for extension for another period of 30 days, without any modifications\nand without giving any reasons thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0066",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 66,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19331,
    "char_end": 19745,
    "char_count": 414,
    "text": "5 PREPARATION AND SUBMISSION OF E-BIDS IN GeM PORTAL\n\n5.1 The bid document, along with terms and conditions, has been uploaded on GeM Portal. The\nbidders can log on to the website and see the bid document. The Bidders shall be required to\nsubmit Technical and Financial Bids through GeM Portal electronically using valid GeM ID.\nMore information useful for submitting online bids on the GeM Portal may be obtained.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0067",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 67,
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 10,
    "char_start": 19747,
    "char_end": 19914,
    "char_count": 167,
    "text": "5.2 The bidders who are desirous of participating in e-procurement shall submit their Bids in two\nbid system i.e. Technical Bids and Financial Bids through GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0068",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 68,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 19916,
    "char_end": 20053,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0069",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 69,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20055,
    "char_end": 20452,
    "char_count": 397,
    "text": "5.3 The bidders should upload the scanned copies of all relevant certificates, documents etc.\nincluding earnest money deposit / exemption certificate as per the requirements contained in\nClause 6 of Annexure 2 of the Bid Document in support of their technical bids. The bidder\nshould sign on all statements, documents etc. uploaded by him, owning responsibility for their\ncorrectness/authenticity.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0070",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 70,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20454,
    "char_end": 20939,
    "char_count": 485,
    "text": "5.4 The Bidders are also required to submit earnest money deposit in original  in a sealed envelope\nsuperscribed “Bids for providing Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping) Services along with\nthe Cleaning material” at reception, Office of the  Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya\nPradesh, 53, Arera Hills, Hoshangabad Road, Bhopal, 462011 or sent by post at the above\nhighlighted address on or before the dates specified in the Bid document (or before the last\nday of submission of bid).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0071",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 71,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20941,
    "char_end": 21057,
    "char_count": 116,
    "text": "5.5 The Bidder should upload the financial bids as per the instructions contained in the Bid\nDocument on GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0072",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 72,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21059,
    "char_end": 21289,
    "char_count": 230,
    "text": "5.6 The bids shall be summarily rejected if the bid is submitted other than through online (GeM\nPortal) or original Earnest money Deposit are not submitted by the Bidders within stipulated\ndate / time as mentioned in bid document.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0073",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 73,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21291,
    "char_end": 21546,
    "char_count": 255,
    "text": "5.7 The important dates are mentioned in Bid document.\n\n6 TECHNICAL BID\n\nThe Bidder shall be required to follow the procedure as specified above and submit the Technical\nBid online through GeM Portal. The following documents shall comprise Technical Bid:-",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
