    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21726,
    "char_end": 22026,
    "char_count": 300,
    "text": "b. Annexure-7: The Bidder shall be required to submit a notarized affidavit on non-judicial stamp\npaper of Rs. 50/- as per Annexure-7 to the effect of acceptance of the terms and conditions of\nthe Bid Document. The Bidder shall ensure that copy of the Affidavit is scanned and uploaded\nin GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0076",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 76,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 22028,
    "char_end": 22678,
    "char_count": 650,
    "text": "c. Annexure-8 : The Bidder shall be required to submit a notarized affidavit on non-judicial stamp\npaper of Rs. 50/- as per Annexure-8 to the effect that none of the relatives of the Bidder are\nemployees of Client and that the bidder has not been convicted of an offence under the\nPrevention of Corruption Act, 1988 and the bidder has not been convicted under the Indian\nPenal Code or any other law for the time being in force, for causing any loss of life or property\nor causing a threat to public health as part of execution of a public procurement contract. The\nBidder shall ensure that copy of the Affidavit is scanned and uploaded in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0077",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 77,
    "page_start": 11,
