    "paragraph_index": 81,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 23534,
    "char_end": 23872,
    "char_count": 338,
    "text": "f. Annexure-6: Technical Bid Form: The Bidder shall be required to sign, scan and upload the\nTechnical Bid Form as per Annexure 6 in GeM Portal. The Bidder shall mandatorily submit\nan Index mentioning all the documents submitted in the Bid along with page number for\nreference. A Sample Index is placed in the bid document as Annexure-13.",
