    "paragraph_index": 82,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 23874,
    "char_end": 24189,
    "char_count": 315,
    "text": "g. Earnest Money Deposit: A scanned copy of earnest money deposit or exemption certificate\nshould be uploaded through GeM Portal as per clause 3 of the Annexure-2. The Bidder shall\nensure that original of the earnest money deposit is also submitted in the office as per the\ninstructions of Clause 3.2 of Annexure-2.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0083",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 83,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 24191,
    "char_end": 24459,
    "char_count": 268,
    "text": "h. Documents in support of Minimum Eligibility Criteria: The Bidder shall be required to\nupload each of the document online through GeM Portal as mentioned in Clause 2.1 of\nAnnexure-2 of the Bid Document in support of their fulfillment of minimum eligibility criteria.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
