    "paragraph_index": 84,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 24461,
    "char_end": 24641,
    "char_count": 180,
    "text": "i. The hard copies of above Annexure 1, Annexure 7, Annexure 8, Annexure 9 and Annexure\n10 must be submitted by successful bidders in original at the time of execution of contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0085",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 85,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 24643,
    "char_end": 24943,
    "char_count": 300,
    "text": "7 FINANCIAL BID:\n\n7.1 The Bidder should quote rates in terms in Indian Rupees. If rate is not quoted in terms of Indian\nRupees, the bid will not be valid and hence the same will be rejected. The consolidated price\nwill be taken into consideration while awarding  of contract to the successful bidder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0086",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 86,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 24945,
    "char_end": 25183,
    "char_count": 238,
    "text": "7.2 The rates quoted shall be firm and final. The price should be all inclusive of all i.e. Minimum\nWages, EPF, ESIC, Uniform, & Liveries, Gratuity, Bonus, Substitute and other statutory\ncharges arising from time to time exclusive of GST.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0087",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 87,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 25185,
    "char_end": 25411,
    "char_count": 226,
    "text": "7.3 At the time of payment of bills, the income tax and any other tax / duty etc. that is required to\nbe deducted, shall be deducted at source as per Government rules and guidelines as may be\nprevailing at the time of payment.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0088",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 88,
    "page_start": 12,
    "page_end": 12,
    "char_start": 25413,
    "char_end": 25960,
    "char_count": 547,
    "text": "8 CLARIFICATION ON TECHNICAL BID EVALUATION.\n\n8.1 The technical bids shall be evaluated based on the available documents submitted by the bidder.\nTo assist in the examination, evaluation, and comparison of the bids, and qualification of the\nbidders, the Client may, at its discretion, ask any bidder for a clarification of its bid. Any\nclarification submitted by a bidder that is not in response to a request by the Client shall not\nbe considered. The Client’s request for clarification and the response shall be in writing in\nconventional manner.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0089",
