  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0092",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 92,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 26416,
    "char_end": 26588,
    "char_count": 172,
    "text": "9 TECHNICAL BID EVALUATION\n\n9.1 The Client shall follow segregated two stage bid evaluation system where the technical bid and\nfinancial  bid shall be evaluated separately.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0093",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 93,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 26590,
    "char_end": 26816,
    "char_count": 226,
    "text": "9.2 The technical bid evaluation shall be done based on the following criteria:\n\n(i)  That the Bidder has signed, scanned and uploaded copy of the 'Bid Submission Form' as per\nAnnexure-1 in the prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0094",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 94,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 26818,
    "char_end": 26952,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(ii) That the Bidder has signed, scanned and uploaded the Technical Bid Form as per Annexure 6\nin the prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0095",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 95,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 26954,
    "char_end": 27088,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(iii) That the Bidder has scanned and uploaded a copy of notarized Affidavit as per Annexure 7 in\nthe prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0096",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 96,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27090,
    "char_end": 27223,
    "char_count": 133,
    "text": "(iv) That the Bidder has scanned and uploaded a copy of notarized Affidavit as per Annexure 8 in\nthe prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0097",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 97,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27225,
    "char_end": 27357,
    "char_count": 132,
    "text": "(v) That the Bidder has scanned and uploaded a copy of notarized Affidavit as per Annexure 9 in\nthe prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0098",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 98,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27359,
    "char_end": 27493,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "(vi) That the Bidder has scanned and uploaded a copy of notarized Affidavit as per Annexure 10\nin the prescribed format in GeM Portal.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0099",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 99,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27495,
    "char_end": 27685,
    "char_count": 190,
    "text": "(vii) That copy of Earnest Money Deposit is scanned and uploaded in GeM Portal. The original of\nthe EMD should be submitted by the Bidder as per the timelines specified  in the Bid document.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0100",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 100,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27687,
    "char_end": 27906,
    "char_count": 219,
    "text": "(viii) That the Bidder meets the minimum eligibility criteria as per Clause 2.1 of Annexure 2 and\nhas uploaded copies of all documents required in support of minimum eligibility criteria as per\nclause 2.1 of Annexure-2.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0101",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 101,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 27908,
    "char_end": 28127,
    "char_count": 219,
    "text": "9.3 A substantially responsive bid shall be one that meets the requirements of the bidding document\nin totality. The technical bid not meeting the minimum eligibility criteria as per the bid\ndocument, shall be rejected.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0102",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 102,
    "page_start": 13,
    "page_end": 13,
    "char_start": 28129,
    "char_end": 28349,
    "char_count": 220,
    "text": "10 FINANCIAL BID OPENING PROCEDURE\n\n10.1 The Financial Bids of all the technically qualified Bidders, whose bids are accepted in\nconformity with the required specifications shall be opened on the appointed date and time.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0103",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 103,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 28351,
    "char_end": 28488,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0104",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 104,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 28490,
    "char_end": 28659,
    "char_count": 169,
    "text": "10.2 Mere becoming the lowest bidder, prior to financial bid scrutiny will not give any right to the\nlowest bidder to claim that he is successful in the bidding process.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0105",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 105,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 28661,
    "char_end": 29163,
    "char_count": 502,
    "text": "11 RIGHT OF ACCEPTANCE:\n\n11.1 The Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya Pradesh, 53, Arera Hills,\nHoshangabad Road, Bhopal reserves all rights to reject any bid including of those bidders who\nfail to comply with the instructions without assigning any reason whatsoever and does not bind\nitself to accept the lowest or any specific bids. The decision of the Competent Authority of\nOffice of the Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya Pradesh, Bhopal in this regard shall be\nfinal and binding.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0106",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 106,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 29165,
    "char_end": 29336,
    "char_count": 171,
    "text": "11.2 Any failure on the part of the bidder to observe the prescribed procedure and any attempt to\ncanvass for the work shall render the bidder’s bids liable for rejection.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0107",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 107,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 29338,
    "char_end": 29623,
    "char_count": 285,
    "text": "11.3 The competent authority of the Office of the  Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya Pradesh,\n53, Arera Hills, Hoshangabad Road, Bhopal reserves the right to award any or part or full\ncontract to any successful agency (ies) at its discretion and this will be binding on the bidders.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0108",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 108,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 29625,
    "char_end": 29938,
    "char_count": 313,
    "text": "11.4  In case of tie in Financial Bid, the Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II) Madhya\nPradesh, Bhopal may select the bidder on the basis of past experience in IA&AD department.\nEven then, if there is a tie, the establishment having more number of years of work experience\nin this office will be preferred.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0109",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 109,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 29940,
    "char_end": 30255,
    "char_count": 315,
    "text": "12 NOTIFICATION OF AWARD BY ISSUANCE OF ‘LETTER OF ACCEPTANCE’\n\n12.1 After determining the successful Bidder, Client shall issue a Letter of Acceptance  (LoA)\nwho will return one copy to Client duly acknowledged, accepted, and signed by the\nauthorized signatory, within three (3) days of receipt of the same by him.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0110",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 110,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 30257,
    "char_end": 30392,
    "char_count": 135,
    "text": "12.2 The issuance of the Letter of Acceptance to the bidder shall constitute an integral part and it\nwill be a binding to the contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0111",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 111,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 30394,
    "char_end": 30514,
    "char_count": 120,
    "text": "12.3 The time taken between the date of issue of Letter of Acceptance shall not prevent the\ncontractor for mobilization.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0112",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 112,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 30516,
    "char_end": 30801,
    "char_count": 285,
    "text": "13 RETURNING OF EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT (BID SECURITY AMOUNT)\n\n13.1 The Earnest Money Deposit of the unsuccessful bidders in the technical Bid evaluation stage\nshall be returned along with their unopened financial bids within seven (07) days after opening\nof the eligible financial Bids.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0113",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 113,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 30803,
    "char_end": 30989,
    "char_count": 186,
    "text": "13.2 The Earnest Money Deposit of the unsuccessful bidders in the financial bid evaluation stage\n shall be returned within seven (07) days, on award of contract to the Successful bidder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0114",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 114,
    "page_start": 14,
    "page_end": 14,
    "char_start": 30991,
    "char_end": 31088,
    "char_count": 97,
    "text": "13.3  No interest shall be payable on the Earnest Money Deposit returned to unsuccessful bidders.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0115",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 115,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 31090,
    "char_end": 31227,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0116",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 116,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 31229,
    "char_end": 31481,
    "char_count": 252,
    "text": "ANNEXURE-3\nGENERAL CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT (GCC)\n\n1. DEFINITIONS\n\n1.1 General\n\nIn this Contract including the Schedules the following words and expressions shall (unless the context\nrequires otherwise) have the meaning assigned to them in this Schedule.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0117",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 117,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 31483,
    "char_end": 32709,
    "char_count": 1226,
    "text": "“Agreement”\nThe word “Agreement” and “Contract” has been used interchangeably.\nParty\nThe word “party” means the Successful Bidder to whom the work of providing\nManpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning items has\nbeen awarded and the Client “Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal”.\nLetter of Acceptance\n(LoA)\nShall mean the intent of the Client to engage the successful bidder for providing\nManpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning items in\nits premises\n‘Confidential\nInformation’\nShall mean all information that is not generally known and which is obtained\n/received during the tenure of the contract and relates directly to the business\n/assets of Client including the information having the commercial value.\nTermination\nDate”\nShall mean the date specified in the notice of Termination given by either Party\nto the other Party, from which the Contract shall stand terminated.\nTermination\nNotice\nShall mean the notice of Termination given by either Party to the other Party\nContractor\nShall mean the successful bidder to whom the work of providing Manpower\n(Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning items in premises has\nbeen awarded.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0118",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 118,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 32711,
    "char_end": 33235,
    "char_count": 524,
    "text": "1.2 CONFIDENTIALITY\n\n1.2.1 The Contractor shall take all precautions not to disclose, divulge and / or disseminate to any\nthird party any confidential information, proprietary information on the Client’s business or\nsecurity arrangements (including but not limited to the Assignment Instructions, Schedules\nand other subsequent Agreements) and/or business of the Client. The obligation is not limited\nto any scope and the Contractor shall be held responsible in case of breach of the\nconfidentiality of Client’s information.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0119",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 119,
    "page_start": 15,
    "page_end": 15,
    "char_start": 33237,
    "char_end": 33447,
    "char_count": 210,
    "text": "1.2.2 If the Contractor receives enquiries from Press / News / Media/ Radio / Television or other\nbodies / persons, the same shall be referred by the Contractor to Client immediately on receipt\nof such queries.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0120",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 120,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33449,
    "char_end": 33586,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0121",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 121,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33588,
    "char_end": 33992,
    "char_count": 404,
    "text": "2\nPERFORMANCE SECURITY DEPOSIT\n\n2.1 The successful bidder within fifteen days of the acceptance of the LoA shall submit a\nperformance security  deposit (valid for a period beyond sixty days of completion of all\ncontractual obligations) in form of DD/ FDR, a sum equivalent to 5% (Five percent) of the\naccepted contract value in favour of \"PAO (Office of Pr. AG(A&E)-I, M.P.) Gwalior,\npayable at Gwalior\".",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0122",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 122,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 33994,
    "char_end": 34684,
    "char_count": 690,
    "text": "2.2 The Performance Security can be forfeited by order of the competent authority of the Office\nof the Accountant General (Audit-II), Madhya Pradesh, Bhopal in the event of any breach  or\nnegligence or non-observance of any terms/condition of contract or for unsatisfactory\nperformance or for non-acceptance of the work order. On expiry of the contract, such portion\nof the said FDR/DD as may be considered by the Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal sufficient to cover any incorrect or excess payments made on the\nbills to the firm, shall be retained for a period of sixty days beyond the date of completion of\nall contractual obligations of the Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0123",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 123,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 34686,
    "char_end": 35002,
    "char_count": 316,
    "text": "2.3 If the contractor fails to provide the Performance Security within the period specified such\nfailure shall constitute a breach of the contract and the Office of the Accountant General\n(Audit-II), Madhya Pradesh, Bhopal shall be entitled to make other arrangements at the risk,\ncost and expense of the contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0124",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 124,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 35004,
    "char_end": 35387,
    "char_count": 383,
    "text": "2.4 On due performance and completion of the contract in all respects, the Performance Security\nwill be returned to the contractor without any interest on presentation of an absolute No\nDemand Certificate in the prescribed form and upon return in good condition of any\nspecifications, samples or other property belonging to the purchaser, which may have been\nissued to the contractor",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0125",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 125,
    "page_start": 16,
    "page_end": 16,
    "char_start": 35389,
    "char_end": 35606,
    "char_count": 217,
    "text": "3. SIGNING OF CONTRACT AGREEMENT\n\n3.1 The successful Bidder shall enter into contract and shall execute and sign the Contract\nAgreement in accordance with the Articles of Agreement before commencement of the\nservices.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
