    "char_count": 321,
    "text": "3.3 The successful Bidder shall return the duly concurred copies of the draft Articles of Agreement\nwithin Two (02) days of receipt of the draft Articles of Agreement from Client, duly printed\non the correct amount of stamp paper, duly adjudicated by the registrar of stamps where the\ncontract is proposed to be executed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
