    "char_end": 36805,
    "char_count": 352,
    "text": "4. SERVICES REQUIRED BY THE CLIENT\n\n4.1 The Contractor shall be providing Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with\nCleaning items in Client’s premises as per the details given herein, or any other location as\nrequired by the Client to be read with the Special Conditions of Contract, Assignment\nInstructions and Schedule of Requirements.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0131",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 131,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 36807,
    "char_end": 37057,
    "char_count": 250,
    "text": "4.2 The Client shall pay the charges as agreed between the Client and the Contractor at the time of\nbidding process. A schedule of charges shall be annexed to the Articles of Agreement after\nfinalizing the amount at the conclusion of Bidding process.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0132",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 132,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 37059,
    "char_end": 37357,
    "char_count": 298,
    "text": "4.3 The Contractor shall provide Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with\nCleaning items in the Client’s premises to its entire satisfaction and it is the sole responsibility\nof the Contractor that the work is executed in all respects in accordance with the Contractor’s\nobligations.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0133",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 133,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 37359,
    "char_end": 37453,
    "char_count": 94,
    "text": "5. COMMENCEMENT OF SERVICES\n\nThe Contract shall become legally binding and in force only upon:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0134",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 134,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 37455,
    "char_end": 37697,
    "char_count": 242,
    "text": "5.1 Submission of Security Deposit.\n\n5.2 The Contractor shall commence Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with\nCleaning items in Client’s premises from the due date of contract after receipt of Letter of\nAcceptance/Work order.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0135",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 135,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 37699,
    "char_end": 38124,
    "char_count": 425,
    "text": "7. CONTRACTOR’S OBLIGATIONS\n\n7.1 The Contractor shall provide Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with\nCleaning items at Client’s premises as per Schedule of Work / Requirements which may be\namended from time to time by the Client during the Contractual period and it shall always\nform part and parcel of the Contract. The Contractor shall abide by such assignments as\nprovided by the Client from time to time.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0136",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 136,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 38126,
    "char_end": 38533,
    "char_count": 407,
    "text": "7.2 The Contractor shall provide Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with\nCleaning items through its uniformed and trained personnel  for the performance of its services\nhereunder and these personnel deployed shall be employees  of the Contractor only and the\nClient shall not in any manner be liable and all statutory liabilities (such as ESI & EPF etc.)\nshall be paid for by the Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0137",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 137,
    "page_start": 17,
    "page_end": 17,
    "char_start": 38535,
    "char_end": 39048,
    "char_count": 513,
    "text": "7.3 The Contractor shall submit to Client, the details of amount deposited on account of EPF and\nESI in respect of the deployed personnel to the concerned authorities every month. The\ncontractor shall submit to the client the list of EPF Account numbers of the outsourced\nManpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services), copy of annual EPF slip, copy of ESIC card.\nThe details of submission of EPF and  ESIC contribution to the concerned authorities by the\ncontractor shall be submitted on every month to the Client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0138",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 138,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39050,
    "char_end": 39187,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0139",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 139,
