    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39189,
    "char_end": 39368,
    "char_count": 179,
    "text": "7.3.1 Further, the Contractor shall also be required to submit an undertaking with the monthly bills\nthat they have paid the monthly dues of EPF/ESI to the respective authorities.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0140",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 140,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39370,
    "char_end": 39529,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "7.4 The Contractor shall produce to the client the details of payments of statutory benefits like\nbonus, leave, relief etc. from time to time to its personnel.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0141",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 141,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39531,
    "char_end": 39793,
    "char_count": 262,
    "text": "7.5 The Client shall have the right, within reason, to have any personnel removed who is\nconsidered to be undesirable or otherwise and similarly the Contractor reserves the right to\nremove any personnel with prior intimation to the Client, emergencies, exempted.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0142",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 142,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39795,
    "char_end": 39967,
    "char_count": 172,
    "text": "7.6 The Contractor shall cover its personnel for personal accident and death whilst performing the\nduty and the Client shall own no liability and obligation in this regard.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0143",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 143,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 39969,
    "char_end": 40156,
    "char_count": 187,
    "text": "7.7 The Contractor shall exercise adequate supervision to reasonably ensure proper performance\nof Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) in accordance with Schedule of\nRequirements.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0144",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 144,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 40158,
    "char_end": 40313,
    "char_count": 155,
    "text": "7.8 The Contractor shall issue identity cards / identification documents to all its employees who\nwill be instructed by the Contractor to display the same.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0145",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 145,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 40315,
    "char_end": 40642,
    "char_count": 327,
    "text": "7.9 The personnel of the Contractor shall not be the employees of the Client and they shall not\nclaim any salary or allowances, compensation, damages or anything arising out of their\nemployment/duty under this Contract. The Contractor shall make them known about this\nposition in writing before deployment under this agreement.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0146",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 146,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 40644,
    "char_end": 41106,
    "char_count": 462,
    "text": "7.10 The Contractor shall also provide at its own cost all benefits statutory or otherwise to its\nemployees and the Client shall not have any liability whatsoever on this account. The\nContractor shall also abide by and comply with the Labour laws, Workmen Compensation\nAct, EPF Laws, ESIC Laws, Income tax laws and Minimum Wages Laws, Contract Labour\n(Regulations Abolition Act), Payment of Bonus Act,1965, payment of Gratuity Act,1972 or\nany other law in force.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0147",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 147,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 41108,
    "char_end": 41260,
    "char_count": 152,
    "text": "7.11 The Contractor shall provide minimum of two sets each of summer and winter uniform to its\npersonnel at its own cost in April and October each year.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0148",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 148,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 41262,
    "char_end": 41428,
    "char_count": 166,
    "text": "7.12 The Contractor shall cover all its personnel under the relevant laws of EPF, Labour, ESIC\netc. Proof of the same should be submitted by the Contractor quarterly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0149",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 149,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 41430,
    "char_end": 41529,
    "char_count": 99,
    "text": "7.13 The Contractor shall submit a copy of wages sheet showing monthly wages paid to its\npersonnel.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0150",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 150,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 41531,
    "char_end": 41704,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "7.14 Adequate supervision shall be provided to ensure correct performance of the services in\naccordance with the prevailing requirements agreed upon between the two parties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0151",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 151,
    "page_start": 18,
    "page_end": 18,
    "char_start": 41706,
    "char_end": 41847,
    "char_count": 141,
    "text": "7.15 All necessary reports and other information shall be supplied immediately as required and\nregular meetings will be held with the Client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0152",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 152,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 41849,
    "char_end": 41986,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0153",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 153,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 41988,
    "char_end": 42162,
    "char_count": 174,
    "text": "7.16 The Contractor must employ any person between the age of 18 to 45 years. Manpower\n(Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) so engaged shall be trained for providing services.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0154",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 154,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 42164,
    "char_end": 42440,
    "char_count": 276,
    "text": "7.17 Contractor’s Personnel\n\n7.17.1 The Contractor shall at all times ensure that it has sufficient, suitable and qualified personnel\nto undertake the responsibilities imposed upon the Contractor under the Contract and to\nprovide full attention for executing the work thereof.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0155",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 155,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 42442,
    "char_end": 42563,
    "char_count": 121,
    "text": "7.17.2 The personnel engaged by the Contractor shall be dressed in neat and clean uniform\n(including proper name badges).",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0156",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 156,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 42565,
    "char_end": 42981,
    "char_count": 416,
    "text": "8. CONTRACTOR’S LIABILITY\n\n8.1 The Contractor shall completely indemnify and hold harmless the Client and its employees\nagainst any liability, claims, losses or damages sustained by it or them by reason of any breach\nof contract, wrongful act or negligence by the Contractor or any of its employees engaged in\nthe provision of the Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning\nitems to the Client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0157",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 157,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 42983,
    "char_end": 43174,
    "char_count": 191,
    "text": "8.2 The Contractor shall be liable in any way whatsoever and the Client hereby expressly does\nnot waives any loss, injury, damage, cost or expense of whatsoever nature directly or\nindirectly:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0158",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 158,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 43176,
    "char_end": 43709,
    "char_count": 533,
    "text": "8.2.1 consisting of, caused by, resulting from or in connection with any loss, damage, destruction,\ndistortion, erasure, corruption or alteration of Electronic Data from any cause whatsoever\n(including but not limited to Computer Virus) unless such loss, damage, destruction,\ndistortion, erasure, corruption or alteration of Electronic Data was due to the negligence or\ndefault of the Contractor or any of its employees engaged in the provision of Manpower\n(Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning items to the Client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0159",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 159,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 43711,
    "char_end": 44126,
    "char_count": 415,
    "text": "8.3 The Contractor shall not Sub-Contract or Sub-let, transfer or assign the contract or any other\npart thereof. In the event of the contractor contravening this condition, Client shall be entitled\nto place the contract elsewhere on the contractors risk and cost and the contractor shall be\nliable for any loss or damage, which the Client may sustain in consequence or arising out of\nsuch replacing of the contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0160",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 160,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 44128,
    "char_end": 44442,
    "char_count": 314,
    "text": "9. CLIENT’S OBLIGATIONS\n\n9.1  If the Contractor Submits any recommendations in writing in connection with improvement\nin performance of services, the Client, at its discretion, after satisfying that recommendations\nmay improve the performance of services, shall accept the recommendations, completely or\npartially.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0161",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 161,
    "page_start": 19,
    "page_end": 19,
    "char_start": 44444,
    "char_end": 44544,
    "char_count": 100,
    "text": "9.2 The Client shall notify the Contractor of any dishonest, wrongful or negligent acts or omissions",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0162",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 162,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 44546,
    "char_end": 44683,
    "char_count": 137,
    "text": "Office of the Accountant General (Audit-II),\nMadhya Pradesh, Bhopal\nBid Document No. Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/\nDated 2 6 . 0 1 . 2 4",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0163",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 163,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 44685,
    "char_end": 44816,
    "char_count": 131,
    "text": "of the Contractor’s employees or agents in connection with the Services as soon as possible\nafter the Client becomes aware of them.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0164",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 164,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 44818,
    "char_end": 45015,
    "char_count": 197,
    "text": "9.3 To enable the Contractor to provide the Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along\nwith Cleaning items, the Client shall ensure that their staff is available to provide such\nassistance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0165",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 165,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 45017,
    "char_end": 45277,
    "char_count": 260,
    "text": "9.4 The Client shall not be under any obligation for providing empanelment to any of the personnel\nof the Contractor after the expiry of the contract. The Client does not recognize any\n“employee-employer” relationship with any of the workers of the Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0166",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 166,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 45279,
    "char_end": 46078,
    "char_count": 799,
    "text": "10. VALIDITY OF CONTRACT\n\n10.1 The contract, if awarded, shall be initially for a period of 13 Months w.e.f  1st March-2024\nto 31st March 2025 (one month for F/Y 2023-24 (Non-Composite) and 12 months of F/Y\n2024-25 (Composite Contract inclusive of manpower (sanitation/housekeeping services)\nand cleaning materials) from the date of award subject to continuous satisfactory\nperformance. In case of breach of Contract or in the event  of not fulfilling the minimum\nrequirements / statutory requirements, the Client shall have the  right to terminate the contract\nforthwith in addition to forfeiting the performance security amount deposited by the\ncontractor and initiating administrative actions for blacklisting etc.  solely at the discretion of\nthe Competent authority of the office of the Client.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0167",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 167,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 46080,
    "char_end": 46368,
    "char_count": 288,
    "text": "10.2 The contract may be renewed for further up to two years, at the discretion of this office based\non satisfactory services provided by and willingness of the contractor. However, the\nContractor has to provide services at the same rate for the period up to finalization of new\ncontract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0168",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 168,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 46370,
    "char_end": 46674,
    "char_count": 304,
    "text": "11. PAYMENTS\n\n11.1 After selection of the Successful bidder as Contractor, a price schedule shall be annexed to\nthe Articles of Agreement according to which all payments shall be made to the Contractor\nby the Client for the Manpower (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) services along with\nCleaning items.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0169",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 169,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 46676,
    "char_end": 46937,
    "char_count": 261,
    "text": "11.2 The prices shall be exclusive of any GST/ service tax, education cess, secondary and higher\neducation cess or any other applicable taxes as may be levied by the Government from time-\nto-time and the same shall be charged in addition to the applicable rate.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0170",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 170,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 46939,
    "char_end": 47183,
    "char_count": 244,
    "text": "11.3 The Contractor shall raise invoice per month and submit the same to Client by 5th of every\nfollowing month. Client shall make all endeavour to make payments within 15-20 days from\nthe date of the receipt of the invoice from the Contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0171",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 171,
    "page_start": 20,
    "page_end": 20,
    "char_start": 47185,
    "char_end": 47464,
    "char_count": 279,
    "text": "11.4 The Contractor shall raise the invoice per month after disbursing the salaries/minimum wages\nto the outsourced personnel and providing all required cleaning materials in the office and\nsubmit the same along with necessary documents to Client by 5th of every following month.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
