    "char_end": 95552,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "NOW THIS AGREEMENT WITNESSTH as follows:\n\nWHEREAS the Client invited bids through GeM Portal, vide Notice Inviting for “ Outsourcing of\nManpower Services (Sanitation/ Housekeeping Services) along with Cleaning Items” at its\noffice under Bid Document No Admin-III/outsourcing/2024-25/D-   dated",
