    "char_count": 341,
    "text": "II. AND WHEREAS the Client has selected M/s……………………………………..as the\nsuccessful bidder (“the Contractor”) pursuant to the bidding process and negotiation of\ncontract prices, awarded the Letter of Acceptance (LoA) No. …………………, to the\nContractor   on   ……………………   for   a   total   sum   of ................................ [Rupees\n………………… Only].",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
