    "char_end": 96473,
    "char_count": 256,
    "text": "III. AND WHEREAS the Client desires that the hiring of Safaiwalas and cleaning items (as\ndefined in the Bidding Document) be provided, performed, executed and completed by the\nContractor, and wishes to appoint the Contractor for carrying out such services.",
