    "text": "A\nUNSKILLED MANPOWER COST (RATE NOT TO BE QUOTED)\nI\ni. MINIMUM WAGES- It is calculated as per\ncurrent minimum wages per day published by the\nGovt of India. (This component of wage per worker\nis calculated for 26 days). The minimum wages per\nday is taken as Rs. 628/- which includes (Basic Wage\nRs. 437/-+VDA Rs. 191/-)",
