    "char_end": 104561,
    "char_count": 377,
    "text": "ii. EPF & ESI- 16.25% (EPF @13% & ESI-\n@3.25%) for unskilled worker (This component of\nwage per worker is fixed as Rs. 2,481/- per month\n(16.25% of (Basic + VDA) of the worker. This\npayment will be made only on production of valid\nproof\nfor\nhaving\nremitted\nthe\nEmployer's\ncontribution. (This is fixed cost, the vendor not\nrequired to quote their own price under this\ncomponent)",
