    "char_start": 115641,
    "char_end": 115977,
    "char_count": 336,
    "text": "1. Generic\nOPTION CLAUSE: The buyer can increase or decrease the contract quantity or contract duration up to 25\npercent at the time of issue of the contract. However, once the contract is issued, contract quantity or\ncontract duration can only be increased up to 25 percent. Bidders are bound to accept the revised\nquantity or duration",
