    "page_end": 52,
    "char_start": 116307,
    "char_end": 116441,
    "char_count": 134,
    "text": "2. The Seller shall not sub-contract the Contract in whole or part to any entity without obtaining the prior\nwritten consent of buyer.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0429",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 429,
    "page_start": 52,
    "page_end": 52,
    "char_start": 116442,
    "char_end": 116723,
    "char_count": 281,
    "text": "3. The Seller shall, notwithstanding the consent and assignment/sub-contract, remain jointly and severally\nliable and responsible to buyer together with the assignee/ sub-contractor, for and in respect of the due\nperformance of the Contract and the Sellers obligations there under.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0430",
    "doc_id": "DOC-087",
    "paragraph_index": 430,
    "page_start": 52,
    "page_end": 52,
    "char_start": 116724,
    "char_end": 117842,
    "char_count": 1118,
    "text": "4. Purchase Preference (Centre)\nPurchase preference to Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs): Purchase preference will be given to MSEs as\ndefined in Public Procurement Policy for Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs) Order, 2012 dated\n23.03.2012 issued by Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises and its subsequent\nOrders/Notifications issued by concerned Ministry. If the bidder wants to avail the Purchase preference,\nthe bidder must be the manufacturer of the offered product in case of bid for supply of goods. Traders are\nexcluded from the purview of Public Procurement Policy for Micro and Small Enterprises. In respect of bid\nfor Services, the bidder must be the Service provider of the offered Service. Relevant documentary\nevidence in this regard shall be uploaded along with the bid in respect of the offered product or service. If\nL-1 is not an MSE and MSE Seller (s) has/have quoted price within L-1+ 15% of margin of purchase\npreference /price band defined in relevant policy, such Seller shall be given opportunity to match L-1\nprice and contract will be awarded for percentage of 100% of total value.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
