    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 2059,
    "char_end": 2093,
    "char_count": 34,
    "text": "Initial of ESIC authorised officer",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0007",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 2095,
    "char_end": 2121,
    "char_count": 26,
    "text": "Sign of Tenderer with seal",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 2123,
    "char_end": 2291,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "All tenderers are requested to read the tender document carefully including its\nterms and conditions, procedures to fill the tender form and tender assessment criteria.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 2293,
    "char_end": 2626,
    "char_count": 333,
    "text": "TENDER DOCUMENTS CONSIST THE FOLLOWING:-\n\nI.\nEligibility criteria\nII.\nGeneral Instructions to Tenderers\nIII. General Conditions of Contract\nIV. Scope of Work (Annexure-I)\nV.\nResource requirement (Annexure-II)\nVI. Technical Bid (Annexure-III)\nVII. Financial Bid (Annexure-IV)\nVIII. Declaration (Annexure-V)\nIX. Check List(Annexure-VI)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 2628,
    "char_end": 3058,
    "char_count": 430,
    "text": "I. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA\n\n1. The Tenderers must have an experience of handling the housekeeping work in reputed\norganisation including Govt& PSUs for at least three years supported by documentary\nevidence and must have among list of big clients, at least three Govt./Semi-Govt./PSUs.\nCertificates of satisfactory performance from these three clients are also to be\nsubmitted along with tender.\n2. The tenderer should have at least;",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3060,
    "char_end": 3381,
    "char_count": 321,
    "text": "a) One similar work contract of 42 lacs or more;\nOR\nb) Two similar work contracts of 28  lacs or more;\nOR\nc) Three similar work contracts of 20 lacs or more.\n3. The total turnover of the agency should not be less than Rs.10 Crores for\n“housekeeping segment” during requisite years of experience as mentioned at (1)\nabove.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 3383,
    "char_end": 3395,
    "char_count": 12,
    "text": "Page 5 of 35",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 3397,
    "char_end": 3431,
    "char_count": 34,
    "text": "Initial of ESIC authorised officer",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 3433,
    "char_end": 3874,
    "char_count": 441,
    "text": "Sign of Tenderer with seal\n4. The tenderer must be registered with the following statutory authorities and must also\nfurnish attested copies of supporting documents:-\na. ESIC, EPF, INCOME TAX AND SERVICE TAX\nb. Registration certificate under contract labour (R & A) Act 1970\nc. Any other registration / licence which is mandatory for such agencies stipulated by\nconcerned authorities from time to time such as Storage of Hazardous Chemicals.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0015",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 15,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 3875,
    "char_end": 4202,
    "char_count": 327,
    "text": "5. The following documents must be submitted along with tender:-\na. Audited Balance Sheets of preceding three years with Income and Expenditure\nstatement and Profit and Loss Account & Audit report of last three years.\nb. Income tax returns of last three years.\nc. ESIC & EPF up to date payment details for the last three years.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0016",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 16,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 4203,
    "char_end": 4672,
    "char_count": 469,
    "text": "6. The Tenderer should have sufficient employees on its rolls specifically trained for\nhousekeeping work. Full list of the employees, viz., name, age, employee code,\ndesignation, experience in the field of housekeeping, PF, ESI details etc. should be\nattached with the technical Bid. Document in support of Service tax, ESI, EPF deductions\nand details of the health and safety measures, the tenderer takes for his workers should\nalso be attached with the technical bid.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0017",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 17,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 4673,
    "char_end": 4893,
    "char_count": 220,
    "text": "7. The Tenderer should have a valid labour license and license for providing Pest control\nand storing chemicals used for the same including Hospital Waste Management (other\nthan Bio Medical Waste) services as applicable.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0018",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 18,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 4894,
    "char_end": 5076,
    "char_count": 182,
    "text": "8. The tenderer should have at least 200 Nos. of captive manpower on his payroll on the\nday of filing the tender. The tenders having captive manpower less than this will be\nrejected.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0019",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 19,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5077,
    "char_end": 5370,
    "char_count": 293,
    "text": "9. Medical Superintendent reserves the right to withdraw/relax this eligibility criteria and\nin such a situation the tenderer will be given sufficient time to take the changes into\naccount. However, no relaxation will be given as far as statutory requirements are\nconcerned, explicit/implicit.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0020",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5372,
    "char_end": 5715,
    "char_count": 343,
    "text": "II. GENERAL INSTRUCTIONS TO TENDERERS\n\nEligible and willing agencies are advised to visit the hospital site to get an onsite\nassessment of the work on any working day between 10.00 AM to 04.00 PM and on\nSaturday from 10.00 AM to 01.00 PM after taking permission from the Dy. Director\n(Administration), ESIC Model Hospital Bapunagar, Ahmedabad.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0021",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5717,
    "char_end": 6157,
    "char_count": 440,
    "text": "1. The closing date and time for receipt of tenders will be 02.00 P.M. on 16/08/2013.\n2. The Tender will be opened at 2.30 PM on 16/08/2013 at ESIC Model Hospital,\nBapunagar, Ahmedabad in the presence of the authorized representatives of the\ntenderers, who wish to be present at that time.\n3. A pre-bid meeting shall be held at the ESIC Model Hospital, Bapunagar, Ahmedabad to\nclarify any queries of the tenderer on 07/08/2013 at 02.30 P.M.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0022",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6159,
    "char_end": 6171,
    "char_count": 12,
    "text": "Page 6 of 35",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6173,
    "char_end": 6207,
    "char_count": 34,
    "text": "Initial of ESIC authorised officer",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6209,
    "char_end": 6330,
    "char_count": 121,
    "text": "Sign of Tenderer with seal\n4. The Tenders are to be submitted as per two bid system i.e. Technical bid and Financial\nBid.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6331,
    "char_end": 6596,
    "char_count": 265,
    "text": "(A) The technical bid should contain the papers to fulfil all the eligibility criteria,\ncertificates of experience, satisfactory performance certificates, undertaking as per\ninstructions, work plan and list of the equipments, tools and tackles required for the\njob.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0026",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 26,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6597,
    "char_end": 7907,
    "char_count": 1310,
    "text": "(B) Financial bid should contain the rates quoted for the services to be provided as per\nthe instructions given in this tender document.\nBoth the bids should be submitted in two separate sealed envelopes super scribed as\n“Technical Bid for House Keeping Services” and “Financial Bid for House Keeping\nServices”.  An Earnest Money Deposit of Rs.1,10,000/- (Rs. One Lac Ten Thousand\nonly) in the form of Demand Draft or Bankers’ Cheque only of any scheduled bank\nshould be in third envelope along with covering letter and it should be superscribed\n“Earnest Money Deposit for Housekeeping Services”.  All three sealed envelopes should\nbe put in a fourth sealed envelope and should be super scribed “Tender for House\nKeeping Services”. Sealed tenders should be addressed to the Medical Superintendent,\nESIC Model Hospital Bapunagar, Ahmedabad.\nThe completely filled Tender should be dropped in the Tender Box kept in the office of\nthe Dy. Medical Superintendent, ESIC Model Hospital, Bapunagar, Ahmedabad by the\nstipulated date and time. “Tender submitted or received after the closing date and\ntime will not be considered”. The Technical Bid must also be accompanied by\ndeclaration in the prescribed Performa (Annexure-V). In the absence of EMD or any the\nmentioned details, the tender will be summarily rejected.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0027",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 27,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7908,
    "char_end": 8167,
    "char_count": 259,
    "text": "5. The Earnest Money Deposit will be refunded to the unsuccessful tenderer only after\nfinalization of the contract. In case of the successful tenderer EMD will be refunded\nafter receipt of the performance security deposit. No interest will be paid on the EMD.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0028",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 28,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8168,
    "char_end": 8465,
    "char_count": 297,
    "text": "6. The bid shall be valid for 180 days from the date of opening of tender.\n7. No Tenderer will be allowed to withdraw his tender after submission during the bid\nvalidity period (180 days). In case the tenderer does not honour his bid, the EMD\nsubmitted by the tendering firm would stand forfeited.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0029",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 29,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8466,
    "char_end": 8634,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "8. All entries in the Tender form should be legible and filled clearly. Any overwriting or\ncorrection which is unavoidable has to be signed by the authorized signatory.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0030",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8635,
    "char_end": 8861,
    "char_count": 226,
    "text": "9. Each page of the Tender document and papers submitted along with, should be\nnumbered, signed and stamped by the authorized signatory as a token of acceptance\nof the terms and conditions laid down by the ESIC Model Hospital.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8862,
    "char_end": 9046,
    "char_count": 184,
    "text": "10. The tenderer shall quote for all the items of Financial Bid (Annexure-IV) failing which\nthe bid shall be considered nonresponsive, incomplete and tender will be summarily\nrejected.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 9047,
    "char_end": 9174,
    "char_count": 127,
    "text": "11. Tender incomplete in any way will be rejected out rightly. Similarly conditional\nTenders will also be rejected out rightly.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
