    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0065",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 65,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 20939,
    "char_end": 21034,
    "char_count": 95,
    "text": "Sign of Tenderer with seal\ncontractor as per agreement. For absentees payment will not be made.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0066",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 66,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21035,
    "char_end": 21446,
    "char_count": 411,
    "text": "24. Materials\nAny deviation in the house keeping tools quality & quantity and other resources as\nmentioned in Annexure ‘II’ will invoke penalty as decided by the competent authority. In\ncase the contractor has not provided the sufficient amount of equipments, tools and tackles\nand requisite materials even after levy of penalty, the hospital may procure it and deduct\nthe cost from the bills of the contractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0067",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 67,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 21447,
    "char_end": 23161,
    "char_count": 1714,
    "text": "25. Risk Clause\na. The Contractor shall at all times have standby arrangements for carrying out the work\nunder the Contract in case of any failure of the existing arrangement. ESIC reserve the\nright for termination of the contract at any time by giving one month written notice, if\nthe services are found unsatisfactory and also has the right to award the contract to any\nother selected tenderer at the cost, risk and responsibilities of Contractor and excess\nexpenditure incurred on account of this will be recovered by the ESIC Model Hospital\nBapunagar from the Contractor’s Security Deposit or pending bill or by raising a separate\nrecovery claim.\nb. All necessary reports and other information will be supplied by the contractor as per the\ndirection of the Hospital Administration. Contractor and its staff shall take proper and\nreasonable precautions to preserve from loss, destructions, waste or misuse the areas of\nresponsibility given to them by the Hospital, and shall not knowingly lend to any person\nor company any of the effects or assets of the Hospital, under its control.\nc. In the event of loss/damage of equipments etc. at the premises of the ESIC Model\nHospital Bapunagar due to negligence/carelessness of Contractor staff, the Contractor\nshall compensate the loss to ESIC Model Hospital Bapunagar. The Contractor or its\nrepresentative/s shall meet Hospital representative/s regularly to take feedback\nregarding the Housekeeping services.\nd. The Contractor will also maintain a suggestion book and a complaint register to be\nproduced to the hospital administration or designated official on weekly basis.\ne. The Contractor shall, in performing its part of this Agreement, ensure the safety of the",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0068",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 68,
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 11,
    "char_start": 23162,
    "char_end": 23919,
    "char_count": 757,
    "text": "building, its equipments, furniture, fixtures and the persons working in or visiting the\nESIC Model Hospital Bapunagar premises and shall indemnify Hospital, for any loss or\ndamage caused by any act of the Contractor or its employees or staff etc.\nf. The Contractor shall not assign or sublet this Agreement or any part thereof to any\nthird party.\ng. The housekeeping staff shall be regularly trained on behavioural aspects and ethics. They\nshall also be made conversant with the way of working of ESIC Model Hospital, its\nrequirements, layout of hospital, fire safety system along with telephone numbers of\nPolice station, fire station, nearby hospitals.\nh. Licenses if any required for Housekeeping services at the site will be procured by the\nContractor.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
