    "char_start": 53405,
    "char_end": 53792,
    "char_count": 387,
    "text": "Sign of Tenderer with seal\nNote: Aforesaid quantities are not exhaustive and may vary depending on requirement.\nIf the above articles are not able to ensure an effective, efficient and timely\nhousekeeping service management in the hospital, the Contractor will have to provide\nadditional items as per requirement. No extra payment whatsoever will be made for\nthese additional quantities.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0174",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 174,
    "page_start": 27,
    "page_end": 27,
    "char_start": 53794,
    "char_end": 54235,
    "char_count": 441,
    "text": "8. Uniforms of housekeeping staff, I-Cards, Covered trolleys, dustpans, mops, buckets,\nwipers, gloves, dust ers, scrubbers, sponge, brooms, brushes, safety gear etc. to be\nprovided by the Contractor as per requirement.\n9.\n MAN POWER REQUIREMENT:\nS. No.\nManpower Description\nNumber\n1\nTrained  Housekeeping  Staff in  uniform and  I – card\n42* Including relievers\n2\nTrained Housekeeping supervisor in uniform and I-card\n03* Including relievers",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC088-0175",
    "doc_id": "DOC-088",
    "paragraph_index": 175,
    "page_start": 27,
    "page_end": 27,
    "char_start": 54237,
    "char_end": 54612,
    "char_count": 375,
    "text": "*Currently the Hospital is working at around 50 percent strength and will soon be working\nat 100 percent strength, which may result in increased requirement of manpower, for\nwhich payment will be made as per the rate quoted as Manpower charges in the Financial\nBid of this Tender document, however, no payment will be made for any increase in\nconsumables, Tools & equipments.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
