    "paragraph_index": 7,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 322,
    "char_end": 404,
    "char_count": 82,
    "text": "Sub: Tender for providing Manpower services on contract basis to NACIN, Faridabad.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0008",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 8,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 406,
    "char_end": 515,
    "char_count": 109,
    "text": "Dear Madam,\nIn  response  to  your  tender  inviting  notice  for  the  above  mentioned  contract,  I/We,  a",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0009",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 517,
    "char_end": 598,
    "char_count": 81,
    "text": "Company/Partnership/Sole Proprietor submit the tender with following particulars:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0010",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 600,
    "char_end": 1338,
    "char_count": 738,
    "text": "Sl. No.\nDescription\nParticulars\n(Full Name of the Firm)\n1\nConstitution & Nature of Firm\n(State whether sole proprietor/partnership firm/limited company)\n2\nYear of Establishment\n3\nRegistration Number under applicable act with a copy of registration certificate\n4\nRegistered Postal Address\n5\nTelephone No.\nFax No.\nMobile No.\n6\nAddress of Branches\n7\nName and address of Directors, in case of Company\nName and address of Sole proprietor\nName and address of partners; in case of partnership firm\n8\n(a)  Name of Bankers & Branch with full address\n(b)  Style of Account & Number\n(c)  Name(s) of person(s) operating the account (enclose banker’s certificate)\nPF Code allotted by the Jurisdictional PF Commissioner with photo copy of\n9\ncertificate",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0011",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 11,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1340,
    "char_end": 1830,
    "char_count": 490,
    "text": "Having acquired the requisite information related to the subject work after visit of the site\nand examining the form of contract, nature, quantum of work as effecting the tender invited by on\nbehalf of the National Academy of Customs, Indirect taxes & Narcotics, Faridabad, I/We, the\nundersigned hereby offer for providing qualified staff as indicated in the Tender Document to provide\nmanpower strictly in accordance with the terms and conditions as indicated by you in the said\ndocuments.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0012",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 12,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 1832,
    "char_end": 2446,
    "char_count": 614,
    "text": "We also agree to submit the bill on monthly basis and accept the payment to the workers\nas per the Minimum wages declared by the Centre Government. I/We also agree for the compliance\nof applicable Labour and other Laws in force and other Govt. orders. All workers engaged by me/us\nwould be suitably compensated by me/us complying with Minimum Wages Act. All other payment like\npayments under Workmen Compensation Act etc. shall be borne and payable by me/us. I/We will\nalways keep NACIN indemnified of any claim/damages that NACIN have to pay with respect to the\nservice and the deputation of any workers to NACIN.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0013",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "page_start": 2,
    "page_end": 2,
    "char_start": 2448,
    "char_end": 2729,
    "char_count": 281,
    "text": "I/We fully understand that NACIN reserves the right to reject any or all the quotations or\nto reject the lowest quotations without assigning any reasons and that NACIN further reserves the\nright to terminate the contract during its tenure at any time without assigning any reasons.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0014",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 14,
