    "char_start": 2734,
    "char_end": 3189,
    "char_count": 455,
    "text": "I/We further pay and have enclosed Earnest Money amounting to Rs 5,00,000/- (Rs Five\nLakh only) in the form of Demand Draft/Pay Order from a Nationalized / Scheduled Bank only drawn\nin favour of PAO,CBEC payable at New Delhi, along with the Technical Bid which will remain with\nNACIN up to final award of contract. However, no interest shall be payable on Earnest money.\nEarnest money of successful bidder shall be adjusted against the security deposit. .",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
