  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0023",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 23,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3588,
    "char_end": 3677,
    "char_count": 89,
    "text": "F.No.: IX-Admn/4/52/2017\n  Date:20.09.2018\n\nNotice Inviting Tender and Schedule of Events",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0024",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 24,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3679,
    "char_end": 3990,
    "char_count": 311,
    "text": " Online tenders under two bid systems are invited from experienced & reputed service providers of\nsound financial standing, meeting the qualifying requirement for providing Manpower Services.\nThe Bidders shall submit their bids online on e-procure portal of Govt. of India\nhttps://eprocure.gov.in/eprocure/app.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0025",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 25,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 3992,
    "char_end": 4186,
    "char_count": 194,
    "text": " The bid shall remain valid for 90 days from the date of opening of technical bid. Any future\nclarification\nand\n/or\ncorrigendum(s)\nshall\nbe\ncommunicated\non\nhttps://eprocure.gov.in/eprocure/app.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0026",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 26,
    "page_start": 4,
    "page_end": 4,
    "char_start": 4188,
    "char_end": 5682,
    "char_count": 1494,
    "text": "Name of work\nTender for Annual contract for providing Manpower on Contract Basis at\nNational Academy of Customs, Indirect Taxes & Narcotics(NACIN),\nFaridabad\nTender no.\nIX-Admn/4/52/2017 dated 20.09.2018\nEarnest Money\nDeposit(EMD)\nRs 5,00,000/- (Rs Five Lakh only) as EMD. EMD fees shall be in the form of\nDemand Draft issued by a Nationalized/Scheduled Bank only in favor of\nPAO, CBEC payable at New Delhi. Please upload the scanned copy of DD\nonline on e-procure portal https://eprocure.gov.in/eprocure/app. The hard\ncopy of the DD (EMD) must reach NACIN through courier/speed post/hand\ndelivery before closing of bids date and time.\nContract period\nThe initial period of contract will be for ONE year.\nPublishing of tender\nFor details and bid documents please visit website:\nhttps://eprocure.gov.in/eprocure/app\nOnline Submission of\ntender\nStart from 1800 hrs on 28.09.2018\nLast Date for submission\nof tender\n1500 hrs 22.10.2018\nOpening of tender\nPart-I- Technical Bid-\nShall be opened at 1400 hrs on 23.10.2018 on the above mentioned e-\nprocure portal at  NACIN Complex, Sector 29, Faridabad.\nPart-II - Financial Bid-\nFinancial bid of only those bidders who declared technically qualified shall\nbe opened after 01 week of uploading the result of technical evaluation on\ne-procure portal. The financial bids will be opened on the above mentioned\ne-procure portal at NACIN, Sec- 29, Faridabad.\nContact persons\n(for any clarifications)\nSuperintendent (Admn), Room No.1,NACIN, Sec-29, Faridabad",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0027",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 27,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5684,
    "char_end": 5685,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "5",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0028",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 28,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 5687,
    "char_end": 6207,
    "char_count": 520,
    "text": " Notes:\n\nThe price shall be filled up both in figures and in words. No overwriting or use of correction\nfluid shall be accepted. Any correction shall be legible and signed by the authorized\nsignatory.\n\nThe Academy reserves the right to modify any terms and conditions before submission of\nthe bids.\n\nAll tender related documents should be uploaded through e-procure portal only. NACIN\nshall not accept any tender related documents except DD which in original must be sent by\nspeed post/courier/courier/hand delivery.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0029",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 29,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6209,
    "char_end": 6316,
    "char_count": 107,
    "text": "Note: This notice is a part of Tender Document.\n\n          Joint Director (Admn)\n          NACIN, Faridabad",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0030",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 30,
    "page_start": 5,
    "page_end": 5,
    "char_start": 6318,
    "char_end": 6323,
    "char_count": 5,
    "text": "*****",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0031",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 31,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6325,
    "char_end": 6326,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "6",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0032",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 32,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6328,
    "char_end": 6548,
    "char_count": 220,
    "text": "CONTENTS AND ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA\n\n1. The Bidder should have minimum three years of experience of rendering Manpower services in\nany Govt. Department / Public Sector Undertaking / any reputed Academy / Private Companies.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0033",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 33,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6550,
    "char_end": 6707,
    "char_count": 157,
    "text": "2. The Bidder should have minimum annual turnover of Rs 1.50 Crore (Rs One Crore Fifty lakhs\nonly) in any of the last three financial year ending 31.03.2018.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0034",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 34,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6709,
    "char_end": 6838,
    "char_count": 129,
    "text": "3. The Bidder should have completed similar works of minimum value as described below during\nthe period 01/05/2015 to 31/03/2018:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0035",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 35,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6840,
    "char_end": 6948,
    "char_count": 108,
    "text": "a) One similar completed work costing not less than the amount equal to Rs 50 lakhs (Rs Fifty\nlakhs only) OR",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0036",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 36,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 6950,
    "char_end": 7064,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "b) Two similar completed works each costing not less than the amount equal to Rs 40 lakhs (Rs\nForty lakhs only) OR",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0037",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 37,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7066,
    "char_end": 7180,
    "char_count": 114,
    "text": "c) Three similar completed works each costing not less than the amount equal to Rs 30 lakhs\n(Rs Thirty lakhs only)",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0038",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 38,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7182,
    "char_end": 7373,
    "char_count": 191,
    "text": "4. The Bidder must note that they should have carried out and completed similar works in their\nown name as principal contractor and not in any other name as per MOU signed with other\nparties.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0039",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 39,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7375,
    "char_end": 7486,
    "char_count": 111,
    "text": "5. The Bidder shall submit the self-attested copies of the following documents along with the\ntender documents:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0040",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 40,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7488,
    "char_end": 7661,
    "char_count": 173,
    "text": "a)\nPF Registration with PF code number.\n\nb)\nESI Registration\n\nc)\nValid Licence (if applicable) issued in respect of previous employers by\nJurisdictional Labour Commissioner.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0041",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 41,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7663,
    "char_end": 7861,
    "char_count": 198,
    "text": "d)\nDetails of works of similar nature carried out in Govt. Department / Public\nSector Undertaking / any reputed educational Institute / Private Companies in\nthe last 3 years ending on 31 March 2018.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0042",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 42,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 7863,
    "char_end": 8027,
    "char_count": 164,
    "text": "e)\nCopies of balance sheet and Profit & Loss A/c of previous three financial years\nending 31 March 2018 duly certified by CA.\nf)\nList of Arbitration cases (if any )",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0043",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 43,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8029,
    "char_end": 8148,
    "char_count": 119,
    "text": "g)\nCopies of certificates/allotment letter of GST and PAN Number.\nh)\nDetails of managerial, supervisory and other staff",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0044",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 44,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8150,
    "char_end": 8309,
    "char_count": 159,
    "text": "i)\nUndertaking of the agency confirming the availability of the adequate\nmanpower of requisite qualification and experience for deployment at NACIN,\nFaridabad.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0045",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 45,
    "page_start": 6,
    "page_end": 6,
    "char_start": 8311,
    "char_end": 9674,
    "char_count": 1363,
    "text": "j)\nCopy of Last income tax return.\n6. Approximate number of skilled/unskilled workers is given in Annex-I. The actual number may\nvary as per the requirement of the NACIN, Faridabad.\n7. The Bidder shall submit details of organizations, where he has provided such similar services as\nper Annex-II.\n8. General Terms and Conditions of the Contract to be fulfilled by the Bidder are given in Annex-III\nand the bidder shall submit it with technical Bid duly signed on each page in lieu of agreeing\nto them.\n9. The bidder shall submit details as per Annex-IV along with Technical Bid.\n10. The bidder may be a proprietary firm, Partnership firm, Limited Company, Corporate body\nlegally constituted, as per law with valid registration on the last date of submission of the bid.\n11. The bidder should have an office in the NCR of Delhi.\n12. There should be no case pending with the police against the proprietor/firm/partner or the\ncompany (Agency) and should also not have been black listed / Holiday listed by any Govt./Semi\nGovt./PSUs. The firm should give such an undertaking with their bid.\n13. The bidder shall pay Bid Security (EMD) of Rs. 5,00,000/- (Rupees Five lakh only) along with the\ntechnical bid in form of DD from a Nationalized / Scheduled Bank only in favour of PAO, CBEC\npayable at New Delhi. Bids received without Earnest Money deposit (EMD) shall stand",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0046",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 46,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 9676,
    "char_end": 9677,
    "char_count": 1,
    "text": "7",
    "is_boilerplate": true,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0047",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 47,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 9679,
    "char_end": 9865,
    "char_count": 186,
    "text": "rejected and thus shall not be considered for evaluation at any stage. The bid security without\ninterest shall be returned to the unsuccessful bidders after finalization of the contract.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0048",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 48,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 9866,
    "char_end": 10254,
    "char_count": 388,
    "text": "14. The EMD deposited by successful bidder will be adjusted towards the Performance Security\ndeposit as specified in the tender document. If the successful bidder fails to furnish the\ndifference amount between Security Deposit and EMD within 15 (fifteen) days after the issue of\nletter of award of work, his bid security shall be forfeited unless time extension has been\ngranted by NACIN.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0049",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 49,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10255,
    "char_end": 10536,
    "char_count": 281,
    "text": "15. The bid shall be valid and open for acceptance of the Competent Authority of NACIN for a\nperiod of 90 days from the date of opening of the tenders and no request for any variation in\nquoted rates and withdrawal of tender on any ground by successful bidder shall be entertained.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0050",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 50,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10537,
    "char_end": 10622,
    "char_count": 85,
    "text": "16. An agreement shall be signed with the successful bidder as per specimen enclosed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0051",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 51,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10623,
    "char_end": 10751,
    "char_count": 128,
    "text": "17. Counter Terms & conditions will not be accepted as also any additions/deletions or change in\nour format will not be allowed.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0052",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 52,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10752,
    "char_end": 10920,
    "char_count": 168,
    "text": "18. All entries in the Tender must be written in ink or typewritten. Over-writing should be avoided.\nCorrections if any should be attested with signature by the bidder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0053",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 53,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 10921,
    "char_end": 11119,
    "char_count": 198,
    "text": "19. Bidders are advised to study carefully the tender documents and the conditions before quoting\ntheir bid. All the pages of the tender form should be signed by the bidder as a token of\nacceptance.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0054",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 54,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 11120,
    "char_end": 11366,
    "char_count": 246,
    "text": "20. The rates should be indicated both in words and figures. In case of discrepancy between the\nfigure(number) and words, the rates given in the words only will be taken as authenticate and\nno further clarification will be sought from the bidder.",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
    "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC089-0055",
    "doc_id": "DOC-089",
    "paragraph_index": 55,
    "page_start": 7,
    "page_end": 7,
    "char_start": 11367,
    "char_end": 11777,
    "char_count": 410,
    "text": "21. The Earnest Money is liable for forfeiture in the event of: (a) withdrawal of offer by bidder\nduring the validity period of the offer (b) Non-acceptance of orders by bidder when placed (c)\nNon-confirmation of acceptance of orders by bidder within the stipulated time after placement\nof offer (d) Any unilateral revision made by the bidder during the validity period of the offer.\nDeclaration by the Bidder:",
    "is_boilerplate": false,
    "is_superseded": false
  },
  {
