    "char_start": 12179,
    "char_end": 12387,
    "char_count": 208,
    "text": "ANNEX-I\n\nApproximate number of Manpower required\n\nSr. no. Description\nRequired No. of personnel\n1\nHostel/Office attendants\n40\n(Should have knowledge of Hindi & English)\n2.\nCooks\n02\n3.\nHelper\n14\n4.\nWash boy\n04",
