    "char_start": 12574,
    "char_end": 12823,
    "char_count": 249,
    "text": "Sr.no.\nName &\nNo. of\nPeriod\nWhether Govt/semi\nAmount\nReason for\nAddress of\npersonnel\nof\nGovt/Autonomous\nof\ntermination\nthe\nsupplied\ncontract\nbodies/PSUs/Industries\ncontract\n(if\norganization,\netc. (pls specify)\ncurrently\ncontact no\nnot valid)\n1.\n2.\n3",
